window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3901,"title":"Chapter 3901: The Lord Invites You","paragraphs":["Emperor Sha was well-known as one of the top five experts in the Magic Dragon Field. In the Magic Dragon Field, who would dare to cause trouble for him except for the Magic Dragon Lord?","Jian Wushuang was different.","He was only a Principles Master, and he had just become famous. Moreover, he had the principle Supreme Treasure Divine Sword, so it was not surprising that he was targeted.","“It’s the four of them.”","Emperor Sha had recognized the four approaching people through his soul power. He immediately frowned and said, “Master, I’m afraid we’re in trouble.”","“Trouble? Do you think I’m afraid of trouble in the Eternal Dark Prison?” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Emperor Sha was stunned. He immediately thought of Jian Wushuang’s identity and felt relieved.","Soon, the four people appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and Emperor Sha.","They were two men and two women. Their auras were extremely powerful. The leader was an enchanting woman in a red robe.","“Master, these four are experts around Demon Dragon Lord. Each of them is extremely powerful. They can be called the strongest experts in the dark zones. The leader, Red One, is no weaker than me in terms of strength,” Emperor Sha said softly.","“Yes, I know all of them.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. He had already obtained information about some of the top experts in the Demon Dragon Realm.","The four people in front of him were all around Demon Dragon Lord. The red-robed woman, Red One, was the most famous and powerful one. The rest of them, including the Dark Fire Ruler, Demon King Myriad Bones, and Marquis Suxin...all of them had the battle strength of the strongest experts in the dark zones. They were no weaker than Thousand-edge Demon Monarch and Blood Rain Demon Monarch.","“They must have come to find me on the order of Demon Dragon Lord.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. “It seems that my presence has attracted the attention of Demon Dragon Lord. However, he didn’t come in person. He only sent four experts under his command...”","Jian Wushuang hoped that Demon Dragon Lord would come in person, but apparently, he did not.","“Emperor Sha, don’t expose the fact that you’ve become my slave,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Understood.” Emperor Sha nodded.","At this moment, the eyes of the four experts were fixed on Jian Wushuang and Emperor Sha.","“The aura of the Principles Master’s divine power and his appearance are the same. He should be Blood Sword Master.” The red-robed charming woman, Red One, glanced at Jian Wushuang with a strange light in her eyes, then she looked at Emperor Sha, who was beside her.","“Emperor Sha? He’s with the Blood Sword Master?” Red One frowned slightly.","Emperor Sha was famous in the Magic Dragon Field, and his strength was no weaker than hers. In the entire magic dragon field, even if the Magic Dragon Lord attacked him personally, he might not be able to kill him.","If Emperor Sha was standing beside the Blood Sword Master, it would be a big trouble for her.","“Red One, the other three, why aren’t you following Demon Dragon Overlord’s side? Why are you here?” Ruler Emperor Sha crossed his hands behind his back as he calmly stared at the four people before him.","“Emperor Sha, we’re not here for you. We’re here for Blood Sword Master,” Ruler Red One said.","“Are you here for Blood Sword?” Ruler Emperor Sha pretended to be deep in thought. “Why are you looking for him?”","“My lord heard that an incredible genius has appeared in Demon Dragon Region. He has comprehended a thread of universe principle at the level of a Principles Master, and his combat power is no weaker than that of a third-level Ruler. My lord is extremely curious about such a genius, which is why he has ordered the four of us to invite Blood Sword Master to Demon Dragon Castle as a guest,” Ruler Red One said.","“A guest? Haha, I’m afraid that being a guest is a lie. Snatching the principle true treasure sword from Blood Sword is the real deal, right?” Ruler Emperor Sha snickered.","“Emperor Sha.” Ruler Red One’s eyes turned cold. “This is an order from his lordship. My lordship wishes to invite Blood Sword Master to Demon Dragon Castle as a guest. This has nothing to do with you. You should hurry up and move aside.”","“Hmph. My apologies. I regret meeting Blood Sword too late. I’ve already decided that he is one of my best friends in this Eternal Prison. You want me to move aside? impossible. Even if the Demon Dragon Ruler personally comes, I won’t give him face.” Ruler Emperor Sha snorted coldly.","“It seems that Emperor Sha wishes to offend my liege for the sake of the bloodsword Ruler.” Ruler Red One’s gaze turned cold as they glanced at the three Rulers, they whispered, “If Emperor Sha wants to interfere in this matter, it won’t be so easy. However, my lord wants us to bring Blood Sword Master back. His orders must be obeyed.”","“How about this? Later on, we’ll make a move. I’ll be responsible for entangling that Ruler Emperor Sha while the three of you work together to take Blood Sword Master down as quickly as possible. If we can’t capture him alive, we’ll kill him and seize his principle true treasure Divine Sword.”","“Yes.”","“Understood.”","Dark Fire Ruler, Demon King Myriad Bones, and Marquis Suxin all nodded in unison.","Boom!","A surge of aura suddenly swept up from Ruler Red One’s body. Her red robes also blew up, creating endless air waves.","“Emperor Sha, you don’t even care about my lord. I’d like to see what you’re capable of!” Ruler Red One shouted, and in an instant, endless red clouds surged, an overwhelming wave of red clouds swept toward Ruler Emperor Sha.","“Master.” Ruler Emperor Sha Glanced at Jian Wushuang.","“It’s okay. Just fight with Ruler Red One. As for the other three, let them join hands to deal with me.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Ruler Emperor Sha nodded and immediately charged forward. In the blink of an eye, he and Ruler Red One had engaged in a frenzied battle.","Each of the two top experts had the battle strength of the top five experts in the Magic Dragon Field. When they fought each other, their movements and power were astonishing.","While the two were fighting, the Dark Fire Ruler, Demon King Myriad Bones, and Marquis Suxin also moved.","“Blood Sword Master, surrender obediently. We can spare your life. Otherwise...” Dark Fire Ruler was surrounded by layers of black flames, and his eyes were filled with killing intent.","“The three of you are not qualified to make me surrender.” Jian Wushuang smiled, but his heart was moved. “The three experts are the strongest in the dark zone. Since I improved the two sword formations, I have been wandering in the dark zones of the Magic Dragon Field for 110 years. Although I have fought with many experts, I have only fought with one person. So far, I have not used the two sword formations to fight two or three people at the same time.”","“With the three of them working together, I might be able to find some principles in the sword formation.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with fighting spirit. Seeing the three experts charging at him, he took out the Wu Qi Divine Sword and waved it. The endless essence immediately swept out."]},{"number":3902,"title":"Chapter 3902 - One Against Three","paragraphs":["Weng weng!","The world trembled slightly, and in an instant, a sea of sword intent appeared in the sky.","This sea of sword intent was incomparably vast, and it immediately covered the three Rulers in front of them. Following that, waves of sword intent continuously surged toward the three Rulers.","“What a powerful concept.”","“Is this a sword formation?”","The three Rulers immediately sensed the extraordinariness of this sword formation.","“It is said that the reason why this Blood Sword Master was able to force the strongest experts of the dark regions to flee in such a sorry state as a Principles Master was because of a sword formation that trapped them. Many of the strongest experts of the dark regions were trapped within the sword formation, as though they were trapped in a vortex. They had no other choice but to use their life-saving secret arts to flee. The sword formation that trapped them should be the one we are looking at right now. This sword formation is quite extraordinary. Even the three of us have to be careful,” Demon King Myriad Bones said solemnly.","“Hmph. A sword formation created by a mere Principles Master? Do you really take it seriously?”","“Hmph. Even if this sword formation can truly trap the supreme experts of the dark regions, now that the three of us are working together, it should be quite easy for us to break through this sword formation.” The Dark Fire Ruler did not think much of it. “The three of us will work together and break through this sword formation.”","“Okay.”","The three masters immediately made their moves.","One after another, extremely powerful attacks were unleashed from their hands. The three of them began to attack wildly in three different directions of the sword formation.","Before the waves of sword essence from the Sea of sword essence had even approached, they had already been crushed by the three of them.","“Huh?”","Jian Wushuang, who was using the Wavelight sword formation at full strength, frowned at this moment.","“There’s a big difference between trapping one person with the sword formation and trapping three people at the same time,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","Previously, he could control the waves of sword essence to attack one person with the sword formation at will, making it impossible for the other person to escape.","However, now that he had trapped three people at the same time, the waves of sword essence had to spread out and attack the three people at the same time. As a result, the power of the waves of sword essence was greatly weakened, and even the speed at which they took shape was far slower than the speed at which the waves of sword essence were destroyed by the three Rulers, it was far slower than the speed at which the waves of sword essence were destroyed by the three Rulers.","The three Rulers attacked the Sea of sword essence in three different directions, but Jian Wushuang had a feeling that he could not react at all. He could only watch as the sea of sword essence was destroyed and the entire Wavelight sword formation...it completely collapsed.","“As expected, I couldn’t see the principles of my Wavelight sword formation when I only targeted one person, but now I’m facing three people at the same time. When they attacked at the same time, some of the principles of my sword formation were exposed.” Jian Wushuang sighed secretly.","He was not angry at the collapse of the sword formation. Instead, he was happy.","This was because while the sword array had collapsed, he had also discovered some of the principles in his sword array. These principles could all be further perfected.","“Hmph, I knew it. How powerful can a sword array cast by a mere Principles Masters be? Wasn’t it just destroyed?” The Dark Fire Ruler sneered, “Without the sword array, the battle strength of this Blood Sword Master is at most comparable to that of a third-level Ruler. Any one of the three of us can easily kill him. However, his lordship has said that if we can capture him alive, it would be best not to kill him.”","“Watch me capture him alive.”","Demon King Myriad Bones chuckled. A black iron chain with baby-like arms appeared in his hand. The black iron chain was covered with a series of special secret patterns, which clearly showed that it had a special ability, the aura emitted by the iron chain was extremely dark, cold, and powerful.","As Demon King Myriad Bones waved his hand, the black iron chain rushed toward Jian Wushuang like a black flood dragon. At the same time, secret patterns were activated.","Seeing the black iron chain sweeping toward him, Jian Wushuang smiled slightly. Then, a large amount of principle power, dominated by the Master of Earth principles, rose up crazily.","A layer of Earth Sword Realm appeared immediately. It was also only 52 layers of Earth Sword Realm, and it overlapped in a special way to form a complete sword formation of Earth Guard.","The black iron chain wrapped around Jian Wushuang’s divine body, but it was blocked by the sword formation of Earth Guard. No matter how the black iron chain attacked, the sword formation did not move at all.","“What?”","“Another sword formation?”","“Look at the sword formation. It’s obviously different from the previous one. This sword formation seems to be used to protect the body.”","The three Rulers looked at the sword formation covering Jian Wushuang’s body and frowned.","“Let’s attack together and use our strongest attack to break this sword formation,” Marquis Suxin said in a deep voice.","The three Rulers did not hesitate and immediately used their ultimate moves.","Three extremely powerful attacks simultaneously struck the Earth Guardian Sword Array. These three attacks were barely comparable to the third strike of Thousand Kills Emperor Lord. Even if they were slightly weaker...they should be comparable to the second strike of Thousand Kills Emperor Lord.","The three attacks simultaneously struck the Earth Guardian Sword Array.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Almost without a pause, three collision sounds rang out. The Earth Guardian sword array trembled slightly under these three powerful attacks, but it quickly calmed down.","“What?”","“How could this be?”","The Dark Fire Ruler, Demon Monarch myriad bone, and Marquis Suxin were all a little stunned.","But at this time, Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “You three are really stupid. Why Don’t you think about why an expert like Emperor Sha met me late and treated me as his best friend?”","Jian Wushuang’s words made the three Rulers tremble.","“Don’t tell me you...” Demon King Myriad Bones stared at Jian Wushuang as a thought flashed through his mind.","“You should have guessed it. Let me tell you, I fought with Emperor Sha Before I met you. However, Emperor Sha was unable to break my protective sword formation despite using his strongest attack. He admired the defensive ability of my sword formation, so he made friends with me.","“Although the three of you have the strength of the strongest expert in the dark zone, even if the three of you combine their strongest attacks, they still can’t compare to Ruler Emperor Sha’s strongest move. How can you break my protective sword formation?” Jian Wushuang smiled.","His words were half true and half false, but the three Rulers in front of him believed him without a doubt.","Because in their eyes, Ruler Emperor Sha’s strength was extraordinary, and he had an extremely proud personality. Anyone he acknowledged and befriended must have extraordinary strength or methods, and the method Blood Sword Master used to gain Ruler Emperor Sha’s approval was most likely this protective sword array.","“Even Ruler Emperor Sha’s strongest move is unable to move this sword array. The three of us definitely won’t be able to move, but the protective sword array is only used to defend against material attacks. Soul attacks can’t defend against it!” Demon King Myriad Bones’ gaze turned cold."]},{"number":3903,"title":"Chapter 3903 - Return Empty-Handed","paragraphs":["“Marquis Suxin, use your soul attack,” Demon King Myriad Bones shouted.","“Watch me,” Marquis Suxin said with a cold glint in her eyes.","In the Eternal Dark Prison, there were very few experts who were good at soul attacks, but Marquis Suxin was one of them.","A surge of soul power swept out, ignoring the earth protection sword formation around Jian Wushuang, and directly poured into Jian Wushuang’s sea of consciousness.","Jian Wushuang’s soul was destroyed in an instant, but it was immediately restored in the next moment.","“The people sent by Demon Dragon Lord are really comprehensive. They even have experts who are good at soul attacks.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“How could it be? His soul was clearly destroyed. Could he be the legendary perfect life-form cultivator?” Marquis Suxin was shocked.","“Blood Sword Master is a perfect life-form? Damn it!” Demon King Myriad Bones cursed, then he looked at the Dark Fire Ruler and said, “Dark Fire, you have a supreme-grade suppression supreme treasure. Can you ignore the protective sword formation on his body and suppress him directly?”","“Let me try.” The Dark Fire Ruler immediately stepped forward and flipped his hand. A golden stone the size of an infant’s head appeared in his hand.","Under the control of the Dark Fire Ruler, the golden stone enlarged at a terrifying speed and floated above Jian Wushuang’s head. Then, the golden stone shook slightly.","Boom!","A powerful suppressive force came into effect directly.","“A suppressive true treasure?” Jian Wushuang raised his head and revealed a playful smile.","He was a cultivator at the perfect life-level. With his strength and the protection of the Earth Protection Sword Array around him, it would take at least a principles true treasure to suppress him, he even had to exert some power from the principles true treasure.","The Dark Fire Ruler was only a third-level Ruler, and he had only taken out a supreme-grade supreme true treasure. How could it suppress him?","Sure enough, he stood under the golden stone and let it suppress him. The result was that he was not affected at all.","“Dark Fire Ruler, your suppression type true treasure is too low-level. Why don’t you take a look at my suppression type true treasure?” Jian Wushuang suddenly smiled wickedly.","Buzz!","An extremely majestic aura suddenly rose.","Under the gaze of the Dark Fire Ruler, a towering stone tablet that was 30,000 meters tall slowly rose into the air. The surface of the stone tablet was surrounded by countless secret engravings, which were extremely complicated, at this moment, with a terrifying power, the stone tablet directly smashed toward the stone tablet.","The stone tablet was also a suppression type true treasure, and the stone tablet was, after all, a supreme-grade supreme true treasure. However, after being smashed by the stone tablet, the stone tablet instantly began to tremble crazily, the secret engravings on the stone tablet and the light emanating from its body dimmed on the spot.","Immediately after, the golden stone shrank back to its original size and flew toward Dark Fire Ruler at the fastest speed. It was like a bullied child running to his parents.","“This, this is...”","Dark Fire Ruler took back the golden stone, but his eyes were fixed on the towering stone tablet.","“A principle true treasure! This Blood Sword Master has a second principle true treasure!” Dark Fire Ruler roared.","“A principle true treasure stone tablet?”","Demon King Myriad Bones and Marquis Suxin were also shocked.","However, the three of them had survived the Eternal Dark Prison for a long time, so they quickly calmed down.","“We’ve used all our methods, but we still can’t kill Blood Sword Master. Red One was stopped by Emperor Sha, so she didn’t have a chance to attack. Obviously, we can’t kill Blood Sword Master, let alone capture her alive,” Demon King Myriad Bones said in a low voice, “let’s go and retreat.”","The three Rulers did not hesitate. Knowing that they could do nothing to Jian Wushuang, they immediately retreated.","Red One, who had been fighting fiercely with Emperor Sha in the void, also retreated, keeping a distance from Emperor Sha.","In the void, Red One, Dark Fire, Demon King Myriad Bones, and Marquis Suxin gathered together again.","Emperor Sha also returned to Jian Wushuang’s side.","“Haha, four of you, do you want to fight again? If you go back like this, I’m afraid you won’t be able to answer to Demon Dragon Lord,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","The four Rulers looked very upset.","“What’s going on?” Ruler Red One asked with a frown.","“Red One, you should have noticed that Blood Sword Master has an even more terrifying protective sword formation besides a sword formation that can trap the enemy. The three of us combined our strongest attacks, but we still couldn’t break the protective sword formation. As for other methods, such as soul attack and suppression, we’ve used them all. They’re useless against Blood Sword Master. The three of us can’t do anything to him.” Demon King Myriad Bones shook his head.","“Oh, right. Your side...” Demon King Myriad Bones turned to look at Ruler Red One.","“Hmph. It’s not like you don’t know how powerful Emperor Sha is. When I fought him, I was only barely able to fight him to a draw. Even if I didn’t use my trump card, Emperor Sha still has a trump card. There’s no way for me to bypass him and deal with Blood Sword Master,” Ruler Red One said in a low voice.","“There’s nothing we can do about it. Blood Sword Master has Emperor Sha helping him. The four of us are indeed helpless against him,” Demon King Myriad Bones said.","“We’ve all done our best. If you want to blame someone for this, you can blame the information we received earlier on for not being accurate enough. We didn’t even know that Blood Sword Master had such a terrifying protective sword formation. Based on my calculations, if we want to break through Blood Sword Master’s Protective Sword Formation head-on, I imagine that only his lordship will be able to do so,” Dark Fire Ruler said.","“Fortunately, the four of us didn’t come out empty-handed. At least we know that Blood Sword Master has another principle treasure, and it seems to be a suppression-type one. We can bring this news back to appease the Lord,” Marquis Suxin said.","The four of them were ordered by Demon Dragon Lord to bring Jian Wushuang back.","But now they could do nothing to Jian Wushuang. If they went back without any gains, Demon Dragon Lord would be furious and might punish them.","But now that they had some gains, they dared to go back and report to the Lord.","“Let’s go back and report to the Lord. As for what to do next, let the Lord decide for himself.”","Red One Ruler sighed, then turned around and left with the three Rulers.","Jian Wushuang and Emperor Sha stood side by side and watched the four leave. Jian Wushuang had no intention of stopping them.","“Master, why don’t you use the token of the disciples of the Red Cloud Lineage to suppress them and let them go?” Emperor Sha asked in puzzlement."]},{"number":3904,"title":"Chapter 3904 - Demon Dragon Castle","paragraphs":["Indeed, if Jian Wushuang wanted to, he could suppress the four Rulers with a flip of his hand.","Among the four Rulers, although the other three were not strong and were only at the level of the strongest expert in the dark zone, the leader, Ruler Red One, was comparable to Emperor Sha, if Jian Wushuang could subdue him, it would be a great help to him.","However, Jian Wushuang did not do that.","“These four are here to capture me under the orders of Demon Dragon Lord. If I use the token of a disciple of the Red Cloud Lineage to subdue them, who will report to Demon Dragon Lord?” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Master, you deliberately left them to inform the Demon Dragon Lord so that he would come here? Are you trying to subdue him?” There was a trace of shock in the eyes of Emperor Sha.","“Demon Dragon Lord is one of the ten great kings in the first level of Eternal Dark Prison. It would be best if he could be subjugated.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “Not only did I ask them to report back, but I also deliberately revealed my second principles treasure just now. Naturally, I wanted to invite you into my trap.”","Emperor Sha’s expression changed. He had completely understood.","“I’m afraid it will take some time for the four of them to return to Demon Dragon Castle and come with Demon Dragon Lord. We’ll wait for him in the 42nd zone,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile, “Emperor Sha, the 42nd region is your territory. You should know very well that there are experts here. I need you to help me find them, let them fight with me, and help me cultivate.”","“That’s a small matter. Master, please follow me.” Emperor Sha immediately led Jian Wushuang to the location of the strongest experts in the 42nd region.","As for the four of them, they were indeed planning to return to Demon Dragon Castle to report the news.","However, among them, Demon King Myriad Bones and Marquis Suxin stayed behind and stayed in the 42nd dark zone.","They stayed behind to monitor Jian Wushuang and find out his exact location.","After all, they had just fought with Jian Wushuang, and Jian Wushuang knew that they were sent by Demon Dragon Lord. Although they had failed this time, they might not be able to return next time.","Therefore, if Jian Wushuang was smarter, he would quickly leave this dark area, go to other places, or even find a place to hide.","It was because of this that Red One Ruler asked Demon King Myriad Bones and Marquis Suxin to stay, so that when Demon Dragon Lord came, they could find Jian Wushuang’s location directly.","However, they did not expect that Jian Wushuang had no intention of leaving or hiding. Instead, he continued to challenge experts in the 42nd Dark Area.","...","In the Demon Dragon Field, there was a huge and boundless castle, which was the Demon Dragon Castle.","As one of the ten kings recognized in the first level of Eternal Dark Prison, the entire Demon Dragon field was the territory of the Demon Dragon Lord. The Demon Dragon Lord had always been supreme in the Demon Dragon Field, and no one dared to provoke him.","Although they were all one of the ten kings, the Demon Dragon Lord was different from the Lone Star Demon Ancestor.","Ruler Star Demon looked like an immortal, but deep down, he was an out-and-out great fiend. Furthermore, his methods were strange and cruel, and he had a special hobby. He liked livestock, on the premise that such livestock could not be found in the eternal prison, he used special methods to turn cultivators into livestock for his amusement.","Therefore, there were all kinds of livestock in Ruler Star Demon’s castle.","However, Demon Dragon Lord’s preferences were quite normal. He liked beautiful women, so there were a large number of beautiful women living in the Demon Dragon Castle.","Of course, these so-called beautiful women were in fact prisoners imprisoned in the Eternal Dark Prison. They might not be strong, but they could only make fun of Demon Dragon Lord, they could also live extremely well in the Demon Dragon Domain.","Inside the Grand Hall of the huge Demon Dragon Castle.","A sturdy old man covered in a hazy black cloth was lying on the bed, surrounded by four beauties waiting on him.","The eyes of this sturdy old man were cloudy, revealing his skin that had a faint black luster. What was most eye-catching was that there was a pitch-black horn on the head of this sturdy old man.","This horn was incomparably sharp, as though it could pierce through the heavens and the earth.","He was Demon Dragon Region Lord, the absolute Ruler of the Demon Dragon realm.","“Region Lord.”","A black-robed Ruler Red One arrived within the palace.","“Red One, you’ve returned?” Demon Dragon Region Lord slowly opened his cloudy eyes, glancing at Ruler Red One.","Although Ruler Red One was a woman, and she was born quite well, Demon Dragon Region Lord had no interest in Ruler Red One at all.","“Did you bring Blood Sword Master back?” Demon Dragon Region Lord asked.","“No, Region Lord.” Ruler Red One shook his head.","“You didn’t bring him back?” Demon Dragon Region Lord frowned, but he immediately used his power again. “I didn’t bring him back alive, but I brought back his corpse. Most importantly, I brought back the principle true treasure sword on him. That’ll do.”","“Region Lord, we weren’t able to bring Blood Sword Master back, and we weren’t able to kill him,” Ruler Red One said nervously.","“What did you say?” Demon Dragon Region Lord rose to his feet. He stared at Ruler Red One with a cold look in his eyes. “Trash!”","“Don’t be angry, Region Lord.” Ruler Red One immediately began to explain in shock, “The four of us were ordered by the Region Lord to capture that Blood Sword Master, but when we found him, he was already in the 42nd dark zone. For some reason, he was already walking together with Emperor Sha. We said that we were ordered by the Region Lord to invite this Blood Sword Master, but Emperor Sha didn’t give us any face at all. He was still incredibly unyielding, and in the end, we had no choice but to fight him.”","“Emperor Sha?” Demon Dragon Region Lord’s gaze turned cold.","There were many experts in the Demon Dragon Region. He naturally knew about the supreme Ruler Emperor Sha.","Not only did he know, he had also met with Emperor Sha before. He had even attacked Emperor Sha before. However, Emperor Sha had luckily escaped that time.","Although he had still kept some trump cards, Emperor Sha’s strength and methods were still extremely powerful.","“So, the reason you weren’t able to bring back the Blood Sword Master is because Disha intervened?” Demon Dragon Region Lord asked.","“Not exactly.” Ruler Red One shook his head.","“Although Emperor Sha is strong, I can still fight him to a standstill. I’ll hold him off while Dark Fire, Myriad Bones, and Suxin deal with the Blood Sword Master. Who would’ve thought that the Blood Sword Master would actually know how to use an incomparably powerful protective sword formation?”","“The protective sword formation isn’t even capable of dealing with Emperor Sha’s most powerful attacks. That’s why Emperor Sha became acquainted with the Blood Sword Master. Although Dark Fire, Myriad Bones, and Suxin are working together, they aren’t able to do anything to the Blood Sword Master,” Ruler Red One explained."]},{"number":3905,"title":"Chapter 3905 - Personally Attacking","paragraphs":["“Lord, the four of us have indeed used all of our abilities, but we still have no chance of killing the Blood Sword Master. Thus, we can only return to report this to you. In addition, when we surrounded and killed the Blood Sword Master with Dark Fire, Myriad Bones, and Suxin, we didn’t gain nothing at all,” Ruler Red One said.","“Harvest? What harvest?” Demon Dragon Ancestor’s voice was still as cold as ever.","“Although the three of them were unable to break through Blood Sword Master’s Protective Sword Array, they were able to force him to reveal quite a few of his trump cards through other means. For example, aside from his extraordinary talent, which allowed him to comprehend a sliver of the universe principles at the level of a Principles Master, he is actually a perfect life-level cultivator. In addition, in addition to the known principle true treasure sword, he also has a second principle true treasure,” said Ruler Red One.","“What? A second principle true treasure?” Demon Dragon Ancestor’s pupils constricted.","In the universe, only fourth-level or even fifth-level Rulers were qualified to own a principle true treasure.","In the first space of Eternal Darkness Prison, only third-level Rulers were imprisoned. Because there were too many Rulers, some of them had heaven-defying opportunities, and some had extraordinary backgrounds, there were also a few principle true treasures, but the number was still pitifully small.","For example, Demon Dragon Lord did not have a single principle true treasure.","He had asked Red One to capture Jian Wushuang in order to get his principle true treasure, the Divine Sword.","But now, Red One told him that Blood Sword Master had a second principle true treasure?","“What’s Blood Sword Master’s Second principle true treasure?” Demon Dragon Region Lord asked.","“It’s a special stone tablet. It should be a suppression type principle true treasure,” Ruler Red One said.","“A suppression type principle true treasure? A stone tablet?” Demon Dragon Region Lord’s expression suddenly changed. “How big is the stone tablet? Is there anything special about its surface?”","“That stone stele is very tall. It is more than 30,000 meters tall, and its surface is covered with golden engravings. Those golden engravings are incomparably profound and complex,” Ruler Red One replied.","“More than 30,000 meters? Golden engravings?” Demon Dragon Region Lord’s eyes lit up. “That’s it. There’s no mistaking it. That’s it!”","“Haha...the heavens are helping me.” Demon Dragon Region Lord began to laugh loudly.","“Region Lord.” Ruler Red One looked at Demon Dragon Region Lord in confusion. He didn’t know why Demon Dragon Region Lord was so happy.","Could it be that the principle true treasure stone tablet in Blood Sword Master’s hands was very useful to Demon Dragon Region Lord?","Demon Dragon Region Lord did not explain too much. He just muttered to himself, “Humph, a stone tablet that is over 30,000 feet tall and has a large number of golden engravings on its surface. It is also a suppression type principle true treasure. If I’m not mistaken, it should be the Heaven Suppression Tablet that old scorpion has been looking for.”","“That old scorpion already has two of those Heaven Suppression Tablets, but he is still extremely eager to obtain a third one. For this reason, he even offered great benefits and conditions. If I’m not mistaken, the Heaven Suppression Tablet requires three of them to be combined in order to unleash its true power. And now, a Heaven Suppression Tablet has appeared in the hands of the Blood Sword Master. If I can obtain it, even though I don’t need it, I can use it to negotiate with that old scorpion!”","“That old scorpion has been imprisoned in the Eternal Dark Prison for the longest time. He has the deepest foundation and the most array treasures in his hands. It is rumored that other than the two Heaven Suppression Tablets, he has a total of three principle treasures. One of them, the long rod, is of great use to me!”","“I have tried my best to beg him for the rod. I was even willing to pay a huge price. He was not willing to give me the rod. However, as long as I get the Heaven Suppression Tablets, he will come begging me with the rod.”","Demon Dragon Region Lord’s eyes flickered with a strange light, and there was a cold smile at the corner of his mouth.","“Red One, where is Blood Sword Master now?” Demon Dragon Region Lord looked down.","“When I came back to inform you, I purposely left ten thousand bones and Suxin behind to monitor Blood Sword Master’s movements. Besides, Suxin has my special token with her. I can sense Suxin’s location, and she’s still in the 42nd dark zone. Clearly, Blood Sword Master hasn’t left that place,” Red One said.","“Haha, you’ve done well. Although you weren’t able to bring the Blood Sword Master back this time, you’ve at least brought me some good news. You’ve all worked hard. Once we capture him, I’ll reward you well.” Demon Dragon Region Lord laughed.","“Many thanks, Region Lord.” Ruler Red One felt joy in his heart, but then, he continued, “Region Lord, the Blood Sword Master’s protective abilities aren’t weak at all. In addition, he has Emperor Sha by his side. If we want to kill him or capture him alive, we won’t be able to do so by ourselves. I’m afraid that only if you personally act, Region Lord, will we have the confidence to capture him.”","“Mhm, I understand.” Demon Dragon Lord nodded. “Just Emperor Sha alone is extremely difficult to deal with. Even if I were to personally kill him, I would have to pay a price to kill him. As for that Blood Sword Master, if his protective sword formation is truly so powerful that he can’t even deal with Emperor Sha’s strongest attack, then killing him might be even more difficult than killing Emperor Sha.”","“This matter is of great importance. I don’t wish for any unforeseen circumstances to arise. Red One, immediately invite Spark over.”","“Invite Ruler Spark over?” Ruler Red One was startled.","There were many experts within the Demon Dragon domain, and they were all skilled in all sorts of techniques.","Ruler Spark, on the other hand, was an incomparably unique existence within the Demon Dragon Domain.","Ruler Spark’s personal combat power was not very strong, but just like Blood Rain Demon Monarch of the ninth dark zone, he was skilled in formations.","And his understanding of arrays had reached an unbelievable level.","If Blood Rain Demon Monarch’s understanding of arrays could barely rank in the top 20 or even the top 10 in the first level of Eternal Dark Prison, then the Ruler Spark’s understanding of arrays..! Was publicly recognized as the number one in the first level of Eternal Dark Prison!","In other words, in terms of array attainments, no one in the first level of Eternal Dark Prison could compare to him. Even Blood Rain Demon Monarch was far behind him.","However, although the array formation was powerful, his own strength was not strong, so he could not become a king.","But even if he was not a king, ordinary kings would not dare to put on airs when they saw him. They were all polite.","This was the case for the Demon Dragon Lord. Although the Ruler Spark lived in the Demon Dragon territory all year round, the Demon Dragon Lord did not dare to order him. He could only ask Red One to go and invite him. And even if he did, he would have to pay a price, only then would the Ruler Spark agree to help him."]},{"number":3906,"title":"Chapter 3906 - Star Demon’s Patrol","paragraphs":["In a dark area of the Demon Dragon Field.","In the vast void, two third-level Rulers were madly fighting each other. The battle was extremely intense.","Rumble...the heaven and earth darkened, and streams of terrifying divine power wildly spread out.","After a long time, the two separated.","“Haha, Golden Armor, you and I have roamed this dark area together. We’ve met each other many times. Every time, you wanted to kill me, but in the end, you couldn’t do anything to me. You could only watch as I left. And this time, it’s the same.” A violet-haired bewitching youth stood there, he let out a hearty laugh.","“You’re formidable. In recent years, my spear techniques have improved, and my strength has also increased a bit. I thought that I could kill you, but it seems that I’m still quite lacking.” The other person was dressed in golden armor, the tall man who was like a Golden War God curled his lips and said.","“You know that you can’t kill me. In the future, don’t waste your time when you see me.” The purple-haired bewitching youth laughed and prepared to leave.","Suddenly —","“Hu!”","A loud and clear voice suddenly sounded.","“Oh? The sound of horses?” The expressions of the purple-haired bewitching youth and the golden-armored man changed.","This was the Eternal Dark Prison. How could there be horses?","Could it be...","The two of them immediately lifted their heads and looked towards the source of the horse cry. As expected, a luxurious horse carriage pulled by a pair of white horses slowly drove over.","There was a person seated on top of the luxurious horse carriage. It was a white robed white haired handsome man. This handsome man had his eyes slightly shut. His body emitted a unique and elegant aura. It was as though he was a celestial being.","Upon seeing this person, the purple-haired youth and the golden-armored man’s expressions changed drastically.","“Star Demon Ancestor!”","“It’s Star Demon Ancestor!”","Both of them turned pale with fright.","Star Demon Ancestor was one of the ten strongest monarchs in the first level of eternal prison. Furthermore, Star Demon Ancestor did not occupy a large area. It was not that he did not have the strength to occupy it, but that he was not interested. Star Demon Ancestor’s eccentricities...everyone in Eternal Darkness Prison knew about it.","He was only interested in the animals in his palm.","In addition, Star Demon Ancestor had a special title. He was publicly acknowledged as the number one evil fiend in Eternal Darkness Prison!","He was a complete psychopath and a lunatic.","He liked to turn people into animals and play with them. Any cultivator who fell into Star Demon Ancestor’s hands would suffer a fate worse than death.","In the Eternal Dark Prison, there were many people who had been captured by Star Demon Ancestor and tortured for a long time. These people hated Star Demon Ancestor to the extreme, but they were also extremely afraid of him.","For example, Demon Monarch Ancient Night, who had luckily escaped from the Eternal Dark Prison, had been captured by Star Demon Ancestor and turned into an animal. He had been tortured for a billion years, so he hated Star Demon Ancestor to the extreme, when he brought Jian Wushuang into the Eternal Dark Prison, the only condition was that Jian Wushuang would find a way to kill Star Demon Ancestor for him.","Without a doubt, Star Demon Ancestor was a well-known demon in the Eternal Dark Prison, but he could do nothing about it.","“Star Demon Ancestor, how did we meet Star Demon Ancestor?”","“Why did Star Demon Ancestor appear in the Demon Dragon Field? Could it be...Star Demon is on a patrol?”","The purple-haired youth and the golden-armored man began to tremble violently.","It was a disaster for Star Demon to be out on a patrol.","As Star Demon Ancestor liked to turn cultivators into animals to torture and tease, he would release the cultivators after he was done with them. Therefore, every once in a while, Star Demon Ancestor would go out, he would capture a large number of cultivators in the eight great domains of Eternal Darkness Prison and transform them into animals to bring back.","This was Star Demon’s patrol.","And during Star Demon’s patrol, any cultivator that Star Demon encountered would definitely be a nightmare.","As expected, when Star Demon Ancestor saw the two Rulers, he waved his hand and an invisible force instantly descended.","“It’s over!”","The purple-haired bewitching youth and the golden-armored man’s faces were pale. Their eyes were filled with terror and despair.","Although they were third-level Rulers and had lived in the eternal prison for so long, they were not weak in terms of their survival abilities. However, they could not resist Star Demon Ancestor at all.","This was because there had long been rumors in the eternal prison that if Star Demon went out on patrol, any cultivator he encountered would be captured. At the very least, they could live. If they wanted to escape, they would die!","Up until now, no one that Star Demon Ancestor had attempted to capture had ever failed.","Even Star Demon Ancestor, the strongest expert in the dark zone, could be easily captured, much less the two of them.","An invisible force descended upon the two Rulers, causing them to look at a loss. In the next moment, their bodies began to transform.","The two Rulers, who were clearly emitting monstrous auras, turned into two animals in the blink of an eye.","A rabbit and a crow.","With a slight wave of Star Demon Ancestor’s hand, the rabbit and Crow appeared in his palm out of control and were thrown into the back of the carriage.","However, when Star Demon Ancestor opened the back of the carriage, he could see that the back of the carriage was already filled with all sorts of animals. However, they were very small in size.","Clearly, Star Demon Ancestor had already captured quite a number of cultivators when he was out on patrol.","After capturing the purple-haired youth and the golden-armored man, the carriage only paused for a moment before continuing forward.","Along the way, Star Demon Ancestor took action time and time again. Any cultivator he encountered would turn into livestock or animals in the trunk of the carriage.","Half a year later, Star Demon Ancestor came to a dark corner. A thin, black-robed elder came to the front of the carriage.","“Welcome, Master.”","The black-robed elder was a third-stage Ruler, after all. Furthermore, he was publicly acknowledged as the strongest expert in this dark region. But now, he was kneeling in front of Star Demon Ancestor.","“Speak,” said Star Demon Ancestor calmly.","“Master, Blood Sword Master is currently in the 42nd Dark Zone. Furthermore, Lord Demon Dragon seems to already know of his existence. Not long ago, Lord Demon Dragon’s four experts attacked in an attempt to kill Blood Sword Master, but they failed. If nothing goes wrong, Lord Demon Dragon will likely attack personally next,” said the black-robed elder respectfully.","“Demon Dragon?”","“Haha, it’s just a small lizard. Forget about the fact that master bloodsword has yet to fall into his hands. Even if he does, if I need him, he will obediently hand master bloodsword over to me.” Star Demon Ancestor snickered, he then looked down. “You have done well in this matter. As a reward, I can reduce the time limit for you by one chaos cycle.”","“Thank you, Master.” The black-robed elder was overjoyed.","Star Demon Ancestor smiled as he drove the carriage straight toward the 42nd dark zone."]},{"number":3907,"title":"Chapter 3907 - Demon Dragon Lord Arrived","paragraphs":["In the 42nd dark zone, Jian Wushuang and Emperor Sha were flying side by side in the vast void.","Not far behind them, there were two other figures following them.","“Demon King Myriad Bones and Marquis Suxin are really annoying,” Emperor Sha said with a frown.","“Let them follow us. Judging from the time, Demon Dragon Lord should be arriving soon,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Master, the cave mansion where White Melody Demon Lord lives is ahead. Although White Melody Demon Lord is also the strongest expert in the dark zone, his strength and skills are mediocre. He doesn’t specialize in any special skills, and he doesn’t have many life-saving secret skills. If he falls into master’s Sword Formation, master will have a chance to kill him,” Emperor Sha said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","It did not take long for Jian Wushuang to meet White Melody Demon Lord. Soon, Jian Wushuang used the wave light sword formation to fight with White Melody Demon Lord.","Not far away in the void, Demon King Myriad Bones and Marquis Suxin released their soul power and watched the battle in front of them.","“This Blood Sword Master is really crazy. He took the initiative to find the strongest experts in the dark zone to fight with them. Does he want to use the strongest experts in the dark zone to temper his sword formation?” Demon King Myriad Bones curled his lips. Emperor Sha was the same. He was clearly extremely arrogant, but he actually brought him to seek out the strongest experts of the dark zones.","“It’s his own fault that Emperor Sha acknowledged Blood Sword Master. The two of them have even become good friends. Blood Sword Master wants to temper his sword formation, so Emperor Sha naturally has to help.” Marquis Suxin laughed calmly.","“I’ve heard of that White Melody Demon Lord. Although he isn’t weak, his life-saving secret arts are very ordinary. If he were to fall into the Blood Sword Master’s sword array alone, he wouldn’t be able to break it. He wouldn’t be able to escape either. He would probably die at the hands of the Blood Sword Master in the end.” Demon King Myriad Bones said.","The two of them were casually chatting.","Suddenly —","The expressions of Demon King Myriad Bones and Marquis Suxin both changed, and then their eyes lit up with joy.","“Lord, we’ve finally arrived.” Their soul-force had already sensed the arrival of Demon Dragon Lord and someone else.","The two immediately went forward to welcome him.","“Greetings, Lord.”","Demon King Myriad Bones and Marquis Suxin both bowed respectfully, while at the same time, they noticed an unyielding old man standing next to Demon Dragon Lord.","“The Ruler Spark?” Demon King Myriad Bones and Marquis Suxin are startled.","“10,000 bones, pure heart, that Blood Sword Master can be in front?” Demon Dragon Lord overlooks over.","“Yes.” The Demon King Myriad Bones nodded respectfully. “He is currently fighting against one of the most powerful experts in the 42nd dark zone, the White Melody Demon Lord. The White Melody Demon Lord shouldn’t be a match for him and is about to die. In addition, Ruler Emperor Sha has been with the Blood Sword Master all these years, and is also in the front,” the Demon King Myriad Bones said.","“Emperor Sha?” Demon Dragon Lord’s eyes were cold. “Many years ago, I tried to kill him, but he was lucky enough to escape. Now that he is with Blood Sword Master, let’s kill him as well. Let’s go.”","Demon Dragon Lord rushed out directly. Behind him, there were five people, including Ruler Spark, Ruler Red One, Dark Fire Ruler, Demon King Myriad Bones, and Marquis Suxin. They were approaching Jian Wushuang at an extremely fast speed.","In the endless void, an endless sea of sword essence swept up, forming layers of sword essence waves that attacked White Melody Demon Lord in the center.","White Melody Demon Lord had been trapped in the light sword formation for a long time. He had used all his skills, but he could not break free from the sword formation. He could only watch as his divine power was being consumed, he was in a desperate situation.","At this moment, Emperor Sha, who had been standing outside the battlefield, suddenly came to Jian Wushuang’s side.","“Blood Sword, Demon King Myriad Bones and Marquis Suxin have left my soul perception range. If I’m not mistaken, Demon Dragon Lord should have arrived,” Emperor Sha said. Because there was an outsider present, Emperor Sha did not call Jian Wushuang master, but Blood Sword.","“Demon Dragon Lord is here?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","“Demon Dragon Lord?” White Melody Demon Lord, who was in the center of the Wave Light Sword Formation, was also shocked.","As expected, a vast and overwhelming aura slowly came from the void in the distance. At the end of the void, several figures were approaching at an amazing speed.","In the blink of an eye, they arrived in the void outside the battlefield, and one figure after another appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","There were six people in the group. Except for the four people whom Jian Wushuang had met before, namely, Red One Ruler, Dark Fire Ruler, Demon King Myriad Bones, and Marquis Suxin, the others were Demon Dragon Lord and an arrogant elder.","“Is that Demon Dragon Lord?”","Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Dragon Lord, who had a black horn on his forehead.","The latter stood there, emitting an invisible aura that was much stronger than that of an ordinary third-level Ruler or even the strongest expert in the dark zone.","Jian Wushuang also felt a tremendous pressure from him.","This pressure would only appear when it posed a great threat to him.","“As expected of one of the ten great kings. Just standing there gives me such a strong pressure. If I didn’t have the token of a disciple of the Red Cloud Lineage, I really couldn’t guarantee that I would be able to escape unscathed.” Jian Wushuang sighed in his heart.","Then he looked at the arrogant elder next to Demon Dragon Lord.","“Who is this man? I don’t think there is a match for him in the Intelligence I received. How can he stand side by side with Demon Dragon Lord?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","Even the Red One Ruler, who was as strong as Emperor Sha, was standing respectfully behind Demon Dragon Lord. However, this arrogant elder was standing side by side with Demon Dragon Lord, Demon Dragon Lord did not have any objection to this.","Obviously, this person was not Demon Dragon Lord’s subordinate.","“Could it be another emperor?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","In his opinion, only the other nine emperors could stand on the same level as Demon Dragon Lord in the first level of Eternal Darkness Prison.","Emperor Sha, who was standing next to him, said softly, “Master, if I’m not wrong, that arrogant elder should be Ruler Spark.”","“Ruler Spark?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“Ruler Spark is not an emperor. He is not very strong and is only an ordinary third-level Ruler. However, he has a very good understanding of formations. He is recognized as the best in the first level of eternal prison!” Ruler Emperor Sha said.","“The best in formations?”","Upon hearing Ruler Emperor Sha’s words, Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up."]},{"number":3908,"title":"Chapter 3908 - Battle Strength of the Emperor","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang had been exploring the dark areas in the Demon Dragon field and challenging the strongest experts in the dark areas. His goal was to perfect his two sword formations as much as possible, over the years, he had gained something, but not much.","The biggest improvement he had made in the two sword formations was in the 9th Dark Zone, under the guidance of Blood Rain Demon Venerable for thirty years.","During those thirty years, his two sword formations could be said to have improved by leaps and bounds.","And now, he had met another expert who was good at formations, and he was publicly acknowledged to be number one in the first level of the Eternal Dark Prison!","This Ruler Spark’s understanding of array formations was definitely higher than Blood Rain Demon Monarch’s, or even much higher.","After all, although Blood Rain Demon Monarch’s attainments in array formations were also high, he was also extremely confident. He believed that his attainments in array formations could barely rank in the top ten of the first level of Eternal Darkness Prison.","But in reality, this sort of ranking was only her own opinion and did not receive the approval of others.","However, it was different for the Ruler Spark. He was recognized by countless cultivators in the first level of Eternal Dark Prison.","His attainments in the Dao of formation must be extremely high.","If Jian Wushuang could subdue such an expert who was good at formation, it would be of great help to him.","“The Demon Dragon Lord is really a good person. It’s one thing for him to come to me, but he actually brought me such a big gift.” Jian Wushuang smiled, feeling extremely happy.","Because of Demon Dragon Lord’s arrival, the fierce battle between Jian Wushuang and White Melody Demon Lord naturally stopped.","Although White Melody Demon Lord did not have much divine power left and it would only take Jian Wushuang a moment to kill him, Jian Wushuang still stopped. White Melody Demon Lord immediately seized the opportunity to escape to the surrounding void.","However, he could not leave immediately because the moment Demon Spirit Lord appeared, the surrounding void was covered by a huge magic formation.","This formation was much more powerful than the one that Blood Rain Demon Monarch had set up in the past.","Moreover, Blood Rain Demon Monarch had set up the formation in the past, so it would take some time to prepare. However, Stone Fire Star Master had set up a more powerful formation with a flip of his hand.","Jian Wushuang, Emperor Sha, and White Melody Demon Lord could not escape from the formation.","“I can feel that the formation is very strong. Even if I use my strongest skills, I’m afraid I Won’t be able to break it,” Emperor Sha said in a low voice.","“To be able to set up such a powerful formation with a flip of his hand, the attainments of Stone Fire Star Master in the Dao of formation are indeed impressive.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes shone with brilliance.","The more skilled he was in the Dao of formations, the happier he felt.","Whoosh!","In a flash, White Melody Demon Lord arrived in the void in front of Demon Dragon Lord and the others.","“Lord, you must be here for Blood Sword Master. It has nothing to do with me. Please let me go. White Melody will remember your kindness. No matter what your orders are, I will do my best.” White Melody Demon Lord was very respectful, his attitude was extremely low.","His divine power had been greatly damaged, and he didn’t want to stay any longer.","And from his point of view, he was the strongest expert in the dark zone. In terms of strength, he was not like the Dark Fire Ruler, Demon King Myriad Bones, or Marquis Suxin. And now, his attitude was so low...he had even promised to work for Demon Dragon Lord in the future. Demon Dragon Lord should have let him go.","But in reality...","Demon Dragon Region Lord merely shot a cold glance at White Melody before waving his hand.","Boom!","A majestic might suddenly swept out, transforming into a bolt of purple divine lightning. The purple divine lightning contained a terrifying destructive power as it struck White Melody’s body.","White Melody widened his eyes as a trace of hatred and anger flashed in his eyes. However, his aura began to dissipate.","With a wave of his hand, White Melody died.","“Hmph. A piece of trash wants to work for me? How laughable.” Demon Dragon Region Lord was disdainful.","Ruler Red One, Demon King Myriad Bones, and the others behind him weren’t surprised at all.","Demon Dragon Region Lord was one of the ten great monarchs. He was the Region Lord of the devildragon realm, and he was a lofty figure. How could it be so easy for him to work for him?","The reason why they were able to work for Demon Dragon Lord was because of some special factors. Otherwise, Demon Dragon Lord would not have bothered to look at them, except for Red One.","Jian Wushuang and Emperor Sha were surprised to see this.","“He is the strongest expert in the dark zone. Although I have used up more than half of his divine power, Demon Dragon Lord did not use his full strength. He simply killed him without even taking out his supreme treasure weapon.” Jian Wushuang was secretly amazed.","At the same time, he understood that Demon Dragon Lord’s strength was stronger than he had imagined.","Previously, he had heard that the most powerful attacks of the thousand kill Emperor Lord and Emperor Sha Ruler were comparable to the power of ordinary kings. But now, it seemed that they were comparable, however, they were only comparable to the power of a casual attack from the ten great kings. If the ten great kings were slightly more serious and took out their supreme treasures and divine weapons, the power they could unleash...would definitely be much stronger than the most powerful attacks of Thousand Kills Emperor Lord and Emperor Sha.","After killing White Melody Demon Lord, Demon Dragon Lord’s expression did not change at all. He looked at Jian Wushuang again with his cold eyes, however, there was a hint of unconcealable fanaticism in the depths of his eyes.","“Blood Sword Master, I’ll give you a chance. Hand over your two principle supreme treasures and submit to me. I can promise not to kill you,” Demon Dragon Lord growled.","“Oh, you want me to submit?” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. He was not surprised.","Just like when he met Demon Emperor ancient night, Demon Emperor ancient night wanted to subdue him at first. He was extremely excited because demon emperor ancient night had left Eternal Dark Prison and returned to the universe, moreover, he had a master behind him. That was why he wanted a super genius like him.","However, Demon Dragon Lord was still in the Eternal Dark Prison, where geniuses were not worth anything. He probably wanted to subdue Jian Wushuang to save some trouble, he did not really care about Jian Wushuang’s talent.","“Demon Dragon Lord, you’d better make a move. Let me see how strong you are as one of the ten kings.” Jian Wushuang beckoned Demon Dragon Lord with a provocative look."]},{"number":3909,"title":"Chapter 3909 - Powerful Demon Dragon Lord","paragraphs":["“You’re courting death!”","Demon Dragon Lord’s eyes were filled with killing intent. With a flip of his palm, a dark golden long staff appeared in his hand.","This dark golden long staff was Demon Dragon Lord’s most powerful magic weapon.","Under normal circumstances, Demon Dragon Lord did not need to use a magic weapon to kill an ordinary expert of the dark zone.","For example, Demon Dragon Lord had killed White Melody Demon Lord directly with its power. However, considering that Emperor Sha was standing beside Jian Wushuang, Demon Dragon Lord would take out its supreme supreme treasure magic weapon immediately.","“Emperor Sha, step aside and don’t interfere,” Jian Wushuang instructed.","“Yes.” Emperor Sha nodded and stepped aside.","“Finally, I can fight with an expert at the Ruler level.” Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Dragon Lord with a hint of excitement in his eyes.","“Emperor Sha retreated?” Demon Dragon Lord glanced at Emperor Sha, but the killing intent in his eyes became more intense. “I don’t care. If he dares to block my way, I’ll kill him.”","Demon Dragon Lord attacked directly.","With a simple step, he crossed the distance and appeared in front of Jian Wushuang. The dark golden long rod in his hand suddenly turned into a dark golden thunderbolt and slashed down fiercely, at that moment, the space was smashed with a violent roar.","A terrifying destructive power appeared above Jian Wushuang’s head.","“This power is so strong.”","Jian Wushuang was secretly shocked, but at the first moment, a large amount of the power of Earth principles rose, carrying the vast universe origin of sword principle.","In an instant, the Earth Guardian Sword Array had been formed.","The Dark Golden Thunderbolt formed by the dark golden long stick directly hit the Earth Guardian Sword Array, and a crisp explosion immediately sounded.","Jian Wushuang’s Earth Guardian Sword Formation began to tremble violently, but it soon calmed down.","“As expected, my Earth Guardian Sword Formation has been greatly improved under the guidance of Blood Rain Demon Monarch. In addition, its power has also been improved to a certain extent over the years of adventuring. Even the most powerful fourth axe of the Emperor of thousand kills could not move the sword formation at all.”","“The attack of the Demon Dragon Lord is indeed much stronger than the fourth axe of the thousand killing Emperor, but it’s still not enough to break my sword formation directly.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","When he was separated from Blood Rain Demon Monarch and the thousand killing Emperor, the thousand killing Emperor had said that Jian Wushuang’s earth guardian sword formation’s protective ability was extremely terrifying. Even if a king came in person, if he did not pay a price...he would not be able to break the sword formation. This was not empty talk.","Now, Demon Dragon Lord had used his strongest supreme treasure magic weapon, but his attack still could not break Jian Wushuang’s earth-protecting sword formation.","“Huh?” Demon Dragon Lord frowned slightly. “No wonder Red One and the others said that they could not kill Blood Sword Master. They could even block my attack with my strongest supreme treasure magic weapon. With the protective sword formation, how could they kill him?”","Demon Dragon Lord admitted that Jian Wushuang’s protective sword formation was very impressive, but he did not care at all.","After all, he was Demon Dragon Lord, one of the ten kings of the first level of Eternal Dark Prison. Although he was still at the third level, the primary Ruler level, in terms of combat strength...he had long reached the peak of the third level, advanced Ruler level, and was even infinitely close to the peak of the third level.","Although he had used all his strength, he did not use his ultimate move.","“Dragon flash!”","Demon Dragon Lord shouted in a low voice, and the dark golden long stick in his hand suddenly turned into a dark golden flood dragon.","The Dark Golden Flood Dragon was huge, and it shot toward Jian Wushuang with a shocking momentum.","The Dark Golden Flood Dragon was unbelievably fast!","Almost instantly, it crashed into the Earth Protection Sword Formation on Jian Wushuang’s body.","The terrifying impact caused the earth protection sword formation to tremble crazily. In the blink of an eye, it reached its limit and finally collapsed.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang retreated rapidly and immediately stopped in the void.","“It broke my Earth Protection Sword Formation?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","He could see that Demon Dragon Lord had only used his ultimate move, but he had not paid any price.","However, Demon Dragon Lord’s attack had only broken his sword formation, but it could not hurt him.","“Even my strongest move, Dragon Flash, could only break his sword formation, but it could not hurt him?” Demon Dragon Lord narrowed his eyes. The next moment, his eyes turned cold, and a shocking murderous aura swept out from his body, black and ferocious scales appeared on his face one after another.","Demon Dragon Lord was a member of the Demon Dragon Clan, and his original body was a Demon Dragon.","Normally, he would not use his original body, but now, he had revealed part of his original body when he killed Jian Wushuang.","Not only did he reveal part of his original body, but he had also consumed a part of his blood essence.","“Die!”","Demon Dragon Lord shouted again, his voice full of endless killing intent. The surface of his body glowed with a faint light, and the dark golden long stick in his hand swung out one after another.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Three strokes in a row, each of which was ridiculously powerful. At the end of the third stroke, the power was stacked together, condensing an explosive power.","Jian Wushuang had no way to dodge, so he could only use the earth-protection sword formation again.","However, the sword formation was hit by an unprecedented impact after the three strikes.","The first two strikes alone destroyed Jian Wushuang’s earth-protection sword formation. As for the third strike, it hit Jian Wushuang’s divine body without any hindrance.","Under the impact of the terrifying power, Jian Wushuang was smashed to the ground.","After a while, Jian Wushuang rose up again, but his aura was obviously weaker than before.","“I’ve lost more than 10% of my Divine Power?”","Jian Wushuang was surprised, but he immediately smiled. “As expected of Demon Dragon Lord, one of the ten kings. He’s really strong.”","Jian Wushuang had to admit.","The three strikes were ridiculously powerful, especially the third strike, which was probably at the peak of the third level.","Even though it was weakened by his supreme treasure armor, it still severely injured his divine body and directly consumed more than 10 percent of his divine power.","This was because Jian Wushuang’s supreme treasure armor had been replaced with the ice soul armor of the supreme grade, which greatly improved his protective ability.","If it was still the Dark Gold Demon Dragon Armor, this strike could at least cause Jian Wushuang to lose more than 30% of his divine power."]},{"number":3910,"title":"Chapter 3910 - Suppression With a Flip of the Hand","paragraphs":["Although the Demon Dragon Lord had paid a price for that move, the price was not too high. The Demon Dragon Lord could probably use the same move many times.","“If I met the Demon Dragon Lord in other places, I would have to flee in a sorry state.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","However, he was in the Eternal Dark Prison.","In the Eternal Dark Prison, he was not worried that he would be in danger.","“Demon Dragon Lord, you are indeed powerful and worthy of the title of Emperor. It’s a pity that you met me, so you can only blame your bad luck,” Jian Wushuang suddenly said.","“Blame my bad luck?” Demon Dragon Lord was stunned.","Master Stone Spark, Ruler Red One, and the others who were watching the battle in the surrounding void were also stunned.","They could not understand what Blood Sword Master could do in such a situation?","Only Emperor Sha understood what Jian Wushuang was going to do after hearing his words. He looked at Demon Dragon Lord with pity.","Jian Wushuang had a rough idea of Demon Dragon Lord’s strength, so he could not be bothered to hide it anymore. He took out the token of a disciple of the Red Cloud branch and activated the power of the magic formation in an instant, a majestic power immediately descended.","“This is...the power of the Eternal Dark Prison’s magic array. The Red Cloud Branch, he is from the Red Cloud Branch!”","Demon Dragon Lord immediately reacted.","But by the time he reacted, it was obviously too late.","The majestic power directly affected Demon Dragon Lord. Although Demon Dragon Lord was an expert at the king level and had battle strength close to the peak of the third level, he was pitifully weak under the power of the Eternal Dark Prison’s magic array, there was no room for struggle.","In an instant, he was suppressed by the power of the array formation and could not move at all.","Not only Demon Dragon Lord, but also the five people who had been watching the battle, including the Ruler Spark, the Red One Ruler, the ten thousand bone demon lord, the Dark Fire Ruler, and the Marquis Suxin, were also suppressed by that power.","“No!”","“The Red Cloud Bloodline, the Blood Sword Master is from the Red Cloud bloodline!”","“We’re doomed, we’re doomed!”","The five people were immediately suppressed and could not move.","Soon, the five people gathered with Demon Dragon Lord and lay in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Master.” Emperor Sha came to Jian Wushuang’s side.","“Master?”","Demon Dragon Lord and the others were shocked when they heard Emperor Sha Address Jian Wushuang. However, they soon understood.","“Emperor Sha has already submitted to Blood Sword Master!”","“Damn it, we were all fooled by him!”","Red One, Demon King Myriad Bones, Dark Fire Ruler, and Marquis Suxin were all shocked and furious.","When they saw Emperor Sha with Jian Wushuang, Emperor Sha called Blood Sword Blood Sword Master. He said that Blood Sword Master was his best friend and that he did it for his best friend.","But now it seemed that it was not the case.","Emperor Sha had long submitted to Blood Sword Master. It was obvious that Blood Sword Master had exposed his identity and used the power of the Eternal Darkness Prison to suppress him. Emperor Sha was willing to submit in order to survive.","It was a lie to see them say that they were best friends. Jian Wushuang was from the Red Cloud Branch and could use the power of the Eternal Darkness Prison. Naturally, he could easily suppress the four of them, however, Jian Wushuang did not do that. Instead, he let them go back and report the news.","His purpose was obvious.","“Bastard, the Blood Sword Master deliberately lured me here!”","“This is a trap. I was tricked by him and he came to me.”","“Stupid, I’m really stupid!”","Demon Dragon Lord growled in a hysterical voice.","“Demon Dragon Lord, you are really stupid.” Jian Wushuang looked down at Demon Dragon Lord, he said in a deep voice, “Don’t you think about it carefully? I’m just a Principles Master, but I have two principle supreme treasures at the same time. I dare to challenge experts in your Demon Dragon field without any scruples. How can I not have any support?”","“Besides, you’ve already sent Ruler Red One and a few others to kill me. Although I’ve sent them away, I know that you’ll definitely take action next, but I still dare to stay in the 42nd dark zone as if nothing had happened. When you arrive, don’t you have any doubts?”","“Of course I have doubts.”","Demon Dragon Region Lord said in a low voice, “When I found out about your existence, I began to doubt your identity. Although there are countless cultivators in the first level of Eternal Darkness Prison, there is no Principles Master among them. At least for hundreds of chaos cycles, I’ve never heard of a Principles Master there, not to mention that this Principles Master has a principle true treasure.”","“I guessed that you might have entered Eternal Dark Prison recently, but I thought you were lucky to find Eternal Dark Prison. I didn’t think of you as a member of the Red Cloud family. After all, the Red Cloud family was destroyed a long time ago. It’s an indisputable fact!”","“I thought you were an arrogant outsider who relied on some protective means. That’s why I wanted to seize the opportunity to attack you. After all, those two principle true treasures in your hands were too attractive to me. I didn’t expect that I would be defeated by you in the end!”","Demon Dragon Region Lord’s eyes were spitting fire.","The winner takes all. He admitted that he had been careless this time. He had taken the initiative to send himself to be suppressed by Blood Sword Master.","However, he did not regret it.","There was nothing to regret. After all, he had been trapped in Eternal Dark Prison for a long time, and he had long lost hope. It was not easy for him to find out that there was an outsider with two true treasures. Of course, he had to seize this opportunity to fight, he might be lucky enough to not only get the two supreme treasures, but also learn from Blood Sword Master how to leave the Eternal Dark Prison.","Unfortunately, he did not succeed and was suppressed by the other party.","“Demon Dragon Lord, you are indeed an Ruler in the Eternal Dark Prison. Don’t worry, I won’t kill you directly. I’ll give you two choices, surrender or die!” Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Dragon Lord calmly.","“Haha, surrender? You want me to surrender?” Demon Dragon Lord sneered.","“Don’t refuse me so quickly. Wait for me to finish.” Jian Wushuang briefly described what he needed to do after submitting to him. Of course, he also mentioned some of the things he could do.","Demon Dragon Lord, who was originally very determined and unwilling to surrender, immediately wavered after hearing Jian Wushuang’s words.","Behind him, the eyes of Stone Ruler Spark, Red One Ruler, and the others also shone brightly."]},{"number":3911,"title":"Chapter 3911 - Five Principles Supreme Treasures","paragraphs":["“Blood Sword Master, can you take us out of the Eternal Dark Prison?” Demon Dragon Lord stared at Jian Wushuang.","“Of course.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “Not only that, you only need to submit to me for 100,000 years. I can swear to the universal principle that you will be free in 100,000 years. Demon Dragon Lord, you have fought for so many years in the Eternal Dark Prison and fought so hard to reach your current position. Now you have a chance to leave, and the price is only 100,000 years. You have to think carefully.”","Demon Dragon Lord frowned and pondered for a moment before raising his head again, he said, “Now I finally understand why Emperor Sha, such a proud man, is willing to submit to you. You’re right. It’s only 100,000 years. Even if I have to work for you for 100,000 years, or even become your plaything like Star Demon Ancestor, I’ll accept it.”","“Demon Dragon Lord, you’re not that stupid.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","It was obvious that Demon Dragon Lord had agreed to submit.","“What about you guys?” Jian Wushuang looked back at Stone Fire Star Master, Red One Ruler, and the others.","Among them, Demon King Myriad Bones, Dark Fire Ruler, and Marquis Suxin agreed without thinking.","They had submitted to Demon Dragon Lord before, but they did not allow him to leave a mark in the soul origin.","Now, they had submitted to Jian Wushuang for only 100,000 years. However, Jian Wushuang was able to take them out of the Eternal Dark Prison. It was definitely a good deal.","As for the Red One Ruler and the Ruler Spark, they both chose to submit without hesitation.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang was delighted.","Among the experts who submitted to him, Demon Dragon Lord was one of the ten great kings. He was probably close to the peak of the third-level Ruler. In the future, he would definitely be a great battle force in the battle with Devil Cloud Star.","As for the Red One Ruler, his battle strength was no weaker than the Emperor Sha Ruler, and he was also a great help.","However, the one who really excited Jian Wushuang was the Ruler Spark.","The Ruler Spark was the best in Eternal Darkness Prison Array Formation. With him around, his two sword formations could be greatly improved and perfected.","In just a moment, Jian Wushuang had left a mark in the soul origin of the Rulers in front of him and had absolute control over them.","“The cave mansion where White Melody Demon Lord lives is right in front of us. Demon Dragon, Stone Fire, and Emperor Sha, you three follow me. The rest of you wait here,” Jian Wushuang instructed.","“Yes.” Everyone naturally accepted the order.","In the cave mansion, Jian Wushuang sat on a stone bench while Demon Dragon Lord, Stone Fire, and Emperor Sha stood in front of him.","“Stone Fire.” Jian Wushuang looked at Stone Fire first.","“Master.” Ruler Spark smiled humbly. Although Ruler Spark looked arrogant, he was actually a very humble man with a good temper. The reason why he was imprisoned in Eternal Darkness Prison...was purely because he had offended the people of the Red Cloud branch, not because he had committed a heinous crime.","“I created two sword formations. Blood Rain Demon Monarch improved them a lot for me, but I still feel that there is a lot of room for improvement. You are good at formations and your attainments in formations are recognized as the best in the Eternal Darkness Prison. From now on, you will stay by my side and help me improve these two sword formations,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Ruler Spark nodded immediately.","“Demon Dragon, you are one of the ten emperors of Eternal Darkness Prison and the Lord of the Demon Dragon Field. Do you have any Principles Supreme Treasures?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“No.” Demon Dragon Lord shook his head.","“None?” Jian Wushuang looked strange.","“Master, there are indeed a few principles supreme treasures in Eternal Darkness Prison, but there are not many. Among the ten emperors, there are a few who have principles supreme treasures, but I’m at the bottom of the list, so I don’t have any.” Demon Dragon Lord said bitterly.","“The bottom of the list?” Jian Wushuang was stunned. “Why? Are you at the bottom of the list?”","“I’m at the bottom. At least I know that six of the ten kings are stronger than me. As for the other four, they’re probably the same as me,” Demon Dragon Lord said.","“Which of the other kings have a nomological treasure?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","“There are four known kings who have a principle supreme treasure. They are blood mountain lord, Redbud Domain Lord, Bone Emperor, and Devil Scorpion Lord. As for the other kings, they may also have a principle supreme treasure, but they have never taken it out. Among the four known kings who have a principle Supreme Treasure, Devil Scorpion Lord has the most principle supreme treasures. He has five principle Supreme Treasures,” Demon Dragon Lord said.","“What? Five?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","In the vast universe, there were only one or two principle supreme treasures in the fourth or even fifth level.","He had also passed the test of the Red Cloud World by chance and obtained a principle Supreme Treasure, divine sword, and a Heaven Suppression Tablet left by his Master Xuan Yi.","But now, in the first level of Eternal Dark Prison, where the highest level was a third level Ruler, someone had five principle supreme treasures at the same time?","These five principle supreme treasures instantly tempted Jian Wushuang.","“Demon Dragon, are you sure that Devil Scorpion Lord has five principle Supreme Treasures?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","“Of course I’m sure. To tell you the truth, I’ve met the old scorpion several times and even fought with him. I know his strength and trump cards very well. I’m sure that he has five principle supreme treasures, and one of them is a principle supreme treasure long staff that is completely suitable for me to use. I went to him personally and was willing to pay a huge price to exchange for the principle supreme treasure long staff, but he refused.”","“The reason I came to you this time is to get the two principle supreme treasures in your hands and exchange them for the long staff,” Demon Dragon Lord said.","“If you get my two principle Supreme Treasures, will Devil Scorpion Lord give them to you?” Jian Wushuang asked with a smile.","“Of course, he will beg me to exchange them,” Demon Dragon Lord said affirmatively.","“Why?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“Master, you don’t know. Devil Scorpion Lord has five principle treasures, two of which are special stone tablets. I heard from Ruler Red One that he has a 30,000-meter-tall stone tablet with golden secret patterns on its surface. It should be the same as the two stone tablets in Devil Scorpion Lord’s hand,” Demon Dragon Lord said.","“The Heaven Suppression Tablet!” Jian Wushuang stood up abruptly. “You mean the Devil Scorpion Lord has two Heaven Suppression Tablets?”"]},{"number":3912,"title":"Chapter 3912 - News","paragraphs":["“Yes, it’s the Heaven Suppression Tablet.”","Demon Dragon Lord nodded and said, “Old Scorpion already has two Heaven Suppression Tablets, but over the years, he has been trying to find a third one. Unfortunately, the resources of Eternal Darkness Prison are limited, so he hasn’t been able to get it. According to my guess, if Old Scorpion gets three Heaven Suppression Tablets at the same time, his strength will definitely increase greatly.”","“It will improve a lot,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","He had a Heaven Suppression Tablet, and he had learned about its origin from the Devil Flame.","The Heaven Suppression Tablet was a principle-suppressing treasure, but its true function was to combine with a unique formation.","The formation was four centimeters long, and the basic first-level formation alone required three Heaven Suppression Tablets.","Since Devil Scorpion Lord was so eager to get the third Heaven Suppression Tablet, it was likely that he had a level one formation with the help of the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","As long as he got three Heaven Suppression Tablets, he could unleash the power of the level one formation and his strength would increase dramatically.","However, now that Jian Wushuang knew about it, he had to start thinking about it.","“If I can get the two Heaven Suppression Tablets from Devil Scorpion Lord and get the first level of the formation from him, with my strength and a sense of the principles of the universe, I’m afraid that my overall strength will be greatly improved.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a strange light.","“Demon Dragon, continue to tell me about the other principle treasures in Demon Dragon Lord’s hands and the other kings. Tell me about them in detail.” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes,” Demon Dragon Lord immediately began to explain.","Although Jian Wushuang had heard about the ten kings in the first level of Eternal Dark Prison, he did not know much about their trump cards.","However, Demon Dragon Lord was one of the ten kings, and he often interacted with those kings, so he must know more about them than Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang and Demon Dragon Lord were talking in the cave mansion.","Outside the cave mansion, Red One Ruler, Dark Fire Ruler, Demon King Myriad Bones, and Marquis Suxin were waiting quietly.","“We originally came with Demon Dragon Lord to deal with Blood Sword Master, but we didn’t expect that Blood Sword Master was from the Red Cloud Branch. In the blink of an eye, he became his slave. How unpredictable.” Demon King Myriad Bones sighed.","“Previously, although we submitted to Lord Demon Dragon, he didn’t leave a mark on our soul essences. But now...” Dark Fire Ruler sighed to himself.","“Let’s all think things through. When we think about Lord Demon Dragon, he was the one who was the most unwilling. But now, isn’t he the slave of Blood Sword Master as well?” Ruler Red One said.","“That’s true.” Demon King Myriad Bones and Dark Fire Ruler both smiled.","Indeed. Even Demon Dragon Region Lord had obediently submitted to Blood Sword Master. They had only been Demon Dragon Region Lord’s subordinates, what was there to be unwilling about?","Right at this moment...","“Someone is coming.” Ruler Red One suddenly raised his head. An aura had already appeared within his soul’s range of perception.","He was quite familiar with this aura.","“It’s Manyu. What is he doing here?” Ruler Red One revealed a puzzled look.","A short while later, a young man dressed in silver armor appeared in front of Ruler Red One and the others.","“Ruler Red One.” The young man laughed as he called out.","“Manyu, why aren’t you staying at Demon Dragon Castle? What are you doing here?” Ruler Red One frowned as he asked.","Ruler Manyu was also an expert under the command of the Demon Dragon Region Lord. However, in terms of status and power, he was inferior to the lord and the others. After all, the lord and the others were all close to the Demon Dragon Region Lord, and they were quite close to him, Ruler Manyu, on the other hand, was simply someone who worked for the Demon Dragon Region Lord.","“Your Lordship, are you inside?” Ruler Manyu glanced at the mountain behind him.","“Yes.” Ruler Red One nodded. “Is there something you need from the Lord?”","“I was originally staying within the castle, but not too long ago I learned of a matter of great importance, which is why I immediately came to report to you, your Lordship,” Ruler Manyu said.","“Is that so?” Ruler Red One understood. “Tell me. What is it that makes you feel the need to personally make this trip?”","“It’s like this.” Ruler Manyu immediately changed the story he was about to report.","After hearing this, Red One and the other three were stunned, and their expressions became extremely solemn.","“Manyu, wait here. I’ll immediately report to the Lord.” Red One immediately rushed toward the cave mansion in the middle of the mountain.","In the cave mansion, Demon Dragon Lord was still telling Jian Wushuang some things about the ten emperors.","Ruler Red One walked in directly.","“Master, Lord.” Ruler Red One bowed to Jian Wushuang and Demon Dragon Lord one by one.","“Red One, what’s the matter?” Jian Wushuang looked at him.","“Master, Master Manyu, one of the Lord’s subordinates, heard about something and rushed over from Demon Dragon Castle to report to the Lord. He said that not long ago, someone in the Demon Dragon Region saw Star Demon Ancestor riding a carriage and capturing cultivators on the way,” Ruler Red One said solemnly.","“Star Demon Ancestor?”","Upon hearing Star Demon Ancestor’s name, both Star Fire and Emperor Sha trembled. Clearly, they feared Star Demon Ancestor.","“Star Demon Ancestor actually came to our Demon Dragon Domain? But it hasn’t even been a billion years since his last patrol. Clearly, it hasn’t been that long yet?” Demon Dragon Region Lord frowned as well.","Star Demon usually went out in a regular way. After all, the purpose of Star Demon’s trip was to capture cultivators and turn them into animals for him to have fun. The cultivators he captured would usually be tortured by him for a long time, when he was tired of them, he would go to capture the next batch.","However, it had not been long since Star Demon went out to capture cultivators. Therefore, Star Demon should not go out during this period of time.","“Star Demon went on a patrol?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","He had heard about Star Demon going on a patrol in the Eternal Dark Prison and knew about Star Demon Ancestor’s weird habits.","At the same time, he also understood why Demon Monarch Ancient Night asked him to find a way to kill Star Demon Ancestor.","It was obvious that Demon Monarch Ancient Night had been caught by Star Demon Ancestor when he was on a patrol. Then, Star Demon Ancestor took him back and turned him into an animal. He was tortured for a billion years.","No one could bear the shame and pain of a Ruler being turned into an animal for a billion years.","“It’s such a coincidence that Star Demon Ancestor chose a place and a time to go on patrol,” Jian Wushuang suddenly said."]},{"number":3913,"title":"Chapter 3913 - The Mysterious Star Demon Ancestor","paragraphs":["It was a coincidence.","He did not go out early or late, but he came to Eternal Dark Prison after he became famous.","Moreover, the place where Star Demon Ancestor went out happened to be in the Demon Dragon Field.","“Master, do you mean that Star Demon Ancestor came for you?” Demon Dragon Lord looked over.","“What do you think?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Demon Dragon Lord.","“It’s possible.” Demon Dragon Lord nodded slightly, then he said seriously, “Star Demon Ancestor is a great devil. He has always been very mysterious. Among the ten kings, he is definitely the most mysterious and special one.”","“The most mysterious and special one?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. “Tell me.”","“Master, you may not know this, but although the ten kings appear to be on the same level, there is a certain gap in strength between us. There will also be competition and even fighting. It’s just that it’s very difficult to kill each other between kings. Over the years, these kings have been very familiar with each other’s strength and methods. However, Star Demon Ancestor is the only one among the ten kings who still doesn’t know his limits.”","“Although he is known as the number one devil of the Eternal Dark Hell, and once in a while he will go out to patrol and capture cultivators wantonly. Those cultivators won’t even have the chance to struggle in his hands, but he will only deal with peak-stage second-level cultivators or ordinary third-level Rulers. But when facing other monarchs, he rarely makes a move.”","“He doesn’t occupy a territory, which means that there are fewer conflicts of interest between him and the other monarchs. Few other monarchs would find trouble with him, and even if they did, he would be able to easily deal with them. During the past hundred chaos cycles, Star Demon Ancestor has struck out several times, but each time, he uses a different method. He can easily send away one monarch after another.”","“In short, he is very mysterious and has many tricks up his sleeve. Most of the Kings among the ten kings are not afraid of each other, but none of them dare to provoke Star Demon Ancestor. Even if Star Demon Ancestor often appears in the territory of these kings and arrests cultivators, these kings usually turn a blind eye and won’t fight Star Demon Ancestor for the sake of these cultivators.”","After saying that, Demon Dragon Lord fell silent.","“Demon Dragon, have you fought with Star Demon Ancestor?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Once,” Demon Dragon Lord said, “that fight was quite shameful for me.”","“Shameful?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“He didn’t fight with me directly. Instead, he used some strange methods and entangled me. Although I tried my best, I couldn’t touch his clothes. In the end, I was teased by him. Of course, it was shameful,” Demon Dragon Lord said.","“He didn’t fight you head-on, but he could use special methods to tease you?” Jian Wushuang looked strange.","Although he had never met Star Demon Ancestor, from what Demon Dragon Lord had told him, Star Demon Ancestor was indeed very mysterious.","“Master, Star Demon Ancestor’s methods are endless. We can’t even send messages because of the special features of Eternal Dark Prison. Although there are some special ways to send messages over the years, most of them are simple and crude. It may take a long time for a message to be sent from our Demon Dragon field to another major region, but Star Demon Ancestor is different.”","“Star Demon Ancestor has his own way of transmitting information. He has created many special black birds over the long period of time. With the support of the secret pattern magic array, the black birds can cross two domains in a short period of time. Moreover, Star Demon Ancestor is a slave in each of the domains. Master, your fame in the Demon Dragon domain might attract the attention of Star Demon Ancestor’s slaves and attract him,” Demon Dragon Lord said.","“It seems that it’s possible.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “Whether or not Star Demon Ancestor is coming for me, he still wants me to deal with him.”","“Mainly to deal with Star Demon Ancestor?” Demon Dragon Lord looked at him.","“I promised someone that I would kill Star Demon Ancestor for him,” Jian Wushuang said.","He had indeed promised Demon Monarch Ancient Night. Since he had already promised, Jian Wushuang would not go back on his word.","Moreover, he was no longer the one looking for Star Demon Ancestor. It was likely that Star Demon Ancestor had already set his eyes on him and was looking for him.","“Star Demon Ancestor may have many tricks up his sleeves, and he may be extremely powerful. However, this is the Eternal Dark Prison after all. As long as he dares to appear in front of me, I can directly mobilize the power of the formation to suppress him. What we need to do now is to wait for him to take the initiative to come over.” Jian Wushuang smiled, many thoughts appeared in his mind.","“In that case, I’ll stay in the 42nd dark zone for the rest of the time. Stone Fire, my sword formation needs your help, so you can follow me. However, you have to set up a formation around me and pretend to trap me. The formation should be more powerful. As for you, Demon Dragon, take your men and stay close to me.”","“I want you to pretend that you’ve trapped me with a formation, but you can’t kill me in a short period of time. This way, when Star Demon Ancestor arrives, he won’t suspect anything. He’ll likely appear in front of me and attack me. I’ll be able to suppress him then,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.”","Demon Dragon Lord and Ruler Spark nodded respectfully.","“Emperor Sha, stay with me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Emperor Sha also nodded.","Soon, Demon Dragon Lord left with Red One Ruler and the others. They did not go far, but stopped nearby.","Ruler Spark immediately set up a huge formation in the void. The formation was so powerful that it could create a lot of noise within a million miles.","Jian Wushuang and Emperor Sha stayed in the formation.","It seemed that he was trapped by the Ruler Spark’s formation and could not escape, but in fact, Jian Wushuang was relying on the Ruler Spark’s formation to improve his two sword formations.","The Ruler Spark would occasionally appear and give Jian Wushuang some pointers on the two sword formations.","It had to be said that the Ruler Spark’s attainments in the Dao of formation were extremely high, much higher than even Blood Rain Demon Monarch.","Jian Wushuang’s two sword formations had improved a lot over the years, but Ruler Spark had found several flaws in them in a short period of time.","On one hand, Jian Wushuang tried to improve his sword formations as much as possible. On the other hand, he was waiting for Star Demon Ancestor to come to him."]},{"number":3914,"title":"Chapter 3914 - Setting up a Trap","paragraphs":["23 years after Jian Wushuang subdued Demon Dragon Lord and the others.","Ta! Ta! Ta!","The luxurious carriage sped through the void.","“Star Demon Ancestor, it’s Star Demon Ancestor!”","“Star Demon Ancestor is out on patrol, run!”","“Run quickly. If Star Demon Ancestor catches sight of you and catches you as a pig, you’ll be in trouble!”","Wherever the carriage passed, cultivators would tremble in fear.","Star Demon Ancestor was a nightmare for many cultivators. Once they encountered him, it would be a disaster.","As long as Star Demon Ancestor encountered him along the way, he would either react quickly and flee, or he would be caught by Star Demon Ancestor and thrown into the trunk of the carriage.","As long as he did not escape in time, he would not be able to escape once Star Demon Ancestor made his move.","And at that moment, the luxurious carriage had arrived at the forty-second dark zone.","“Phew!”","The carriage came to a halt in the void. Star Demon Ancestor, who was sitting in the carriage, raised his eyelids slightly and looked into the void ahead.","He could sense that there was an extraordinary array formation’s might in the void millions of kilometers away. At the same time, his soul power had sensed a few powerful auras not far away.","“Looks like I let the Demon Dragon get ahead of me.” Star Demon Ancestor propped his head with his right hand. “But that’s right. This is the Demon Dragon domain after all. It’s his territory. I’ll need some time to rush here. My speed is indeed inferior to his, but even though he’s faster than me, Blood Sword Master doesn’t seem to have fallen into his hands.”","Star Demon Ancestor chuckled as he pointed with a finger.","“Go!”","With that said, the carriage continued its journey. Moments later, it arrived in a void.","In the void, five figures were gathered there. The leader was none other than Demon Dragon Region Lord.","“Demon Dragon, long time no see. How have you been?” Star Demon Ancestor said in a gentle voice that caused one’s heart to tremble. It was as though he was greeting an old friend.","“Star Demon.” Demon Dragon Region Lord narrowed his eyes. There was a look of unconcealable wariness in his eyes.","Yes, it was wariness.","Furthermore, this wariness was not faked. Over the long years in Eternal Darkness Prison, Demon Dragon Region Lord had interacted with Star Demon Ancestor. The latter had countless tricks up his sleeve. He had even easily used some tricks to tease him, in Demon Dragon Region Lord’s eyes, even Devil Scorpion Region Lord, who had five principle true treasures, was not afraid of the ten kings of Eternal Dark Prison.","This was because even though the other kings were stronger than him, he knew the depth of their abilities.","However, Star Demon Ancestor was the only one who was so deep that he could not fathom it.","“Star Demon, what are you doing in my Demon Dragon Territory?” Demon Dragon Region Lord asked in a low voice.","“I’ve been staying in the castle for too long. I came out to take a stroll and catch some little fellows to entertain myself.” Star Demon Region Lord smiled faintly. “What? I’m just casually catching some cultivators in your Demon Dragon Domain. You, Demon Dragon, can’t be that stingy, right?”","“Hmph, just some ordinary cultivators. Since you think highly of them, go ahead and catch them. I’m too lazy to care. However, your purpose for coming here this time isn’t just that, right?” Demon Dragon Region Lord’s gaze was ice-cold. “Do you dare to say that you don’t know about Blood Sword Master?”","“Haha, I knew I couldn’t hide it from you, Demon Dragon.” Star Demon Ancestor laughed loudly, “Not long ago, I received a report from a slave saying that an extremely heaven-defying Principles Master had appeared in Demon Dragon Territory. His combat power was comparable to that of a third-level Ruler, and he could even make dark zone supreme masters flee in panic. He even had a principle true treasure godly sword in his hands. I was very interested at that time.”","“Demon Dragon, you should be aware that there are no Principles Masters in the first level of eternal dark hell. Now that a Principles Master has suddenly appeared, it is very likely that he came from the outside world. From him, we might be able to obtain a way to leave eternal dark hell. Do you think I will give up?” Star Demon Ancestor said.","“Humph! No matter what you say, that Blood Sword Master is now in my Demon Dragon Territory. He is my prey. Do you want to snatch him from me?” Demon Dragon Region Lord’s gaze turned cold.","“If I really want to snatch him, what can you do?” Star Demon Ancestor cast a mocking glance at Demon Dragon Region Lord.","“Bastard!” Demon Dragon Region Lord’s expression turned ugly as his eyes seemed to spew fire.","“Demon Dragon, you should be more realistic. You should know that if I decide to do something, there’s nothing I can’t do. If I want to snatch your prey, you can only watch helplessly as there’s nothing you can do. Furthermore, you must have found Blood Sword Master before me, right? But from the looks of it, Blood Sword Master has yet to fall into your hands. In other words, even if I don’t do anything, you won’t be able to do anything to him.” Star Demon Ancestor gave a strange smile.","Demon Dragon Region Lord clenched his hands tightly but fell silent. He did not retort.","“It looks like that Blood Sword Master is indeed capable. He can’t even do anything to you, Demon Dragon. This piqued my interest even more.” Star Demon Ancestor smiled faintly. “Demon Dragon, that Blood Sword Master is inside that gigantic array formation in front of us, right?”","Demon Dragon Region Lord looked up at Star Demon Ancestor and nodded unwillingly. “Yes.”","“That’s good. Stay here and watch how I take down Blood Sword Master.” Star Demon Ancestor Smiled sinisterly as he immediately drove the carriage to the gigantic array formation in front of him.","Demon Dragon Region Lord clenched his hands tightly as he stared coldly at Star Demon Ancestor. Only after Star Demon Ancestor left did his expression change.","“Star Demon Ancestor truly is terrifying. He is also very cautious. When we were chatting, he was observing your reactions. However, Region Lord, you were well prepared and didn’t reveal any flaws. Star Demon Ancestor should no longer have any suspicions. Now, all we have to do is wait for him to appear in front of Master Bloodsword and be suppressed by him,” Ruler Red One said with a cold laugh from behind Demon Dragon Region Lord.","“Humph, Star Demon Ancestor...” Demon Dragon Lord’s face turned ferocious. “He is one of the ten great kings, but Star Demon Ancestor is the most special and has the most powerful means. I usually fear him, and he thinks nothing of other kings because of his powerful means. But this time, I want to see how he fell at the hands of Blood Sword Master!”","This time, they had set up a trap for Star Demon Ancestor under Jian Wushuang’s order, so that Star Demon Ancestor would come to them.","As long as Star Demon Ancestor dared to appear in front of Jian Wushuang, no matter what incredible means he had, he would be suppressed by Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3915,"title":"Chapter 3915 - Silent","paragraphs":["A vast array formation with a majestic aura covered the vast void.","The array formation set up by the Ruler Spark was indeed ridiculously powerful. Even if the Demon Dragon Lord was trapped in the array formation, he would probably need to spend some effort to get out.","And such a powerful array formation would cause quite a stir.","Star Demon Ancestor had sensed the array formation’s power and was attracted here.","Soon, Star Demon Ancestor appeared in the void around the array formation. He got down from the carriage and immediately walked into the array formation.","“Oh?”","The Ruler Spark, who had set up the array formation, immediately sensed Star Demon Ancestor’s existence.","“Star Demon Ancestor is finally here, and his aura is so unique. If I hadn’t completely integrated into the formation, I might not have known that he had broken into my formation. His skills are indeed extraordinary.” Ruler Star Fire was secretly surprised.","Since Star Demon Ancestor had already arrived and his skills were so amazing, he did not dare to reveal himself to Jian Wushuang immediately in case Star Demon Ancestor slipped away.","Demon Dragon Lord had said that Star Demon Ancestor had many tricks up his sleeves. No one knew how many tricks he had up his sleeve. Although Jian Wushuang had the token of a disciple of the Red Cloud branch, he was not sure whether he could suppress Star Demon Ancestor, Star Demon Ancestor could mobilize part of the power of the Eternal Dark Prison, but Jian Wushuang was not sure if he could suppress Star Demon Ancestor if he was alert and used his tricks to escape in an instant.","Star Demon had already appeared in the magic formation and immediately sensed the presence of the Ruler Star Fire and Jian Wushuang.","“This magic formation is quite unique. The one who used it should be the Ruler Star Fire, right?”","Star Demon looked in the direction of the Magic Formation. He could sense that the Ruler Star Fire was at the end of that direction.","“He is actually able to merge with the formation and sense my existence. Ruler Spark is indeed skilled in formations. If there is a chance, I can bring him back to my castle and have a good spar with him to study the formation.” Star Demon Ancestor smiled, then he looked at Jian Wushuang, who was sitting cross-legged in the center of the formation.","“Is he Blood Sword Master?”","Star Demon Ancestor looked at Jian Wushuang carefully, as if he wanted to see through him completely.","The strange thing was that there were so many Jian Wushuang, but there was no difference between the two. It showed how brilliant Star Demon Ancestor was at concealing his aura.","“The Principles Master has comprehended a trace of the universe principle. This little guy is really good.” Star Demon Ancestor smiled, and then an invisible force swept out.","Jian Wushuang still did not notice it at all. He was now fully immersed in the study and improvement of his two sword formations.","Even when the invisible power appeared around him, he did not react. He did not even realize that the invisible power had directly entered his body until it entered his sea of consciousness.","“Oh no.” Jian Wushuang’s face suddenly changed, and his eyes suddenly opened.","He immediately became alert and tried to block the erosion of the invisible power, but it was obviously over.","When the power had already entered his sea of consciousness, it was useless for him to resist.","In just a moment, the power had entered his soul in his sea of consciousness and found his soul origin, leaving a special mark in his soul origin.","This mark was different from the one Jian Wushuang had left in the soul origin of the Demon Dragon Lord and the others.","The mark Jian Wushuang left in the soul origin of the Demon Dragon Lord and the others was just a control method. He could activate the mark at any time and destroy the soul origin of the Demon Dragon Lord and the others, it was equivalent to killing the Demon Dragon Lord and the others.","The mark Star Demon Ancestor left in Jian Wushuang’s soul origin was to completely control him.","It was equivalent to soul enslavement.","Quietly, the soul enslavement was completed.","“It’s done.” Star Demon Ancestor smiled and his figure slowly emerged from the formation.","“You are Star Demon Ancestor.” Jian Wushuang looked at the white-haired handsome man with a gloomy face.","“It’s me.” Star Demon Ancestor nodded slightly. “Strange, you should have been enslaved by my soul. When you see me, you should kneel down and call me master. How can you still have your own consciousness and thoughts?”","“Soul enslavement? Hehe...” Jian Wushuang just smiled coldly, and then his soul in his sea of consciousness began to burn at a terrifying speed.","“Soul burning?” Star Demon Ancestor’s face changed. “You can still burn your soul under my soul enslavement, and you’re so decisive?”","Under normal circumstances, choosing to burn one’s soul would mean death.","Anyone who was forced into a desperate situation would have to hesitate for a moment to use soul burning, but the Blood Sword Master in front of him did not hesitate at all, knowing that his soul had been enslaved, he immediately performed soul burning. He was very decisive.","Once the soul burning started, it could not be stopped.","“What a pity. I wanted to know how to leave this Eternal Dark Prison from him, but now...” Star Demon Ancestor frowned.","He watched Jian Wushuang’s soul burn and disappear, but in the next moment, Jian Wushuang’s soul power recovered at an amazing speed.","But the difference was that his recovered soul was not enslaved.","“Star Demon Ancestor, you are really good at enslaving my soul without making a sound.” Jian Wushuang stared at Star Demon Ancestor with a cold face.","He was indeed careless.","He felt that his perceptive ability and life-saving ability were very good, and with the token of a disciple of the Red Cloud branch in hand, he could be fearless and focus on perfecting his two sword formations.","In the end, he did not notice the arrival of Star Demon Ancestor, nor did he expect Star Demon Ancestor to have such impressive means to silently enslave his soul.","If not for the fact that he was a cultivator at the perfect life-level and that his soul essence had already fused with every part of his divine power, making him invincible in the aspect of the soul, he would have been enslaved by Star Demon Ancestor in that instant, he had become his slave.","Even with the token of a disciple of the Red Cloud branch, he could not mobilize the power of the Eternal Dark Prison in time.","“Your soul has been burned out, but you have recovered in an instant? You are a perfect life-level cultivator?” Star Demon Ancestor looked at Jian Wushuang in astonishment.","Although he had received some information about Jian Wushuang, he did not know that Jian Wushuang was a perfect life-level cultivator."]},{"number":3916,"title":"Chapter 3916 - Suppressing Star Demon","paragraphs":["“I’ve long heard that Star Demon Ancestor is the most mysterious and resourceful emperor among the ten eternal prison lords. Today, I finally learned how to enslave his soul without making a sound. It’s indeed a good method.” Jian Wushuang stared at Star Demon Ancestor, his eyes were cold.","“Haha, I didn’t expect you to be a perfect life-level cultivator besides comprehending a trace of universe principle. If such a super genius were to be placed in the deepest part of the universe, countless superpowers would fight over him.”","Star Demon Ancestor smiled, then he said, “Blood Sword Master, believe me, even if you are a perfect life-level cultivator, your life-saving methods are not weak. Even the demonic dragon can’t do anything to you. But believe me, I have thousands of ways to kill you. So, why don’t you consider becoming my servant?”","“Humph, Star Demon Ancestor, I’m afraid you’re going to miscalculate this time.” Jian Wushuang smiled coldly and took out the Red Cloud disciple token.","The moment the token appeared, Star Demon Ancestor’s expression changed.","!!","Without any hesitation, Jian Wushuang activated the power of the Eternal Dark Prison’s formation to suppress Star Demon Ancestor.","Rumble! The world shook as the supreme power pressed down on Star Demon Ancestor’s body.","He was too close to Star Demon Ancestor. Even if Star Demon Ancestor had thousands of means, he could not escape from this suppressive power,","Star Demon Ancestor let out a muffled groan and fell to the ground, his face turning ugly.","However, it was worth mentioning that although Star Demon Ancestor was suppressed by the supreme power, his body was still standing, unlike the other Rulers who were pressed to the ground, he could not move at all.","Star Demon Ancestor was not only standing, but he could barely move. However, he could not use much of his strength.","“He can stand?” Jian Wushuang could not help being surprised.","Star Demon Ancestor was one of the ten great kings, but he was still lying on the ground under the suppression of the power. How could he stand?","Jian Wushuang understood that Star Demon Ancestor was much stronger than Demon Dragon Lord.","Of course, this had a lot to do with Jian Wushuang himself.","“Although I can use the power of the Eternal Dark Prison with the help of the disciple token of the Red Cloud Branch, I’m Only a Principles Master, so the power I can use is very limited. Most importantly, the Eternal Dark Prison’s array was severely damaged in the war that destroyed the Red Cloud branch. The foundation of the array was damaged, so the power of the Eternal Dark Prison’s array was weakened.”","“If the foundation of Eternal Darkness Prison had not been damaged, I would have been able to suppress everything in the first level, even if I was only a Principles Master. But now, although I can suppress Star Demon Ancestor, I can’t do it as thoroughly as I did with Demon Dragon Lord. At least, Star Demon Ancestor can still stand,” Jian Wushuang murmured.","Of course, since he was already suppressed, Jian Wushuang did not care whether Star Demon Ancestor was standing or lying down.","“Star Demon Ancestor, do you think I need to think about it now?” Jian Wushuang stood in front of Star Demon Ancestor with a cold gaze.","However, what surprised Jian Wushuang was that the expression on Star Demon Ancestor’s face only changed a little when he took out the token of the Red Cloud Lineage. Now, Star Demon Ancestor’s expression had calmed down again, when Jian Wushuang opened his mouth to ask, Star Demon Ancestor revealed a faint smile.","“Blood Sword Master, I knew you must have entered the Eternal Dark Prison through some special means. You must have a way to leave the Eternal Dark Prison. Now it seems that it’s true. But I didn’t expect you to enter the Eternal Dark Prison through the token of the Red Cloud Lineage.” Star Demon Ancestor smiled, he was not worried about his current situation at all.","It was completely different from how Demon Dragon Lord and the Red One Ruler looked when they were being suppressed.","“The Red Cloud Lineage has long been destroyed. There’s no doubt about that. The experts of the Red Cloud Lineage should have all died by now. As for the tokens or tokens in their hands, even if the later generations obtain them, they won’t be able to recognize them as their masters, so they are naturally useless.”","“That’s why I didn’t think of you as a member of the Red Cloud Lineage. But now, it seems that although the Red Cloud Lineage has been destroyed, there’s still an inheritance left behind. You must have been lucky to get the inheritance of the Red Cloud Lineage and become a member of the Red Cloud Lineage. You got the disciple token of the Red Cloud Lineage,” Star Demon Ancestor said.","“You’re right. I did encounter the inheritance of the Red Cloud Lineage by chance and became a new disciple of the Red Cloud Lineage. I entered the Eternal Dark Prison with this token,” Jian Wushuang admitted directly, then he asked, “Star Demon Ancestor, you’re already in such a dire situation. Why aren’t you anxious?”","“It’s useless to be anxious. Besides, although I’m suppressed by you, I’m not completely suppressed. Even though I can’t escape or use most of my skills, I can still use some of the most basic skills. You’re just a Principles Master. Why don’t you try and see if you can kill me?” Star Demon Ancestor smiled.","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","It was true that he could not completely suppress Star Demon Ancestor. Star Demon Ancestor could barely move, so he could not use most of his skills.","However, even if he could only use a little of his skills or some simple protective skills, he would not be too weak.","“Then I’ll try.”","Jian Wushuang was stunned. With the divine sword in his hand, he activated his divine power and slashed down with his sword.","Whoosh!","A hazy sword shadow flew out. It was Jian Wushuang’s strongest sword skill, hazy.","Star Demon Ancestor, who was suppressed by the power of the Eternal Prison Formation, had no room to dodge. He did not intend to dodge at all. With a slight movement of his finger, a huge black vortex appeared in an instant, the black vortex spun crazily and devoured everything around it like a bloody mouth.","Jian Wushuang’s obscure swordsmanship swept a large amount of hazy fog onto the black vortex, which immediately devoured it mercilessly.","It was like a drop of water falling into the sea without stirring up any wind or waves.","“This...”","Jian Wushuang was extremely astonished.","He could tell that the black vortex that had suddenly appeared was not created by Star Demon Ancestor himself, but by Star Demon Ancestor in a special way.","In other words, the black vortex must have come from a special treasure."]},{"number":3917,"title":"Chapter 3917 - Special Power","paragraphs":["When he was in the Red Cloud World, Lord Wu had said that he could easily suppress many Rulers on the first to fifth levels in the Eternal Dark Prison with the help of the token of a disciple of the Red Cloud branch.","Now, he had indeed suppressed Star Demon Ancestor, but he was obviously different from other Rulers. Under such circumstances, he could still guide the black vortex out.","“This black vortex is also very unique. It should be an extremely special power. It can’t even suppress the power of the Eternal Darkness Prison’s formation.” Jian Wushuang frowned.","Under normal circumstances, he could use part of the Eternal Darkness Prison’s power to suppress everything.","Not only could he suppress Star Demon Ancestor, but he could also suppress any means or power that Star Demon Ancestor used.","!!","The moment Star Demon Ancestor guided the black vortex to appear, Jian Wushuang immediately mobilized the power of the formation to suppress the black vortex. However, he immediately discovered that the power of the black vortex was very special, or rather, very strange, it was completely unaffected by the power of the formation.","“Star Demon Ancestor, I really underestimated you. I didn’t expect you to have mastered such an extremely special power.” Jian Wushuang stared at Star Demon Ancestor.","“Haha, Blood Sword Master, although you have received the inheritance of the Red Cloud Lineage, I’m afraid he doesn’t know many things about the Red Cloud Lineage. Do you know why the Red Cloud Lineage imprisoned me in the Eternal Dark Prison?” Star Demon Ancestor laughed.","“Isn’t it because you have committed crimes outside?” Jian Wushuang’s voice was low.","“Of course not. The Red Cloud Lineage imprisoned me because I had such a special power. Although I only had a preliminary grasp of it, it was enough to make the Red Cloud Lineage envious. They imprisoned me in the Eternal Dark Prison and sent people to contact me from time to time. They tried to find out how I got this power.”","“It’s a pity that I refused to obey. I even left a restriction in my Dao. Even if a supreme-being from the Red Cloud Lineage were to attack me personally, as long as they dared to touch my soul, the restriction would be triggered. I would die immediately and they would not be able to get what they wanted.” Star Demon Ancestor smiled.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang was extremely shocked.","He did not know whether Star Demon Ancestor’s words were true or not. It would be fine if they were false, but if they were true...","The special power in Star Demon Ancestor’s hand actually made even the Red Cloud branch envious?","Then this special power was a little terrifying.","“I’ve been entangled with the Red Cloud branch for a long time by my own means. In the end, until the Red Cloud branch was completely destroyed, I was helpless. As for you, you can use the token of the Red Cloud branch in your hand to suppress me, but I’m afraid it won’t be so easy to kill me completely,” Star Demon Ancestor said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang looked at Star Demon Ancestor coldly.","“Stone Fire,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Master.” Stone Fire immediately appeared beside Jian Wushuang.","“Go and call Demon Dragon and the others,” Jian Wushuang ordered.","“Yes.” Stone Fire nodded and immediately went to where Demon Dragon Lord and the others were.","It did not take long for Demon Dragon Lord and the others to arrive in front of Jian Wushuang.","When they saw the suppressed Star Demon Ancestor and the huge black vortex in front of him, their expressions were very strange.","“Master.” Demon Dragon Lord bowed respectfully to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","“Haha, Demon Dragon, I didn’t expect you to be subdued by Blood Sword Master long ago. You deliberately set up a magic array and pretended to be thinking of a way to deal with him. It seems that you are deliberately plotting against me.” Star Demon Ancestor looked at Demon Dragon Lord with a smile.","Demon Dragon Lord snorted and did not speak.","“Demon Dragon, Star Demon Lord is indeed very strange. Although i suppressed him, he has an extremely special power that can protect him. I just attacked with all my strength, but I failed to kill him. You are much stronger than me. Try your best and see if you can kill him,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Demon Dragon Region Lord nodded solemnly. He had also seen how extraordinary the black vortex in front of Star Demon Ancestor was.","Immediately, the dark-golden staff appeared in Demon Dragon Region Lord’s hand as his divine power surged out frantically.","Instantly, the dark-golden staff transformed into a dark-golden bolt of lightning as it struck down.","The surrounding space was struck so hard that it produced an intense boom.","Demon Dragon Region Lord had completely unleashed his powerful strength as one of the ten monarchs. However, when the pole struck the black vortex, it only trembled slightly, moments later, it returned to normal.","Demon Dragon Region Lord’s strike did not cause too much of an impact on the black vortex.","“This...” Demon Dragon Region Lord frowned.","“Blood Sword Master, I told you that although you can suppress me, you can’t kill me,” Star Demon Ancestor said fearlessly.","“Really?” Jian Wushuang curled his lips. “Star Demon Ancestor, although I don’t know how you mastered this special power and why it can’t even suppress the power of the Eternal Dark Prison’s formation, the power you mastered shouldn’t be endless, right?”","“Maybe our attacks won’t have much effect on the black vortex, but what will happen after dozens, hundreds, or even thousands of attacks?","“Now, I have six experts in the dark zone and Demon Dragon Lord. We can attack your black vortex again and again without any fear. I don’t believe that your black vortex can continue to be unaffected.”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold.","Hearing his words, the eyes of Demon Dragon Lord and the others lit up.","Star Demon Ancestor narrowed his eyes. He took a deep look at Jian Wushuang and then laughed, “Haha, you’re right. I can block one or two attacks with this special power, but I can’t block hundreds or thousands of attacks. It seems that I’m doomed to die here today.”","“Since I’m doomed to die, I won’t let you do it yourself.”","Star Demon Ancestor was still smiling, but suddenly, an extremely violent aura emerged from his body. The soul power in his sea of consciousness began to burn crazily at an alarming speed.","Jian Wushuang, Demon Dragon Lord, and the others were shocked.","“He burned his soul to die? How decisive!” Jian Wushuang was astonished.","“He is too decisive. It seems that he doesn’t care about his own life.” Demon Dragon Lord and others were also puzzled."]},{"number":3918,"title":"Chapter 3918 - Unforeseen Circumstances","paragraphs":["Demon Dragon Lord and the others had all been suppressed before.","Although they had been suppressed, they did not completely despair. They knew that even though Jian Wushuang suppressed them, he might not kill them.","Sure enough, Jian Wushuang had given them a condition, and they chose to submit.","But now, Star Demon Ancestor did not even ask. Knowing that he was suppressed and that Jian Wushuang had the ability to kill him, he burned his soul and chose to die, he did not give Jian Wushuang a chance to make a condition.","Of course, Jian Wushuang had already promised Demon Monarch Ancient Night, so he must kill Star Demon Ancestor. But before killing Star Demon Ancestor, he still wanted to get something from Star Demon Ancestor, but Star Demon Ancestor did not even have a chance to do so. He chose to burn his soul decisively.","!!","And there was something even more strange.","When Star Demon Ancestor burned his soul, he was not only decisive, but also very calm. He did not show any unwillingness in his expression or words. He even burned his soul with a smile.","When Jian Wushuang suppressed the experts and subdued them, although there were some experts who would rather die than commit suicide by burning their souls, they had no choice but to do so, with endless unwillingness and resentment, there was no unwillingness or resentment in Star Demon Ancestor’s eyes?","“Blood Sword Master.”","Star Demon Ancestor spoke again. His soul had been burned by more than half. He endured the intense pain of burning his soul, but his expression did not change.","“You’re good. I believe we’ll meet again soon.” Star Demon Ancestor smiled.","“What?” Jian Wushuang’s expression suddenly changed.","They would meet again soon?","Star Demon Ancestor had burned his soul and died. How could they meet again?","“Is Star Demon Ancestor just a clone?” Jian Wushuang frowned as he looked at Star Demon Ancestor. The latter’s soul became weaker and weaker until it completely disappeared.","Star Demon Ancestor’s divine body also lost its vitality and fell to the ground, dead.","Looking at the corpse left by Star Demon Ancestor, Jian Wushuang’s heart was heavy.","He could see that Star Demon Ancestor was indeed dead. His soul had completely burned out and his divine body had lost its vitality. Moreover, this Star Demon Ancestor did not look like a clone.","After all, although there were some unique clone techniques in the vast universe, this kind of clone was one with the original body’s soul. If the soul was burned and destroyed, then both the original body and the original body would die, Star Demon Ancestor’s soul had been completely burned right under his nose. It did not look like he could survive.","However, the words Star Demon Ancestor left before he died and his calmness made him doubt whether Star Demon Ancestor was really dead or not.","Jian Wushuang was deep in thought.","Demon Dragon Lord, Emperor Sha, and the others looked at Star Demon Ancestor’s body and sighed.","Star Demon Ancestor was the most mysterious and terrifying monarch in the first level of eternal prison. But now, he had died in front of them.","Everyone was paying attention to the death of Star Demon Ancestor. However, in the surrounding void, the luxurious carriage that Star Demon Ancestor had been traveling in had been floating there the entire time.","The white horses that pulled the carriage had wings on their backs. There were also a large number of cultivators that Star Demon Ancestor had captured in the back of the carriage. They had turned into livestock or animals.","When Star Demon Ancestor was alive, these cultivators had been livestock.","But now, with Star Demon Ancestor dead, the restrictions that had been binding them immediately dissipated.","In an instant...","Boom!","With an earth-shattering boom, the luxurious carriage exploded. Following that, Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh. Countless figures appeared in the world at the same time.","“Haha, we have recovered. We have recovered.”","“He’s dead. Star Demon Ancestor has been killed.”","“Haha, I thought that I would be captured by Star Demon Ancestor and tortured for a long period of time. I never expected that Star Demon Ancestor would die in the blink of an eye. He died well, he died well!”","“It’s that Blood Sword Master. He killed Star Demon Ancestor. He’s from the Red Cloud Lineage!”","“The Red Cloud Lineage?”","When the restriction came into contact, the cultivators immediately returned to their original appearances. At the same time, they had been in the surrounding void. Although they had turned into livestock and stayed in the trunk, they still knew what had happened in the outside world, they had seen with their own eyes that Jian Wushuang had used the power of the Eternal Dark Prison’s formation to suppress Star Demon Ancestor, forcing him to burn his soul and commit suicide.","Now that they had recovered, they immediately looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Oh no!”","Jian Wushuang, Demon Dragon Lord, and the others’expressions changed drastically.","They only paid attention to Star Demon Ancestor’s death, but they did not notice the many cultivators captured by Star Demon Ancestor.","“Quick, suppress them.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. He immediately used the power of the Eternal Dark Prison’s array to suppress the cultivators.","Demon Dragon Lord, Ruler Spark, Emperor Sha Ruler, and others also attacked at this moment, wanting to suppress or kill all these cultivators.","However, there were too many of them.","Star Demon Ancestor had crossed a large region on the way and met a large number of cultivators on the way. Most of them were caught in the trunk of the carriage! Star Demon Ancestor had caught nearly 10,000 cultivators!","The nearly 10,000 cultivators who had been turned into livestock and stayed in the trunk had all regained their original appearance and strength in an instant because of Star Demon Ancestor’s death, tens of thousands of cultivators who were at the peak of the second level at the very least stood in the void. Although Jian Wushuang had reacted immediately and wanted to suppress them, they were not slow either.","However, those cultivators were not slow either. When they saw Jian Wushuang’s action, they immediately became restless.","“Run, the Blood Sword Master wants to suppress us!”","“Run for your lives!”","“Spread out, we have too many people. He can’t suppress us.”","Tens of thousands of cultivators fled in a panic at the same time, and they fled in all directions.","As they had expected, although Jian Wushuang could mobilize part of the power of the Eternal Dark Prison’s formation and easily suppress the Rulers, it was impossible for him to suppress nearly 10,000 cultivators at the same time, moreover, these nearly 10,000 cultivators were not in front of him, but at a certain distance from him.","Jian Wushuang tried his best to suppress only a small part of them. There were only a few hundred of them, but most of them had already escaped from Jian Wushuang’s sight."]},{"number":3919,"title":"Chapter 3919 - Universe Boat","paragraphs":["“Sorry to trouble you.”","Jian Wushuang’s face turned a little ugly when he saw most of the cultivators escape from under his nose.","Although these cultivators did not have any enmity with him, he did not have to kill them all.","However, these cultivators all knew that he was from the Red Cloud branch when they saw him using the power of the Eternal Dark Prison formation to suppress Star Demon Ancestor.","Now that they had escaped and there were so many of them, it would not be long before his identity was known in the Eternal Darkness Prison. He could not hide it even if he wanted to.","!!","One had to know that he had always been careful and did not easily use the array formation’s power because he did not want his identity to be exposed. Now that his identity was completely exposed, he would no longer be able to do anything in the Eternal Darkness Prison, but it would be far less convenient than before.","“No one knew my identity before, so naturally, no one would be afraid of me. Even because of the Supreme Treasure Divine Sword in my hand, it would attract experts to come to my door voluntarily, like Demon Dragon Lord and Star Demon Ancestor.”","“But after my identity was exposed, it would be impossible for other experts to come to my door voluntarily. Not only that, if the experts of the Eternal Dark Prison saw me in the future, they would probably think of escaping immediately and would never dare to fight me in front of me.”","“And the other eight kings...”","Jian Wushuang frowned.","Among the ten kings in the first level of Eternal Dark Prison, Demon Dragon Lord had already submitted to him, and Star Demon Ancestor was dead, but there were still eight kings left, the eight kings were all very powerful. Even the weakest one was no weaker than Demon Dragon Lord, and some of them had principle treasures. Devil Scorpion Lord, for example, had five principle treasures each, among them, there were two Heaven Suppression Tablets that were very useful to Jian Wushuang.","Of course, Jian Wushuang had thoughts about the remaining eight kings. He had originally planned to ask Demon Dragon Lord to take him to the eight kings after he dealt with Star Demon Ancestor, then he would use methods to suppress the eight kings, preferably to make them submit to him.","However, now that his identity had been exposed, the eight monarchs knew that he was from the Red Cloud faction. They would not give him another chance to suppress them. If the eight monarchs were not stupid, as soon as they received this news...they would definitely find a place to hide and hide for billions of years. After he left, the eight monarchs would reappear.","In other words, after what had just happened, it was no longer possible for him to continue pretending to be a pig to eat a tiger. It was no longer possible for him to subdue the eight monarchs one by one. In fact, it was not just the eight monarchs. Most of the top experts in the first level of the Eternal Dark Prison...for example, the Rulers who were the strongest experts in the dark zone would probably choose to hide.","“Demon Dragon,” Jian Wushuang shouted coldly.","“Master.” Demon Dragon Lord stepped forward respectfully.","“How far is the territory that you mentioned from the Demon Dragon Field?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Not far. It’s next to the Demon Dragon Field. If you leave now, you should be able to arrive within 500 years,” Demon Dragon Lord said.","“500 years?” Jian Wushuang frowned. “How could it take so long? Star Demon Ancestor was not in the Demon Dragon field before, but he came here immediately after hearing my news. It didn’t take him long.”","“Star Demon Ancestor had incredible means. He created a special black bird that was extremely fast. He could cross the first level of Eternal Darkness Prison in a short time. He used the same method on his carriage, so his carriage was also extremely fast. It didn’t take him long to travel from one major region to another, but we didn’t have the ability.”","Demon Dragon Lord said, “The first level of the Eternal Dark Prison is extremely far from one territory to another. If we travel at a normal speed, it will take us 500 years to reach the Devil Scorpion territory from the Demon Dragon Territory. But don’t worry, master. Firstly, the information of the Eternal Dark Prison is very troublesome. Although the lords of each territory have some special methods to collect information, it may not be able to reach the other lords in just 500 years.”","“Secondly, I just said 500 years. It’s only under normal circumstances, but I know that Ruler Spark has a special treasure. If we use this special treasure to travel, we can save ten times the time. In other words, 50 years should be enough.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang could not help looking at Ruler Spark.","Ruler Spark smiled and said, “Master, I do have a universe boat. If we use it to travel, we can save a lot of time.”","“Universe boat?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“Universe boat is a flying treasure that can travel through the dark void of the universe. After all, the vast universe is boundless, and 99% of it is dark void. If the cultivators in the universe are wandering in the vast universe, they naturally need to travel through the dark void of the universe all year round. This kind of travel is too slow to rely on the flying speed of the cultivators themselves.”","Ruler Spark smiled. “As for universe boat, in the dark void space of the universe, it can burst out with an extremely terrifying speed, which is much faster than the speed of a cultivator. Naturally, it can greatly reduce the time needed to travel. However, universe boat is also more valuable in the universe. Even the lowest-level universe boat can not be bought by a third-level Ruler who has gone bankrupt. I was lucky enough to kill a great being while adventuring in Eternal Dark Prison, and I got such a universe boat from him.”","“Even though I only got the lowest-level universe boat, and that universe boat is already largely broken, and many of the arrays on it are already broken, so I can’t use it at all, it just so happens that I’m good at arrays. All these years, I’ve spent a lot of energy and means to restore a lot of the arrays on that universe boat. I’ve even taken into consideration the environment of Eternal Dark Prison, and I’ve specially added some other special arrays to make it travel within Eternal Dark Prison.”","“Now, the universe boat may not be able to travel in the dark void space, but it can definitely travel in the Eternal Dark Prison. Of course, its speed is very fast.” Ruler Spark was very confident in the universe boat.","“That’s good.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up. “Now that my identity has been exposed, the remaining eight emperors will probably hide in fear if they know my identity. The other seven emperors will be fine, but Devil Scorpion Lord...I must get his principle true treasure.”"]},{"number":3920,"title":"Chapter 3920 - Old Scorpion","paragraphs":["“Demon Dragon, Stone Fire, you two follow me and set off immediately. We’ll go to the Devil Scorpion territory to suppress Devil Scorpion Lord before he gets any news!” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Demon Dragon Lord and Ruler Spark nodded immediately.","“Emperor Sha, you, Hong Yi, and the others will go to the ninth dark area to meet Thousand Kills and the others. Then wait for me there,” Jian Wushuang instructed.","“Master, what about the people around us?” Emperor Sha suddenly asked.","Jian Wushuang looked around.","!!","Nearly 10,000 cultivators had appeared at the same time. Although most of them had escaped, hundreds of them had not managed to escape in time. They were either suppressed by Jian Wushuang or captured by Demon Dragon Lord and the others.","“These people...” Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. He could tell at a glance that these people were not very strong. Many of them were only at the second-level master level. Of course, there were also many third-level masters, however, none of them were comparable to the strongest expert in the dark zone.","“Blood Sword Master, we are willing to submit and give up all our treasures. All we ask is that you spare our lives.”","“Blood Sword Master, please spare our lives!”","Most of the suppressed cultivators were begging for mercy, but some were silent.","“I don’t need trash around me. Kill all of them.” Jian Wushuang’s face was cold.","“Yes.” Demon Dragon Lord and the others immediately took action.","“No!”","“Blood Sword Master, you will die a horrible death!”","“Blood Sword, you will die sooner or later, you will!”","Amidst the shrill roars and roars, hundreds of masters, who were at least at the peak of the second level, were killed.","As for the treasures and interspatial rings they left behind, they all fell into Jian Wushuang’s hands.","“These people are the only things that are useful to me, or to the Divine Beginning Realm.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold, without the slightest bit of pity.","His soul was of a lower level, so he could not leave a mark in the soul origin of too many people. Therefore, those who were qualified to be his servants must be elites, at least at the level of the strongest expert in the dark zone. And these people...none of them could reach that level.","Moreover, most of these people were imprisoned because they had committed heinous crimes. Jian Wushuang would certainly not be merciful to them. He would kill them directly and deprive them of their confidence.","These Rulers who had survived in the Eternal Dark Prison for so long were all of extraordinary value. Each of them had many supreme treasures in their hands. After killing hundreds of people in one go, Jian Wushuang instantly obtained a large number of supreme treasures, when he returned to the Divine Beginning Realm, these supreme true treasures could also be left for the experts of the Divine Beginning Realm to use.","After killing these cultivators, Jian Wushuang quickly set off together with Demon Dragon Lord and Ruler Spark.","He saw a huge black wooden boat speeding through the void. Its speed was dozens of times faster than the fastest speed of a third-level Ruler. With such a terrifying speed, it was impossible to stop it, there was no way to stop it.","It would take about 500 years to travel from the Demon Dragon Field to the Devil Scorpion field. However, it only took 38 years for Jian Wushuang to arrive in the Devil Scorpion field.","In just 38 years, his identity had not spread throughout the Demon Dragon Field.","In the hinterland of the Devil Scorpion field, a huge black stone castle stood there.","This huge black stone castle was where Devil Scorpion Lord lived.","In the Eternal Dark Prison, the environment and resources were limited. Although there were many large territories, there were no cities or buildings in these territories. Even if there were...most of them were stone castles or castles.","Devil Scorpion Lord’s castle was even larger than Demon Dragon Castle.","Buzz!","A huge universe boat appeared in the void outside the castle. Three people came down from the universe boat. They were Jian Wushuang, Demon Dragon Lord, and Ruler Spark.","“Spark, your universe boat is really good,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“If master likes it, just take it,” Ruler Spark said with a smile. He did not feel reluctant at all.","“We’ll see.” Jian Wushuang just waved his hand and glanced at Demon Dragon Lord. “Demon Dragon, your strength is similar to that of Devil Scorpion Lord, and you should be familiar with his divine power aura. See if he’s in the stone castle.”","“Yes.”","Demon Dragon Lord immediately stepped forward and spread his soul power. In an instant, all the auras in the huge stone castle were within his perception.","In the deepest part of the stone castle, there was an extremely powerful aura, which was slightly stronger than Demon Dragon Lord’s.","Demon Dragon Lord could not help laughing when he sensed this aura.","“Master, the old Scorpion is in the stone castle and hasn’t left. It seems that he hasn’t heard the news yet,” Demon Dragon Lord said.","“That’s good.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","He had rushed here as fast as he could because he was worried that Devil Scorpion Lord would get the news ahead of time and hide.","The Eternal Dark Prison was vast, and the devil scorpion field alone was large enough. If Devil Scorpion Lord hid, it would be difficult for him to find it. Then, he would have a hard time finding the principle treasures in Devil Scorpion Lord’s hands, especially the two Heaven Suppression Tablets.","Fortunately, he was fast enough, so Devil Scorpion Lord had not received any news yet.","“Master, the old Scorpion has also sensed my presence and is coming toward us,” Demon Dragon Lord said.","“Let’s go and meet Devil Scorpion Lord,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","Jian Wushuang rushed forward with Demon Dragon Lord. As for Ruler Spark, he was waiting quietly on the universe boat.","Soon, Jian Wushuang met Devil Scorpion Lord.","Devil Scorpion Lord was covered in a layer of black armor. His hair was messy, his nose was sunken, and there were black secret patterns around his eyes. The black secret patterns looked like scales and looked extremely ferocious, Devil Scorpion Lord looked extremely ugly.","“Demon Dragon, why are you here today?” Devil Scorpion Lord squinted and stared at Demon Dragon Lord. He did not pay much attention to Jian Wushuang.","“Old Scorpion, I’m here today to introduce you to someone,” Demon Dragon Lord said with a smile.","“Introduce you to someone? The one beside you...the Principles Master?” Devil Scorpion Lord looked surprised.","“Yes, it’s my master, Blood Sword Master,” Demon Dragon Lord said with a smile.","“Master?” Devil Scorpion Lord was shocked.","“Devil Scorpion Lord.” Jian Wushuang looked at Devil Scorpion Lord with a smile. With a flip of his right hand, he took out the token of the Red Cloud branch."]},{"number":3921,"title":"Chapter 3921 - Three Heaven Suppression Tablets","paragraphs":["“Token of the Red Cloud Lineage!”","Seeing the token in Jian Wushuang’s hand, Devil Scorpion Lord was scared out of his wits.","He screamed and his face was twitching crazily, which made his ugly face even uglier.","In the first level of Eternal Dark Prison, Devil Scorpion Lord was an absolute being who could do whatever he wanted. Even among the ten kings, he was only a little afraid of Star Demon Ancestor, he did not take the other lords to heart.","It had been a long, long time since such a powerful expert had shown any signs of panic or fear in the Eternal Darkness Prison, much less being frightened.","!!","But now, Devil Scorpion Lord was truly frightened.","He was not afraid of anyone, not even the other lords. Even Ruler Star Demon, although he was mysterious, was also afraid. However, if the other party were to attack, he was not afraid. However, no matter how powerful he was, facing the true controller of Eternal Darkness Prison...he was powerless against the Red Cloud branch who created Eternal Darkness Prison.","“Demon Dragon, you hurt me!”","Devil Scorpion Lord roared and was suppressed by Jian Wushuang in the next moment.","Half a day later, in Devil Scorpion Lord’s Stone Castle.","Devil Scorpion Lord, who had been roaring in the void, stood respectfully in front of Jian Wushuang. Demon Dragon Lord stood side by side with him.","“Devil Scorpion, I heard from Demon Dragon that you have five principle supreme treasures. Take them out,” Jian Wushuang said.","The corner of Devil Scorpion Lord’s mouth twitched slightly, and he looked coldly at Demon Dragon Lord.","Demon Dragon Lord gloated over Jian Wushuang’s misfortune.","They were both suppressed and chose to submit to Jian Wushuang, but Demon Dragon Lord did not have a principle supreme treasure. As for the other treasures, Jian Wushuang was not interested, Devil Scorpion Lord, on the other hand, had a total of five principle treasures. Jian Wushuang definitely wanted these five principle treasures.","Although he was unwilling, Devil Scorpion Lord immediately took out the five principle treasures.","In addition to the two Heaven Suppression Tablets, there was a Cyan Saber, a war hammer, and a purple stone staff.","“Master, among these five principle treasures, the war hammer is my offensive magic weapon. With it, my strength can firmly suppress Demon Dragon,” Devil Scorpion Lord said nervously.","He wanted to tell Jian Wushuang that the war hammer was his most suitable weapon and that he wanted to keep it.","Jian Wushuang glanced at Devil Scorpion Lord and then threw the war hammer to him. “Since you need it, I’ll leave it to you.”","“Thank you, master. Thank you, master.” Devil Scorpion Lord immediately became happy.","“This stone staff should be the one you’ve been longing for, right?” Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Dragon Lord again.","“Yes.” Demon Dragon Lord nodded repeatedly and looked at the stone staff with a burning gaze.","“Okay, this stone staff is for you. I hope it can improve your strength,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Thank you, master,” Demon Dragon Lord also thanked him, at the same time, he said, “don’t worry, master. The reason why I wasn’t a match for Devil Scorpion was because I lacked a magic weapon. Now that I have this stone stick, my battle strength will definitely not be weaker than Devil Scorpion’s, or even stronger.”","“Stronger? Demon Dragon, you’re too arrogant.” Devil Scorpion Lord glanced at Demon Dragon Lord coldly.","“What? You don’t believe me? After I refine the stone stick, you and I can compare.” Demon Dragon Lord deliberately provoked him.","“Okay, let’s fight.” There was a trace of anger in Devil Scorpion Lord’s eyes.","“Shut up.” Jian Wushuang’s voice sank.","Demon Dragon Lord and Devil Scorpion Lord immediately quieted down.","Jian Wushuang continued to look at the three principle supreme treasures in front of him.","“This saber...among my servants, there are some who use the saber as a weapon, but they are not very strong. Even if I get this principle Supreme Treasure Saber, my overall combat strength won’t increase too much. Keep it for now.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand and put the principle supreme treasure saber into his interspatial ring.","As for the last two Heaven Suppression Tablets...","Jian Wushuang directly refined them in front of Devil Scorpion Lord. The process was very short and only took a moment.","“How could it be? This is the Heaven Suppression Tablet. I spent a lot of money before, but I couldn’t really refine one of them. But Master, you...” Devil Scorpion Lord looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","“Humph, idiot, I’m afraid you don’t know that master is a super genius who has comprehended a trace of the universe’s principles. Isn’t it easy to refine the Heaven Suppression Tablet?” Demon Dragon Lord mocked from the side.","“Is that so?” Devil Scorpion Lord suddenly understood and was shocked.","It was amazing that a Principles Master could comprehend a trace of universe principle.","“The reason why I can refine the two Heaven Suppression Tablets so quickly is that I have experience in refining them,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Experience?” Devil Scorpion Lord was stunned. “Master, you mean...you have other Heaven Suppression Tablets?”","“Of course.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and another Heaven Suppression Tablet appeared in the void.","Of course, under Jian Wushuang’s deliberate control, the three Heaven Suppression Tablets had shrunk to only a few feet tall.","“Three, three Heaven Suppression Tablets!” Devil Scorpion Lord’s eyes were burning.","“Devil Scorpion, I heard from Demon Dragon that you’ve been looking for the third Heaven Suppression Tablet for years. That’s why I came to you first. If I’m not wrong, you must have a special magic array that works with the Heaven Suppression Tablet, right?” Jian Wushuang stared at Devil Scorpion Lord.","Devil Scorpion Lord took a deep breath and then nodded solemnly. “Master, I do have that magic array, and it happens to be the first level magic array that requires three Heaven Suppression Tablets.”","“Great.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up. “Give me that magic array.”","Devil Scorpion Lord did not hesitate. He waved his hand and took out a token and handed it to Jian Wushuang. “The magic array is inside this token. You can look at it carefully, master.”","Jian Wushuang took the token and immediately checked it with his consciousness.","There was indeed a special formation inside the token, including the detailed information of its control steps and methods.","However, this formation was created by the supreme-being who created the Heaven Suppression Tablet. The supreme-being had exceptional attainments in the field of formation. With this formation and 108 Heaven Suppression Tablets, he could rival a universe Ruler at the level of an invincible supreme-being.","Although the first-level magic array he had obtained was simplified and could be used with only three Heaven Suppression Tablets, it was still extremely complicated and profound for Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3922,"title":"Chapter 3922 - Doubts","paragraphs":["“This formation is really profound. Fortunately, I have studied the two sword formations, so I am more or less at the beginning of the Formation Dao. I am barely qualified to study this formation. Moreover, I have a master who is good at formations by my side.” Jian Wushuang smiled slightly.","It would take him some time to master such a profound formation.","“Ruler Spark, take a look at this formation. You are very skilled in the formation Dao. When I master this formation, I need your help,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Ruler Spark nodded and took the token.","“Devil Scorpion has five principle supreme treasures, two Heaven Suppression Tablets, and the other three principle supreme treasures are only offensive magic weapons. They don’t help me much.” Jian Wushuang shook his head secretly, he had been expecting Devil Scorpion lord to have another principle-based treasure.","!!","For example, a principle-based treasure armor, a domain, a flying treasure, and so on.","Unfortunately, Devil Scorpion Lord’s five principle-based treasures were all offensive magic weapons, except for the Heaven Suppression Tablets.","Of course, Devil Scorpion Lord had two Heaven Suppression Tablets, which was a pleasant surprise to him. Compared with Devil Scorpion Lord, Star Demon Ancestor was a real disappointment to Jian Wushuang.","After his death, Star Demon Ancestor’s treasures, including his interspatial ring, naturally fell into Jian Wushuang’s hands.","However, Jian Wushuang had checked carefully before and found that there was not a single principle supreme treasure among the treasures left by Star Demon Ancestor.","Although Demon Dragon Lord had said that Star Demon Ancestor was not one of the few kings known to have a principle supreme treasure, Star Demon Ancestor was the most mysterious and special one among the ten kings, he had many tricks up his sleeves, so no one could be sure whether he had a principle supreme treasure.","Therefore, when Jian Wushuang knew about Star Demon Ancestor’s mysteriousness, he guessed that Star Demon Ancestor should have at least one or two principle supreme treasures.","But in fact, he did not even have one.","Not only was there no principle supreme treasure, but there were also many kinds of treasures left by Star Demon Ancestor. However, there was nothing that Jian Wushuang was pleasantly surprised or concerned about, it could be said that the treasures left behind by Star Demon Ancestor were too ordinary in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","There was also the special power that Star Demon Ancestor was able to ignore the suppression of the eternal prison formation. Jian Wushuang could not find any trace of Star Demon Ancestor’s treasures or his corpse.","It could be said that although he killed Star Demon Ancestor, he did not obtain anything useful for him.","This made Jian Wushuang feel very strange.","Because in his opinion, Star Demon Ancestor was a mysterious emperor who had endless means. He even possessed special powers that once attracted the attention of the Red Cloud branch at his peak. Such a special existence...how could he have so few resources and treasures? He could even be said to be so poor!","He was too poor.","The value of the many things left behind by Star Demon Ancestor was probably not comparable to that of any emperor. This was obviously a little strange.","In addition, Star Demon Ancestor was calm when he died. There was no trace of anxiety or fear, and the words left behind by Star Demon Ancestor before his death made Jian Wushuang even more vigilant.","“Is Star Demon Ancestor really dead?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly. He also had a trace of doubt in his heart.","However, he could not be sure.","He shook his head and did not think any further.","“Devil Scorpion, Demon Dragon, you are both kings. Do you know if the remaining kings have other types of principle treasures besides offensive magic weapons?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Well...” Devil Scorpion Lord and Demon Dragon Lord looked at each other, the former said with great certainty, “Master, some of the remaining kings do have principle-type supreme treasures, but they only have offensive weapons. I’m afraid they don’t have any other types. At least, we’ve never seen them take them out.”","“None of them?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Master, as you know, the first level of Eternal Darkness Prison is for first-level and second-level masters. As for the third-level masters, they are all slowly breaking through after a long period of slaughter. For many masters here, principle-type supreme treasures are beyond their reach.”","“The reason why there are so many principle treasures in the first level of Eternal Darkness Prison is because there were too many prisoners. A few lucky ones got the principle treasures, but they were only offensive weapons.”","“Of course, the Heaven Suppression Tablet is a suppression-type principle treasure, but it’s special and there are many of them. That’s why it fell into the hands of some first-level or second-level Rulers,” said Devil Scorpion Lord.","“In that case, I don’t need to waste my energy to deal with the other kings,” Jian Wushuang said.","In fact, it had only been a few decades since he killed Star Demon Ancestor. The kings of the other domains had not received any news and had not chosen to hide, if he drove the universe boat at the fastest speed, he might have a chance to suppress one or two kings.","However, Jian Wushuang obviously did not plan to do so. After all, those kings did not have any principle supreme treasures that could be of great use to him. Even if he suppressed one more king, he would not gain much. He might as well spend the time...comprehending the magic formation that drove the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","Jian Wushuang spent the rest of the time in the Devil Scorpion Castle, comprehending the special magic formation.","The formation was called the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation. Although it was only a simplified version of the first layer of the formation, it was enough for Jian Wushuang to study the drill ground.","While Jian Wushuang was studying the formation, the news of Star Demon Ancestor’s death and Demon Dragon Lord’s forced submission had begun to spread in the first layer of eternal prison.","As Jian Wushuang expected, the remaining seven kings were shocked when they heard the news. The first thing they did was to escape from the castle where they lived, they had to find a place to hide.","They were also afraid that the Blood Sword Master with the token of the Red Cloud Lineage would come and suppress them.","After all, they might be stronger than the Blood Sword Master, but he had the token of the Red Cloud Lineage, so he could easily suppress them.","Once they were suppressed, their lives were in his hands. The emperors did not dare to take such a risk.","Hide, hide for hundreds of millions of years."]},{"number":3923,"title":"Chapter 3923 - Divine Devil Heaven Suppression Formation","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang had lived in Devil Scorpion Castle for 130 years.","During these 130 years, Jian Wushuang had devoted all his energy to studying the Divine Devil Heaven Suppression Formation. In addition, he also had the help of Stone Ruler Spark and Devil Scorpion Lord, only now did he manage to master this formation.","“130 years, and this is only the simplest level one formation. If it were a higher level two formation, a third formation, or even the ultimate level of this formation, I wonder how complicated it would be.” Jian Wushuang sighed in his heart.","“This is mainly because master’s cultivation time is too short and he hasn’t studied much about formation, so it takes a longer time. If it were some cultivators living on the time drill ground, they would have studied many fields because they were bored over the years. It must be the same for Formation Dao. It should be much easier for them to study this formation,” the Starlord said.","“That’s true.” Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile.","!!","His cultivation time was indeed too short. Compared to the Rulers who had been imprisoned in the Eternal Dark Prison for hundreds of chaos cycles, it was too short.","These Rulers had lived for too long and were too bored. Naturally, they would be involved in all kinds of paths, and they would also study formations.","Jian Wushuang had only started to dabble in formations in recent years to study the two sword formations. Naturally, he could not compare to those Rulers who had lived for a long time.","“Stone Fire, Devil Scorpion, thank you for your help these years,” Jian Wushuang said.","“You’re welcome, master,” Stone Fire said.","“It’s our good fortune to be able to serve you, master,” Devil Scorpion said.","For the past 130 years, Stone Ruler Spark and Devil Scorpion Lord had been very helpful to Jian Wushuang.","Stone Ruler Spark was very skilled in the field of formation and could give Jian Wushuang a lot of guidance and help.","Devil Scorpion Lord’s understanding of formation was far inferior to Stone Ruler Spark’s, but he was the first to obtain the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, which he had already mastered, naturally, he could also give Jian Wushuang some advice and help.","It was because of their help that Jian Wushuang only used 130 years, or it would have taken even longer.","“Now that I have mastered the formation, it’s time to test its power. Let’s go.” Jian Wushuang smiled and directly flew toward the void outside the castle.","Soon, Jian Wushuang arrived at a vast void.","There were no cultivators within a radius of millions of miles.","Jian Wushuang stood at the center of the Void. With a wave of his hand, the three towering Heaven Suppression Tablets floated out at the same time and landed in three different corners of the void.","The three Heaven Suppression Tablets all exuded an ancient and vast aura.","“Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, activate!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a sharp light as he struck out a series of special handprints. Under Jian Wushuang’s control, the three heaven-shaking tablets were covered in golden light from complicated golden secret patterns, which began to flow rapidly, buzz, buzz, the void slightly shook.","In the next moment, rays of golden light were emitted from the three Heaven Suppression Tablets at the same time.","The rays of golden light were connected to each other. In the blink of an eye, the three Heaven Suppression Tablets had completely intersected, and a huge golden magic formation was formed.","The Golden Magic Formation was like a huge golden cage, covering the vast world. A terrifying aura was rising from within the magic formation.","“Demon Dragon, try it in my magic formation,” Jian Wushuang ordered.","“Yes.” Demon Dragon Lord nodded and immediately rushed into the center of the Golden Magic Array.","“I’m going to start you. Be careful.” Jian Wushuang smiled and then commanded with his mind, “Suppress!”","Boom!","The entire Golden Magic Array suddenly roared, and then endless golden light covered Demon Dragon Lord at an incredible speed.","The golden light was completely formless. The Demon Dragon Lord wanted to immediately attack and disperse the golden light, but his might could not affect the golden light at all.","The golden light that filled the sky swept over, enveloping the Demon Dragon Lord’s entire body. At that moment, the Demon Dragon Lord only felt a terrifying force acting on his body...although the power did not cause him much harm, it suppressed his mind and power to the greatest extent.","“The power of suppression is so strong. Although it can’t suppress me in the first place, my strength has been greatly weakened by the power of suppression. I think I can use 70% of my strength.” Demon Dragon Lord was a little shocked.","“You can use 70% of your strength?” Jian Wushuang was not surprised.","The Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation could suppress a world to the greatest extent. When a cultivator was trapped in the formation, he would naturally be subjected to a huge suppressive force. However, because Jian Wushuang’s divine power was weak, this suppressive force should not be too heaven-defying.","“With my current strength, I can easily suppress an ordinary first-level or even second-level Ruler. An ordinary third-level Ruler would probably be trembling in fear in my formation. It would be good if I could exert 20-30% of my strength. However, the magic-dragon Lord is one of the ten great kings. He is very strong and can exert nearly 70% of his strength,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","“However, this is only the most basic suppressive power of the Demon Dragon heaven-shaking formation combined with the Heaven Suppression Tablets. The power contained in the three Heaven Suppression Tablets has yet to be fully unleashed.”","Jian Wushuang smiled, but his eyes were flickering. A trace of universe principle fused into the three Heaven Suppression Tablets at the same time.","Suddenly...roar!","A deep roar could be heard, and the three Heaven Suppression Tablets began to tremble violently. Then, endless golden secret patterns began to condense on the surfaces of the three Heaven Suppression Tablets, they actually condensed into three towering golden phantoms at the same time.","These three Golden Phantoms were the remnant souls of the golden gods and demons hidden in the Heaven Suppression Tablets!","The Heaven Suppression Tablets were created by an extremely top-tier supreme-master in the field of formation. This top-tier supreme-master created 108 Heaven Suppression Tablets, and each Heaven Suppression Tablet contained a remnant soul of the golden gods and demons.","This golden-colored god-devil was actually an extremely powerful cultivator. When he was still alive, all of them possessed the combat prowess of an ultimate Ruler. It was a pity that they were all killed by that supreme-being, and his remnant soul was absorbed into the Heaven Suppression Tablet, this was the reason why the Heaven Suppression Tablet was so tyrannical.","Naturally, this was the first 108 Heaven Suppression Tablets created by that supreme-being."]},{"number":3924,"title":"Chapter 3924 - Thoughts","paragraphs":["There were two types of Heaven Suppression Tablets.","The first type was the 108 Heaven Suppression Tablets personally created by that supreme-being. These 108 Heaven Suppression Tablets were extremely powerful, and each of them was an upper-grade principle treasure. Their value was immeasurable.","The second type was created by some experts using their own Heaven Suppression Tablets as the original form. They could also be used with the Heaven Suppression Tablets created by the god-devil formation. Although these Heaven Suppression Tablets also contained a golden god-devil remnant soul, the quality of the Golden Divine Devil Remnant Souls was not as good as the first one.","The 108 Heaven Suppression Tablets created by the supreme-being were fused with the remnant souls of ultimate Rulers, which were top-grade magic array treasures. The Heaven Suppression Tablets refined by the later experts were fused with the remnant souls of the Divine Devil, most of them were the remnant souls of the fourth or fifth-grade Rulers, and the materials used were different. In terms of level, they were only at the level of low-grade principle treasures.","The three Heaven Suppression Tablets that Jian Wushuang had obtained belonged to the second category.","!!","Even so, it was still difficult to control the Heaven Suppression Tablets. Jian Wushuang still needed to comprehend a trace of the universe principle to control the Heaven Suppression Tablets, and he could also wake up the Golden Devil God’s remnant soul inside.","For example, Devil Scorpion Lord, although he had also mastered the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, even if Jian Wushuang gave him the three Heaven Suppression Tablets, he could at most rely on the formation to exert the power of suppression, however, he could not summon the Golden Divine Devil Phantoms of the Heaven Suppression Tablets.","This was why Devil Scorpion Lord was far inferior to Jian Wushuang.","Now, the three Golden Divine Devil Remnant Souls appeared, and suddenly, terrifying power burst out from them.","In an instant, the originally enormous power of suppression increased by a large margin.","“The Suppressive Force is even stronger. I can only use 50% of my strength now.” Demon Dragon Lord’s face darkened.","While the Suppressive Force increased, the three golden remnant souls emitted a hazy golden light and rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","Under the baptism of the Golden Light, Jian Wushuang felt that the power of his divine power had increased greatly. It was as if he had used a special secret skill.","“The power of suppression can suppress my opponent to the greatest extent, but at the same time, it can increase my strength to a certain extent.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were shining.","This Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation was actually quite detailed with some domain-type methods.","Many domain-type methods were used to suppress the opponent, but at the same time, they could strengthen their own domains.","Now, the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation could do the same, but the effect was stronger.","In addition to its suppressing power, the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation also contained a killer move.","Jian Wushuang had already mastered this killer move.","“Demon Dragon, I’m going to use the killer move of this formation. You have to be careful. If you can’t hold on, just say it,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Master, just use it.” Demon Dragon Lord’s eyes were solemn. He flipped his hand and a purple stone staff appeared in his hand.","This purple stone staff was the Magic Formation Supreme Treasure he had obtained from Devil Scorpion Lord. Demon Dragon Lord had refined this purple stone staff over the years and now had a handy principle supreme treasure, Demon Dragon Lord’s strength was naturally much stronger than before.","“Magic Formation, kill!”","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened. In an instant, mighty golden light burst out from the three Heaven Suppression Tablets at the same time, and the three Golden Divine Devil Phantoms on the Heaven Suppression Tablets also stared more intently.","Whoosh! The mighty golden light easily cut through the void like a blade. Like a sea of blades, it crazily attacked Demon Dragon Lord.","The Demon Dragon Lord immediately waved the purple stone rod in his hand.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","One after another, the heaven-shaking rod shadows shot out in an incomparably violent manner, scattering the golden light that filled the sky.","After dozens of consecutive attacks, the blade-like golden light that filled the sky finally dissipated.","The Demon Dragon Lord was still standing at the center of the Golden Array, but his aura was somewhat chaotic at this moment.","“Why did master stop?” Demon Dragon Lord looked over. He could see that the golden light, which was as sharp as a blade, had not reached the limit of the array, even though he had defeated a lot of it, the array should be able to display more golden light.","“Demon Dragon, what do you think of the power of my move?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s very powerful. The Golden Light is as powerful as the full-strength attack of a third-level Ruler. There are also many of them. Under the suppression of this magic formation, I can only use 50% of my strength. It’s not easy for me to resist the attacks of the Golden Light,” Demon Dragon Lord said.","“But didn’t you resist it in the end?” Jian Wushuang chuckled. However, if he looked carefully, there was a hint of surprise in his eyes.","Yes, it was a surprise.","Jian Wushuang had been looking forward to the power of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation. Now that it was truly displayed, the formation did not disappoint him.","Whether it was the suppressing power of the formation or the enhancement of his own strength, they were all of great use to him.","However, what really surprised him was the killing move that he had just displayed.","This killing move could burst out rays of golden light that were as sharp as blades. These rays of golden light were densely packed together, and their power was very powerful.","However, Jian Wushuang saw some similarities between these golden lights and his wave light sword formation.","The Wave Light Sword Formation formed a huge sea of sword essence, which carried out wave after wave of sword essence. The wave of sword essence was vast and endless. No matter who it was, as long as they were trapped in his sword formation...unless they could rely on their powerful attacks to directly destroy his sword formation, or use their escape techniques to fight within his sword formation, otherwise, they would be trapped within this sword formation forever...constantly enduring the wave of sword intent’s impact.","Purely in terms of nature, that heavy killing move of the heaven suppressing formation was a killing move, and it was meant to kill the opponent.","But the wave light sword formation was meant to trap the opponent.","However, judging from the process of the two, there were indeed many similarities between the two. The blade-like golden light attacks...as well as the endless sword essence impact of the wave light sword formation...an idea suddenly appeared in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“If I can combine my wave light sword formation with the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, no, just with the killing move of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, will the power be stronger?” Jian Wushuang murmured, his eyes also flashed with a strange light."]},{"number":3925,"title":"Chapter 3925 - The Power of the Sword","paragraphs":["“Stone Fire.” Jian Wushuang called out to Ruler Spark, “I have a direction in my mind. Can the killing move of the Divine Demon Heaven Suppression Formation that I just displayed be combined with the wave light sword formation that I created?”","“Combine with the Sword Formation?” Ruler Spark was stunned and then nodded. “Master, the killing move that you just performed is still performed by the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation. It’s a method of formation. Since it’s a formation, in principle, it can be combined with other formations. Of course, it can also be combined with master’s sword formation. It’s just that the process is more complicated. Master may need some time to complete it.”","“It doesn’t matter if it takes me some time. As long as it doesn’t take thousands or tens of thousands of years, it’s worth trying,” Jian Wushuang said.","“It won’t take thousands or tens of thousands of years. After all, you have completely mastered the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation. I think master will be able to combine his sword formation with the killer move in the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation in a few decades,” the Ruler Spark said.","“Okay, then I’ll study it for a few more decades.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","He did not return to the Devil Scorpion Castle. Instead, he began to study it in the void.","The Demon Dragon Lord had become the target of his sword formation trial, so he did not dare to complain.","Time passed day by day. In just 26 years, Jian Wushuang had tried countless times before he finally combined his wave light sword formation with the killer move in the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation.","In the Void, the Demon Dragon Lord was also covered by the huge golden formation.","Around the formation, three Golden Divine Devil Phantoms had gathered on the three 30,000-meter-tall Heaven Suppression Tablets and burst out with the greatest power.","The suppressive power crazily suppressed the Demon Dragon Lord, so it could only exert 50% of its strength.","“Demon Dragon, take this.”","Jian Wushuang smiled. In an instant, the three Heaven Suppression Tablets burst out with golden light that was as sharp as a blade.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang’s wave light sword formation was activated. The sea of sword essence swept up waves of sword essence.","What was remarkable was that the vast golden light merged with the Sea of sword essence not long after it flew out, in an instant, endless waves of sword intent with golden light covered the sky and earth as they charged toward the Demon Dragon Lord. The power of these waves of sword intent with golden light soared to the sky.","The power of a random wave of sword intent was enough to make an ordinary third-level Ruler’s expression change.","The Demon Dragon Lord held the purple stone staff tightly in his right hand. He also sensed the tyrannical power of the waves of sword intent with golden light around him and immediately attacked. He smashed the staff one after another, but it was only a few collisions, Demon Dragon Lord’s expression changed.","“How is this possible? Although I can only use about 50% of my strength, I’m definitely at the advanced stage of the third level. I’m still much stronger than an ordinary expert of the dark zone. But now, I’m only using a magic weapon, which is a principle-type supreme treasure. How can I just barely defeat one wave of Golden Sword Essence?” Demon Dragon Lord was a little stunned.","Previously, his strength had been absolutely superior to Jian Wushuang’s.","When Jian Wushuang used the sword formation of wave and light, he could easily destroy more than half of the sword formation with a casual strike.","Now, although his strength was suppressed, the sword formation should be shaken by a casual strike.","However, when he used the sword formation, he only managed to destroy the first wave of sword essence, which was coming from the surrounding area.","In other words, the power contained within the golden wave of sword intent was not much weaker than his. It was probably the strongest attack that was comparable to the strongest expert in the dark zone.","For example, the first strike of the thousand killing Emperor Lord was probably as powerful as the first wave of sword intent.","However, the first strike of the thousand killing Emperor Lord was his ultimate move. After the first strike, he had to gather his strength again before he could unleash the second strike.","But now, in the sword formation, endless waves of golden sword essence rushed toward him. Each wave of golden sword essence was comparable to the first move of the thousand-kill emperor. It was too terrifying.","The Demon Dragon Lord had to use his full strength to break the waves of golden sword essence around him. He could withstand one or two waves, or even dozens of waves, but after dozens or hundreds of waves of sword essence.., even Demon Dragon Lord could not withstand it.","“Demon Dragon, use your most powerful move and see if you can break my sword formation,” Jian Wushuang said loudly.","Demon Dragon Lord did not hesitate. He saw a shocking murderous aura sweep up, and black ferocious scales appeared on his face one after another.","He had already revealed part of his original body.","Immediately after, the surface of his body emitted waves of dark light, and the purple stone rod in his hand was swung out one after another.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Three rod strikes in a row, each of which contained explosive power, directly bombarded the surrounding ocean of sword intent.","Demon Dragon Region Lord’s strongest move, and it was also the strongest move used by a principle true treasure divine weapon. Its power was world-shaking. However, three rod strikes in a row bombarded the ocean of sword intent, and although it caused the entire ocean of sword intent to tremble greatly.., the waves of sword essence collapsed one after another, and a part of the sword formation collapsed, but that was all.","In just a moment, the entire sword formation had completely recovered, and a large number of golden waves of sword essence continued to attack the Demon Dragon Lord.","“This...” The Demon Dragon Lord’s eyes were wide open, and his head was a little dazed.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang laughed.","“That’s right. The Wave Light Sword Formation and the killing move of the Divine Demon Heaven Suppression Formation are perfectly combined. They complement each other and make my sword formation much more powerful.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","Previously, when he had used the wave light sword formation with all his strength, the power of the sword essence waves could barely match the ordinary attacks of the third level. As for the toughness of the formation...some of the strongest dark zone supreme masters were able to break through his formation head-on.","But now, when combined with the killer move of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppression Formation, golden light covered the surface of the waves of sword intent, and the entire wave light sword formation underwent an earth-shaking transformation.","Now that he had executed his wave light sword formation, the power of each wave of golden sword intent was comparable to the strongest attack of a dark zone supreme master, and it was comparable to the level of the first axe of thousand killing Emperor, in terms of toughness, even Demon Dragon Ruler, one of the ten great kings, could not break it with his strongest killing move using his principle true treasure weapon.","Compared to this, the power had increased by too much."]},{"number":3926,"title":"Chapter 3926 - 41 People","paragraphs":["“Now, if I use this sword formation and the Divine Devil Heaven Suppression Formation, I can easily kill Demon Dragon.” Jian Wushuang glanced at Demon Dragon Lord.","Demon Dragon Lord had already used his most powerful move, but he could not break the sword formation at all. The waves of golden light sword essence, which were as powerful as the ultimate move of the strongest expert in the dark zone, attacked again and again, the only thing the Demon Dragon Lord could do was passively block the waves of golden sword intent while trying to think of a way to escape from the sword array.","However, do not forget that the Demon Dragon Lord was currently inside the Divine Devil Heaven Suppression Array.","The Divine Devil Heaven Suppression Array was a suppression-type array that could directly suppress the entire world. Furthermore, it was activated by three heaven suppression monoliths at the same time. Such a suppression-type array might not even be able to be defeated by a fourth-level Ruler...in this formation, the Demon Dragon Lord would not be able to use his life-saving secret skills or escape.","“I can’t believe that in less than 100 years, I have the strength to kill the Demon Dragon Lord.” Jian Wushuang had a strange look on his face.","A hundred years ago, when the Demon Dragon Lord attacked him, he was no match for it. He had to use the token of the Red Cloud Lineage to suppress it.","But now, he could kill the Demon Dragon Lord even without the token of the Red Cloud Lineage.","Of course, he relied on the three Heaven Suppression Tablets and the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation. Apart from this, his real combat strength was still far from the level of the Demon Dragon Lord.","“Anyway, from today on, I have another trump card. I’m Only a Principles Master now, so I can’t fully display the power of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation. If one day I break through to become a Ruler and use this formation again, I’m afraid it will be truly terrifying,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Alright, Demon Dragon, stop.”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand, and the Sea of Golden Light and sword essence dissipated on the spot. As for the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation that was suppressing the heaven and earth, it had also been withdrawn.","The three Golden Divine Devil Phantoms on the three Heaven Suppression Tablets had also disappeared. The three Heaven Suppression Tablets shrank in size and were put into Jian Wushuang’s interspatial ring.","After the sword formation and the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation were taken back, Demon Dragon Lord heaved a heavy sigh.","It had to be said that he had suffered a lot during the time he was trapped in the sword formation.","“Congratulations, master. The Sword Formation has finally been completed.” Ruler Spark was the first to arrive in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Master, this sword formation, together with the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, is really powerful. If Demon Dragon was an enemy, he would have died in your sword formation,” Devil Scorpion Lord said.","“It’s okay.”","Jian Wushuang only smiled faintly, but he was still very happy.","“I’ve mastered the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation and my sword formation can work perfectly with it. My years of comprehension have not been in vain. Devil Scorpion, Demon Dragon, and Stone Fire, get ready. We’re leaving,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Leaving?”","Devil Scorpion Lord, Demon Dragon Lord, and Stone Fire Lord looked at each other in dismay. Their eyes were filled with unconcealable joy and excitement.","“Master, are you planning to leave the Eternal Dark Prison?” Devil Scorpion Lord asked excitedly.","It was not his fault for being so excited. After all, they had all been imprisoned in the Eternal Dark Prison by the Red Cloud Lineage for more than 100 chaos cycles. How long had it been.","They had been trapped here for such a long time, and their hearts were close to despair.","However, when they had submitted to Jian Wushuang, they had known that Jian Wushuang could take them out of the Eternal Dark Prison. From then on, they had been looking forward to it.","They were looking forward to leaving this place and returning to the universe.","“It’s time to leave,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","He had not been in the Eternal Dark Prison for long, less than 1,000 years.","However, he had gained a lot in the past 1,000 years.","Not only had his strength improved by leaps and bounds, but he had also obtained three Heaven Suppression Tablets, mastered the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, and had also taken in many experts.","Next...if his identity was not exposed, he did not mind staying in the Eternal Dark Prison for a while longer. If possible, he could try to subdue the other seven kings.","However, his identity had been spread in the Eternal Dark Prison. Perhaps most of the experts did not know about it, but the remaining seven kings had their own ability to collect intelligence, so they must know of his existence, as long as those kings were not stupid, they would choose to hide.","Since they were hiding, it would be difficult for Jian Wushuang to find them. After all, he was not a high-level expert of the Red Cloud Branch. He was not strong enough to use the token of the Red Cloud branch to greatly mobilize the power of the Eternal Dark Prison’s formation, he saw everything in the Eternal Dark Prison.","Since he could not attack those kings, it was useless to stay here.","As for the other levels of Eternal Dark Prison, he could not enter them at all. Even the first level was because he just happened to know where the entrance was, and the flaw of the Eternal Dark Prison array was there. As for the other levels, he did not know, even Lord Wu in the Red Cloud World did not know. Otherwise, he could try to use the token of the Red Cloud Lineage to go to the other levels to subdue some experts, by then, the threat of the Star Master could be easily removed.","“Get ready, the three of you. We’ll head to the ninth dark area of the Demon Dragon Domain immediately. The strongest experts I’ve subdued are there. The exit to the first level of eternal prison is also there,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Devil Scorpion Lord and the other two suppressed their excitement and went to prepare.","“I don’t have enough servants. I can try my best to capture and subdue some of them along the way.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Soon, Jian Wushuang took Devil Scorpion Lord, Demon Dragon Lord, Ruler Spark, and a few strong dark zone supreme experts with him on the universe boat, they headed toward the Demon Dragon Region.","On the way, Jian Wushuang did not stay idle when he passed through the dark zones. Instead, he often took action to subdue the strongest experts in the dark zones.","When Jian Wushuang returned to the ninth dark zone of the Demon Dragon Region, there were already more than 20 slaves following him. In addition, he had already subjugated them, Thousand Kills Emperor Lord, Blood Rain Demon Monarch, Emperor Sha Master, and Ruler Red One were waiting for him in the ninth dark area. In total, he had 41 slaves!"]},{"number":3927,"title":"Chapter 3927 - Had Finally Come Out","paragraphs":["Eternal Dark Prison, ninth dark area.","In the vast void, a spatial passage had been temporarily opened.","Jian Wushuang stood in front of the spatial passage with 41 servants.","“Everyone, this spatial passage is the exit. After passing through here, you can leave.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","The 41 slaves behind him, including the two strongest lords, Demon Dragon and Devil Scorpion, had an unprecedented fervor in their eyes.","“Everyone, leave with me.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang directly stepped into the space passage in front of him.","The 41 slaves naturally followed him. Soon, they disappeared in the space passage. After Jian Wushuang and the others left, the space passage also disappeared.","Eternal Darkness Prison returned to its usual ‘peace’.","...","Deep in Crimson Rock Mountain, in front of the entrance passage of the first level of Eternal Darkness Prison, Demon Monarch Ancient Night was waiting quietly.","Of course, at this moment, only a consciousness incarnation left by Demon Monarch Ancient Night was waiting here. As for his original body, it had already returned to Ancient Night Demon Palace.","Buzz! The originally peaceful magic array passage suddenly lit up, and then many figures stepped out of the passage.","“We’re out, haha! We’re finally out.”","“It’s been hundreds of chaos cycles. How many years has it been? We’ve finally reached the end.”","“The air outside is so good.”","“Haha, we’ve finally walked out of that damn place alive.”","One after another, cheerful laughter rang out. The prisoners who had just walked out of the Eternal Dark Prison could not hide the excitement and ecstasy in their hearts at this moment.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing at the front of the crowd, appeared extremely calm.","“Demon Monarch Ancient Night?” Jian Wushuang also noticed the consciousness incarnation of Demon Monarch Ancient Night.","“Blood Sword Master.” Demon Monarch Ancient Night walked forward, but his eyes were fixed on the people behind Jian Wushuang.","Although he was only a consciousness incarnation and not his original body, he could still sense the overwhelming strength of these people.","And he could recognize quite a few of them directly.","“Demon Dragon Lord, the one next to him is Devil Scorpion Lord. There are only two out of the ten sovereign kings?” Demon Monarch Ancient Night’s eyes widened.","He had also luckily escaped from the Eternal Dark Prison, but in the first level of the Eternal Dark Prison, he was just an insignificant little figure. He was at the lowest level. After all, he had not even reached the third level...but now, the people standing in front of him were all at the third level, and they were all experts in the third level. They were all the strongest experts in the dark zone, and they were all well-known.","As for Demon Dragon Lord and Devil Scorpion Lord, they were one of the ten great kings.","They were high and mighty existences that he could only look up to.","But now, these top experts were standing obediently behind Jian Wushuang. Judging from their expressions, it was obvious that they already had Jian Wushuang as their master.","“Demon Monarch Ancient Night, why did you leave your consciousness avatar here?” Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Monarch Ancient Night in surprise.","“I deliberately left my consciousness avatar here to wait for you. I wanted to see the results of your trip to the Eternal Dark Prison, Blood Sword Master. Now it seems that your gains in the Eternal Dark Prison are extraordinary,” Demon Monarch Ancient Night praised, his expression was much more humble than before.","It could not be helped. The people behind Jian Wushuang now all had the strength to kill him easily, and they were obviously dominated by Jian Wushuang. If he accidentally angered Blood Sword Master at this time...Blood Sword Master could easily kill him with just one of his subordinates.","“The harvest is not bad,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile. “By the way, before entering Eternal Dark Prison, I also killed Star Demon Ancestor for you.”","“Star Demon Ancestor is dead?” Demon Monarch Ancient Night’s heart trembled, and a look of ecstasy and excitement appeared in his eyes.","Star Demon Ancestor had turned him into a beast and ravaged him for a billion years. Those billion years were absolutely inhuman for him, and it was a fate worse than death. Therefore, he had an unprecedented hatred for Star Demon Ancestor, that was why he asked Jian Wushuang to kill Star Demon Ancestor for him.","Now that he heard that Jian Wushuang really killed Star Demon Ancestor for him, how could he not be excited.","“I did help you kill Star Demon Ancestor. Demon Dragon and the others can testify that. They saw it with their own eyes, but I’m not sure whether Star Demon Ancestor is dead or not.” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“You’re not sure?” Demon Monarch Ancient Night was stunned.","“How should I put it? I did kill him, but I suspect that Star Demon Ancestor still has a clone in the world. But I’m sure that Star Demon Ancestor is dead in Eternal Darkness Prison,” Jian Wushuang said.","“That’s enough.” Demon Monarch Ancient Night clenched his hands, feeling the joy of revenge.","“Well, Demon Monarch Ancient Night, if there’s nothing else, we’ll take our leave,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Blood Sword Master, it’s up to you,” Demon Monarch Ancient Night said with a smile.","Immediately, Jian Wushuang led his 41 servants and rushed out of Crimson Rock Mountain.","They passed through the inner area of Crimson Rock Mountain in a mighty manner. They did not deliberately conceal their auras. On the way, they met many Principles Masters, who were shocked when they sensed Jian Wushuang and the others’auras.","After all, except for Jian Wushuang, the others were all third-level Rulers. Although the Principles Masters could not distinguish the strength of these Rulers, even the weakest first-level Rulers...there were more than 40 of them. In this Star Field, they could be said to be world-shaking.","“We should be in a dangerous place now, right?”","“We should be. We have passed by many places, and some places give me a sense of danger. Moreover, there are many Principles Masters’little fellows wandering here.”","“Haha, Principles Master...in the Eternal Dark Prison, we haven’t sensed the aura of Principles Master for a long time, except for Master.”","Jian Wushuang’s servants were chatting along the way, but they did not interact with the Principles Masters they encountered.","Soon, they left the area of Red Rock Mountain and stepped into the universe void. Then, Ruler Spark took out the universe boat.","The array formation on the universe boat was severely damaged. Although Ruler Spark had improved the array formation, he could only adapt to traveling in the Eternal Dark Prison. When they arrived in the universe void...although the universe boat could travel, its speed was not too fast, but it was much faster than their flying speed.","Soon, they arrived at the void space near Star Palace."]},{"number":3928,"title":"Chapter 3928 - Changes","paragraphs":["“Demon Dragon, wait on the universe boat.”","Jian Wushuang ordered and then rushed toward the Star Palace alone.","“Huh?”","After nearly a thousand years, Jian Wushuang was shocked when he returned to the Star Palace.","There were three Earth Stars in the void in front of him. The smallest one in the middle was the core.","These three Earth Stars were protected by a powerful magic formation and were connected to each other. Waves of power spread out, which was very intimidating.","“Three Earth Stars?”","Jian Wushuang had a strange look on his face.","Although Star Palace used to occupy an Earth Star as its nest, it was only one Earth Star. When did it become three Earth Stars?","Jian Wushuang’s soul power spread out and instantly sensed the auras of many experts on the three Earth Stars, which were much more numerous than before.","“It seems that Star Palace has changed a lot since I entered the Eternal Dark Prison.” Jian Wushuang smiled, but he had already appeared on the Earth Star in the center. The Magic Formation on the Earth Star did not stop him.","As soon as he returned to the Star Palace and released his soul power, Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the others, who had been in the Star Palace, naturally noticed him. They immediately came forward to welcome him.","“Haha, my young friend, you’re finally back.”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis.”","A series of greetings sounded. There were two other people who appeared in front of Jian Wushuang besides Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and Heaven Ancestor.","Jian Wushuang also knew the two people. They were Xuan Yan and Di Shisan from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","Xuan Yan, as the Palace Master of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect’s punishment palace, was already a Ruler before the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was destroyed. Jian Wushuang was not surprised to see him in the Star Palace.","But Di Shisan...Jian Wushuang looked at Di Shisan. He could sense the incomparably sharp aura on the latter’s body. The latter stood there as if he was a sword that had lost its sharpness, but it was still a breathtaking matchless divine sword.","Di Shisan’s aura was much stronger than before.","“The Ruler realm.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a strange light. Then he smiled and said, “Di Shisan, congratulations. You’ve finally broken through to the Ruler realm.”","“I was just lucky,” Di Shisan said calmly.","“Lucky?” Jian Wushuang shook his head secretly.","He knew very well that Di Shisan’s breakthrough to become a Ruler was not due to luck.","Before the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was destroyed, Di Shisan was widely recognized as the number one Principles Master. He had even cut off an arm of a Ruler when he was in the Principles Master realm. Although that Ruler was in the Divine Beginning Realm...his strength was suppressed, but Di Shisan was still very impressive for being able to do this.","He was already very close to becoming a Ruler. Unfortunately, before he could make a breakthrough, the Seven Star Mysterious Sect suffered a great change and was directly destroyed. He was also heavily injured and fell into a deep sleep. He stayed in the eternal chaotic world for a long time, during that long time, his strength could not increase because of the restriction of the Heavenly Dao environment.","It was not until Jian Wushuang refined the eternal chaotic world and brought them all back to the Divine Beginning Realm in recent years that their strength could slowly recover and begin to increase.","In addition, although Di Shisan had lost to Jian Wushuang in the battle, he had gained a lot of insights and went into closed-door cultivation.","In this closed-door cultivation, Di Shisan had directly broken through to become a Ruler.","It could be said that Di Shisan was able to break through purely because of his own strength. Moreover, he had accumulated a lot of strength. There was no luck involved at all.","“Heavenly Marquis, my young friend, I’m afraid you don’t know this. Di Shisan’s comprehension of the essence of the Dao of the sword is extremely high. After the battle with you, he went into seclusion, and in the past few years, he has once again greatly improved. In addition, he has perfected his own sword art system. After breaking through to become a Ruler, he has gone to the Third Dao realm to train. His improvement has been even more rapid, and he has also comprehended a set of principles. Right now, in terms of cultivation level, he is already a high-level Ruler. In terms of combat power, when paired with his most powerful supreme treasure, he is no weaker than a peak Ruler!”","“In the Divine Beginning Realm, except for you, Heavenly Sword Marquis, Di Shisan is the strongest.” Daoist Xuan God said with a smile.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang could not help looking at Di Shisan.","How long had it been since he became a Ruler, and he already had the battle strength of a superior Ruler? He was stronger than Daoist Xuan God and the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master?","“It’s mainly because the Three-layered Dao Realm is too magical.” Di Shisan was still as calm as ever.","Jian Wushuang shrugged helplessly. He had interacted with Di Shisan many times, and he knew very well that Di Shisan was such a cold and taciturn person.","“By the way, how has the overall strength of the Divine Beginning Realm improved during the thousand years I’ve been away?” Jian Wushuang asked.","He had given the Three-layered Dao Realm to Xuan Yi and the others a long time ago, and countless cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm had already begun to improve their strength with the help of the Three-layered Dao Realm. Now that so many years had passed, there should be some results.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s question, Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the others looked at each other and laughed.","“My young friend, the Three-layered Dao Realm is really a treasure. It’s amazing. Over the years, a large number of cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm have entered the Three-layered Dao Realm to cultivate, and each and every one of them has been greatly improved. Just at the level of Principles Masters, there have been more than 100,000 Principles Masters in the Divine Beginning Realm in the past thousands of years,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“More than 100,000?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","How many Principles Masters did the Divine Beginning Realm have?","Probably less than 10,000.","However, in just a few thousand years, more than 100,000 Principles Masters had emerged. It was indeed a terrifying number.","“Where are the Rulers? Have there been any new Rulers born in the Divine Beginning Realm with the help of the Triple Dao World?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","“Not yet.” Daoist Xuan God shook his head. “The only Ruler born in the Divine Beginning Realm over the years is Di Shisan. However, Di Shisan relied on himself to make a breakthrough and then went to the Three-layered Dao Realm to cultivate.","“However, although the Three-layered Dao Realm has yet to nurture a Ruler, several Principles Masters who were originally cultivating in the second-layered Dao world are about to make a breakthrough. I reckon that there will be a few who will make a breakthrough in the next few hundred years at most. Among them, the fastest one to make a breakthrough should be your good friend, Demon Master Chenhuo.”","“Chenhuo?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","Demon Master Chenhuo had been by his side for a long time and was indeed one of his best friends. He had reached the pinnacle of the six void realms and was one of the people closest to a Ruler, now that Chenhuo was about to make a breakthrough, Jian Wushuang was very happy."]},{"number":3929,"title":"Chapter 3929 - Within 1,000 Years","paragraphs":["“By the way, what are the three Earth Stars in the Star Palace?” Jian Wushuang suddenly asked.","“This...haha!” Daoist Xuan God laughed, “My dear Heavenly Marquis, you forgot that you went to visit Demon Monarch Ancient Night in person. After that, Monarch Death came to my Star Palace to apologize. Soon after, there was news that you defeated Demon Monarch Ancient Night in a battle.”","“You must know that Demon Monarch Ancient Night was publicly acknowledged as the number one expert in this star domain. Even the Sky Roc Ruler, a peak Ruler, was unable to withstand a single move from him. Yet, you were able to defeat Demon Monarch Ancient Night. Furthermore, you are only a Ruler of principles. Once this news is out, my Star Palace’s status in this star domain will immediately change.”","“Before this, although my Star Palace could barely be considered a major power because of your rise, it still couldn’t be considered to be at the peak. However, after your battle with Demon Monarch Ancient Night, there was no need for my Star Palace to do anything. Most of the experts of the major powers in this Star Field naturally classified my Star Palace as one of the peak powers. Moreover, without my Star Palace needing to think of any methods, countless experts took the initiative to come over. If they wanted to join my Star Palace, my Star Palace naturally wouldn’t reject them.”","“In less than 1,000 years, there have been more than 10,000 Principles Masters in Star Palace.”","“What?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","When he went to eternal prison, there were only 1,000 Principles Masters in Star Palace.","In less than 1,000 years, there had been more than 10,000 Principles Masters?","That was too fast.","“There are too many Principles Masters, so one Earth Star is not enough to satisfy the Star Palace. In recent years, we spent some money to find two uninhabited Earth Stars in this Star Field and moved them here. The three Earth Stars were side by side to form the current temporary palace,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood.","He had to admit that Star Palace was indeed much stronger than before.","“It’s a good thing that Star Palace is stronger. The more experts there are, the greater the chance of victory for the Divine Beginning Realm in the battle with Devil Cloud Star.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","At the mention of Devil Cloud Star, Daoist Xuan God’s expression immediately turned grave.","“My young friend, there’s something I must tell you.” Daoist Xuan God stared at Jian Wushuang.","“What is it? How can I be serious?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s Devil Cloud Star,” Daoist Xuan God said solemnly, “you know, Star Palace has spies in the Star Field where Devil Cloud Star is located. They have been keeping an eye on Devil Cloud Star. Ten years ago, they sent a message that Devil Cloud Star Master had come out of seclusion.”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted.","He knew that the reason why Devil Cloud Star had been quiet all these years was that Devil Cloud Star Master had been in seclusion, which was the most important stage.","However, once Devil Cloud Star Master came out of seclusion, his strength would probably break through to the fourth-level Ruler level, and he would definitely make a move.","Jian Wushuang had been preparing for how to deal with Devil Cloud Master. At the same time, he hoped that Devil Cloud Master would stay in seclusion for a little longer and give him more time to prepare, in this way, he would have more confidence in dealing with Devil Cloud Master.","But now...","“Is Devil Cloud Master ready to leave?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Not ready to leave, but yeah.” Daoist Xuan God said, “According to our spies, Devil Cloud Star has been preparing for a long time, waiting for Devil Cloud Star Master to come out of seclusion. Less than a year after Devil Cloud Star Master came out of seclusion, he led his army and left the Star Field. Most experts in that Star Field don’t know the purpose of the army, but we know that Devil Cloud Star is coming for us.”","“How much time do we have?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“A thousand years at most,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“What?” Jian Wushuang was shocked and frowned. “How can it be so fast? Doesn’t it take at least tens of thousands of years to get here from Devil Cloud Star?”","“Yes, under normal circumstances, it takes tens of thousands of years for a Ruler to rush to our Star Field from the Star Field where Devil Cloud Star is located. However, Devil Cloud Star Master is a Ruler of a second-grade star world, so his means and strength are very impressive. He also has a universe boat,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“Universe boat?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Before meeting Ruler Spark, he might not have known what universe boat was, but after meeting Ruler Spark and riding on the universe boat, he was no stranger to it.","It was able to travel through the universe void at a fast speed. Even the lowest level universe boat could travel through the universe space dozens or even hundreds of times faster than an ordinary Ruler.","With the universe boat traveling in place of the universe boat, the arrival time of the Devil Cloud Star Army would definitely be greatly reduced.","“Universe boat, it’s very strange. The speed of traveling through the universe void is too fast. At most, it’ll take 1,000 years for the Devil Cloud Star Army to reach this Star Field. It won’t even take 1,000 years. In other words, within this 1,000 years, we must prepare for the great battle with the Devil Cloud Star,” Daoist Xuan God said solemnly.","“Within 1,000 years?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","The expressions of Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and Di Shisan all turned grim.","Within 1,000 years, the war with Devil Cloud Star would break out.","This war would determine the life and death of the Divine Beginning Realm.","If they were defeated, they might be able to use their own strength to flee elsewhere in the universe. Jian Wushuang, with his strength and talent, should be able to live well in other territories. However, the Divine Beginning Realm, their hometown...was finished.","In order to increase his strength, Devil Cloud Star Master would squeeze the Divine Beginning Realm dry. At that time, the Divine Beginning Realm would collapse in the shortest amount of time, and countless cultivators would be able to survive, except for the group at the highest level who could escape to the universe, no one else could survive.","No one could accept this result.","For example, Jian Wushuang’s family, his wife, and many of his good friends were all in the Divine Beginning Realm. The Divine Beginning Realm was their home and their root, but for Jian Wushuang...the Divine Beginning Realm was still the existence that his Master Xuan Yi risked his life to protect.","Xuan Yi created him after his death. From the moment he inherited his master’s mantle and became a new perfect life, he had an inborn mission. This mission was to take over the Divine Beginning Realm again, to protect everything in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Thus, they could not afford to lose this battle. They had to win!"]},{"number":3930,"title":"Chapter 3930 - A Batch of Rulers","paragraphs":["“Less than 1,000 years. There’s too little time for us to prepare,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes, it’s too little. We’ve only been in the triple-realm for a few thousand years. We’ve only just begun to create experts. If we have more time, it won’t take long. In just tens of thousands of years, countless Principles Masters will emerge in the Divine Beginning Realm. A large batch of Rulers will increase their overall strength by many times. But we can’t help it. We don’t have that much time. We can only make the best use of the nearly 1,000 years to do everything well,” Daoist Xuan God said in a deep voice.","The surrounding masters also nodded.","They could not complain that Devil Cloud Star’s arrival was too sudden and too short. They could only do as much as they could and make more preparations in the last thousand years.","“Everyone, I have brought back a group of experts,” Jian Wushuang suddenly said.","The Masters immediately looked at Jian Wushuang.","“A group of experts? How many are there?” Daoist Xuan God asked.","“Dozens of them,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Just dozens?” Daoist Xuan God did not think much of it.","“Everyone, those experts are in the void outside Star Palace. You’d better follow me and see for yourself.” After saying that, Jian Wushuang rushed out of Star Palace.","The six Rulers looked at each other. Although they were puzzled, they immediately followed him.","They left Star Palace and soon arrived at the void space where the universe boat was.","From afar, the six Rulers saw the huge universe boat.","“What is this?”","“What a huge boat! And it can stay in the universe void space?”","“Is this the legendary universe boat?”","The six Rulers were shocked.","They knew that the reason why the Devil Cloud Star Army could resist this Star Field within 1,000 years was because Devil Cloud Star Master had a universe boat.","They had heard of some universe boats. They could travel through the universe void, so they could stay there. The huge boat in front of them was obviously very similar to the universe boat.","“It’s a universe boat, but it’s not complete. The experts I brought back are waiting on the boat,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","The six Rulers also saw dozens of figures standing on the universe boat.","Each of the dozens of figures exuded a terrifying aura. They were cold as ice, turned into huge black holes, were unruly, and looked like axes that could split the heaven and earth.","Each of the figures was terrifying.","Sensing the terrifying aura emitted by the dozens of people on the universe boat, Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Heaven Ancestor, Di Shisan, and Xuan Yan, the six Rulers, all sucked in a breath of cold air, their hearts instantly surged.","Just a moment ago, they did not take Jian Wushuang’s words seriously about bringing back a group of experts. But now...this group of experts stood in front of them, making them completely terrified.","“Rulers, they are all Rulers!”","“They are not ordinary Rulers. I can sense that any one of these dozens of people is ridiculously strong. They are even much stronger than the top Rulers I have seen before!”","“They are too strong. Who are these people?”","The six Rulers’ bodies trembled.","They had no choice but to tremble. Therefore, they stood in front of the universe boat. The dozens of powerful figures on the universe boat glanced at them from time to time.","Any one of them glanced at them, and they felt a chill in their hearts. It was as if they had been on the verge of death.","It was too terrifying.","Any one of these dozens of figures was definitely more powerful than them.","Standing in front of such a group of top-tier experts, they did not dare to breathe loudly even though they were also Rulers.","Only Jian Wushuang landed on the universe boat casually.","“Master.”","Immediately, dozens of figures, which made Daoist Xuan God and the other six Rulers tremble in fear, bowed and kowtowed in unison.","The one they kowtowed and shouted was obviously Jian Wushuang.","“Master?” Daoist Xuan God and the other six were a little confused.","“Get up.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand, and the 41 servants including Demon Dragon Lord stood up. However, there was still a modest and respectful look on their faces.","“My young friend, what...what is going on?” Daoist Xuan God walked up, but his eyes were still filled with unprecedented shock.","“I just said that they are experts I brought back from a dangerous place in the Universe Battlefield. They were trapped in that dangerous place for a long time, and I can help them get out. But as a condition, they have to stay by my side and serve me for 100,000 years.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Work for you? For 100,000 years?” Daoist Xuan God gasped, but then he immediately asked, “How strong are these people? Why do I feel that they are very powerful and terrifying?”","“Each of them has the battle strength of a third-level Ruler, and they are very powerful among the third-level Rulers. Of course, they are very terrifying for you,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“A third-level Ruler?” Daoist Xuan God stared at him.","Behind them, the Temporal Temple Master, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the others were also frightened, and their lips were trembling.","Only Di Shisan was puzzled at this moment. “What is a third-level Ruler?”","He had just become a Ruler not long ago and had just entered the Universe Battlefield. He did not know about the division of Rulers.","Jian Wushuang smiled, he said, “Rulers are divided into many different levels according to the number of principles fused. For example, although you are a superior Ruler, you are only a first-level Ruler. If you fuse one more principle, you will be a second-level Ruler. As for the third-level Ruler, you have to fuse six principles at the same time.”","“In our Star Field, a second-level Ruler can be said to be an invincible expert. Take Demon Monarch Ancient Night for example. He is only the most superior Ruler of the second-level. Any one of these people behind me can easily kill Demon Monarch Ancient Night.”","“Any one of these people is stronger than Demon Monarch Ancient Night. Any one of them can easily kill Demon Monarch Ancient Night?” Even the ice-cold Di Shisan was completely shocked at this moment.","In the years he had been in the Universe Battlefield, he had heard of Demon Monarch Ancient Night’s great name more than once.","For most of the experts in this Star Field, Demon Monarch Ancient Night was still terrifyingly strong.","But now, Jian Wushuang had brought back some people who were stronger than Demon Monarch Ancient Night.","But there were more than 40 people here!"]},{"number":3931,"title":"Chapter 3931 - The Plan","paragraphs":["After a long while, the six Rulers finally managed to recover from their shock. However, what followed was an unprecedented excitement and ecstasy.","After all, these experts were brought back by Jian Wushuang, and they were obviously under his orders.","They had been worried that the Devil Cloud Star Army would arrive in a thousand years. How could they not be excited when a group of top-notch Masters suddenly appeared?","The dozens of experts in front of them were definitely a huge amount of peak battle strength for the Divine Beginning Realm!","They did not have the confidence to face the Devil Cloud Star Army because they were far inferior to Devil Cloud Star in terms of peak battle strength.","!!","If they were to put aside their peak combat power and compete with the Principles Masters, the Divine Beginning Realm would have the absolute advantage. However, in a life-and-death battle like that, peak combat power was obviously more important. And now...with so many powerful Rulers appearing all of a sudden, their extremely empty peak combat power became incomparably tyrannical.","This immediately gave them a lot more confidence.","“My young friend.”","Daoist Xuan God quietly came over and asked in a low voice, “Can you control or deploy the Rulers behind you?”","“Of course.” Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile. “These people have been subdued by me. I even left a mark in their soul origin. It can be said that their lives are in my hands. How can they dare to disobey my orders?”","“That’s good.” Daoist Xuan God’s eyes lit up.","He was worried that Jian Wushuang would not be able to completely control these experts. Not only would there be a great storm, but they would also be unable to use their battle strength to the limit during the battle with the Devil Cloud Star Army, but now that he heard that Jian Wushuang had left a mark in these experts’ soul origin, he was completely relieved.","“By the way, besides these experts, there are also many treasures in this interspatial ring. Take a look.” Jian Wushuang smiled and took out another interspatial ring.","“Treasures?”","The eyes of Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and Heaven Ancestor shone with a strange light.","The four of them knew what Jian Wushuang was capable of. Back then, Jian Wushuang had brought back two batches of treasures, both from the Red Cloud World. The first batch was a large number of supreme treasures, including 100 Supreme Treasures, the second batch was the Three-layered Dao Realm, which made them ecstatic.","But this time, what did Jian Wushuang bring back?","“Oh my God!”","“Oh my God!”","“No, I can’t believe it!”","The few of them, who had been looking forward to it, stared at the treasures in Jian Wushuang’s interspatial ring with their eyes wide open.","They could not even hide the shock in their hearts and cried out in surprise.","It was not their fault that they were so shocked. The treasures in the interspatial ring were really incredible to them.","Supreme true treasures!","The interspatial ring had supreme true treasures!","Jian Wushuang had brought back 100 supreme true treasures last time, and the Rulers had several supreme true treasures with them. They would not be too surprised to see supreme true treasures again, but now...they could not help being shocked.","Because the interspatial ring was filled with countless supreme treasures.","There were so many of them, at least thousands of them!","And some of them emitted an extremely powerful aura. They were obviously Supreme Treasures of the supreme grade.","“How can there be so many supreme treasures?” Daoist Xuan God’s eyes widened in disbelief.","The others had similar expressions.","Jian Wushuang was the only one who looked calm and had a faint smile on his face.","He had killed many Rulers during his adventure in the Eternal Dark Prison, especially the Star Demon Ancestor. He had suppressed and killed hundreds of them in one go.","After all, these Rulers had survived for hundreds of chaos cycles in the Eternal Dark Prison. Each of them had killed many experts during their long adventure, so they naturally had many treasures in their hands.","The first Ruler Jian Wushuang killed in the Eternal Dark Prison was Lord Siyi, who was at the peak of the second level. However, after killing him, Jian Wushuang obtained more than 20 supreme treasures, later, he killed many Rulers. Even the weakest one was no weaker than Lord Siyi. There were many third level Rulers and even the strongest experts in the dark zone.","Jian Wushuang also killed Star Demon Ancestor, and the experts he had subdued had many treasures. Although Jian Wushuang did not ask for most of the treasures, they did not need ordinary supreme treasures, naturally, he gave them all to Jian Wushuang.","With all the supreme treasures, Jian Wushuang had a lot of supreme treasures. Now, he had taken out about 70 percent of the supreme treasures and thousands of them.","“Supreme treasures are extremely common in the Eternal Dark Prison. They are not valuable at all. However, in this Star Field, the supreme treasures are the real treasures.” Jian Wushuang chuckled.","Now, when Daoist Xuan God and the others saw so many supreme treasures, they were shocked beyond words.","“These supreme treasures are not of much use to me now. Xuan God, think about how you can make the most of them,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.”","Xuan God had been calm since the destruction of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. He immediately discussed with the Temporal Temple Master and the others.","Soon, the result came out.","“My young friend, the number of Supreme Treasures you gave us is indeed too many. This Star Field is too small, so it’s impossible for us to make full use of them. At most, we can only make use of part of their value, but it’s worth trying,” Xuan God said.","“Do you have a plan?” Jian Wushuang looked at him.","“Yes, we do.” Daoist Xuan God nodded slightly. “We plan to tell the public that we have a large number of top-tier supreme treasures.”","“Tell the public?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Yes, tell the public.” Daoist Xuan God smiled and said, “With this batch of supreme treasures and the many top-tier supreme treasures you brought back for us, we can’t use so many of them in the divine beginning realm alone. Therefore, we plan to use this batch of supreme treasures to try our best to win over the forces or experts in this Star Field.”","..."]},{"number":3932,"title":"Chapter 3932 - Open Recruitment","paragraphs":["“Our Divine Beginning Realm is just one of the astral worlds in this Star Field. Moreover, it’s just an astral world that hasn’t been nurtured for long. If it weren’t for the fact that we’ve relied on the three layers of Dao Worlds, our Divine Beginning Realm would have produced a large number of experts. Otherwise, our overall strength and foundation would be far inferior to the other astral worlds in this Star Field.”","“There are many Principles Masters in this star area. Moreover, those Principles Masters who dare to wander in the three great battlefields all year round are all powerful. They are much stronger than the new Principles Masters in our Divine Beginning Realm. As for Rulers, there are many in this star area. If possible, I plan to recruit as many of them as possible.”","“Our Star Palace has been very low-key in recent years. Our reputation in this Star Field is quite good as well. Aside from the sacred islands that the three great holy lands once supported, we don’t have any enemies. The experts of this Star Field don’t hate our Star Palace, but now that we have a large number of supreme treasures, we can use them as a condition to invite them to fight for us in the Divine Beginning Realm.”","Daoist Xuan God smiled.","“We’ve just discussed this. Although this Star Field has a large number of Principles Masters and quite a few Rulers, because it’s located at the very edge of the universe, the number of true treasures this Star Field possesses is relatively small. After all, the only way for the great beings of this Star Field to obtain true treasures and opportunities is through the three great battlefields. However, although the three great Universe Battlefields of Crimson Rock Mountain, Devil Smoke Valley, and Quicksand Demon region contain a large number of true treasures and opportunities, the number of true treasures that can truly be obtained is very, very small.”","!!","“That’s why the great beings in this Star Field are short of true treasures, especially high-level true treasures.”","“My little friend, you brought back a total of 100,000 pinnacle true treasures from the Red Cloud World for the first time. These are pinnacle true treasures. Under normal circumstances, even Rulers would attach great importance to pinnacle true treasures, not to mention Principles Masters.”","“We can make a promise. As long as Principles Masters above the fifth level of the void space are willing to fight on behalf of our Divine Beginning Realm, it won’t be long before they are willing to give their all in the Great War against Devil Cloud Star in a thousand years. We will give them a pinnacle true treasure as a reward. As for those below the fifth level of the void space, after all, we can give top-tier true treasures as a reward for the cultivators at the fourth and third level of the Void Space.”","“I believe that if this news spreads out, the entire Star Field will be in an uproar. Countless Principles Masters in the Star Field will go crazy over it. I’m afraid that within a few hundred years, countless Principles Masters will rush to my Star Palace for Supreme True Treasures and top-tier true treasures. With these true treasures, the Divine Beginning Realm will be able to gather an enormous army of Principles Masters in a short period of time!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","He had no doubt about what Daoist Xuan God had said.","There were too few supreme true treasures in this Star Field, and they were of low quality. Even Rulers valued a pinnacle true treasure. Among the Principles Masters, there were only a few who were special, there were almost no pinnacle true treasures in this Star Field.","An ordinary pinnacle true treasure was enough to make any Principles Master in this Star Field go crazy, including those at the pinnacle of six levels.","As for top-tier true treasures, those Principles Masters at the six levels of the void space would also be envious.","Now, as long as it was above the five levels of the void space, they would give top-tier true treasures to those at the three levels of the void space and the four levels of the void space. If this news spread out, not many Principles Masters would be able to resist the temptation.","“And that’s only for Principles Masters. As for the battle strength of Rulers, we now have a large number of supreme true treasures. We can also ask the Rulers of this Star Field to help us at the price of supreme true treasures. Although the battle strength of the Rulers of this Star Field is not much, all of them together can be considered a strong force.”","“Together with the army of countless Principles Masters, we can completely gather more than 70% of the battle strength of the upper echelons of this Star Field in the Divine Beginning Realm. When the Devil Cloud Star Army arrives, our chances of fighting them will be much greater,” Daoist Xuan God added.","“That’s right.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. “Compared to this Star Field, the Divine Beginning Realm is much better. If we can combine all the upper echelons of this Star Field with true treasures, it’ll be a great help to our Divine Beginning Realm. As for these true treasures, we’ll only pay a large number of pinnacle true treasures and top-tier true treasures. As for the supreme true treasures, they won’t be too much, so they won’t affect our Divine Beginning Realm.”","“It doesn’t really matter,” said Daoist Xuan God with a smile. “Actually, when you first brought back 100,000 pinnacle true treasures and 100 supreme true treasures, I had already considered this step. However, at that time, we didn’t have too many supreme true treasures on hand. If we used all of them as a price to recruit great beings, then after the Great War ended, Pinnacle True Treasures would flood the universe, and the Great Beings of all the powers in the universe would have a large number of pinnacle true treasures and supreme true treasures. As for us in the Divine Beginning Realm, we would be at a disadvantage when it comes to true treasures.”","“In addition, in that situation, the only trump card of the Divine Beginning Realm was your strength. However, at that time, your combat power wasn’t enough to intimidate the entire Star Field. I was worried that if we acted like this, it would cause the countless major powers in this Star Field to go crazy. At that time, not only would they not help us resist Devil Cloud Star, they would even directly attack and snatch our Supreme Treasures.”","“But now, neither of those two exists.”","Daoist Xuan God paused, he laughed, “This time, you brought back thousands of supreme treasures for us. With these supreme treasures in our hands, even if we flood this Star Field with supreme treasures in the future, our Divine Beginning Realm will still be in the absolute lead. As for the experts of the other factions...you are now publicly acknowledged as the number one expert in this Star Field. Even Demon Monarch Ancient Night was defeated by you. With just you alone, no one in this Star Field would dare to act recklessly.”","“Besides, you’ve brought back such a large number of experts. With them, we can protect our precious treasures even if we have dozens of times more. No one or force dares to lay their hands on our Star Palace.”","Jian Wushuang smiled.","It was a sin to be rich.","The Star Palace had a large number of precious treasures, but they had to hide them carefully and did not dare to expose them. After all, the Star Palace was not very strong in this Star Field.","But now, not to mention the large number of Principles Masters under Star Palace, just the top-level combat power alone, or any of his servants, could sweep across this Star Field. With such power...Star Palace did not need to worry at all."]},{"number":3933,"title":"Chapter 3933 - Boiling!","paragraphs":["“In that case, let’s make the news public as soon as possible and let all the experts in the Star Field know in the shortest time possible.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “As for the Supreme Treasures, don’t be stingy and use them freely. I’ll go to the Red Cloud World again in a while and bring back as many supreme treasures as possible.”","Red Cloud World had countless true treasures, more than hundreds of millions of them?","Even though Lord Wu had some restrictions on supreme true treasures and supreme true treasures, if they were only top-tier, pinnacle true treasures, Lord Wu would have said it back then, he could take as many as he wanted.","That time, he only brought out 100,000 pinnacle true treasures. If he needed them now, he could go to Red Cloud World and ask Lord Wu for some top-tier and pinnacle true treasures, he believed that Lord Wu would most likely agree to his request.","“With enough true treasures, we can gather a large number of Principles Masters to form an army of Principles Masters. However, there are too many Principles Masters, so it’s not easy to fully utilize them. The best way is to let them practice and master some special battle formations so that they can work together to unleash greater battle strength. However, this kind of battle formation is fine on a small scale, but our Star Palace doesn’t have a large-scale battle formation at the moment,” Daoist Xuan God said with a frown.","!!","“A large-scale battle formation?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","It was true that an army composed entirely of Principles Masters would have to work together with some special formations or battle formations in order to unleash greater battle strength.","Now, there were more than 100,000 Principles Masters in the Divine Beginning Realm alone. If a large number of Principles Masters gathered in this Star Field, the number would be even more terrifying. It was likely that there would be hundreds of thousands of Principles Masters at any time, it must be very demanding to be able to maximize the battle formation of these Principles Masters.","“Stone Fire,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Master.” Stone Fire immediately came to Jian Wushuang’s side.","“Your attainments in formation are the highest among us. Do you have a way to solve this battle formation?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Ruler Spark smiled and said, “Master, to tell you the truth, before I was imprisoned, I served in the military camp of a divine kingdom. My duty is to design and perfect the military formations and formations of the army. Of course, the military formations of a divine kingdom’s army are terrifyingly high-level. There are nearly 100,000 people in charge of researching and perfecting this military formation. I’m just one of them, but I know a lot about the military formations and battle formations of this army.”","“As for the army of the divine kingdom, they could easily send out tens of millions and hundreds of millions of experts. In comparison, it’s much easier to create hundreds of thousands, or at most close to a million, battle formations of Principles Masters.”","“That’s good.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up. “In that case, I’ll leave it to you.”","“No problem.” Ruler Spark nodded with confidence.","“Xuan God, Ruler Spark is a formation master. His understanding of formation is very high. Even among the fourth-and fifth-level masters, he is extremely high. No one in this Star Field can compare to him. Leave the battle formation to him,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Thank you, Mr. Stone Fire.” Daoist Xuan God cupped his hands and said.","“I’m just following master’s orders. You’re too kind.” The Starlord returned the salute.","“Xuan God, I’ll leave these people to you for now. Find a place to settle them first. If they need anything, as long as they don’t go too far, they can be satisfied,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Daoist Xuan God nodded.","Jian Wushuang turned around and looked at the slaves behind him. “Listen up. Xuan God is my elder and has done me a great favor. When I’m not around, you have to listen to him. Of course, if you need anything, you can ask him. He will do his best to satisfy you, but don’t go too far.”","“In addition, you were all imprisoned by the Red Cloud Branch, and most of you have committed crimes. There may even be some evil people among you. I don’t care about these, but now that you’re under my command, you have to behave. Whoever dares to stir up trouble in this Star Field, don’t blame me for being rude. I already have a lot of slaves, so it doesn’t matter if I kill a few.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold.","The servants in front of him were shocked.","There were indeed many evil people among them who had committed heinous crimes.","They had been imprisoned in the Eternal Dark Prison for a long time. Now that they finally got out of the Eternal Dark Prison, they had been holding back their energy and wanted to vent, some of them even wanted to slaughter them.","For them, who were strong and had lived for a long time, it was normal to slaughter some ants. However, it was clear that their master disliked such things.","Now that they were under Jian Wushuang’s control, they did not dare to disobey his orders.","After all, although Jian Wushuang swore to the universal principle that he would return their freedom in 100,000 years, they had to obey his orders.","If they did not obey his orders, Jian Wushuang could still kill them at any time.","“Xuan God, I’m going to the Nine Emperor Pavilion. If you need anything, you can send me a message directly,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Daoist Xuan God nodded slightly.","“Demon Dragon, follow me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Demon Dragon Lord nodded.","Immediately, Jian Wushuang and Demon Dragon Lord set off for the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","The remaining 40 slaves were temporarily settled in Star Palace by Daoist Xuan God.","At the same time, a piece of news spread through the entire Star Field at the fastest speed.","This news was personally spread by Star Palace Master. He said that there were countless supreme treasures in Star Palace. In this Star Field, any Principles Master or Ruler who was willing to fight for Star Palace for 10,000 years would be able to obtain a supreme treasure as a price.","Among them, Principles Masters at three or four levels of void space were rewarded with a top-tier true treasure!","Principles Masters at five or six levels of void space were rewarded with a pinnacle true treasure.","Great beings at the Ruler level were rewarded with a supreme true treasure!","Regardless of how many Principles Masters and Rulers came, Star Palace guaranteed that they had enough true treasures. Even if it was a million top-tier or pinnacle true treasures, Star Palace could afford it.","As soon as the news spread out, the entire Star Field was in an uproar.","Soon after, countless great beings from this Star Field heard the news and rushed to Star Palace!","For a time, Star Palace became the center of attention in this Star Field.","Star Palace..."]},{"number":3934,"title":"Chapter 3934 - The Pavilion Master Welcomes You","paragraphs":["The Nine Emperor Pavilion was a large-scale trading place.","When Jian Wushuang heard about the Nine Emperor Pavilion from Temporal Temple Master, he only knew that it was very special. It did not compete for Ruler, did not participate in the fight for treasures and opportunities, and only did business. However, the Nine Emperor Pavilion spread to many corners of the universe, there were even some in the deepest parts of the universe.","At that time, Jian Wushuang was a little curious about the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","After subduing Devil Flame and a large number of slaves in the Eternal Dark Prison, Jian Wushuang had a new understanding of the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","The Nine Emperor Pavilion was a giant!","Although it did not compete for Ruler and did not participate in the fight for treasures and opportunities, the Nine Emperor Pavilion spread to every corner of the universe. Even in the deepest parts of the universe, it held an important position.","In the deepest parts of the vast universe, there were many eternal divine kingdoms. These divine kingdoms were created by top-tier Absolute Rulers, such as the Red Cloud Branch.","These divine kingdoms should be the territory of the creator, but within these divine kingdoms, there was the Nine Emperor Pavilion, and there were quite a few of them.","To be able to spread the Nine Emperor Pavilion to every corner of the universe and even infiltrate large divine kingdoms without any objections from the masters of those divine kingdoms, one could imagine how terrifying the Nine Emperor Pavilion was.","“The Nine Emperor Pavilion has existed in the vast universe for such a long time and covered such a vast territory. Its strength and heritage are simply unimaginable. The one who created it must be an earth-shaking expert. He must be at least an invincible supreme-being, which is at the level of Supreme Lingyun, or maybe even stronger,” Jian Wushuang thought.","The Nine Emperor Pavilion was definitely a Super Ruler in the universe, at least much stronger than the Red Cloud Branch.","Jian Wushuang had no doubt about this.","Although the Star Field he was in was at the edge of the universe, the power of the Nine Emperor Pavilion still penetrated into it.","In the middle of the Star Field, a huge and ancient Earth Star floated quietly. The Nine Emperor Pavilion was located on this Earth Star.","Whoosh! Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang and Demon Dragon Lord appeared in the void outside the Earth Star.","“Nine Emperor Pavilion.” Jian Wushuang looked calmly at the huge Earth Star in front of him.","Although there was a layer of great magic formation on the Earth Star, Jian Wushuang could still clearly see the tall buildings in the magic formation.","The entire Nine Emperor Pavilion was extremely vast and there were many cultivators walking around on the Earth Star. Most of these cultivators were experts who came to the Nine Emperor Pavilion to trade.","Beside Jian Wushuang, Demon Dragon Lord was much more overbearing than him. He glanced at the Nine Emperor Pavilion in front of him and swept out his soul power recklessly. The array on the Nine Emperor Pavilion...it could not stop Demon Dragon Lord’s soul detection at all. In an instant, Demon Dragon Lord had a clear view of the scene in the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","“There are three Rulers in total. Two of them are only at the first level, but one of them has reached the second level,” Demon Dragon Lord said.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","He did not expect that there would be a second level Ruler in the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","When the experts in the Eternal Dark Prison had not come out, there was only one second level Ruler in the Star Field, Master Kun Yu. It seemed that no one else had reached the second level, but now it seemed that...there was such a master in the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","“Let’s go in.” Jian Wushuang rushed toward the Earth Star.","When Jian Wushuang appeared in the void outside the Nine Emperor Pavilion and swept the soul power of the Demon Dragon Lord, the three Masters in the Nine Emperor Pavilion immediately sensed him.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Three powerful auras rose from the Nine Emperor Pavilion at the same time, and three figures appeared above the buildings in the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","The appearance of these three instantly caused a commotion within the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","“Rulers? Three Rulers?”","“They are the three pavilion lords of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. The one in the center is the first pavilion lord of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, Ruler Chenyun. It is said that this Ruler Chenyun reached the peak-level of Rulers many years ago, and in terms of combat power, he isn’t any weaker than Ruler Kun Yu. However, Ruler Kun Yu has already left this Star Field because of the rise of Demon Monarch Ancient Night. Right now, among the strongest experts in this Star Field, other than Blood Sword Master and Demon Monarch Ancient Night, this Ruler Chenyun should be the strongest.”","“Did something happen? The three Rulers of the Nine Emperor Pavilion actually appeared at the same time. Even the deepcloud Ruler has appeared.”","Exclamations rang out from below.","Many Principles Masters who had come to the Nine Emperor Pavilion to trade raised their heads in shock as they stared at the three Rulers.","Soon after, the three Rulers directly flew into the void ahead under their gazes. There were two figures slowly walking over.","Clearly, the three Pavilion Masters had appeared because of the arrival of these two people.","However, who were these two people? They actually caused the three Pavilion Masters of the Nine Emperor Pavilion to appear at the same time to welcome them?","“Haha, the arrival of the Blood Sword Master brings light to our Nine Emperor Pavilion.”","A grand laughter was emitted from the mouth of Ruler Chenyun.","Upon hearing this laughter, the Principles Masters below immediately understood.","“I was wondering who it was. So it’s the Blood Sword Master!”","“Mm, with the status of Ruler Chenyun, in this Star Field, probably only the Blood Sword Master and Demon Monarch Ancient Night are qualified for him to personally welcome him.”","“Blood Sword Master? That’s the Blood Sword Master? Judging from his aura, he’s just an ordinary Principles Master?”","“An ordinary Principles Master?”","“What a joke. He’s also a Principles Master, but if Blood Sword Master wants to kill us, it’s as easy as crushing an ant. Let alone us, even an ordinary Ruler would be easily killed by Blood Sword Master. After all, he defeated Demon Monarch Ancient Night in a head-on fight. How powerful is Demon Monarch Ancient Night?”","“Who’s the one-horned elder next to Blood Sword Master?”","“I don’t know, but he seems to be an extremely powerful expert.”","The Principles Masters below all began to discuss.","To these Principles Masters, ordinary Rulers were already high and mighty. The appearance of Ruler Chenyun was enough to make them excited and even shocked.","And in this Star Field, it had long been rumored that he was a god. With the level of a Principles Master and being hailed as the number one expert in this Star Field, Blood Sword Master was enough to make them go crazy.","It was a great fortune for the Principles Masters to meet such an expert.","They were also Principles Masters, so they admired and admired Jian Wushuang’s strength.","Now, they looked at Jian Wushuang like he was their idol."]},{"number":3935,"title":"Chapter 3935 - Was Too Low-Level","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang and Demon Dragon Lord stood in the void above the Nine Emperor Pavilion. In front of them were the three Pavilion Masters of the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","However, the three Pavilion Masters were not looking at Jian Wushuang, but Demon Dragon Lord.","“This man...”","Ruler Chenyun looked at Demon Dragon Lord and frowned.","He did not know Demon Dragon Lord, and he had never heard of such an expert. However, although Demon Dragon Lord was standing behind Jian Wushuang, there was an invisible pressure on him, it was so strong that even Ruler Chenyun was shocked.","At this moment, Demon Dragon Lord glanced at him. With just a simple glance, Ruler Chenyun felt his body and mind twitching.","“What a terrifying expert. I feel that he isn’t weaker than Demon Monarch Ancient Night, and might even be stronger!”","Ruler Chenyun was the number one Pavilion Master of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. When Demon Monarch Ancient Night rose to power, he had interacted with the latter. However, the Nine Emperor Pavilion’s background was too great. Back then, although Demon Monarch Ancient Night had absolute power in this Star Field...he could suppress many major powers in this Star Field, but he did not dare to provoke the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","Ruler Chenyun found that the one-horned elder standing in front of him was more powerful than Demon Monarch Ancient Night.","However, the one-horned elder was standing a little behind Jian Wushuang.","“Blood Sword Master, May I know who is standing next to you?” Ruler Chenyun asked.","“He’s just a servant of mine. Don’t worry, Ruler Chenyun,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“A servant?” Ruler Chenyun and the other two Pavilion Masters looked at each other, feeling even more shocked.","“Ruler Chenyun, I’m here to make a deal,” Jian Wushuang said.","“It must be a big deal for Blood Sword Master to come here in person. Please follow me to the cabinet. We can talk about it slowly,” Ruler Chenyun invited.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Immediately, Jian Wushuang and Demon Dragon Lord headed toward the Pavilion in the center of the Nine Emperor Pavilion under the guidance of Ruler Chenyun.","...","Jian Wushuang sat in front of a round table in the magnificent pavilion, while Demon Dragon Lord stood behind him respectfully. In front of him, the three Pavilion Masters of the Nine Emperor Pavilion were also sitting there.","“Blood Sword Master, what treasures do you want to exchange for?” Ruler Chenyun asked directly.","“Crystals, all kinds of special crystals, but at a higher level,” Jian Wushuang said.","He wanted special crystals, so he naturally prepared them for Devil Flame.","Although he had killed many masters in the Eternal Dark Prison, subdued many experts, and obtained a large number of special crystals, these special crystals, except for the gold-green world stone that he got from Thousand Kills Emperor Lord, were not enough, even if all the gems were added up, they would not be enough for Devil Flame to restore 10% of his gold-swallowing divine body.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang needed more high-quality gems.","“That’s easy. I have a list of the special gems from the Nine Emperor Pavilion. Blood Sword Master, you can take a look at it.” Ruler Chenyun handed a list to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang took it and browsed it with Devil Flame.","After a while, he finished reading the list.","“No, it’s too low-level.” Devil Flame’s voice sounded in Jian Wushuang’s mind. “The Crystals on this list are all ordinary. Their quality is lower than the ones you got in the Eternal Dark Prison. Now that my gold-swallowing divine body has recovered a lot, I need to continue to recover. Even if I devour these ordinary crystals, they won’t be of much use. Only those higher-level crystals can help me recover my gold-swallowing divine body.”","“None of the crystals on this list can meet my requirements.”","Jian Wushuang frowned.","He had heard from Devil Flame that as the gold-swallowing divine body slowly recovered, the quality of the crystals would become higher and higher. Although Devil Flame’s gold-swallowing divine body had not recovered by 10%, ordinary crystals could no longer help him recover his divine body.","“Ruler Chenyun, to tell you the truth, the special crystals I want must be of a high level. None of the crystals on this list can meet my requirements,” Jian Wushuang said.","“None?” Ruler Chenyun was shocked. “That’s not right. The Crystals on this list are extremely rare and precious in this Star Field. Several of them are almost extinct in this Star Field. How could none of these precious crystals meet your requirements?”","“Blood Sword Master, can you tell me what you want these crystals for?”","Ruler Chenyun was indeed curious.","However, Jian Wushuang shook his head. “This matter is of great importance. Forgive me for not being able to tell you, but I do need those higher-level crystals. Ruler Chenyun, do you have any higher-level crystals in the Nine Emperor Pavilion, or do you have other ways to get them?”","“The crystals that I can take out are all on this list. I’m afraid it’s difficult to find higher-level crystals in this Star Field. However, Blood Sword Master, if you really need them, there are other ways,” Ruler Chenyun said.","“What ways?” Jian Wushuang looked at him.","“Blood Sword Master, you should know something about the Nine Emperor Pavilion. It covers every corner of the universe and every Star Field. This Star Field is at the edge of the universe and is the most barren place. Naturally, it has limited resources and treasures. This Star Field doesn’t have higher-level crystals, but other Star Fields do. If you really need them, the Nine Emperor Pavilion can send them to you from other Star Fields.”","“But...it will cost a lot more to send it from other Star Fields,” Ruler Chenyun said.","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. He was not surprised.","The high-level crystals he needed were very difficult to get in this Star Field. Unless he entered the deepest part of the three battlefields and had a heaven-defying opportunity, he could only get one or two of those special crystals, for example, Jian Wushuang had obtained a piece of blood blaze iron.","However, difficult seeds were purely a matter of luck.","It was indeed not easy to obtain such high-level special crystals within the resources of this Star Field. He could only send them from other Star Fields.","The price of sending them from other Star Fields was certainly more expensive. After all, the universe void was too vast. One Star Field was extremely far away from another Star Field. Even the Nine Emperor Pavilion...it would not be easy to send treasures from one Star Field to another.","“I want to know what kind of crystals the Nine Emperor Pavilion can send to this Star Field in a short period of time,” Jian Wushuang asked."]},{"number":3936,"title":"Chapter 3936 - Universe Origin Stone","paragraphs":["“Well, I have to talk to the Pavilion Masters of some nearby Star Fields to get accurate information.” Ruler Chenyun paused for a moment. “Well, please wait here for a moment. I’ll contact the branch Pavilion Masters of those Star Fields immediately.”","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded and did not rush them.","Ruler Chenyun immediately ordered people to serve them good wine and food.","Half a day later, Ruler Chenyun gave a definite answer.","“Blood Sword Master, I’ve just compiled this list. It can be sent to this Star Field in the shortest time. The level of the special crystals on this list is much higher than the previous list. See if you’re satisfied.” Ruler Chenyun sent another list to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang took it, scanned it with his consciousness, and nodded slightly.","Indeed, the level of the special gems on this list was much higher than the previous one.","“Devil Flame, what do you think?” Jian Wushuang communicated with Devil Flame in his mind.","“It’s not bad.”","Devil Flame also said, “Although there are only dozens of gems on this list, they are not low-level. The highest level of these gems can help me recover my divine body the most. One is Ice Essence Crystals, and the other is Gold-Fire Magic Stones. Although these two gems are still inferior to the gold-fire world stone, they are still very good, especially the Gold-Fire Magic Stones. If there are a certain number of them, I can recover 10% to 20% of my divine body in a short time.”","Jian Wushuang immediately raised his head after receiving the answer from Devil Flame. “Ruler Chenyun, I need two kinds of crystals, Ice Essence Crystals and Gold-Fire Magic Stones. I wonder how much they are worth?”","“Ice Essence Crystals and Gold-Fire Magic Stones?” Ruler Chenyun raised his eyebrows, he smiled and said, “Blood Sword Master, you have good taste. On the latest list I gave you, these two kinds of crystals are of the highest level, especially Gold-Fire Magic Stones, which are extremely rare in the edge of the universe.”","“Of course, the higher the level, the higher the value. Moreover, these two crystals need to be sent from other Star Fields, so the price is even higher.”","Ruler Chenyun only said that the price was higher, but he did not mention the specific value of these two crystals.","Jian Wushuang said directly, “Not only do I need to send these two crystals from other Star Fields, but I also have a request, which is that the speed must be fast. Within 500 years, they must be sent to this Star Field and handed over to me.”","“What? Within 500 years?” Ruler Chenyun stared at him.","“Why? Can’t you do it?” Jian Wushuang glanced at him.","“I can do it. The Nine Emperor Pavilion is spread throughout the universe and has connections with other Star Fields. There are special space passages between us. If we use them, we can send them to you within 50 years, let alone 500 years!”","“But the key is the universe passage. Unlike the space passages in the Star Fields, it’s extremely difficult to open any of them. The cost is enormous. And this is just the creation. Every time we use the universe space passage, we also have to pay a huge price. It’s the same for the short-distance universe space passage. But to cross the Star Fields, the cost is even more ridiculous.” Ruler Chenyun frowned.","“I know the price is high, and I’m prepared for it. You don’t have to waste your breath on me. Just tell me how much it will cost to deliver these two crystals to me within 500 years,” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice.","Ruler Chenyun pondered for a moment, then stretched out a finger and said, “One Gold-Fire Magic Stone costs one Universe Origin Stone!”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils suddenly shrank.","“What a big demand,” Demon Dragon Lord said coldly, and a faint murderous aura swept out from his body.","Ruler Chenyun and the other two Pavilion Masters of the Nine Emperor Pavilion were shocked when they sensed this murderous aura.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand, indicating Demon Dragon Lord to restrain his aura.","“One Universe Origin Stone?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","Universe Origin Stone was a special unit used for trading in the vast universe.","In the vast universe, there were two kinds of currency. One was Universe Crystals, which was the first universal currency that Jian Wushuang came into contact with. When he received the blood north inheritance, he got some Universe Crystals, at that time, he did not know the use of Universe Crystals. Later, when he entered the Universe Battlefield, he found out.","However, Universe Crystals were only the most basic currency, and most of them were used by Principles Masters and some weaker Rulers.","Rulers who had reached a certain level of strength used Universe Origin Stones to trade.","In the universe, the ratio of Universe Origin Stones to Universe Crystals was 1:100 million.","In other words, 100 million Universe Crystals could be exchanged for one Universe Origin Stone.","However, in this Star Field, even those Principles Masters who had been adventuring in the Universe Battlefields all year round and had true treasures would only have 100 Universe Crystals in total, even for a first-tier Ruler, their total wealth would only be around 100,000 Universe Crystals. If they had a supreme true treasure, their wealth might be a little more, but it would not be much more.","One Universe Origin Stone was equivalent to 100 million Universe Crystals, which was an astronomical figure for most first-level Rulers.","On the market, a supreme true treasure could be worth between 1 million and 2 million Universe Crystals.","One Universe Origin Stone was equivalent to dozens or even nearly a hundred supreme true treasures.","Demon Dragon Lord could not be blamed for saying that Ruler Chenyun was asking for too much. Under normal circumstances, a golden-fire magic stone did not need one Universe Origin Stone. At most, 0.1 Universe Origin Stone would be enough.","“Blood Sword Master, I know that the price is relatively expensive, but there’s no other way. Your request is too high. You must send it to this Star Field within 500 years. For 500 years, you can only rely on the universe space passage,” Ruler Chenyun said solemnly.","“What about Ice Essence Crystals?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","“The value of Ice Essence Crystals is slightly lower than Gold-Fire Magic Stones, but if it is sent within 500 years, it will also cost 0.9 Universe Origin Stones,” Ruler Chenyun said.","Jian Wushuang fell silent.","In his heart, he was asking Devil Flame, “Devil Flame, how many Gold-Fire Magic Stones or Ice Essence Crystals do you need to recover 20% of your gold-swallowing divine body?”","“If all of them are Gold-Fire Magic Stones, 100 should be enough. If all of them are Ice Essence Crystals, I’m afraid you’ll need about 120,” Devil Flame replied.","“100 Gold-Fire Magic Stones means 100 Universe Origin Stones.” Jian Wushuang could not help narrowing his eyes."]},{"number":3937,"title":"Chapter 3937 - In Exchange","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang had the Universe Origin Stone.","He had obtained it from killing and subduing many experts while adventuring in the Eternal Dark Prison.","It should be known that most of the experts in the Eternal Dark Prison came from the depths of the universe and had survived hundreds of chaos cycles of slaughter. Every single one of them had extraordinary wealth and more or less had some Universe Origin Stones or Universe Crystals in their hands, all of them added together, they now had about 20 Universe Origin Stones.","However, 20 Universe Origin Stones were obviously not enough to buy Gold-Fire Magic Stones and Ice Essence Crystals.","“Ruler Chenyun, I need a lot of Gold-Fire Magic Stones and Ice Essence Crystals,” Jian Wushuang suddenly said.","“Oh?” Ruler Chenyun immediately looked at Jian Wushuang.","“If it’s just Gold-Fire Magic Stones, I need 100. As for Ice Essence Crystals, I need 120,” Jian Wushuang said directly.","“This...” Ruler Chenyun and the other two Pavilion Masters were stunned.","They knew very well how expensive Ruler Chenyun’s price was.","One Gold-Fire Magic Stone was worth 100 Universe Origin Stones.","In the universe, even a master of the fourth or fifth level might not have 100 Universe Origin Stones?","How could this Blood Sword Master afford it?","Even though he was extremely doubtful...however, Ruler Chenyun still said, “Blood Sword Master, even though I’ve given you this list, it doesn’t mean that there are many crystals on this list, especially the ones with the highest levels, such as Gold-Fire Magic Stones and Ice Essence Crystals.”","“Previously, I’ve communicated with many branch Pavilion Masters and made statistics. All the Star Fields in this vicinity add up to only around 30 Gold-Fire Magic Stones. As for the Ice Essence Crystals, they are a little more, but they are less than 60. Even if I gave you all of them, they wouldn’t be able to meet your requirements.”","“How about this? I can try my best to give you 30 Gold-Fire Magic Stones and 50 Ice Crystals within 500 years. Of course, if it’s slightly inferior crystals, such as Blood-Dragon Crystals, there are a lot of them in the surrounding Star Fields. I can get you 200 or 300 of them. What do you think?”","“Blood-Dragon Crystals?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“That’s fine.” The voice of the Devil Flame sounded in Jian Wushuang’s mind. “Although the Blood-Dragon Crystals are not as high as Gold-Fire Magic Stones and Ice Essence Crystals, 300 Blood-Dragon Crystals together can be compared to 30 to 40 Gold-Fire Magic Stones. All of them are enough.”","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “Just 30 Gold-Fire Magic Stones, 50 Ice Essence Crystals, and 300 Blood-Dragon Crystals.”","“Okay.” Ruler Chenyun looked solemn. “I thought you only needed one or two Gold-Fire Magic Stones, so the price is naturally much higher. But now that you need so many at once...many crystals are in the same Star Field, so you can get a lot of them in one universe passage. This way, you can save a lot of money, so I can lower the price for you.”","“How about this? 30 Gold-Fire Magic Stones and 50 Ice Essence Crystals. I’ll give you 50 Universe Origin Stones. As for 300 Blood-Dragon Crystals, I’ll give you 30 Universe Origin Stones. If you agree, I’ll send them to the Star Palace within 500 years.”","“Sure.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Although 80 Universe Origin Stones was still a huge number, it was indeed a lot more favorable than what Ruler Chenyun had said.","“Blood Sword Master, how do you pay for the 80 Universe Origin Stones?” Ruler Chenyun looked at him.","“I have a batch of treasures in my hand. Take a look and see how much they are worth.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand and took out an interspatial ring.","The interspatial ring contained a large number of resources and treasures that he had obtained from the experts he had killed in the Eternal Dark Prison.","Many of these resources and treasures were extremely precious. They were not found in this Star Field, so they were naturally of great value.","After taking the interspatial ring, Ruler Chenyun began to examine it carefully.","When he saw the countless precious treasures in the interspatial ring, Ruler Chenyun’s heart immediately trembled.","“Good god, Eight Directions Nether Vine, Wind-Fire Immortal Herb, Thunder Killing Blood Elixir...” Ruler Chenyun called out the names of dozens of treasures in one breath.","“These treasures are not only rare in our Star Field, but also in the nearby Star Field. Blood Sword Master, how could you take out so many treasures in one breath? Most of the other treasures are also very precious and high-level. Most of them are very difficult to find in our Star Field.”","“Well, well, well.”","Ruler Chenyun kept praising Jian Wushuang’s skills.","He was just a Principles Master, but the treasures he brought out were enough to amaze most of the Rulers at the edge of the universe.","“Ruler Chenyun, tell me directly how much these treasures are worth,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","Ruler Chenyun made a simple calculation, he quickly replied, “Blood Sword Master, most of the treasures in this interspatial ring are extremely rare and there are several of them that are even more valuable. Add them all up and I can give you 30 Universe Origin Stones.”","“30 Universe Origin Stones?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","30 Universe Origin Stones, in addition to the 20 Universe Origin Stones he already had, was only 50 Universe Origin Stones.","“I have some true treasures here, take a look.” Jian Wushuang took out another interspatial ring.","Ruler Chenyun immediately took it. After checking, he found that there were only dozens of true treasures in the interspatial ring, but they were all supreme true treasures.","And they were not ordinary supreme true treasures.","“Dozens of supreme true treasures at the Supreme Level?” Ruler Chenyun widened his eyes and immediately calmed down, he said with a smile, “Blood Sword Master, I’ll still give you the price of 20 Universe Origin Stones for these dozens of supreme true treasures.”","Jian Wushuang finally frowned, he said in a low voice, “These supreme true treasures are all at the supreme level. Each of them is extremely valuable. It should be easy to exchange any one of them for 10 to 20 million Universe Crystals. Among them are true treasure armor, domain type true treasures, and suppression type true treasures. Adding them all together, it’s more than 20 Universe Origin Stones, right?”","“Blood Sword Master, you don’t know that,” Ruler Chenyun said with a smile.","“In other words, the rarer something is, the more valuable it is. If you take out one supreme true treasure or two supreme true treasures, the price will be different,” Ruler Chenyun said, “but if you take out dozens of them at once, and I’ve heard that there are a lot of true treasures in Star Palace, including many supreme true treasures, it must be related to you, Blood Sword Master.”"]},{"number":3938,"title":"Chapter 3938 - War Saber","paragraphs":["“Star Palace has a lot of true treasures, including supreme true treasures. They are also using these true treasures to recruit experts. If everything goes well, it won’t be long before all the true treasures and supreme true treasures in this Star Field are overrun. In the future, the value of the true treasures in this Star Field will naturally be devalued.”","“Blood Sword Master, you should understand the principle of adapting to local conditions.” Ruler Chenyun looked at Jian Wushuang calmly.","Jian Wushuang was silent.","He did feel that 20 Universe Origin Stones was a little low, but what Ruler Chenyun said made him unable to refute.","Adapting to local conditions, if there were not many supreme true treasures in this Star Field, let alone supreme-grade universe true treasures, then the value would naturally be different.","Even if the price was lowered, he could not be angry or force the other party.","After all, he was not facing a small force, but the Nine Emperor Pavilion!","Although the first Pavilion Master of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, Ruler Chenyun, had been polite to him since he entered, in fact, Ruler Chenyun did not fear him at all.","After all, he was standing behind the Great Nine Emperor Pavilion. He only knew how to do business fairly and strive for greater benefits for the Nine Emperor Pavilion. Jian Wushuang was helpless about this.","“I’ve exchanged almost all the resources and treasures that I can exchange for, but I still can’t get 80 Universe Origin Stones. Unless...” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and pondered for a moment. Then, he made a decision.","“Ruler Chenyun, I have another true treasure, see how much it’s worth.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand.","This time, he did not take out his interspatial ring, but took out a Cyan Saber.","As soon as the Cyan Saber appeared, it immediately emitted a terrifying murderous aura. Moreover, the Cyan Saber faintly carried an extraordinary power.","That extraordinary power was the universe principle.","“This is...a principle supreme treasure!”","Ruler Chenyun and the other two Pavilion Masters of the Nine Emperor Pavilion were shocked when they saw the Cyan Saber.","Indeed, this Cyan Saber was the principle supreme treasure that Jian Wushuang had obtained from Devil Scorpion Lord.","He used one of the five principle Supreme Treasures of Devil Scorpion Lord. He gave a purple stone stick to Demon Dragon Lord and refined two Heaven Suppression Tablets.","As for the last one, it was the Cyan Saber. Jian Wushuang kept it in his interspatial ring in case he needed it.","Now, in order to get what he needed from the Nine Emperor Pavilion, Jian Wushuang took out the Cyan Saber.","“Blood Sword Master, you have a principle Supreme Treasure?” Ruler Chenyun looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","“Cut the crap. Look at how many Universe Origin Stones this principle true treasure saber can be exchanged for,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","Ruler Chenyun immediately began to check the power of the Cyan Saber. A moment later, he gave Jian Wushuang an answer, “Blood Sword Master, the Cyan Saber you took out is a low-grade principle true treasure, and it’s only average among low-grade principle true treasures.”","“In the vast universe, a normal low-grade principle true treasure is worth between 100 to 200 Universe Origin Stones, and your principle true treasure blade is estimated to be between 120 Universe Origin Stones.”","“However, as I said before, the rarer the item, the more valuable it is. Your supreme-grade supreme true treasures, because of their quantity, are naturally worth less. However, principle true treasures, other than the Heaven Suppression Tablet that was first born, are almost non-existent in this Star Field. At the very least, since I became the first Pavilion Master of the Nine Emperor Pavilion in this Star Field, I have never obtained a principle true treasure. Thus, in terms of value, this principle true treasure blade is naturally worth more.”","“How about this? I’ll give you a price of 150 Universe Origin Stones for this low-grade principle true treasure saber. What do you think?”","After Ruler Chenyun finished speaking, he looked at Jian Wushuang with a smile.","“150 Universe Origin Stones?” Jian Wushuang looked up at Ruler Chenyun and nodded secretly.","On the way here, he had asked Demon Dragon Lord about the price of the principle true treasure saber. Demon Dragon Lord also said that the price of the principle true treasure saber should be between 120 and 130 Universe Origin Stones, the price of 150 Universe Origin Stones offered by the Ruler Chenyun was indeed relatively high.","As he said, the rarer the item, the more valuable it was.","In this way, the supreme-grade supreme treasures he had sold before were not at a loss.","“The 150 Universe Origin Stones of the principle-type Supreme Treasure Saber, together with the treasures and supreme treasures just now, add up to 190 Universe Origin Stones. After deducting the 80 Universe Origin Stones that bought Gold-Fire Magic Stone, Ice Essence Crystal, and Blood-Dragon Crystal, there are 110 Universe Origin Stones left. I also have a list with some treasures in it. See if you can collect them within 500 years.” Jian Wushuang took out another list.","There were more than 100 treasures on the list. They were meant for Jian Wushuang to cultivate the supreme eternal celestial body.","The supreme eternal celestial body came from the Lingyun Planet. It was an internal star secret skill of the Lingyun Planet. Its level and power were very high. Jian Wushuang had only cultivated the first level, however, his divine body had been greatly improved and was comparable to an elementary universe supreme treasure.","One must know that the supreme imperishable celestial body had 11 levels. He could cultivate the first three levels at the level of a Principles Master.","Jian Wushuang had only completed the first level.","The reason why he had not cultivated the second level all these years was that cultivating the supreme imperishable black iron required a lot of treasures. Moreover, those treasures were of a very high level. The first level required treasures, he could barely find the treasures in this Star Field, but he could hardly find the treasures needed to cultivate the second level.","Jian Wushuang had come to the Nine Emperor Pavilion because he had a large amount of resources in his hands. The treasures on the list he had just taken out were the treasures he needed to cultivate the second and third levels of the supreme-level eternal black body, there were more than a hundred of them, and almost none of them could be found in this Star Field.","Jian Wushuang was not sure if the Nine Emperor Pavilion could get them for him within 500 years.","“These treasures...”","Ruler Chenyun and the other two Pavilion Masters of the Nine Emperor Pavilion looked at the treasures on the list and gasped.","“Why? Is it difficult?” Jian Wushuang asked in a deep voice.","“Blood Sword Master, the treasures on your list are very high-level and rare. It’s very difficult to collect one or two of them in our Star Field alone. However, if we search for them in the nearby Star Field at any cost, we can probably find 99% of them. However, there is a golden origin divine fruit on the list!”Ruler Chenyun said, there was a hint of shock in his eyes.”"]},{"number":3939,"title":"Chapter 3939 - The Nine Emperor List","paragraphs":["“The golden origin fruit is a first-class treasure. It’s said that just by swallowing it, one’s godly body can be greatly strengthened. If it’s refined into a pill or used for other purposes, its effects will be even more shocking. In some big territories in the universe, many fourth-level and even fifth-level Rulers yearn for the golden origin fruit. However, the value of the golden origin fruit is extremely high. One golden origin fruit costs 50 Universe Origin Stones!”","“And that’s only the market price, because golden origin divine fruits are usually priceless. If a golden origin divine fruit sells well, it’s normal to sell it for 70 Universe Origin Stones.”","Ruler Chenyun exclaimed.","“The Nine Emperor Pavilion is a big business. Although the golden origin divine fruit is valuable, it’s nothing to the Nine Emperor Pavilion, right?” Jian Wushuang looked over.","“The golden origin divine fruit is nothing to the Nine Emperor Pavilion. However, this is the edge of the universe, and there are many Star Fields nearby. I dare say that there isn’t a single golden origin divine fruit. Blood Sword Master, if you want the golden origin divine fruit, you can only send it from some big territories in the deeper parts of the universe. Moreover, it’s within 500 years, so the price is much higher,” Ruler Chenyun said.","“Just tell me how many Universe Origin Stones you need,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“400 Universe Origin Stones!” Ruler Chenyun said directly.","“Eight times the price?” Jian Wushuang’s face changed. “It’s too expensive. A single golden origin divine fruit costs 400 Universe Origin Stones. I can’t afford it at all.”","400 Universe Origin Stones was indeed a bit too much. Even if he exchanged the principle Supreme Treasure Saber for Universe Origin Stones, plus the resources and supreme treasures he had sold before, minus the special crystals he used to buy them...he only had 110 Universe Origin Stones left, which was about 140, including the 30 Universe Origin Stones he had.","He was still far from 400 Universe Origin Stones.","“Blood Sword Master, do you really need the golden origin divine fruit?” Ruler Chenyun suddenly looked over.","“Of course.” Jian Wushuang nodded solemnly.","“If you really want it, there is another way,” Ruler Chenyun said.","“What is it?” Jian Wushuang looked at him.","“Blood Sword Master, you may not know this, but there is a special list called the Nine Emperor List in the Nine Emperor Pavilion!” Ruler Chenyun began to explain, “There are countless experts on the Nine Emperor List. Some of them are supreme masters, some are Rulers, and some are Principles Masters. But without exception, those who are qualified to put their names on this list must be real experts. Even Principles Masters must be heaven-defying Principles Masters with great potential.”","“Blood Sword Master, I heard that you went to the Ancient Night Demon Palace and fought with Demon Monarch Ancient Night.”","“That’s true.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Ruler Chenyun looked at Jian Wushuang with a smile. “Many people saw the fight with their own eyes. Some of them even recorded the process of the fight with a mirror token. The Nine Emperor Pavilion has a mirror token like this. After we carefully watched the fight between you and Demon Monarch Ancient Night, we found that although you are a Principles Master, your combat strength is no less than that of a master at the peak of the second level. Your comprehension of the origin of the universe of sword principle is extremely high. You even comprehended a trace of the Universe principle!”","“There is no doubt that you, Blood Sword Master, are the most heaven-defying super genius in the vast universe. It’s rare to see such a super genius in billions of Star Worlds. Such a super genius is definitely qualified to be listed on the Nine Emperor List.”","Jian Wushuang remained silent.","He was not surprised that the Nine Emperor Pavilion had captured the scene of his battle with Demon Monarch Ancient Night. After all, many people had seen it with their own eyes.","However, the Nine Emperor List that Ruler Chenyun had mentioned still puzzled him.","“Ruler Chenyun, what’s so special about the Nine Emperor List?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“The Nine Emperor List is actually a list of experts. Anyone who is listed on the Nine Emperor List is a friend of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. They will receive extraordinary treatment in the Nine Emperor Pavilion. For example, if you don’t have enough Universe Origin Stones to buy the golden origin divine fruit, it doesn’t matter. As long as you are on the Nine Emperor List, the Nine Emperor Pavilion can give you the golden origin divine fruit first. You only need to pay the Universe Origin Stones that you can afford. When you have enough Universe Origin Stones in the future, you can return them.","“In the future, the people on the Nine Emperor List will be able to get the most benefits from any branch of the Nine Emperor Pavilion in exchange for treasures and resources. There are even many key information in the universe. As long as it is useful to you, the Nine Emperor Pavilion will take the initiative to find you and tell you about it for free.”","“You should know that the universe is vast and boundless. When a cultivator travels in the universe, there is a lot of information that can not be obtained in time. However, the people on the Nine Emperor List do not have to worry about this at all. For example, Blood Sword Master, in the future, when you travel in the universe, if something happens to you in the universe, the Nine Emperor Pavilion will find you immediately and inform you,” Ruler Chenyun said with a smile.","“This...” Jian Wushuang’s eyes shone with a strange light.","From what Ruler Chenyun had said, the people on the Nine Emperor List could indeed benefit greatly from the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","The timely information was invaluable.","However, Jian Wushuang also understood that everything needed to be paid back. How could the Nine Emperor Pavilion not pay back for serving the people on the Nine Emperor List?","“If I leave my name on the Nine Emperor List, what do I need to do for the Nine Emperor Pavilion?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“One thing,” Ruler Chenyun said directly.","“What is it?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“I don’t know.” Ruler Chenyun shook his head, he smiled and said, “The Nine Emperor Pavilion will open a door for all the experts on the Nine Emperor List and try our best to get intelligence resources for them. The Nine Emperor Pavilion only needs people on the Nine Emperor List to do one thing for the Nine Emperor Pavilion. However, this is not a fixed matter. It’s when you might need to help that we will ask you.”","“Even if the Nine Emperor Pavilion invites you, you can still refuse it, but you can only refuse it twice at most. But on the third matter, you have to complete it. Otherwise, not only will you be removed from the Nine Emperor List, but you will also be viewed as an enemy by the Nine Emperor Pavilion in the future.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. He already understood the meaning of the Nine Emperor List.","The Nine Emperor Pavilion would try its best to serve the experts on the Nine Emperor List and satisfy some of their needs, as well as their sources of information.","The people on the Nine Emperor List would owe the Nine Emperor Pavilion a favor. In the future, the Nine Emperor Pavilion would ask them to do something, but it would depend on the actual situation and when they were needed, only then would the Nine Emperor Pavilion invite him.","But even if they invited him, the other party could still reject them twice."]},{"number":3940,"title":"Chapter 3940 - Merit","paragraphs":["“Ruler Chenyun, your Nine Emperor Pavilion is really good at doing business.” Jian Wushuang glanced at Ruler Chenyun.","Although the Nine Emperor Pavilion did give something, it was in exchange for the favor of many experts who were not ordinary people.","For example, although Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master and his strength was not in the Nine Emperor Pavilion’s eyes, the Nine Emperor Pavilion knew that Jian Wushuang had grasped a trace of the universe’s principles, he was a super genius that was rarely seen in billions of star worlds.","How great was the potential of such a super genius?","His favor was not valuable now, but when he grew up in the future, it would be of great use.","And the Nine Emperor Pavilion relied on the help they provided to these experts in the early stages, allowing them to owe them a favor and place their names on the Nine Emperor List. They only paid a price that was completely acceptable to the Nine Emperor Pavilion, for example, those so-called intelligence reports. The Nine Emperor Pavilion itself was an intelligence agency.","It could be said that the Nine Emperor Pavilion paid a very small price to place bets on the young experts. Many of these young experts did not truly grow up and died before they could return the favor, however, even if only one out of a hundred people had grown up, it would be a profit for the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","After a long period of accumulation, many of the names on the Nine Emperor List had already grown to become peak existences. However, they all owed the Nine Emperor Pavilion a favor. What kind of terrifying power was this?","Just the power contained in the Nine Emperor List alone was enough to cause the vast universe to disregard the powers that held the Nine Emperor Pavilion in awe.","It was no wonder that the Nine Emperor Pavilion was able to become a giant in the vast universe and spread its influence throughout every corner of the universe.","“Blood Sword Master, would you like to become a friend of the Nine Emperor Pavilion?” Ruler Chenyun looked at Jian Wushuang with a smile.","“Of course I would.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","There was nothing to refuse. He indeed needed the golden origin divine fruit, and the only way for him to obtain it was through the Nine Emperor List.","It was not a bad thing to put his name on the Nine Emperor List and become a friend of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. Although he would owe the Nine Emperor Pavilion a favor, it would be a long time before he became a top expert, only then would the Nine Emperor Pavilion ask for it from him.","Now, and for a long time to come, the Nine Emperor Pavilion would only use the resources they had used to serve him.","“I don’t even know if I have the chance to become a top expert in the future. If I have the chance, I can return the favor to the Nine Emperor Pavilion,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Blood Sword Master, here is a token. You just need to leave your name and a drop of essence blood in it,” Ruler Chenyun said with a smile.","“Essence Blood?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Of course.” Ruler Chenyun laughed, “The universe is vast, and there are countless cultivators. There are countless people with the same name. It’s not convincing at all, but blood essence is the only one.”","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and immediately left the words ‘Blood Sword’and a drop of blood essence in the token.","After leaving it, the token lit up with a special light. Seeing this, Ruler Chenyun smiled and put the token back. Then, he took out another token. “Blood Sword Master, from today onwards, you are a friend of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. There is a token here that can represent your identity.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and put the token into his interspatial ring.","“I have done as you said. As for the golden origin divine fruit...” Jian Wushuang did not finish his words.","“Blood Sword Master, don’t worry. Within 500 years, I will definitely send the golden origin divine fruit and all the treasures on this list to Star Palace. As for the Universe Origin Stones that you need...Blood Sword Master, you only need to give me the Universe Origin Stones that you have now. As for the rest, you can return them later,” Ruler Chenyun said with a smile.","“Sure.” Jian Wushuang also smiled. “There’s one more thing. Since I’m already recognized by the Nine Emperor List, according to what you said, the Nine Emperor Pavilion will inform me of any information that has a lot to do with me. Now, you should know what I’m most concerned about, right?”","“Of course, Blood Sword Master, what you should be most concerned about is Devil Cloud Star,” Ruler Chenyun said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Blood Sword Master, according to the information we received from the Nine Emperor Pavilion, Devil Cloud Star Master has come out of seclusion not long ago. He has led his army and rode universe boat toward this Star Field. They are traveling at a very fast speed. If nothing goes wrong, the Devil Cloud Star Army will arrive at this territory in about 950 years,” Ruler Chenyun said.","“950 years?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and said, “I need your Nine Emperor Pavilion to keep an eye on the Devil Cloud Star for me.”","“No problem. Blood Sword Master, you can leave a message token. I’ll send you a message as soon as I hear anything about the Devil Cloud Star.”","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang left a message token and then left with Demon Dragon Lord.","After Jian Wushuang and Demon Dragon Lord left.","Ruler Chenyun and the other two Pavilion Masters of the Nine Emperor Pavilion stood together and smiled.","“Chenyun, we’ve made a great contribution this time,” one of the Pavilion Masters said with a smile.","“Yes, we’ve made a great contribution,” Ruler Chenyun also smiled. “Blood Sword Master is extremely talented and has a heaven-defying opportunity. After his battle with Demon Monarch Ancient Night, I reported some information about him. The higher-ups also attach great importance to Blood Sword Master. After all, he has comprehended a trace of universe principle at the level of Principles Master, and it’s at the edge of the universe.”","“The higher-ups wanted us to think of a way to build a good relationship with him, and they wanted us to think of a way to put his name on the Nine Emperor List.”","“But the higher-ups didn’t tell us his name for long before I finished it. If the higher-ups knew about it, they would definitely give us a share of the credit. Let’s not talk about how much reward they would give us. As long as they transfer us out of here and into those larger territories, that would be enough.”","Although the Nine Emperor Pavilion was a super force in the universe, they also valued geniuses.","Especially a super genius like Jian Wushuang, who was rarely seen in billions of star worlds. Although the Nine Emperor Pavilion would not try to recruit him like other big forces, they definitely wanted to be on good terms with him, after all, as long as such a genius did not die, his future achievements would not be low.","Inviting such a super genius to become a member of the Nine Emperor List was indeed a great contribution.","And for the three Rulers of the Chenyun Ruler, who were at the edge of the universe and in the most barren Star Field, their chances of making contributions were too little.","Now, this contribution was already great enough for them."]},{"number":3941,"title":"Chapter 3941 - Concerns","paragraphs":["After coming out of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, Jian Wushuang and Demon Dragon Lord flew side by side in the universe void.","“Master, you could have asked the Nine Emperor Pavilion to hire a fourth-or fifth-level Ruler to help you at the cost of a principle true treasure. After all, most fourth-level Rulers, including many fifth-level Rulers, don’t have any principle true treasures. I’m afraid that many fourth-or fifth-level Rulers would be willing to come at the cost of a principle true treasure,” Demon Dragon Lord said.","“You may be right.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","“We can invite experts if we ask the Nine Emperor Pavilion to help us. However, our territory is at the edge of the universe. It’s difficult to find a fourth-level Ruler in the nearby Star Fields, let alone a fifth-level Ruler. Therefore, even if the Nine Emperor Pavilion helps us, the experts we invite must be far away from our Star Field. Even if we use the universe passage to teleport, we may not be able to reach this Star Field in a short time.”","“Moreover, even if there are experts who can reach this territory within 1,000 years, I still have many concerns,” Jian Wushuang said seriously.","“Concerns?” Demon Dragon Lord was puzzled.","“Demon Dragon, you should know that I haven’t cultivated for long, only 200,000 years. However, in such a short period of time, I have grown step by step. Although I am only a Principles Master, my battle strength is comparable to that of a third-level Ruler. Moreover, I have comprehended a trace of universe principle and can even take out a principle supreme treasure. Tell me, is this something that an ordinary person can do?” Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Dragon Lord.","“It’s true that ordinary people can’t do it. Master’s talent is incredible...” Demon Dragon Lord didn’t finish his words.","“Incredible talent can only be one of the factors,” Jian Wushuang interrupted. “No matter how great your talent is, if you didn’t get such a great opportunity in this Star Field, you wouldn’t be able to reach this level in such a short time. At least, others must think so.”","Demon Dragon Lord was stunned, then he nodded slowly.","Indeed, even he thought that Jian Wushuang was too heaven-defying and too abnormal.","Moreover, such heaven-defying talent could not be achieved purely by relying on his own talent. He must have gotten some great opportunities and fortunes.","“You think so too. Then the problem is, if I really use a principle treasure to invite a fourth or even fifth level Ruler, this Ruler is completely out of my control. Although I invited him, who can guarantee his character?","“Maybe he will think that I have a big secret and directly attack me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes, it’s very possible.” Demon Dragon Lord nodded heavily.","In fact, Demon Dragon Lord himself did not need to be mentioned. If he was not under Jian Wushuang’s control and it was his first time in this Star Field and he knew that Jian Wushuang was an extremely monstrous genius, he would definitely have his eyes on Jian Wushuang, even if he was invited by Jian Wushuang, he would definitely have his eyes on Jian Wushuang.","It was not unreasonable for Jian Wushuang to have such concerns.","“Just the Devil Cloud Star Master alone has put the Divine Beginning Realm in great danger. It’s still on the brink of death. Who knows what will happen if another stronger person comes?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold.","He did not dare to gamble or place his hopes on an unfamiliar expert he did not know.","Instead of relying on an external expert, he might as well rely on himself.","“Demon Dragon, follow me to Devil Smoke Valley first,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Demon Dragon Lord nodded.","The two immediately sped up and soon arrived at Devil Smoke Valley, one of the three Universe Battlefields.","“Demon Dragon, wait for me outside Devil Smoke Valley,” Jian Wushuang ordered.","“Yes,” Demon Dragon Lord answered.","Jian Wushuang entered Devil Smoke Valley alone and soon arrived at the deepest part of Devil Smoke Valley.","“Life and Death Realm?”","Jian Wushuang passed the Life and Death Realm, but then he shook his head. “When I left the special space, although I came out of the Life and Death Realm, the entrance to the special space might not be in the Life and Death Realm. Moreover, there is a great danger in the Life and Death Realm. I’d better not take the risk.”","Jian Wushuang did not choose to enter the Temporal where the experts of the Lingyun branch were sleeping through the Life and Death Realm. Instead, he followed the path he had taken to enter the Temporal and went to the unknown area in the Magic Smoke Valley, then, he entered the special Temporal.","The gray void was vast and boundless. There was no light or sky or earth.","There was only a void.","This special Temporal was completely different from the outside world.","Fortunately, it was not Jian Wushuang’s first time in this special Temporal. He was not too surprised by the environment of this Temporal. He directly flew toward the dark void in front of him.","Jian Wushuang flew through the dark void for a long time before he saw the huge floating platform in front of him.","Jian Wushuang was very familiar with that platform.","When he first came to this special Temporal, he was trapped by the 18-terminal formation on the platform for 97,000 years.","In the end, he finally passed the 18-terminal formation with great difficulty and passed the test set up by the Lingyun Star Master. He became an inner star disciple of the Lingyun Star lineage and cultivated the supreme eternal secret skill.","At that time, Jian Wushuang had met Wind Devil, a top expert from the Lingyun Star lineage, in this special space.","Wind Devil was an extremely powerful supreme expert. However, he had been seriously injured in the battle and had been sleeping in this special space.","When Jian Wushuang had left this special space, Wind Devil had said that if he encountered any trouble in the future, he could come to this special space to seek help.","Jian Wushuang came here to ask for help.","“Eh?”","As soon as Jian Wushuang approached the huge platform, he was immediately attracted by the scene on the platform.","On the platform, a young man wearing armor and with an evil face was waving a golden long spear while fighting with six human-shaped statues.","The aura of this young man was obviously that of a Principles Master, and he had reached the sixth realm of the Void Realm. His spear skills were not bad, but it was a pity that his spear skills were not a match for the six human-shaped statues, in the battle, he was completely overwhelmed by the six human-shaped statues.","Soon, the young man was defeated and retreated to the center of the high platform.","At this time, he noticed Jian Wushuang, who had appeared in the void near the high platform."]},{"number":3942,"title":"Chapter 3942 - Emperor Golden Snake","paragraphs":["“Emperor Golden Snake.”","Jian Wushuang appeared on the high platform in a flash.","“You are, Blood Sword Master?” Emperor Golden Snake, an evil-looking man in armor, was surprised at first, but then he was ecstatic. “I made the right bet!”","“You made the right bet?” Jian Wushuang was confused.","“Haha, Blood Sword Master, you don’t know this, but I, golden snake, have a deep-seated blood feud. My wife and children died at the hands of the same person. That person is King Dongqing.” Golden Snake Emperor laughed.","“King Dongqing?” Jian Wushuang immediately thought of king Dongqing, who was very famous among the masters of the principles of this Star Field.","King Dongqing was an expert who had reached the pinnacle of the six realms. In terms of strength, he was much stronger than Emperor Golden Snake.","“Even in my dreams, I want to kill King Dongqing. Unfortunately, I’m not strong enough to kill him. Moreover, I know that my talent is limited. Even if I were given another million or ten million years, I’m afraid that I wouldn’t be able to do anything to King Dongqing. Therefore, I can only explore the three battlefields and take risks. I hope to get a great opportunity to kill King Dongqing.”","“But such a great opportunity is hard to come by. I didn’t gain anything for a long time until I found out that you survived the Life and Death Realm.”","“Before you entered the Life and Death Realm, your strength was only average, or even worse than mine. But after you came out of the Life and Death Realm, your strength soared and you became the number one Principles Master. Later on, you even fought against a Ruler. Obviously, you reached an incredible opportunity in the Life and Death Realm and your strength soared.” Emperor Golden Snake stared at Jian Wushuang.","“So, you came to the Life and Death Realm?”Jian Wushuang also looked at Emperor Golden Snake.","“Yes, the Life and Death Realm has always been a forbidden place. No one has ever come out alive. But you came out. Since you came out alive and got a great opportunity, why can’t I?","“So I chose to gamble.","“I broke into the Life and Death Realm and encountered several trials and tribulations in the Life and Death Realm. Every time, I narrowly escaped death. However, I was lucky and went through several trials and tribulations along the way. Only now did I come to this special Temporal and come to this high platform. And now, I’ve met you! “Haha.","“Haha, to be able to meet you in this special Temporal, it means that you really did get a great opportunity in this Temporal. I bet correctly!”","Emperor Golden Snake laughed with a hint of madness.","Jian Wushuang looked at Emperor Golden Snake with a hint of pity in his eyes.","Emperor Golden Snake knew that he had come out of the Life and Death Realm alive and that he had obtained a great opportunity and his strength had soared, therefore, he took the initiative to enter the Life and Death Realm to seek the same great opportunity.","It had to be said that the Emperor Golden Snake was very crazy. Perhaps it was because he was burdened with a deep blood feud, but he had never been able to find any hope of revenge. It was not easy for him to finally have a chance in front of him. Even if the chance was slim...he still wanted to grab it tightly.","Unfortunately, the Emperor Golden Snake was destined to be disappointed.","He had obtained an opportunity in this special Temporal, but as for the increase in his strength, it was purely due to his own ability during the process of obtaining the opportunity.","Emperor Golden Snake’s strength had reached a bottleneck, and he might not be able to break through it by himself for a long time. Now that he was trapped in the 18-ultimate formation, he would probably be like the previous star-thunder Ruler, he would be trapped until he died, unable to leave.","“Emperor Golden Snake.”","Jian Wushuang spoke, “This Temporal is indeed the place where my strength soared. There is indeed a great opportunity here, but the condition for obtaining this great opportunity is that you can break through the 18-ultimate formation in front of you. You have 10 million years. If you can break through the 18-ultimate formation in 10 million years, you will have a chance to seek revenge from King Dongqing. But if you can’t, you will have to die here.”","“10 million years?” Emperor Golden Snake narrowed his eyes and nodded solemnly. “In order to avenge my wife and children, I will definitely make it. Blood Sword Master, thank you for telling me this!”","“I wish you good luck.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep look at Emperor Golden Snake and immediately left.","He had long passed the test of the 18-ultimate formation. Now that he wanted to leave, the 18 human-shaped statues on the high platform naturally did not stop him.","After passing through the high platform, Jian Wushuang continued to fly into the dark void ahead.","“The 18-skill formation varies from person to person. Back then, I was only an Immortal Saint, so the conditions for me to pass through the 18-skill formation were not that harsh. However, it took me nearly 100,000 years to barely pass through it. Emperor Golden Snake, on the other hand, is a Principles Master. If he wants to pass through the 18-skill formation, the conditions are much harsher.”","“Unless he has a better understanding of sword principle than most third-level masters like I do, and has even created a unique sword skill and two sword formations, it’s almost impossible for him to break through the 18-ultimate formation.” Jian Wushuang shook his head and sighed.","Of course, Emperor Golden Snake had another way to break through the 18-ultimate formation, which was to comprehend a trace of the universe principle. But was it possible?","Even Jian Wushuang had only comprehended a trace of the universe principle with the help of the life core fragment of the Immortal Ghost Demon when he had gone to the Dark Magic Region.","Emperor Golden Snake had never been exposed to the universe principle before, so how could he have the chance to comprehend it when he was trapped in the 18-ultimate formation?","It was because of this that Jian Wushuang wished Emperor Golden Snake good luck. In his opinion, Emperor Golden Snake would not be able to walk out of this special Temporal alive.","“Emperor Golden Snake may have lost his mind due to the death of his wife and children. In order to seek revenge, he could do anything. He knew that it would be difficult for him to survive in the Life and Death Realm, but he still chose to gamble...” Jian Wushuang sighed.","“If in a thousand years, the Divine Beginning Realm is defeated in the battle with the Devil Cloud Star, the Divine Beginning Realm will completely collapse. Many of my family and friends, as well as countless experts in the Divine Beginning Realm, will not be able to escape the evil hands of the Devil Cloud Star. At that time, even if I manage to escape, I will be like Emperor Golden Snake. I will go crazy and seek revenge against the Devil Cloud Star Master.”","Seeing Emperor Golden Snake, Jian Wushuang felt pity for him. At the same time, he thought of the situation he and the Divine Beginning Realm were facing, and his heart felt heavy.","At this moment, a golden light appeared in front of Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3943,"title":"Chapter 3943 - The Bitterness of the Wind Devil","paragraphs":["The golden light shone from the deepest part of this special Temporal. As the golden light got closer and closer, the light became more and more dazzling. When it approached Jian Wushuang, the golden light was like a huge golden sun, it completely illuminated the entire Temporal.","The golden light dissipated and revealed the appearance of a tall cultivator.","He was hundreds of feet tall, wearing golden armor, boots, and a golden puppet fighter on his head. He also held a golden spear in his hand and looked like a golden war god.","“Jian Wushuang, greetings, senior Wind Devil.” Jian Wushuang bowed.","Seeing Wind Devil again, Jian Wushuang was still filled with shock.","After all, he was a living supreme expert, different from Lord Wu of the Red Cloud World.","Lord Wu’s divine body was close to collapse, and he had been relying on the Red Cloud World to maintain it. Moreover, what Jian Wushuang saw in the Red Cloud World was not Lord Wu’s original body, but just an incarnation, Jian Wushuang could not truly experience the power of a supreme expert.","But this Wind Devil in front of him was his original body.","Although this Wind Devil was still not in his peak state, and perhaps had not recovered 20-30% of his strength, standing in front of Jian Wushuang now, Jian Wushuang felt as if he was facing the entire universe, he was so tall and lofty, and he was like a speck of dust in the universe, very small.","Jian Wushuang felt that if Wind Devil wanted to, he could kill him countless times with just a glance.","“Little guy, how long have you been away from this space and time? Why are you back so soon?” Wind Devil, who was in golden armor and looked like a god of war, fixed his long and narrow eyes on Jian Wushuang. “Oh, I’ve broken through to Principles Master, and...I can sense the existence of a trace of universe principle in you. What’s going on?”","“Senior Wind Devil, I’ve already comprehended a trace of universe principle,” Jian Wushuang said and waved his hand. Immediately, the trace of universe principle power condensed in his hand.","“As expected, hahaha!” Wind Devil’s eyes lit up, and then he burst into laughter. His laughter was grand and ancient, so grand that it caused the Temporal to tremble crazily. “A Principles Master can comprehend a trace of the universe’s principles. You’ve done well for my Lingyun Planet. I was right about you.”","“Senior Wind Devil, to tell you the truth, I came here to ask for your help,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Ask for help?” Wind Devil still had a smile on his face. “I did say that if you encounter any problems, you can come here to ask for my help. Tell me, what is it?”","“It’s like this. My hometown, the Divine Beginning Realm, is quite special...” Jian Wushuang briefly explained the cause and effect of the incident. “Within a thousand years, if I’m not mistaken, the Devil Cloud Star Army will arrive in this Star Field in more than 900 years. At that time, I’m not absolutely sure that I can win the war.”","“Is that so?” Wind Devil understood. “In other words, in more than 900 years, you will have to face a Ruler who has reached the fourth level, and this Ruler has taken over a Star Field.”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“That’s a bit troublesome.” Wind Devil frowned. “My brothers were seriously injured in that battle, so they can only stay in this special space and sleep with the help of special means. Even if I can wake up occasionally, I’ll have to sleep again in a while. Our original bodies won’t be able to help.”","“Previously, I told you to come find us if you ran into any trouble because I could attach a strand of my consciousness to your body. You are a perfect life-form cultivator with abundant divine power, and after becoming a Principles Master, your divine power is comparable to that of an ordinary Ruler. If you really encounter a powerful enemy, my consciousness will directly take over your divine body.”","“Although I only have the divine power of an ordinary Ruler, I can easily kill an ordinary first-level or second-level Ruler. I can even kill a third-level Ruler who is slightly weaker. This should be enough in your Star Field.”","“But I didn’t expect your opponent to reach the fourth level.”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed slightly.","Wind Devil had been sleeping in this special space ever since the battle. Over the years, some cultivators had accidentally entered this special space, Wind Devil knew from those cultivators that the strongest in this space was a superior Ruler of the first level. Occasionally, a primary Ruler of the second level would appear.","With such strength, even if Wind Devil’s true body could not attack, he could easily rely on his consciousness to attach himself to a Ruler of principles. That was why Wind Devil had confidently told him that if he encountered any trouble...he could come and find them.","But now, it was clear that the opponent he encountered had exceeded Wind Devil’s expectations.","“I can not kill a fourth-level Ruler with just my consciousness attached to you. I can only give you some special treasures that will allow you to kill that Devil Cloud Star Master,” Wind Devil said in a low voice.","“I have many of these treasures. I can even kill fifth-level Rulers, ultimate Rulers, and even weaker paragons, much less fourth-level Rulers. The trouble is that most of these treasures require a certain level of cultivation to master or guide them out.”","“For example, I have a Blood Demon Pearl which contains a terrifying power of Blood Demon. Once activated, it can easily kill an ultimate Ruler. However, to activate the power of Blood Demon in the Blood Demon Pearl, it requires the strength of a Ruler above level four. As for other treasures, most of them are similar to this Blood Demon Pearl.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was a little dumbfounded.","He understood what Wind Devil meant. He had treasures that could kill a fourth-level Ruler, but the key was that these treasures were of a very high level, and they were not meant to deal with a fourth-level Ruler, they were meant to deal with an ultimate Ruler and an Absolute Ruler. It was a waste of his talent to deal with a fourth-level Ruler.","More importantly, he would not be able to use those treasures even if they were given to him. He would not be able to draw out the power within those treasures.","“There’s nothing I can do about it. I’m an Absolute Ruler, after all, and I’m fairly strong amongst Absolute Rulers. Although I’ve collected quite a few treasures, they are definitely of a higher level. The lower-level ones are only meant to be used against fourth-level and fifth-level Rulers. I’ve long since given them to my disciples. It Won’t be easy for you to ask me to find a treasure that can be used against fourth-level Rulers, and one that you, the Principles Master, can guide.”","Wind Devil’s face was also a little bitter."]},{"number":3944,"title":"Chapter 3944 - Bamboo Leaf, Blood Elixir!","paragraphs":["“Little guy, don’t worry.”","Wind Devil suddenly laughed again, “Although I don’t have any treasures that you can use, my brothers might have them. So, wait here for a moment. I’ll go and ask my brothers.”","“Thank you, senior,” Jian Wushuang said.","Wind Devil immediately turned around and walked toward the deepest part of the Dark Void. Jian Wushuang stood there and waited quietly.","Soon, Wind Devil, who was wearing golden armor, appeared in front of Jian Wushuang again.","“Little guy, you’re lucky. My brothers have two treasures that can help you.” Wind Devil smiled and flipped his hand, a cyan bamboo leaf and a scarlet elixir with a unique aura appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Bamboo Leaf and blood elixir?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","He first looked at the cyan bamboo leaf.","The cyan bamboo leaf looked ordinary to the naked eye and was no different from an ordinary bamboo leaf. However, as Jian Wushuang’s consciousness covered it, he found that there was an extremely terrifying power hidden in the bamboo leaf.","This hidden power made Jian Wushuang’s heart skip a beat.","“This bamboo leaf was originally in the hands of a fifth-level master. If I’m not mistaken, it was personally refined by the fifth-level master. It was probably prepared for his disciple. Unfortunately, in one encounter, the fifth-level master accidentally offended one of my brothers and was killed by my brother, so the bamboo leaf fell into the hands of my brother.”","Mad Demon smiled. “This bamboo leaf was personally refined by a fifth-level Ruler. Although its method is ordinary, it contains part of the power of a fifth-level Ruler. With your current strength, you can barely channel this power. Under normal circumstances, killing an ordinary fourth-level Ruler should not be a problem.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes immediately lit up.","A treasure refined by a fifth-level Ruler contained part of the power of the fifth-level Ruler?","As expected, the Devil Cloud Star Master was only a fourth-level Ruler, and he had just made a breakthrough. If he guided the power in the bamboo leaf, he might be able to kill the Devil Cloud Star Master.","“What about the blood pill?” Jian Wushuang looked at the scarlet pill again.","The color of the pill was like blood, and the aura it emitted was very unique.","Jian Wushuang could not recognize the pill at all. Not only him, but he also could not recognize the Devil Flame, which was an ultimate level master when he was alive.","“This elixir is very special.” Wind Devil’s expression became serious. “It can help you reach a new level of strength in a short time, but you will also have to pay a very high price. Unless you have no choice, I don’t want you to take this elixir.”","Jian Wushuang could not help glancing at the scarlet elixir and asked, “If I take this elixir, will I die?”","“I might survive, but I might die directly,” Wind Devil said directly.","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","He did not expect that the second treasure Wind Devil gave him would be such a costly elixir.","Once it was swallowed, it would have the power of life.","“I gave you this elixir as a precaution, but I don’t want you to take it.” Wind Devil stared at Jian Wushuang.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded heavily and put the bamboo leaves and blood into his interspatial ring with a wave of his hand.","“Well, I’ve given you what I can. You can leave now.” Wind Devil waved his hand.","“I’ll take my leave.” Jian Wushuang bowed slightly to Wind Devil, then turned around and left.","Seeing Jian Wushuang leave, Wind Devil curled his lips and followed him back to the depths of this special Temporal.","There, several consciousnesses had woken up for a short time.","“Fourth brother, how is it?” One of the consciousnesses asked.","“I’ve given the two treasures to this little guy.” Wind Devil smiled.","“What did you tell him?” Another consciousnesses asked.","“I’m telling the truth about the bamboo leaf, but the elixir...I said that the elixir could make him burst out with higher battle strength in a short period of time, but the price he had to pay afterward would be very high, and it might even lead to his death,” Wind Devil said.","“You actually said that?”","“Fourth brother, this little fellow has been deceived miserably by you.”","“If this little fellow is really forced into a desperate situation one day and then swallowed that medicinal pill, and finds out that it’s not what you said, what will happen to him?”","These few awakened consciousnesses began to chat.","“If it really comes to that time, he will definitely have the determination to die. With this sort of determination, the benefits he will receive from swallowing that medicinal pill will be even greater,” Wind Devil said directly.","“Mm, what you said makes sense.”","The few ancient existences that were sleeping in this special space and time nodded their heads.","These few ancient existences were all top experts under the command of the Lingyun planet’s lineage. Each of them had the battle prowess of a paragon, and they were considered experts among paragons.","Back then, they had followed under the command of the Lingyun planet Lord and were his lackeys. In that battle, they had also displayed a very strong battle prowess. Unfortunately, the Lingyun planet lineage was nearly wiped out in the end, and countless experts were killed, even the master of Lingyun has left and gone to God knows where.","As for the few of them, they all stayed in this special Temporal and fell into a deep sleep. After a long period of deep sleep, they were almost no longer involved in the affairs of the world. The reason why these consciousness woke up one after another today, and it’s purely because of Jian Wushuang.","Long years of sleep, not easy to a little guy into their eyes, the most important thing is that this little guy is extremely heaven-defying, they will naturally pay more attention to one or two.","The two treasures that Wind Devil gave Jian Wushuang just now.","The bamboo leaf was indeed a treasure refined by a fifth-level master, which contained part of its offensive power.","However, the real effect of the blood pill was not the same as what Wind Devil said. As for the price that he had to bear after swallowing it, it was actually made up by Wind Devil.","What a joke. There were not many experts left in the Lingyun Star lineage. Jian Wushuang had only become an inner star disciple of the Lingyun Star lineage in recent years. Not only did he pass the test of the 18-ultimate formation personally set by the Lingyun Star Master, but he had also become an inner star disciple of the Lingyun Star lineage, now, he had grasped a trace of the universe principle at the level of a Principles Master.","The experts of the Lingyun planet must have done their best to protect such a dazzling genius. How could they give Jian Wushuang a pill that would endanger his life if he swallowed it as a trump card?","The reason why the Wind Devil Society said that was because they hoped that Jian Wushuang could rely on his own ability to survive this crisis and not use the pill."]},{"number":3945,"title":"Chapter 3945 - Immortal Dipper Battle","paragraphs":["Coming out of the special space, Jian Wushuang felt much more relaxed.","He had come to seek help from the experts of the Lingyun Star lineage. Although he had not obtained any treasures or powers that could absolutely kill the Star Master, he had still gained a lot.","The two treasures that Wind Devil had given him, the bamboo leaf and the blood pill, were both huge trump cards that could be used to deal with the Star Master.","With these two trump cards in hand, Jian Wushuang was naturally more confident in dealing with the Star Master.","Jian Wushuang did not stay in Devil Smoke Valley for long. He quickly left Devil Smoke Valley and met up with Demon Dragon Lord. Then, he rushed back to Star Palace as fast as he could.","After returning to Star Palace, Jian Wushuang immediately went to meet with Daoist Xuan God and the others, as well as Ruler Spark.","“Xuan God, have my subordinates been honest during my time of power?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Not bad.” Daoist Xuan God smiled. “I’ve already set aside one of the three Earth Stars under my Star Palace for them to live in. Over the years, they’ve been quite well-behaved except for some small requests in terms of women, food, and wine.”","“That’s good.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. “My men have been trapped in a prison for a long time. I’m afraid they’ve been sullen for a long time. As long as they don’t ask too much, just agree to some small requests.”","“I know.” Daoist Xuan God nodded with a smile.","“What about the experts? When the news of my Star Palace spread out, there should be many experts coming to the Star Palace, right?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","“Of course, the lowest is a top-tier true treasure, followed by a top-tier true treasure or even a supreme true treasure as a reward. How can the Principles Masters in this Star Field, including the Rulers, resist the temptation?","“It has only been a few decades, but many experts have come in person or sent messages to our Star Palace, agreeing to fight for our Star Palace.”","“This is only the beginning. I estimate that more and more experts will be invited later. In addition, the Divine Beginning Realm has relied on the Triple Dao world to produce far fewer experts. When the Devil Cloud Star Army arrives, our side will be able to gather an army of hundreds of thousands of Principles Masters!” Daoist Xuan God said.","“Hundreds of thousands of Principles Masters?” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. This number was within his expectations.","“Stone Fire, how are your preparations for the Battle Formation?” Jian Wushuang looked at Stone Fire, who was beside him.","“Master, the battle formation used by the Principles Masters is easy to solve. I have prepared a total of four battle formations. These four battle formations are used by different numbers of people, and their power is different. The simplest battle formation only needs 1,000 Principles Masters to work together. After the formation is completed, the battle strength of this 1,000-man battle formation is definitely above that of a first-level Ruler. Even an ordinary second-level Ruler would have to retreat in the face of such a 1,000-man battle formation.”","“As for the second battle formation of a higher level, it requires 10,000 Principles Masters to work together, so its power is naturally stronger...as for the strongest fourth formation, it can be used by 100,000 Principles Masters.”","The Ruler Spark slowly explained to Jian Wushuang, and Jian Wushuang was very satisfied.","It had to be said that the Ruler Spark had prepared a very full battle, and its power was also very impressive.","“Other than the Principles Master army, I have also designed some battle formations for Rulers. One of them is called the immortal squall battle formation. This battle formation is extremely powerful, and even in the deepest parts of the universe, many of the God kingdoms are quite famous. And this immortal squall battle formation has a total of five layers. Each layer is more and more formidable, and each layer is more and more terrifying!”","“When I was in the Army of the divine kingdom, I had some experience with this battle formation. However, I could only comprehend the first battle formation, which required 36 experts at the Ruler level,” said the Ruler Spark.","“The Battle Formation?” Jian Wushuang was secretly surprised.","One battle formation was divided into five different levels, and the requirements were obviously different. This battle formation was very famous in the depths of the vast universe, its power could be imagined.","“Thirty-six Rulers...my servants are all very powerful. Each of them has reached the third level, and they are the real experts among the third level Rulers. There are more than 36 of them. If I choose 36 of them to form this Immortal Dipper Battle Formation, how powerful will it be?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Master, this is what I wanted to tell you as well. If master can select thirty-six experts from the slaves to cultivate this Immortal Dipper Battle Formation, then even if it’s just the first layer of the formation, these slaves don’t need to master it to an extremely high level. As long as they master the basics, with the strength of these slaves, they will be able to easily unleash the combat prowess of a fourth-level Ruler.”","“If they have a better grasp of this battle formation, their strength will be stronger by relying on the battle formation,” said the Ruler Spark.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but become excited.","The Devil Cloud Star Master had probably reached the fourth level. None of his slaves were a match for the Devil Cloud Star Master in a one-on-one fight. Even if they joined hands, they might not be able to fight against the Devil Cloud Star Master, however, if they could use the battle formation to perfectly combine the power of these slaves, they might have a chance to fight against him.","Moreover, the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation was so powerful.","“Stone Fire, I want you to immediately choose 36 of my slaves to form the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Master, it’s not difficult to form the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation. The key is to master the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation at least slightly. Only then can the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation have the confidence to fight against Devil Cloud Star Master. However, the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation is extremely complicated. It’s not easy to master even the simplest first level battle formation.”","“There are strong and weak slaves under master’s command, and there are also strong and weak slaves. The point is that they don’t have much time left. They only have 900 years left. I’m worried that they won’t be able to master the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation in such a short time, let alone master it to a certain level.”","“Well...” Jian Wushuang frowned, but suddenly he stared at him and said, “Oh, the Temporal Tower! The Temporal Tower in the Temporal Temple!”","At this moment, Jian Wushuang thought of the Temporal Tower that he had seen in the Temporal Temple, and many thoughts immediately appeared in his mind."]},{"number":3946,"title":"Chapter 3946 - Temporal Tower","paragraphs":["The Temporal Tower could change the flow of time. Even for the simplest level, it had only been a year in the outside world. It was very magical.","When Jian Wushuang first saw the Temporal Tower, he was very shocked by it. At that time, the Temporal Temple Master said that he had personally refined the Temporal Tower.","However, when he came to the Universe Battlefield and gradually understood the secrets of this Star Field and the vast universe, Jian Wushuang knew that the temple master was lying to him.","Yes, the Temporal Tower had indeed been refined by the temple master, but the temple master had just repaired it under the premise that the Temporal Tower already existed.","This Temporal Tower was a special treasure that the Temporal Temple Master had obtained from the Universe Battlefield, and it was still in a damaged stage.","The Temporal Temple Master had an extremely brilliant way of using Temporal. Under the premise that the Temporal Tower already existed, he had managed to restore a portion of the Temporal Tower’s power, that was how the three-story Temporal Tower that stood in the Temporal Temple was created.","“The Temporal Tower can change the flow of time. Although one can hardly sense the principles of heaven and earth in the Temporal Tower, the universe principles, and even the Sword Dao can not be cultivated and comprehended, it is possible to study something in the Temporal Tower that has nothing to do with the outside world and only requires a large amount of time.”","“For example, formations and some secret skills...”","“In the outside world, it takes a long time to study a powerful formation, but if you study it in the Temporal Tower, the time will be greatly reduced.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes slowly lit up.","“Xuan God, please invite Temporal here,” Jian Wushuang said.","...","A few days later, in the secret realm where the Temporal Temple was located in the Divine Beginning Realm.","An exquisite black tower was floating there quietly. The black tower was not tall, but it was divided into three levels.","“Temporal Tower.”","Looking at the black tower in front of him, Jian Wushuang’s eyes revealed a trace of surprise.","When he was the Immortal Saint, he knew that the Temporal Tower was very magical, but he had not really cultivated in it.","After all, although time flowed slowly in the Temporal Tower, it was isolated from heaven and earth. It could only be used to study some special methods, but it could not be used to cultivate and comprehend the principles of Heaven and earth.","“The Temporal Tower is indeed extraordinary. When I first got it, I thought it was an extremely special supreme treasure, or even a principle supreme treasure. However, I found out later that it was not. It was just a special treasure in Temporal. Most importantly, it was too damaged. Its internal structure and countless formations were damaged by 99%. After I got it, it took me a long time to restore it to its current state based on my understanding of Temporal,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Temporal, there shouldn’t be any restrictions for us to enter the Temporal Tower to study arrays or battle formations, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“There are some restrictions,” Temporal Temple Master said solemnly, “first of all, to keep the flow of time in the Temporal Tower running, we need to pay a huge price. If it’s only for the Temporal temple, the price is a bit heavy, but for the Star Palace and the entire Divine Beginning Realm, it’s nothing.","“In addition, the formation of the third level of the Temporal Tower hasn’t been completely completed yet, so we can’t let more than one person enter at a time. As for the second and third levels, there are no restrictions.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and said, “Then please do your best to maintain the operation of the Temporal Tower for these years.”","“No problem.” Temporal Temple Master nodded.","“Demon Dragon.” Jian Wushuang looked behind him at the 36 people, including Demon Dragon Lord.","He had selected these 36 people from his 41 slaves, including Demon Dragon Lord and Devil Scorpion Lord, the two most powerful experts.","“From today on, you 36 people will enter the second floor of the Temporal Tower and concentrate on studying the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation given to you by Stone Fire Star Master. I’ll give you 800 years at most. In the outside world, 800 years is equivalent to 80,000 years in the space of the second floor of the Temporal Tower. You should be able to master the battle formation. After 800 years, you can practice it,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” The Demon Dragon Lord and the other 36 slaves accepted the order at the same time.","“Stone Fire, go in with them and help them control the battle formation,” Jian Wushuang instructed.","“Yes, Master.” The Ruler Star Fire nodded.","Immediately, the Ruler Star Fire, Demon Dragon Lord, and the other 36 slaves entered the second level of the Temporal Tower.","After they entered the Temporal Tower, Jian Wushuang also walked toward the tower.","He was going to the third level!","The third level of the Temporal Tower was a simple open space. Jian Wushuang stood on the open space, but he could clearly feel that the time flow in this open space was completely different from the outside world.","“The time flow in the second level of the Temporal Tower is 100 times slower than the outside world, and the time flow in the third level is 1,000 times slower!” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","1,000 times the flow of time.","In other words, he had been cultivating here for 1,000 years, and only one year had passed in the outside world.","Of course, the flaw was that this space was completely isolated from the outside world, so it was impossible to comprehend the principles, the universe principles, and even the sword principle.","However, it was possible to study the absolute arts and perfect the sword formation.","“I created three sword skills, including the wave light sword skill and the Earth Protection Sword Formation, which have been improved into the wave light sword formation and the Earth Protection Sword Formation. These two sword formations have been greatly improved under the guidance of the Ruler Spark, but they haven’t reached the limit!” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","His two sword formations did have a lot of room for improvement.","Not only the two sword formations, but also the most powerful attack swordsmanship, the obscure swordsmanship. In Jian Wushuang’s opinion, it was also possible to evolve into the obscure swordsmanship.","Once the obscure swordsmanship was transformed into a sword formation, his attack power would greatly increase. By then, his three sword formations, one to kill, one to trap, and one to defend, would have no flaws, then his strength would naturally be different.","Whether it was evolving or continuing to perfect his sword formation, he needed a lot of time. Staying in the eternal tower, the flow of time was 1,000 times slower, this gave him enough time to study his three sword formations.","“Let’s begin.”","In the space on the third floor of the Temporal Tower, Jian Wushuang had already begun to immerse himself in the evolution and perfection of his sword formation."]},{"number":3947,"title":"Chapter 3947 - 400,000 Years","paragraphs":["Time passed day by day, year by year.","In the blink of an eye, 400 years had passed.","It had been 400 years in the outside world, but Jian Wushuang had studied it for 400,000 years in the space on the third floor of the Temporal Tower, where the flow of time slowed down!","For Jian Wushuang, who had cultivated for less than 200,000 years, the 400,000 years was extremely long and boring. However, he had endured it. His goal was to further improve his sword formation, thus, he could have a little more confidence when he faced the Devil Cloud Star Master.","During these 400,000 years, the wave light sword formation and the Earth Protection Sword Formation that Jian Wushuang had evolved earlier had become more powerful, especially the wave light sword formation, if it was combined with the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation performed by the three Heaven Suppression Tablets, its power would be even stronger.","As for the other attack sword formation, the obscure sword formation, Jian Wushuang had already completed it. Now that it had been perfected step by step, its power had also greatly increased.","After reaching this step, logically speaking, Jian Wushuang did not have much room for improvement, but he was still meditating in the Temporal Tower.","Until the 410th year, which meant the 410,000 years in the Temporal Tower.","“My young friend,” the Temple Master’s voice suddenly sounded in the third level of the Temporal Tower.","“Temporal, what’s the matter?” Jian Wushuang raised his head slightly.","“The Xuan God sent a message, saying that the first Pavilion Master of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, Ruler Chenyun, is now in Star Palace,” the Temple Master said.","“Ruler Chenyun?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. “Ruler Chenyun said that he would send me all the treasures I bought in the Nine Emperor Pavilion within 500 years. It has been 410 years. It seems that all the treasures have arrived.”","Since Ruler Chenyun had arrived, Jian Wushuang did not intend to continue studying in the tower. Instead, he immediately left the tower and headed for Star Palace.","In the Magnificent Palace of Star Palace.","Daoist Xuan God and the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master were sitting on their thrones, while Ruler Chenyun was sitting opposite them.","As for the other two masters of Star Palace, the Temporal Temple Master and the Heaven Ancestor, they were all in the Divine Beginning Realm and had no consciousness incarnations.","“Xuan God, you and I have met several times before. Back then, you even came to my Nine Emperor Pavilion to exchange treasures. I remember the first time I saw you, you seemed to have been forced into a sorry state by your enemies. But now, you seem to be very glorious. I heard that your combat power is now comparable to that of a top-tier Ruler, and you even have several supreme true treasures in your hands. Tsk, tsk, I’m afraid that not many people in this Star Field are your match now.”","Ruler Chenyun laughed, but his words were filled with a hint of flattery.","“Ruler Chenyun, you must be joking. In terms of power, you are far more powerful than me. As for the current glory of our Star Palace, that is only because a powerful genius has appeared in our Star Palace. I, as the palace lord, am only relying on the good fortune of my young friend, the Heavenly Marquis.” Daoist Xuan God laughed as well, he felt extremely happy in his heart.","Being praised depended on the person.","If the person standing in front of Daoist Xuan God was a Principles Master, or a Ruler of ordinary power, then Daoist Xuan God would not care about such praise.","However, the person who was praising him in front of him was Ruler Chenyun.","As the first pavilion lord of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, he was definitely one of the most powerful figures in this Star Field. Naturally, Daoist Xuan God felt happy at the praise of such an expert.","This meant that the current Star Palace was indeed powerful enough. It was so powerful that even Ruler Chenyun had to be polite to it.","“Oh, right. Xuan God, did you know that not long ago, that person from the Ancient Night Demon Palace left this Star Field?” Ruler Chenyun suddenly said.","“Demon Monarch Ancient Night? He left?” Daoist Xuan God was startled.","Although the Star Palace’s power had been increasing at a terrifying rate over the past few years, almost every day, the Principles Masters and even Rulers would come knocking on their doors and agree to fight for the Star Palace. In just a few centuries...now, the overall power of Star Palace had reached an incredible level.","To put it bluntly, over 50% of the power of this Star Field was already on Star Palace’s side.","There was no other way. The Temptation of top-tier true treasures, pinnacle true treasures, and even supreme true treasures was irresistible in this Star Field.","However, although Star Palace was extremely powerful and gradually suppressed Demon Monarch Ancient Night’s Ancient Night Demon Palace, Demon Monarch Ancient Night was still a top-tier power in this Star Field. Under the premise that Star Palace didn’t make a move...no one in this Star Field could rival it.","But now, the Demon Monarch had left this Star Field.","“The departure of the Demon Monarch might have something to do with the experts brought back by the Heaven Marquis,” Daoist Xuan God could not help thinking.","He was right. Under normal circumstances, the Demon Monarch had just come out of the Eternal Dark Prison and had not enjoyed many happy days, so he was not in a hurry to leave.","However, after Jian Wushuang entered the Eternal Dark Prison and brought back a large number of experts, Demon Monarch Ancient Night could no longer sit still.","After all, any one of the experts Jian Wushuang brought back could easily kill him. Any one of them was an existence that he looked up to.","Although he knew that these experts were now Jian Wushuang’s servants and listened to his orders, he could not guarantee that Jian Wushuang would loosen the restrictions on these experts. If any of them disliked him, they might kill him directly.","After all, he was just a master at the peak of the second level, but he had created a great force in this Star Field and became an Ruler. He was very happy, but these stronger third level experts...even Demon Dragon Lord and Devil Scorpion Lord, who were once eternal prison monarch, could only become servants and follow Jian Wushuang’s orders.","Such a completely different treatment would inevitably make these people feel unbalanced and jealous.","Therefore, it was wise for Demon Monarch Ancient Night to choose to leave this Star Field.","“Well? The Heaven Marquis has returned to Star Palace.” Daoist Xuan God suddenly raised his head.","“Is he back?” Ruler Chenyun’s eyes lit up, and he immediately stood up.","Soon, Jian Wushuang appeared in the hall.","“Ruler Chenyun.”","Jian Wushuang greeted Ruler Chenyun with a smile. As for Daoist Xuan God and the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, he just nodded.","“Blood Sword Master, I heard that you’ve been cultivating in the Divine Beginning Realm for years. I hope I didn’t disturb you,” Ruler Chenyun said.","“My strength has reached a bottleneck. Even though I’ve been cultivating all these years, my progress has been very slow. There’s no need to disturb me. I hope you’ve come to bring me good news, Ruler Chenyun.” Jian Wushuang smiled at Ruler Chenyun."]},{"number":3948,"title":"Chapter 3948 - The Third Level of the Supreme Immortal Celestial Body","paragraphs":["“Blood Sword Master, I’ve brought everything you asked for. As promised, I’ll deliver it to you within 500 years.”","Ruler Chenyun did not disappoint Jian Wushuang. He took out an interspatial ring and handed it to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang took it and scanned it with his consciousness. His eyes immediately lit up.","Inside the interspatial ring were the Gold-Fire Magic Stone, Ice Essence Crystal, Blood-Dragon Crystal, and other special gems he had bought in the Nine Emperor Pavilion, he also needed many special treasures to cultivate the second and third levels of the supreme immortal celestial body, including the extremely special gold-origin divine fruit.","“The Nine Emperor Pavilion hasn’t disappointed me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Of course,” Ruler Chenyun said with a smile, “by the way, the Nine Emperor Pavilion has been paying attention to the movement of the Devil Cloud Star for years. Not long ago, we received intelligence that the Devil Cloud Star Army stopped for a short period of time when they passed by a Star Field. Of course, they didn’t stay for a long time, less than a year. As for the purpose of their stay, we don’t know yet. The Nine Emperor Pavilion will help you figure it out as soon as possible.”","“Thank you.” Jian Wushuang thanked him.","“You’re welcome. Blood Sword Master, you’re a friend of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. It’s nothing.” Ruler Chenyun said humbly, “If there’s nothing else, I’ll take my leave.”","“Chenyun, I’ll see you off.” Daoist Xuan God immediately stood up to see him off.","Jian Wushuang stood where he was and looked at the interspatial ring in his hand, his eyes shining brightly.","Not long after, Jian Wushuang returned to the Temporal Tower.","Time flowed slowly in the Temporal Tower. Not only could it be used to study formations, but it could also be used to cultivate secret skills.","“Devil Flame, 30 Gold-Fire Magic Stones, 50 Ice Essence Crystals, and 300 Blood-Dragon Crystals. I’ll send them into the blood-red gourd now. You can devour and absorb them yourself,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Sure.” Devil Flame nodded with a hint of excitement in his voice, “Don’t worry, master. With these crystals, my gold-devouring divine body will recover to 20% of its peak soon. By then, my soul will be able to control this divine body and at least recover to the peak of the third-level. However, with my skills, even if I’m only at the peak of the third-level, I can still exert the battle strength of a fourth-level Ruler.”","“As for the Devil Cloud Star Master, he must have just reached the fourth level. I’m 90% sure that I can defeat him. As for killing him, I’m not less than 50% sure.”","“Well, then you work hard.” Jian Wushuang was quite satisfied with Devil Flame’s answer.","90% defeat and nearly 50% kill was already very high. It was worth it for him to pay a great price to get these special crystals for Devil Flame.","After Jian Wushuang put the Gold-Fire Magic Stone, Ice Essence Crystal, and Blood-Dragon Crystal into the blood-red gourd, he sat down cross-legged.","With a wave of his sleeve, one special treasure after another appeared in front of him.","There were dozens of different kinds of treasures, all of which were used to assist in cultivating the second level of the supreme-level undying celestial body.","“Let’s begin.”","Jian Wushuang’s face was solemn.","The supreme immortal celestial body was an internal star secret skill of the Lingyun Star Branch. It was a high-level secret skill that could even be cultivated by an expert of the supreme realm. It would be of great use to an expert of the supreme realm if he succeeded in cultivating it.","Jian Wushuang could cultivate the first three levels at the same time as he was now a Principles Master. It had taken him a lot of time just to cultivate the first level. Naturally, it would take him longer to cultivate the second and third levels.","Fortunately, he was in the Temporal Tower, so the flow of time was 1,000 times slower than in the outside world. Otherwise, even if he got these treasures, Jian Wushuang was not confident that he could complete the second and third levels of the supreme immortal body before the arrival of the Devil Cloud Star Army, he had completed the second and third levels of the supreme immortal body.","Time passed. It had been 3,000 years in the Temporal Tower and only three years in the outside world. Jian Wushuang had already completed the second level of the supreme immortal body, buzz, buzz, buzz.","Jian Wushuang was still sitting cross-legged on the open space on the third level of the Temporal Tower. His divine body was trembling slightly, but Jian Wushuang could clearly sense that his divine body was emitting an extremely powerful aura, an extremely powerful aura.","Yes, it was powerful, powerful!","The first level of the supreme eternal celestial body allowed Jian Wushuang’s divine body to directly rival that of an elementary universe supreme treasure.","Now that he had cultivated the second level, Jian Wushuang carefully examined and tested it. He estimated that his divine body could already match that of an ordinary top-tier supreme treasure.","“A divine body that matches that of a top-tier universe supreme treasure.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","Under normal circumstances, the first level of the supreme imperishable body was the entry level, and it could only match that of an elementary universe supreme treasure. If he succeeded in cultivating the second level, his divine body could generally reach that of an advanced universe supreme treasure, and there were a few who had a solid foundation, those with strong physiques could reach the level of a top-tier supreme treasure.","Jian Wushuang was obviously a person with a strong foundation and an extremely strong physique. Once he completed the second level, his divine body would directly be comparable to a top-tier supreme treasure.","“This is only the second level. Next, it will be the third level.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes shone with a fierce light. He waved his sleeve again, and dozens of different treasures appeared in front of him, the most eye-catching one was the golden divine fruit.","The golden origin divine fruit was extremely valuable.","Just by consuming it, one’s divine body could be greatly strengthened. It was also a rare treasure in the vast universe. Many masters in the fourth or even the fifth level longed for such a treasure, it was used to strengthen their divine bodies.","If the golden origin divine fruit was refined into elixirs with some special techniques or cultivated with secret skills, the effect would be better.","Now, the golden origin divine fruit was the most important part of the many treasures Jian Wushuang needed to cultivate the third level of the supreme immortal body.","In the Temporal Tower, Jian Wushuang cultivated the third level of the supreme immortal body again.","It took him more time to cultivate the third level than the second level. It took him 8,000 years, but it only took him eight years in the outside world.","“I’ve succeeded in cultivating the third level of the supreme immortal body.”","Jian Wushuang clenched his hands. He could feel that his divine body had undergone a huge transformation. His eyes were filled with unconcealable joy and excitement.","He could feel that after cultivating the third level of the supreme immortal body, his divine body had become dozens of times stronger than before.","If his previous divine body was only barely comparable to a top-tier universe true treasure, now his divine body was comparable to a supreme true treasure!","Yes, it was a supreme true treasure.","The third level of the supreme undying mysterious body was the limit that Principles Masters could cultivate, and his divine body was comparable to a supreme universe true treasure!","This was the limit that Principles Masters could reach in their divine bodies in the vast universe, and this divine body was a legend among Principles Masters. But now, Jian Wushuang had achieved it."]},{"number":3949,"title":"Chapter 3949 - Dealing With Devil Cloud Star Master","paragraphs":["“A divine body comparable to a supreme true treasure. It’s much stronger than before,” Jian Wushuang murmured.","Before, he had only cultivated the first stage, and his divine body was comparable to a primary true treasure. Now, it was a supreme true treasure, separated by several levels. How could it be the same?","Now, he had such a terrifying and tyrannical divine body. If he encountered a first-level Ruler, Jian Wushuang would not even need to move, even if a superior Ruler personally attacked him. He would allow his opponent to attack him, but if he was struck by Jian Wushuang, he would not even need to move, at most, it would only tickle him.","After all, in this Star Field, the highest-level divine weapon used by the Rulers was the supreme universe true treasure.","The strongest universe supreme treasure was so tough that a full-strength attack from a first-level Ruler would not be able to shake it at all.","Even his slaves, who were all third-level Rulers and were extremely powerful among the third-level masters, were not able to hurt Jian Wushuang even if he did not attack or block them, these slaves would not cause him much harm. If he wore the supreme-grade supreme treasure armor, ice soul armor, these slaves would find it even harder to hurt him.","Moreover, his divine body was comparable to a supreme supreme treasure, which not only improved his divine body’s strength and protective ability, but the power contained in such a powerful divine body was also ridiculously strong.","After all, Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master. In terms of divine power, he had always been at an absolute disadvantage compared to other Rulers.","Even though he was a perfect life form, his divine power was only comparable to that of a primary Ruler of the first level. Even though he had used many secret skills and the power of his will, which was given by the universe principles, his divine power was still very weak and could only reach the second level. With the help of the Wu weeping divine sword, he could only reach the peak of the second level.","But this was his limit, unless he used the dragon-exterminating secret skill to burn his divine power.","But now, Jian Wushuang’s divine body, which was at the most powerful supreme treasure level, was no weaker than the Ruler, who was at the peak of the first level.","With the use of many secret skills, his divine power could reach the peak of the second level. With the help of the Wuqi Divine Sword, his power should be comparable to that of a third-level Ruler.","This was undoubtedly a huge improvement in his overall strength.","“The three sword formations I created are very exquisite. After years of studying in the eternal tower, I have improved them to the extreme. The sword formations are extremely powerful. Now that my divine power has increased, the three sword formations will be even more terrifying.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","His own strength was also very important in the upcoming battle with the Devil Cloud Star.","After knowing that the Devil Cloud Star Army would arrive in this Star Field within a thousand years, Jian Wushuang had already begun to calculate the combat strength and trump cards of his camp.","On the surface, the Star Palace had gathered a large number of Principles Masters in this Star Field over the years. In addition, the Divine Beginning Realm had given birth to a large number of experts with the help of the Triple Dao world. When the battle with the Devil Cloud Star began...there would definitely be an army of hundreds of thousands of Principles Masters, and these Principles Masters all had top-tier true treasures or pinnacle true treasures.","In addition, these Principles Masters had also formed battle formations, so the combat power they could deliver would be even stronger.","As for Rulers, there were also quite a number of them in his camp, and all of them had supreme true treasures. It was even possible that a Ruler might have a few supreme true treasures.","All of these were power on the surface.","These powers were not a secret in this Star Field at the moment. Most people knew that when the Devil Cloud Star Army arrived, they could ask anyone, they probably knew that the Divine Beginning Realm would have an army of so many Principles Masters and many Rulers.","However, this kind of power on the surface could only deal with the army under Devil Cloud Star.","Devil Cloud Star was, after all, a second-grade astral world, and it had an extremely high level of combat power. Just that Devil Cloud Star Master alone should be a fourth-grade Ruler, and he also had many experts under his command, most likely, there were many third-grade and second-grade Rulers.","The Divine Beginning Realm camp could not resist or even resist the top battle strength of Devil Cloud Star.","However, the Divine Beginning Realm did not show it on the surface, and there were also many hidden battle strength.","Just the 41 slaves that Jian Wushuang brought back from the Eternal Dark Prison alone were powerful enough to deal with the Devil Cloud Star Army and other experts apart from Devil Cloud Star Master.","The existence of these slaves was a secret in the Star Palace, and not many people knew about it. Even if Devil Cloud Star could get the news through some means, he could not know the level of the experts that Jian Wushuang brought back.","When the real war broke out, the experts of the two camps would fight each other. If the experts of the Divine Beginning Realm were to come out, they would be able to crush the Devil Cloud Star Army.","However, there was only one person in the camp of Devil Cloud Star that Jian Wushuang feared, and that was Devil Cloud Star Master.","After all, he was a fourth-level master. Even if he had just made a breakthrough, he would not be easy to deal with.","Jian Wushuang was also prepared for Devil Cloud Star Master’s methods. He now had three great battle forces and two trump cards, which were used to deal with Devil Cloud Star Master.","The first battle power was himself!","He was undoubtedly the strongest in the Divine Beginning Realm.","When he was in the Eternal Dark Prison, he had obtained three Heaven Suppression Tablets, used the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, and used his own sword formation. He already had the strength to kill the Demon Dragon Lord.","Now, he had spent more than 400,000 years in the eternal tower to study and develop the three sword formations. They were extremely powerful, and he had cultivated the supreme eternal celestial body to the third level, which was comparable to the divine body of the most powerful supreme treasure, his strength had soared again.","Now, if he used the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation with all his strength, he was confident that he could fight Devil Cloud Star Master head-on. Even if he could not defeat him, he would be able to trap him with the sword formation.","Even if Devil Cloud Star Master’s strength was beyond his expectations, Jian Wushuang could just use the dragon-exterminating secret skill and burn his divine power to increase his strength again. By then, he could also fight Devil Cloud Star Master head-on.","If Devil Cloud Star Master’s strength was lower than he expected, he could kill Devil Cloud Star Master on the spot by using the dragon-exterminating secret skill and controlling the sword formation with all his strength."]},{"number":3950,"title":"Chapter 3950 - Spending Time With His Family","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang alone had the ability to fight against the Devil Cloud Star Master Star.","The second most powerful battle force was the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation formed by his 36 slaves.","The Immortal Dipper Battle Formation was the strongest battle formation that the Master of stone Spark could produce. It only required 36 masters to work together, and his 36 slaves all had the battle strength of third-level masters, when the 36 slaves worked together in the battle formation, their battle strength could reach the fourth level in a short time, and they were even very powerful among the fourth level masters.","Over the years, the 36 slaves had stayed in the Temporal Tower to meditate on the battle formation, and they had basically mastered it.","It meant that the battle formation would be able to operate when the battle on the Devil Cloud Star broke out.","As for the third battle strength, it was Devil Flame...","At the peak of Devil Flame, he was a master at the ultimate level. Although he only had a soul body now, his gold-swallowing divine body had begun to be rebuilt. He relied on the Gold-Fire Magic Stone, Ice Essence Crystal, and Blood-Dragon Crystal that Jian Wushuang had bought from the Nine Emperor Pavilion, Devil Flame’s gold-swallowing divine body could recover to 20%. By then, Devil Flame’s soul body would dominate the gold-swallowing divine body, which was also a fourth-level master’s battle strength.","According to what Devil Flame said, he was 90% sure that he could defeat the Devil Cloud Star Master, and he was almost 50% sure that he could even kill him.","Jian Wushuang, Devil Flame, and 36 slaves formed an Immortal Dipper Battle Formation. These were the three strongest battle forces that Jian Wushuang could use, which were enough to compete with the Devil Cloud Star Master.","In addition, Jian Wushuang had two trump cards.","These two trump cards were naturally the bamboo leaf and blood pill that Wind Devil gave him.","These two trump cards could be said to be two killing moves that could be used at critical moments to kill the Devil Cloud Star Master.","Of course, bamboo leaf was fine, but the blood pill...Wind Devil said that he would pay a huge price if he swallowed the blood pill and might even die. Jian Wushuang did not doubt it. Therefore, the blood pill...it was definitely his last choice. He would not use it unless it was absolutely necessary, but he would fight with Devil Cloud Star Master.","Three battle strength and two killing moves. This was everything that Jian Wushuang had prepared.","He believed that the methods he had prepared should be enough to deal with Devil Cloud Star Master.","If even these methods could not deal with Devil Cloud Star Master, then he had no other way.","“Phew!”","Jian Wushuang exhaled and slowly stood up. He looked around at the void.","“In the past years in the eternal tower, I have improved everything that I can. Even if I continue to stay here to cultivate, I’m afraid it won’t help me much. Instead, it’s a waste of time. It’s time to leave.”","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and then left the tower.","After leaving the tower, Jian Wushuang did not go to the Star Palace. Instead, he chose to return to the Eternal Saint World.","In the Eternal Saint World, Jian Wushuang’s family lived here.","“Father, mother.”","Jian Wushuang stood in front of his parents, who had been here for two lifetimes.","“Shuang ‘er, I heard that the Divine Beginning Realm will suffer a catastrophe soon. It’s hard to predict whether they will live or die. Now, the top experts of the Divine Beginning Realm have gathered together and are trying to increase their strength in preparation for the upcoming war. You are now one of the leaders of the Divine Beginning Realm. Why didn’t you prepare for the war? Why did you come back?” Jian Nantian frowned.","“I’ve prepared everything I can for this battle, and my strength has reached a bottleneck. I can’t improve in a short period of time. Therefore, I’m afraid that I won’t be able to improve even a little bit in the next few hundred years even if I concentrate on cultivating. I might as well spend some time with you.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Filial piety was the first priority!","Jian Wushuang had been working hard and making preparations for the upcoming disaster in the Divine Beginning Realm, but he had not been able to spend time with his family. Even his wife had been separated for so long, he had only spent a few thousand years alone with his wife.","But now, the real disaster was coming. What Jian Wushuang wanted to do most was to spend time with his family.","“Child, now that the Divine Beginning Realm is in danger, the first thing you should think about is how to deal with this disaster.” Luo Xinqin walked up and muttered a few words, but the smile on her face showed that she was still very happy.","“In the next few hundred years, our family will take a good look around the Divine Beginning Realm. Shuang ‘er, what do you think?” Jian Wushuang looked at the peerless beauty beside him with a gentle gaze.","“I’ll listen to you, husband.” Leng Rushuang smiled.","For Leng Rushuang, the safety of the Divine Beginning Realm was not important. What she really cared about was that she could stay by Jian Wushuang’s side. That was enough.","“Let’s go. Call Uncle Xiao and the others, as well as Big Brother Wang Yuan, Second Brother, and Fourth Brother. We’ll set off together.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Okay.”","Everyone responded.","Soon, more than 100 people were sent out.","Among them were Jian Wushuang’s family and friends, his disciples, and their children.","More than 100 people began to travel in a warship that could fly in the Divine Beginning Realm.","They traveled from the Eternal Saint World to the third heaven and then to the endless territory.","There were no obstacles along the way, and no one or anything disturbed them. Jian Wushuang gave up cultivation and spent hundreds of years with his wife, he spent time with his family and friends.","They traveled around the world and saw all kinds of things. If they were bored, they would stop in a territory and live there for ten or dozens of years. They lived a very happy and warm life.","Unfortunately, such a happy and warm life did not last long, only 530 years.","One day, 530 years later, the Chenyun Ruler sent a message to Jian Wushuang, “Blood Sword Master, the universe boat that Devil Cloud Star Master is on has arrived near this Star Field. It will be here in a month at most.”","“Is it finally here?”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and looked at his family and friends.","“Sorry, I have to leave now.”","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, the warship, which had been laughing and laughing, suddenly turned cold.","They all knew that the happy and warm days of hundreds of years had come to an end.","As for whether they would still have such days, it would depend on the outcome of the next big battle."]},{"number":3951,"title":"Chapter 3951 - Arrival","paragraphs":["The vast and boundless universe void space was pitch black, and no light could be seen.","An ancient and huge universe boat was shuttling through the dark void space. This universe boat was incredibly fast. It was obviously huge and heavy, but it could fly through the dark void space of the universe, it was like a fish shuttling through water.","Within the universe boat, there were many powerful and majestic energies. Whether it was the cabin or the deck, there were many great beings standing there. Most of them were Principles Masters, but there were also many Rulers.","And at the core of this universe boat, there was clearly a golden and resplendent palace.","In the center of the palace, two figures were sitting on towering thrones, with fine wine and delicacies placed in front of them.","“In a few days, I will be able to resist that Star Field. Tsk tsk, speaking of which, I have taken over a Star Field in this Star Field. However, my true body spends most of its time in the Devil Cloud Star. As for this Star Field, I seldom come here. I remember that the last time I came to this Star Field was a very, very long time ago.” A loose green robe was placed on the middle-aged man’s back, a middle-aged man with short hair held a bowl of wine and sighed. He had a unique smile on his face.","At first glance, this green-robed middle-aged man gave people a gentle and refined feeling. However, his eyes were strangely golden, which made him even more bewitching.","And his identity was the Star Devil Cloud Star Master.","He was also the source of this catastrophe in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Countless years ago, if Devil Cloud Star Master had not come to this star area and accidentally found the embryonic stage of the Divine Beginning Realm and seized it, many things would not have happened, the Divine Beginning Realm would also be very stable.","Unfortunately, because of this Devil Cloud Star Master, everything changed.","Right now, the entire Divine Beginning Realm was in a crisis because of this Devil Cloud Star Master. Once they failed to survive, countless creatures in the Divine Beginning Realm would lose their lives.","“Devil Cloud, we agreed that when we get to that heavenly realm, you have to let me take a good look at the heavenly realm that you’ve taken over. It would be best if you let me enter that heavenly realm to take a stroll.” Said a man in purple armor who was sitting opposite Devil Cloud Star Master. “Let’s go,” Said a man in purple battle armor.","This man in purple battle armor had a burly figure. At first glance, he looked like a huge mountain. He was sitting opposite the Devil Cloud Star Master, and his words and actions did not carry any hint of reverence. Moreover, the Devil Cloud Star Master had clearly interacted with him on an equal level.","“Shi Hua, don’t worry. You can forget about just taking a look at my astral world. Even if you want to stay there for a long time, you can do so as long as you want,” said the Devil Cloud Star Master with a smile.","“I don’t plan on staying in your astral world for long. I’m just curious and want to take a look. Although it’s only a Grade 3 astral world, it’s after all a self-nurtured place in the vast universe. To be able to possess such an astral world, tsk tsk, it’s really enviable.” The purple armored man praised, but at the same time, he did not hide his envy.","“Haha, I was just lucky. Back then, when I was forced into a corner in Devil Cloud Star, I came to other territories to try my luck. In the end, I really hit the jackpot.” Devil Cloud Star Master laughed.","“Of course I was lucky. However, you didn’t die when you took over a star world. Instead, you succeeded in taking over. Your ability isn’t weak either.” The purple-armored man praised.","He was very clear that even if it was an embryonic astral world, it would still be extremely difficult for him to take over it.","The reason why the Devil Cloud Star Master was able to succeed was because of his own experiences. He was forced into a corner by others. It was not easy for him to find a great opportunity. Naturally, he gambled everything. He did not leave any way out for himself before he succeeded in taking over it.","Devil Cloud Star Master and the purple-armored man were casually chatting and laughing.","Suddenly...","“Huh?” Devil Cloud Star Master’s expression changed. He had already sensed the two people waiting in the void space in front of the universe boat.","“Let the two people in front come up.”","Devil Cloud Star Master sent a message to the great beings on the universe boat.","Soon, the universe boat stopped in the dark void space in front of them. The two human figures who had been waiting there for a long time arrived on the universe boat, and they soon appeared in front of Devil Cloud Star Master.","“Greetings, Devil Cloud Star Master.”","The two people who arrived bowed slightly to Devil Cloud Star Master with a hint of humility.","“Star Luo, Sorcerer God, you two are hiding here?” Devil Cloud Star Master looked at the two people in front of him with interest.","They were Master Star Luo and Sorcerer God.","Master Star Luo was Leng Ruxue’s master. Although she was not an expert under Devil Cloud Star Master, she had worked with him before. Previously, Jian Wushuang had tried to help his wife, Leng Rushuang, recover her divine body, he had also tried to find Master Star Luo, but unfortunately, he had not been able to find her.","As for the Sorcerer God, he had once controlled the Sorcerer God sect in the Divine Beginning Realm and stood on the same side as the three Saint Realms. He had also attacked Jian Wushuang.","Later, after Jian Wushuang had destroyed the three Saint Realms, he had also tried to find and kill the Sorcerer God. However, the Sorcerer God seemed to have vanished without a trace.","Now, the two people Jian Wushuang was looking for had appeared here.","“It can’t be helped. The Star Palace has complete control over the Star Field. Their forces are everywhere in the Star Field, including the three Universe Battlefields. The Star Palace and Jian Wushuang have been looking for us. If we were still in the Star Field, they would have found us long ago. We can only stay at the edge of the Star Field and wait for your arrival, Devil Cloud Star Master,” the Sorcerer God said with a dry smile.","“Sorcerer God, do you remember our agreement?” Devil Cloud Star Master stared at the Sorcerer God.","“Of course I do. But since the three saint realms were uprooted by Jian Wushuang, all my plans have stopped. I can’t do anything about it,” the Sorcerer God said.","“That’s not a problem. After I flatten this Star Field and kill Jian Wushuang and his people, you can do it again,” said Devil Cloud Star Master.","“That’s true. However, the power of Jian Wushuang and the Divine Beginning Realm is no longer the same as before. I’m afraid it won’t be easy to completely uproot the resistance of the Divine Beginning Realm,” said the Sorcerer God.","“Oh?” The Star Master raised his eyebrows. “Then tell me, how strong has the resistance of the Divine Beginning Realm become over the years?”","“Devil Cloud Star Master, as far as I know, because of that Blood Sword Master, the Divine Beginning Realm has obtained a large number of resources and treasures. At the same time, they’ve also gathered a large number of experts. Especially in recent years, they’ve gathered nearly 70% of the upper echelons of this Star Field...” Sorcerer God began to narrate."]},{"number":3952,"title":"Chapter 3952 - Life and Death","paragraphs":["After listening to the Sorcerer God’s explanation, the look on the Star Master’s face did not change at all.","“Almost 70% of the upper-level battle strength in the entire Star Field?” The Star Master sneered, “They are just ants at the level of Principles Masters. No matter how many there are, they are still ants. They are not worth mentioning in front of my army.”","“In addition, I heard that Jian Wushuang brought back a group of experts from somewhere not long ago. There are about 30 to 40 of them. They seem to be quite strong,” the Sorcerer God added.","Jian Wushuang brought back a group of experts from the Eternal Dark Prison. This matter was still considered a secret in this Star Field. Even in the Star Palace, not many people knew about it, however, the Sorcerer God, who had been hiding at the edge of this Star Field, actually knew about it?","“A group of experts? How strong can they be?” Devil Cloud Star Master looked down.","“They should all be Rulers. As for their specific battle strength, I’m not sure,” Sorcerer God said.","“Haha, Rulers? The Rulers of this Star Field were only at the first level. At most, there would be one or two second level Rulers. In front of me, how could they be considered experts? Ridiculous.” Devil Cloud Star Master laughed, he still did not care.","Hearing this, Sorcerer God gave Devil Cloud Star Master a meaningful glance, but did not say anything else.","“Alright, if there’s nothing else, you can leave first.” Devil Cloud Star Master waved his hand.","“Yes.” Sorcerer God nodded, bowed, and left.","After Sorcerer God Left, Devil Cloud Star Master’s expression was still calm, but the purple-armored man sitting next to him frowned.","“Devil Cloud, who was that person just now?” The purple-armored man asked.","“It was a sovereign who had submitted to me not long ago. When he found out that I had taken over an astral world, he took the initiative to look for me and work for me. Although I had taken over that astral world previously, I did not know how to make the most of it. It was the Sorcerer God who told me how to make use of it. He was the one who came up with the plan,” the Star Lord said.","“Is that so?” The violet-armored man nodded slightly, however, he continued, “I just met this person. Although he appears to be at the level of an ordinary Ruler, he still gives me a feeling that I am unable to completely see through him. Devil Cloud, when you are facing him, have you ever felt this way?”","“Now that you mention it, there is indeed a bit of truth to it. Perhaps there are some secrets hidden within him, but no matter what, he is just an ordinary first level Ruler. You and I can casually kill him with a single slap. We don’t have to worry about him stirring up any trouble.” Devil Cloud Star Master said.","“That’s true.” The violet-armored man nodded slightly.","Next, Devil Cloud Star Master turned to look at Ruler Star Luo.","“Star Luo, take out my treasure.” Devil Cloud Star Master said.","Ruler Star Luo immediately waved his hand. Instantly, a pitch-black spear that emanated an endless aura of destruction appeared in the void space of the palace.","This black spear did not just exude an incredibly dense aura of destruction. More importantly, it was emanating a unique power that even the purple-armored man was surprised by.","“Devil Cloud, what’s going on with this spear? It’s clearly not a principle true treasure, but why does it give me such a unique feeling?” The purple-armored man asked.","“Haha, of course it’s special. This spear comes from the Great Universe Godly Palace, and it has a trace of special power. Because of this trace of special power, this spear is much more valuable than ordinary supreme true treasures. It’s not much weaker than a principle true treasure,” said Devil Cloud Star Master.","“A treasure from the Great Universe Godly Palace? No wonder.” The purple-armored man looked surprised, and then he felt relieved.","“Star Luo, thank you for taking back the Spear for me. I owe you one. After this incident, I will completely wipe out this Star Field. I will give you the thing you need,” said Devil Cloud Star Master.","“Then I’ll wait for your good news, Devil Cloud Star Master.” After saying that, Master Star Luo turned around and left.","In the temple, Devil Cloud Star Master and the purple-armored man continued to talk. The speed of universe boat did not slow down at all. Soon, it had passed through the vast dark void and officially entered the Star Field.","...","In the Divine Beginning Realm, the eternal sacred world.","After receiving the message from the Chenyun Ruler, Jian Wushuang returned with his family and friends.","“Father, mother, and everyone, are you sure you don’t want to leave the Divine Beginning Realm?” Jian Wushuang looked solemnly at his two-time parents and his family and friends.","With the war coming, he planned to take his family and friends out of the Divine Beginning Realm first.","With his current strength and means, he could find a place for them to live in this Star Field, such as in other star worlds, so that he could at least ensure the safety of his family members.","Unfortunately, when he brought this up, none of his family members were willing to leave.","They did not have any intention of leaving. Instead, they wanted to stay in the Divine Beginning Realm.","“Shuang ‘er, you don’t have to say anymore. We’ve already thought about it clearly. We’ll stay in the Divine Beginning Realm and live and die with it,” said Jian Nantian.","“Right. The Divine Beginning Realm gave birth to us. It’s our hometown. Our hometown has suffered a great calamity. Although we can’t help much, we won’t abandon it and run away alone. Moreover, we’ve already lived long enough. Even if the Divine Beginning Realm collapses in the next moment and we all die, I don’t have anything to regret,” Zhuo Yunfeng also smiled.","“We tried to escape once when you met a great enemy. We don’t plan to experience that again,” Luo Xinqin added.","Not only Jian Wushuang’s parents, but also Wang Yuan, Yang Zaixuan, Su Rou, and others were unyielding.","No one chose to abandon the Divine Beginning Realm and escape alone.","They all intended to share life and death with the Divine Beginning Realm.","Jian Wushuang was helpless about this, and he could not force them.","After all, he was also a member of the Divine Beginning Realm. In this difficult time, he had to shoulder the burden for the Divine Beginning Realm. He also decided to share life and death with the Divine Beginning Realm.","If he was like this, how could he restrain or force the people around him?","“If that’s the case, then we will be with the Divine Beginning Realm in life and death.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","Many of his closest relatives and friends in front of him also smiled, and their eyes were filled with determination."]},{"number":3953,"title":"Chapter 3953 - He Must Win","paragraphs":["Looking at the determination in the eyes of his close friends and relatives, Jian Wushuang’s heart was in turmoil.","He knew that he had no way to retreat in the following battle.","Once he was defeated, he could not bear the consequences.","Therefore, he must win this battle no matter how much he had to pay!","“Everyone, I’ll go first,” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice.","“I’ll go with you.” Leng Rushuang walked over and held Jian Wushuang’s hand.","“Yes, we’ll go together.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Immediately, the husband and wife set off at the same time and headed toward the gathering place of experts from the Divine Beginning Realm.","Jian Nantian, Ji Wumeng, Zhuo Yunfeng, Luo Xinqin, Wang Yuan, Yang Zaixuan, Su Rou...Jian Wushuang’s closest relatives and life and death brothers all watched Jian Wushuang and his wife leave.","There was not only determination in their eyes, but also anticipation.","They were also roaring crazily in their hearts.","“We must win!”","“We must win!”","...","Outside the Divine Beginning Realm, in the void near the edge of the universe, countless experts were gathered here at this moment.","These experts were from the Divine Beginning Realm, a large number of experts who had been promoted in the shortest time by relying on the Triple Dao world, and many Principles Masters who already existed in the Divine Beginning Realm, there were a total of 140,000 Principles Masters.","There were also countless great beings recruited by Star Palace who had relied on a large number of top-tier true treasures and pinnacle true treasures over the years. In addition to the Great Beings who were already under them, the number was even more exaggerated. There were a total of 560,000 of them!","The 560,000 Principles Masters from Star Palace, together with the 140,000 Principles Masters from the Divine Beginning Realm, made up a total of 700,000!","There were 700,000 Principles Masters in the army. Although the strength levels of these Principles Masters were different, many of them were only in the second or third void realm, there were many experts in the fourth, fifth, sixth, and even the ultimate six void realms in the army.","Moreover, the 700,000 Principles Masters had another characteristic, which was that each of them had a supreme true treasure at the very least. As for those who were slightly stronger, they used a pinnacle true treasure.","Of course, with Star Palace’s original resources, even with the 100,000 pinnacle true treasures that Jian Wushuang had brought back previously, it was still impossible for the 700,000 Principles Masters to have a pinnacle true treasure or a pinnacle true treasure, the reason why it could be completed now was that Jian Wushuang had gone to the Red Cloud World personally not long ago.","He had found Lord Wu in the Red Cloud World, and Lord Wu had promised to give him another batch of true treasures.","This batch of true treasures contained a total of one million top-tier true treasures and 300,000 pinnacle true treasures.","With the addition of this batch of true treasures, the true treasures in Star Palace would naturally be incomparably abundant. Even if the army of 700,000 Principles Masters was given a top-tier or even pinnacle true treasure, there would still be a large amount of surplus in Star Palace.","This army of 700,000 Principles Masters, who each had a top-tier or even pinnacle true treasure, under the command of Ruler Spark, formed a total of seven huge battle formations. Each battle had 100,000 people, which was equivalent to seven legions, any legion could unleash terrifying power with the help of a battle formation.","If the seven legions were divided, each 10,000 people could form a battle formation of 10,000 people, and the power they could unleash was not weak either.","When the battle formation of 10,000 people was divided again, it was a battle formation of 1,000 people...","In short, in less than 1,000 years, under the control of an array master like Ruler Spark, the power of this army of Principles Masters had increased by many times.","This was only at the level of Principles Masters. As for Rulers, in the past 1,000 years, Star Palace had recruited many Rulers with supreme true treasures. In total, there were more than 30 of them, and all of them had supreme true treasures, some of them had two or three supreme true treasures, so their battle strength was not low.","These were the battle strength that had been shown on the surface. As for the other battle strength, such as Jian Wushuang’s servants, they had not shown up except for the Ruler Star Fire.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Three figures suddenly appeared in the camp of the Divine Beginning Realm.","Among the three figures, Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang were walking in front, while a man in golden armor followed behind them with a cold expression.","The man in golden armor was burly like an iron tower, guarding Jian Wushuang’s side.","He had been staying in the blood-red gourd, and had also submitted to the Devil Flame under Jian Wushuang’s command.","Over the years, the Devil Flame had absorbed the gold-devouring divine body formed by the Gold-Fire Magic Stone, Ice Essence Crystal, and Blood-Dragon Crystal. It had already recovered 20% of its original state, after that, the soul of the Devil Flame guided the gold-devouring divine body out of the blood-red gourd and turned into a burly man in gold armor, following Jian Wushuang.","“Stone Fire.” Jian Wushuang sent a message.","Soon, the Starlord, Daoist Xuan God, and Temporal Temple Master arrived in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Master.” The Starlord bowed respectfully to Jian Wushuang.","“My young friend, you’re here.” Daoist Xuan God and the others simply greeted him.","“Stone Fire, I asked you to cultivate the battle formation for these Principles Masters and my servants. How are they doing now?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Don’t worry, master. The Army of Principles Masters has been cultivating the battle formation in my way for years. Although there are many experts in their battle formation, the battle formation itself is not very complicated. They are all Principles Masters, so they can easily master the battle formation. Now that they have basically mastered it, they can fully unleash the power of the battle formation.”","“As for your slaves, they have been cultivating in the Temporal Tower and have almost mastered the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation through the flow of time. They have been practicing it secretly for more than 300 years. Now, once the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation is used, its power will be extremely powerful.”","“However, the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation is a trump card, including the strength of your slaves. The Devil Cloud Star has not received any news about it, so I asked them to hide for the time being and wait for a critical moment to attack,” said the Ruler Spark.","“Well, you did a good job.” Jian Wushuang nodded. He was very satisfied with what the Ruler Spark had done over the years.","“Xuan God, I don’t understand. Why did you choose to fight with Devil Cloud Star in the universe void closest to the Divine Beginning Realm?” Jian Wushuang asked in puzzlement.","Although they were already in the universe void, the Divine Beginning Realm was behind them. The distance was too close. Once the battle broke out, if the power of both sides was slightly out of control...the power of the attack could very possibly affect the Divine Beginning Realm. It would also bring a lot of damage to the Divine Beginning Realm."]},{"number":3954,"title":"Chapter 3954 - On the Eve of the Great Battle (First Part)","paragraphs":["“Heavenly Marquis, you don’t know this, but we have no choice but to choose this place. After all, we have to leave a way out for ourselves and countless experts in the Divine Beginning Realm,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“A way out?” Jian Wushuang frowned, still puzzled.","Daoist Xuan God explained, “Devil Cloud Star is a second-grade star world after all. No one knows how strong Devil Cloud Star Master is. Although we have gathered about 70% of the upper echelons of the Star Field and the experts you brought back, no one knows whether they can defeat the Devil Cloud Star Army.”","“It would be good if we won in the end, but if we lost, then we would have to make plans for the countless cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm. That’s why we chose this place as the battlefield.”","“This place is the universe void. It can allow the great beings of both sides to display their strongest combat power. It can completely allow both sides to fight to the death. If our side has the advantage then, we can naturally exterminate the Devil Cloud Star Army in one go. And even if we lose, the Great Beings of our Divine Beginning Realm can immediately choose to flee back to the Divine Beginning Realm.”","“After all, the Divine Beginning Realm is only a third-grade astral world, and it repels foreign experts, especially cultivators above the Ruler realm. They simply can not display much combat power in the Divine Beginning Realm. Even though that Devil Cloud Star Master has possessed the Divine Beginning Realm and is the Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm, he still has to follow the principles of the universe. Even if his true body enters the Divine Beginning Realm, he will not be able to display his peak strength. At that time, our camp can continue to fight with Devil Cloud Star in the Divine Beginning Realm!”","“Of course, if we fight in the Divine Beginning Realm, it will be very passive for our camp. Master Devil Cloud can completely ignore us and continue to think of ways to accelerate the evolution of the Divine Beginning Realm. However, without the existence of forces like the three Saint Realms, our camp can constantly interfere with the experts under his command. This will more or less affect his plans and buy more time for the Divine Beginning Realm.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but fall silent.","He understood what Xuan God meant.","In fact, there were only three outcomes in the following battle.","The first outcome, which was what they desired the most, was to kill Devil Cloud Star Master.","As long as Devil Cloud Star Master died, all the dangers could be resolved without the power of his will of Heavenly Dao, which dominated the Divine Beginning Realm.","The second outcome was to settle for the second-best outcome. If he could not kill Devil Cloud Star Master, he had to completely defeat the Devil Cloud Star Army so that the forces under his command could not infiltrate the Divine Beginning Realm.","In that case, even if Devil Cloud Star Master was still alive and still dominated the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm, if he did not have any help in the Divine Beginning Realm, it would speed up the evolution process of the divine realm, his plan to improve his strength would certainly be greatly affected. Even if he did not stop moving forward, his speed would be greatly reduced. This would buy Jian Wushuang a lot of time to break through to the Ruler realm.","The Divine Beginning Realm could accept either of these two results.","However, if neither of these two results could be achieved, there would only be one final result left.","This kind of result was something that countless great beings of the Divine Beginning Realm were not willing to see. It was that the Divine Beginning Realm’s camp had been defeated by the Devil Cloud Star Army, and countless great beings of the Divine Beginning Realm could only flee back to the Divine Beginning Realm, relying on the Divine Beginning Realm’s rejection of the Great Beings of the outside world, they continued to tangle and fight with the Devil Cloud Star Army.","However, this kind of result was too passive. Moreover, that Devil Cloud Star Master probably would not give them any more chances.","Just like that time...long years ago, during the Battle of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","At that time, the Divine Beginning Realm didn’t have the ability to contend with Devil Cloud Star. Therefore, at that time, the Seven Star Mysterious Sect didn’t dare to run to the void outside the universe to fight with Devil Cloud Star. They could only passively stay in the Divine Beginning Realm, they thought of a way to tangle with Devil Cloud Star Master, but in the end, they were still disintegrated by devil cloud star from the inside. The three great holy regions directly led the forces of the Divine Beginning Realm, and some Rulers of the Devil Cloud Star from the outside world assisted in destroying the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","The gap between the two sides was too big. The forces of the Divine Beginning Realm basically had no room to struggle. The top forces of the Divine Beginning Realm also knew this, so they compromised.","However, it was different now. The Divine Beginning Realm had the ability to fight with Devil Cloud Star, so they chose to fight head-on with Devil Cloud Star Master in the universe void at the edge of the Divine Beginning Realm.","“I understand. Let’s go and have a look around.” Jian Wushuang held Leng Rushuang’s hand and the couple walked in the middle of the void.","Daoist Xuan God, Ruler Spark, and the others followed him.","Jian Wushuang’s soul power had already covered the void, so he could sense the aura of countless Principles Masters.","He knew some of these Principles Masters, such as Temple Master Bai Xing, Ba Cang, spirit ancestor, serene ancestor, and the others from the Temporal Temple, and the Heaven Ancestor Daoist sect, there were also many Principles Masters from the nine-tailed clan...the aura of these experts he was familiar with was obviously much stronger than before. Apparently, they had been cultivating in the Three-layered Dao Realm over the years, although they had not broken through to become Rulers, they had made great progress.","“Eh?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, but he suddenly looked in a direction.","In that direction, there were dozens of auras of Principles Masters gathered, most of which were women.","“Are they from the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly and glanced at Leng Rushuang beside him. “Shuang ‘er, accompany me to meet some acquaintances.”","“Yes.” Leng Rushuang nodded.","As Jian Wushuang moved, he soon arrived at the void where the experts of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley were.","“How are you all from the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley?” Jian Wushuang’s voice was a little cold. His eyes swept across the experts of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","The Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley was indeed a big force in the Divine Beginning Realm, but it was not the top force. The number of Principles Masters was not too many, but now there were more than 30 Principles Masters gathered here, apparently, because of the Triple Dao world, many Immortal Saints in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley had broken through to become Principles Masters.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","The people of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley immediately recognized Jian Wushuang and were shocked.","After all, the current Heavenly Sword Marquis was vastly different from before in terms of strength and status."]},{"number":3955,"title":"Chapter 3955 - The Eve of the Great Battle (Part Two)","paragraphs":["“Mai Yi, greetings, Blood Sword Master.” The gray-haired old woman standing at the front of the experts of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley saluted respectfully and shouted.","“The old valley master of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","He had met the old valley master several times before, and it was because of the old valley master that he had to compromise and take Leng Rushuang’s soul body away, after that, he had finally awakened his wife’s soul body and rebuilt her divine body.","Looking at the old valley master in front of him, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were slightly cold.","Leng Rushuang, who was standing beside him, fixed her beautiful eyes on a beautiful figure behind the old valley master.","Jian Wushuang also looked at the beautiful figure.","It was indeed a stunning woman, and her appearance and temperament were very similar to Leng Rushuang’s.","However, because Leng Rushuang had reconstructed her divine body with the heart of the astral world, her divine body was more perfect than the woman in front of her.","“Husband, who is that woman?” Leng Rushuang asked with confusion.","“She is your second life. You are one with her, but now she is her and you are you,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Is that so?” Leng Rushuang nodded slightly, but she looked at him with more curiosity.","Jian Wushuang looked at the woman and noticed that her aura was very strong. She had reached the pinnacle of the six void realms, and the most important thing was that her aura was too cold, it was so cold and perfect that there seemed to be no emotion on her face. Although she stood there, her expression did not change at all, whether Jian Wushuang came or looked into Leng Rushuang’s eyes.","She was a real, emotionless person.","Just like the principle of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, she forgot all feelings. Apparently, she had also cultivated the unique divine skill of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. Compared to the old valley master, she was more perfect and had a higher level of cultivation. Now, she...she was truly like a fairy, unworldly.","“She no longer has any emotions. What’s the difference between such a person and a walking corpse?” Jian Wushuang shook his head secretly.","The unique divine skill of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley was very powerful, but the price was unacceptable to Jian Wushuang.","“Blood Sword Master, the person beside you should be your wife, right?” The old valley master, Mai Yi, looked over with a smile on her face. “It seems that you’ve found the ice heart glazed jade, Blood Sword Master.”","“Ice-heart glazed jade?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. “I’m still very angry about the ice-heart glazed jade. Mai Yi, how dare you lie to me?”","“Lie? Blood Sword Master, how can you say that?” Mai Yi asked in surprise.","“Humph, you said that my wife’s soul was attached to the star-moon agarwood for hundreds of millions of years. It was safe. At most, it would take hundreds or thousands of years for my wife’s soul to wake up. However, after tens of thousands of years or even 100,000 years, my wife’s soul did not wake up until I met an expert who told me that the star-moon agarwood could not maintain my wife’s soul forever!”","“My wife’s soul has been attached to the star-moon agarwood. Her soul has been damaged, and the ice-heart glazed jade can’t restore her divine body. If I didn’t get a higher-level treasure by chance, I might never see my wife again.” Jian Wushuang’s voice was extremely cold.","“What?” Mai Yi was shocked. “How, how could it be?","“The hundred-million-year star-moon agarwood should be able to preserve your wife’s soul. No, no, Blood Sword Master, forgive my ignorance. I did think that your wife’s soul would be protected by the hundred-million-year star-moon agarwood. I didn’t expect it to be like this...”","Mai Yi was also anxious.","She knew how important Leng Rushuang was to Jian Wushuang. Otherwise, Jian Wushuang would not have been so crazy for her.","With Jian Wushuang’s current strength and status, if he really wanted to pursue the previous matter, she could not bear the slightest bit of anger.","Jian Wushuang coldly glanced at Mai Yi, and the anger in his heart gradually subsided.","He could see that Mai Yi was not lying. At least, she did not deliberately deceive him. She thought that the star-moon agarwood was enough to protect his wife.","“Well, now that I have reunited with my wife, I can’t be bothered to punish you. The battle with Devil Cloud Star is coming soon. You, the people of the supreme emotion-forgetting valley, should do your best in this battle.” Jian Wushuang snorted coldly, then he turned around and left.","Leng Rushuang took a deep look at the woman who looked like her and left.","Seeing Jian Wushuang leave, the people of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley heaved a sigh of relief.","...","After walking around the area where many Principles Masters gathered, Jian Wushuang came to the place where many Rulers gathered.","Because of the Triple Dao world, there were many new Rulers in the Divine Beginning Realm. Jian Wushuang was very familiar with some of them.","“Haha, Chenhuo, congratulations on becoming a Ruler.”","Jian Wushuang went directly to Demon Master Chenhuo.","Demon Master Chenhuo had reached the pinnacle of the six void realms when he was in the Divine Beginning Realm. With the help of the Triple Dao world, he had broken through to the Ruler level, he could be said to be the first Ruler created by the Triple Dao world.","As for Di Shisan, who had broken through earlier than him, he had broken through by relying on his own strength. It had nothing to do with the Triple Dao world.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, no, I should call you Blood Sword Master now. It’s rare that you can still remember me with your current status and identity.” Demon Master Chenhuo smiled.","“You’ve been by my side for so many years. How could I forget your kindness?” Jian Wushuang smiled.","When he was weak, he did not have many good friends in the Divine Beginning Realm, and Demon Master Chenhuo was definitely one of them.","And Demon Master Chenhuo had indeed helped him a lot.","Now that Demon Master Chenhuo had broken through to the Ruler realm, because of Jian Wushuang, he was immediately bestowed with several supreme true treasures. Not only did he have a supreme true treasure magic weapon, but he also had a supreme true treasure armor, he also had a domain type supreme true treasure and a flying type supreme true treasure.","With these supreme true treasures, Demon Master Chenhuo’s life-saving ability would be greatly improved in the upcoming battle with Devil Cloud Star."]},{"number":3956,"title":"Chapter 3956 - Had Arrived","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo exchanged casual greetings, but at this moment, he noticed two figures next to him.","“Elder Dark Bone, Ming Yun?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed as he walked forward.","“Blood Sword Master.” Both Elder Dark Bone and Ming Yun were extremely humble.","“You two are here too. Dark Bone, have you also broken through to become a Ruler?” Jian Wushuang looked at Elder Dark Bone and could sense the aura of a Ruler emanating from him.","“To tell you the truth, I have already become a Ruler a long time ago,” Dark Bone said.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“My Dear Heavenly Marquis, Dark Bone has been on my side for a long time. It’s just that no one knows about it,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood.","No wonder Dark Bone had been helping him in the past. It turned out that he was on his side from the beginning.","“After all, the Divine Beginning Realm is our hometown. Although I, Dark Bone, am not very capable, I will not turn a blind eye to the desperate situation of my hometown.” Elder Dark Bone laughed, “As for Ming Yun, he and I are good friends. He came with me this time. Although we can not help much in this battle, we can at least contribute.”","Jian Wushuang nodded.","The great battle was about to begin. The experts of the Divine Beginning Realm were united.","Only in this way could they have a chance of winning the battle with Devil Cloud Star.","At this moment, Ruler Chenyun suddenly sent a message.","“Blood Sword Master, I have bad news.” Ruler Chenyun’s voice was a little low.","“Bad news?” Jian Wushuang frowned. “What happened?”","“Blood Sword Master, when I sent you a message, I told you that the universe boat on Devil Cloud Star stopped for a while when it passed by a Star Field. Before, the Nine Emperor Pavilion did not know why the universe boat stopped there, but now, we have figured it out.” Ruler Chenyun paused, he continued, “Devil Cloud Star’s universe boat stopped in that Star Field because of an expert from that Star Field, Shi Hua Divine Emperor.”","“Shi Hua Divine Emperor?” Jian Wushuang remembered the name.","“That Shi Hua Divine Emperor is a fourth-level Ruler. Although he is only at the elementary level of the fourth-level, he is very famous in many Star Fields nearby. Moreover, he is very familiar with Devil Cloud Star Master and they seem to be on good terms. This time, when Devil Cloud Star passed by the Sea of consciousness of that Star Field, he was invited to come to this Star Field with him,” Ruler Chenyun said.","“What did you say?” Jian Wushuang’s expression immediately changed. “Are you saying that in the universe boat that Devil Cloud Star is currently on, besides Devil Cloud Star Master, there is also a fourth-level Ruler, Shi Hua Divine Emperor?”","“That’s right.” Ruler Chenyun nodded slightly.","“Damn it!” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands, but he could not help cursing in his heart.","Devil Cloud Star Master alone was already very difficult to deal with.","Although he had prepared many methods over the years, which gave him some confidence to face Devil Cloud Star Master, he was still not absolutely sure that he could win this battle.","But now, in addition to Devil Cloud Star Master, there was also an Shi Hua Divine Emperor?","They were both fourth-level Rulers. If Shi Hua Divine Emperor made a move, his battle strength could completely influence or even change the entire battle situation.","“Ruler Chenyun, can you confirm the relationship between Devil Cloud Star Master and Shi Hua Divine Emperor? If it comes to a critical moment, will he definitely make a move?” Jian Wushuang asked immediately.","“Of course, I can confirm the relationship between them. They are indeed good friends. Some experts in the surrounding Star Fields have heard about this, but I can’t guarantee that Shi Hua Divine Emperor will not make a move when the battle begins,” said Ruler Chenyun.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed.","Shi Hua Divine Emperor and Devil Cloud Star Master were good friends. Now that they were on the universe boat in Devil Cloud Star, Shi Hua Divine Emperor would most likely attack when the war began if Devil Cloud Star’s side was defeated. In other words, in this war...they had another enemy who had reached the level of a fourth-level master.","It was indeed bad news.","“Fortunately, although Shi Hua is also a fourth-level master, he is not very strong. The three most powerful experts of our camp should be able to fight him easily. The real threat to our camp is Devil Cloud Star Master,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","Shi Hua’s arrival was beyond Jian Wushuang’s expectations and brought him some pressure, but it was still within his range.","“Blood Sword Master, the universe boat that Devil Cloud Star is on has arrived in this Star Field. It’s rushing to the Divine Beginning Realm as fast as it can. I think it’ll take at most half a day,” Ruler Chenyun said.","“Half a day?” Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold. “All the experts in the Divine Beginning Realm are ready and are ready to die. Now, we’re just waiting for them to arrive!”","In the void where countless experts gathered, a solemn atmosphere had already gathered.","As the news of the arrival of the Devil Cloud Star army spread, a large number of experts in the void were ready. Countless Principles Masters rose up, they had already formed one huge battle formation after another.","The numerous Principles Masters within the battle formation were also gathering their strength and waiting for the next big battle.","Half a day later, under the gaze of hundreds of thousands of great beings from the Divine Beginning Realm camp, an ancient and incomparably huge universe boat slowly sailed over from the universe void space at the very front.","This universe boat was too big. It was at least ten times bigger than the universe boat that Stone Ruler Spark had obtained back then.","On this ancient universe boat stood countless great beings. In the depths of the universe boat, there was a powerful and even terrifying aura circling.","“The Devil Cloud Star Army has arrived.”","In a nearby universe void space, three figures stood there calmly.","These three figures were the three Pavilion Masters from Nine Emperor Pavilion, and the leader was dark cloud Ruler.","When the three of them saw the enormous universe boat descend and appear in the void space, they were secretly amazed.","“Devil Cloud Star is a level two star world after all. It has countless experts under its command, and there are close to a hundred Rulers. Devil Cloud Star Master previously took over a star world, and now, he has broken through to the level four realm. In addition, he has an existence called Shi Hua Divine Emperor with him. I wonder if the Divine Beginning Realm will be able to withstand such a lineup...”"]},{"number":3957,"title":"Chapter 3957 - Confrontation","paragraphs":["“It would be fine if we could block it, but if we can’t, the death of the Divine Beginning Realm is still a small matter. The key is that Blood Sword Master might also die,” another Pavilion Master said with a frown.","To the Nine Emperor Pavilion, they did not care about the life and death of the Divine Beginning Realm.","The only thing they cared about was Jian Wushuang’s life or death.","After all, Jian Wushuang was a real super genius, and his name was already on the Nine Emperor List. If he could grow up in the future, it would be beneficial to the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","“Unfortunately, the Nine Emperor Pavilion does not compete for Ruler and does not participate in the fights between the various forces. Although the Blood Sword Master is on the Nine Emperor List, the Nine Emperor Pavilion will only provide him with some basic help, but we will not help him out of the crisis. Whether he lives or dies in this battle depends on himself.” Ruler Chenyun shook his head secretly.","The Nine Emperor Pavilion would not care about the experts on the nine-emperor list.","Especially the young experts who had not yet grown up.","For example, although the Nine Emperor Pavilion valued geniuses like him, they would not help Jian Wushuang much. Even if Jian Wushuang was in a desperate situation, the Nine Emperor Pavilion would not help him, this was the iron principle of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. After all, there were so many geniuses on the Nine Emperor List. If the Nine Emperor Pavilion helped anyone who was threatened, the Nine Emperor Pavilion would pay too much and would not be able to handle it.","Moreover, the path of cultivation could not be smooth sailing. Anyone who wanted to become a top expert had to go through trials and tribulations.","The Nine Emperor Pavilion was willing to see the genius experts on the Nine Emperor List meet with danger, because in the eyes of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, these dangers were just some tempering.","Only experts who could truly grow through the tempering and reach the top level of the universe were qualified to ask the Nine Emperor Pavilion to help them.","The current Jian Wushuang was still far from that level.","“I hope Blood Sword Master can survive this time,” Ruler Chenyun thought.","The ancient and huge universe boat appeared in the void at the edge of the Divine Beginning Realm. Hundreds of thousands of cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm looked at the ancient universe boat with serious expressions.","“Finally, it’s here.”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, and there was a fierce gleam in the depths of his eyes.","His wife, Leng Rushuang, stood beside him. Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Heaven Ancestor stood beside Jian Wushuang as well. There were many high-level experts in the Divine Beginning Realm, looking at the ancient universe boat in front of them, their expressions were solemn, and their hearts were slightly trembling.","Buzz, buzz, buzz. The ancient universe boat finally came to a complete stop in the dark void. Then, countless figures rushed out of the universe boat like wasps.","These people were the great beings under the command of Devil Cloud Star, and they were all Principles Masters. As for the number, it was much less than the Divine Beginning Realm’s camp, which only had 100,000 people.","However, although the Principles Masters in the Devil Cloud Star Army could not be compared with the Divine Beginning Realm’s camp in terms of numbers, these Principles Masters of Devil Cloud Star were all wearing the same black armor, and even the godly weapons in their hands...they were all the same standard divine weapons, and their auras were all magnificent and tyrannical.","100,000 Principles Masters were at least at the peak of the void fifth level, and more than half of them were at the void sixth level.","In terms of quality, these Principles Masters in the Devil Cloud Star Army were much stronger than the Principles Masters in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Although the Divine Beginning Realm had an army of 700,000 Principles Masters, forming an army formation of seven people with 100,000 people, the strength of these 700,000 people was uneven. Even though there were quite a number of void sixth level Principles Masters among them...in terms of numbers, however, they were not as many as Devil Cloud Star’s side.","This was merely a simple comparison of numbers and quality. However, in a real battle, the coordination of the army, the degree of tacit understanding, and all sorts of methods were the key to victory.","Although the Divine Beginning Realm’s side had an army of 700,000 people, if they really wanted to fight against the army of 100,000 Principles Masters from Devil Cloud Star, they might not have the confidence to win completely.","Suddenly...","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","More than 100 streams of light rushed out of the ancient universe boat and appeared at the front of the army of 100,000 Principles Masters.","These streams of light were the Ruler-level experts of the Devil Cloud Star Camp. There were more than 100 of them, led by Devil Cloud Star Master and Shi Hua Divine Emperor.","“Is he Devil Cloud Star Master?” Jian Wushuang stared at the most conspicuous person in the crowd.","It was a middle-aged man who looked extremely elegant. He stood at the front of the army with his hands behind his back. There was a smile on his face, and a faint golden light appeared in his eyes, he gave off an extremely demonic feeling.","The root of the war was Devil Cloud Master, and also the true source of the disaster in the Divine Beginning Realm.","“Devil Cloud Master looks very ordinary. He doesn’t look very scary. I can’t sense his aura.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","He knew that the more ordinary Devil Cloud Star Master looked, the more extraordinary he was.","“The man in purple armor next to him should be Shi Hua Divine Emperor?” Jian Wushuang looked at Shi Hua Divine Emperor again.","They were both fourth-level Rulers, so Jian Wushuang did not dare to underestimate Shi Hua Divine Emperor.","“Eh?” Jian Wushuang’s expression suddenly changed, and his eyes immediately locked onto a Ruler behind Devil Cloud Star Master.","“Ruler Starfall.” Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted, and a trace of sharpness flashed in his eyes.","He knew Ruler Starfall, but he had never seen the Sorcerer God’s real body, so he could not recognize him. However, Daoist Xuan God and the others immediately recognized him.","“It’s the Sorcerer God?”","“The Sorcerer God is very cunning. When the three Saint Realms were destroyed, the three masters of the Saint Realm were killed, but the Sorcerer God fled far away. We have been looking for him all these years, but we haven’t been able to find him. We really don’t know where he has been hiding all these years.”","Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the others looked at the Sorcerer God with killing intent in their eyes.","“Haha! I didn’t expect you to reach such a level in such a short time. Jian Wushuang, you really surprised me.” A hearty laughter suddenly sounded.","The faint golden light in the eyes of the Devil Cloud Star Master suddenly became more dazzling, making him look even more evil.","“Devil Cloud Master, this should be the first time I’ve seen your real body. Moreover, I’ve been waiting for this day for a long time,” Jian Wushuang said in a cold voice.","“I’ve been looking forward to meeting you, Jian Wushuang. After all, you’re the most powerful genius I’ve ever met in my cultivation. Even your master, Xuan Yi, can’t compare to you in terms of talent and potential,” Devil Cloud Master sneered."]},{"number":3958,"title":"Chapter 3958 - Fourth Divine General","paragraphs":["“Master?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold.","The simple conversation had already caused Jian Wushuang to be filled with a shocking killing intent.","After all, his master, Xuan Yi, had died at the hands of the Star Master.","“Jian Wushuang, I heard that you are now the publicly acknowledged number one expert in this Star Field. I’m very curious about your current strength.” The Star Master smiled and suddenly waved his hand, a towering throne materialized behind him. He sat on the throne and looked down at everything.","“Tao Shi,” Devil Cloud Star Master said.","“Star Master.” A man over two meters tall and as strong as a brown bear walked out.","“Go up and test this little guy’s strength. Remember, don’t kill him at the beginning, or it will be boring.” Devil Cloud Star Master said playfully.","“Yes.” The burly man, who looked like a brown bear, immediately stepped forward.","“Which one is Jian Wushuang? Come up and die.” The burly man, who looked like a brown bear, stood in front of the hundreds of thousands of soldiers in the Divine Beginning Realm and shouted loudly. His voice shook the sky and was very arrogant.","However, Jian Wushuang frowned. “What does Devil Cloud Master want to do? Fight in front? Is it necessary?”","Jian Wushuang was puzzled, but he immediately noticed the special gazes around him.","These gazes came from the experts of the Divine Beginning Realm. At this moment, hundreds of thousands of experts were staring at him.","These gazes were filled with anticipation and fanaticism.","Just as Devil Cloud Star Master had said, Jian Wushuang was now the undisputed strongest expert in this Star Field, and one of the biggest supporters of the Divine Beginning Realm’s camp in this battle, countless cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm undoubtedly regarded him as their backbone. If Jian Wushuang won this battle, it would be fine, but if he lost, it would be a huge blow to his own camp, it would definitely be a huge blow.","One had to know that Devil Cloud Master’s subordinate was the only one who had come to challenge him. If he could not even defeat his subordinate, then there was no need to fight anymore.","“It seems that Devil Cloud Master wants to win this battle more easily.” Jian Wushuang’s face was cold. He noticed that many people around him were looking at him expectantly. He knew that he could not back down from this battle, he had to accept the challenge and defeat or even kill his opponent cleanly.","Only then would their morale not be affected.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang stepped forward and stopped in front of the burly man.","“You are Jian Wushuang? A Principles Master?” The burly man glanced at Jian Wushuang with disdain.","A Principles Master was just an ant. He did not know why his star master wanted him to deal with an ant?","Although he did not understand...the burly man said in a deep voice, “I’m Tao Shi, the fourth divine general under the Star Master. The star master told me not to kill you at the beginning, so don’t worry. I won’t let you die so quickly. But if you’re too weak and can’t even take my simplest attack, then you can’t blame me if you die.”","“If you don’t kill me first, I’ll kill you first,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“Haha, you’re so arrogant.” Tao Shi laughed coldly, but a fierce aura rose from his body. This aura was earth-shaking, many cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm were shocked at once.","It could not be helped. The strength of the cultivators in this Star Field was too low.","Before, the strongest had only reached the second level. Now, Tao Shi’s aura was clearly at the third level.","The cultivators in this Star Field had never seen a Ruler at the third level. Now that they felt this aura, they were naturally terrified.","However, after Jian Wushuang sensed this aura, his expression remained calm.","“This aura is only at the third-level primary Ruler level, and it’s very ordinary among the third-level primary Rulers. Any third-level Ruler in the Eternal Dark Prison would probably be stronger than him. With such strength...there’s no need to waste time. Just kill him!”","Jian Wushuang did not care about Tao Shi at all.","With a flip of his right hand, Wu weeping divine sword appeared in his hand. As the aura of the principle true treasure spread out, the eyes of many Rulers in the Devil Cloud Star, including the star master and Shi Hua Divine Emperor, lit up.","Jian Wushuang had already made his move.","Buzz buzz buzz!","A hazy fog, like a domain, swept out majestically.","In the blink of an eye, the entire world was covered by this mist.","Within the area covered by the hazy mist, a sword formation had already taken shape.","Tao Shi stood on the spot, unable to block the spread of the mist at all. He was already at the center of this hazy mist, and at the same time, he sensed the special power contained within the mist.","“Is this...a formation?” Tao Shi frowned, and a huge axe appeared in his hand.","Suddenly, a cold light lit up.","A huge sword shadow came slashing down from the fog.","It was so fast that it was incredible. It appeared directly from the fog. Tao Shi did not see how Jian Wushuang attacked. By the time he reacted...the huge sword shadow had already appeared in front of him. He did not even have time to swing his giant axe to block the Sword Shadow.","Bang!","The Sword Shadow did not suffer any obstruction as it struck Tao Shi’s divine body. Tao Shi’s divine body shook violently as he spat out a huge mouthful of blood. The Aura on his body was directly weakened by more than 20% at this moment.","“How is this possible?” Tao Shi’s eyes widened.","As the fourth divine general under the Devil Cloud Star Master, he clearly had monstrous strength. Moreover, the huge axe was already in his hand, but he did not have the time to make a move. His divine power had already been annihilated by more than 20%.","Hua!","Another giant sword shadow came, followed by the third, the fourth, and the fifth!","“No!”","Tao Shi let out a shrill scream. He crazily waved the giant axe in his hand, trying to block it!","However, he only managed to block one of the five sword shadows. The other four hit his divine body directly. All of Tao Shi’s divine power was destroyed.","Buzz!","The hazy fog in the sky dissipated, and the world returned to peace.","Jian Wushuang had already put away his Wu Qi divine sword. He stood quietly in the universe void, and under his feet was Tao Shi’s cold corpse.","It only took a moment for the fog to dissipate, but Tao Shi, the fourth divine general under the command of Devil Cloud Star Master, still died on the spot!"]},{"number":3959,"title":"Chapter 3959 - The Great Battle Had Finally","paragraphs":["“He’s dead! That Taoshi is dead!”","“In just a split second, I didn’t even have time to react. This so-called fourth divine general has already been killed?”","“Did you see that? This is Blood Sword Master, the number one expert in our Star Field!”","“He’s too strong. Blood Sword Master is too strong. With Blood Sword Master around, that Devil Cloud Star Master is nothing.”","The countless cultivators from the Divine Beginning Realm camp were completely shocked.","Because the battle just now was too fast. They only saw the fog spread out. As for what happened in the fog, they did not even have time to see it clearly before the fog spread out again. and the fourth divine general Tao Shi who had been shouting just now...the fourth divine general Tao Shi, who had burst out with a monstrous aura, had died.","In just a moment, Jian Wushuang had completely conquered them with his absolute strength.","The result of this battle immediately boosted the morale of the cultivators from the Divine Beginning Realm Camp!","They had been a little apprehensive about the result of this battle, but now, because of Jian Wushuang, they were full of confidence and almost thought that they could win this battle.","“We won this battle beautifully!”","“The Heavenly Marquis is too powerful.”","“I can feel that Tao Shi’s aura is much stronger than ours, but he was killed in front of the Heavenly Marquis.”","The Rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm camp were also pleasantly surprised and excited. They all knew that Jian Wushuang had easily won and killed his opponent, which had a great impact on the battle.","“Master’s strength has increased again.”","Among Jian Wushuang’s many slaves, only Ruler Spark was standing among the experts of the Divine Beginning Realm camp. The others had hidden themselves.","Ruler Spark was also secretly surprised at this moment.","He knew Jian Wushuang’s strength. A thousand years ago, in the Eternal Dark Prison, although Jian Wushuang’s strength was strong enough, he could only use the wave light sword formation to trap and slowly kill his opponent.","However, in the past thousand years, Jian Wushuang had been cultivating in the Temporal Tower, and his strength had obviously increased a lot, especially in the sword formation.","Both the Wave Light Sword Formation and the Earth Protection Sword Formation had been greatly improved.","Of course, the divine body, which had cultivated the third level of the supreme immortal celestial body and was comparable to the most powerful supreme treasure, gave Jian Wushuang a stronger divine power.","What Jian Wushuang had just displayed was the hazy sword formation derived from the obscure sword skill.","This sword formation was an absolute killing sword formation. It was also extremely powerful when displayed by Jian Wushuang.","At present, Jian Wushuang could easily kill an ordinary third-level Ruler without using any trump cards and relying solely on the obscure sword formation.","The entire universe void was in a state of chaos and madness because of the result of the battle between Jian Wushuang and Tao Shi.","The cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm were all pleasantly surprised and excited, while those on the Devil Cloud Star were the exact opposite. When they saw that their fourth divine general had been killed so easily, they were all shocked.","They knew how powerful this fourth divine general, Tao Shi, was.","The six great divine generals under the command of the Devil Cloud Star Master were all similar in strength. Even the first divine general was not much stronger than the sixth divine general, it could be said that these six great divine generals were the strongest warriors under the command of the Devil Cloud Star Master.","Of course, the Devil Cloud Star Master himself was far above these six great divine generals.","But now, the fourth divine general was killed so easily. In the entire Devil Cloud Star Camp, only their star Master could contend with the other party?","“I originally wanted to slightly suppress the other party’s morale, but I didn’t expect it to be a trap for myself.” Devil Cloud Master also frowned. Jian Wushuang had killed Tao Shi so cleanly, this was clearly beyond his expectations.","“However, Jian Wushuang’s increase in strength is indeed beyond my expectations,” Devil Cloud Star Master thought to himself.","“A mere Principles Master was able to kill a third-level Ruler in an instant. This Principles Master is very powerful. I’ve cultivated for almost a chaos cycle and have seen many genius experts, but I’ve never seen such a heaven-defying Principles Master.” Shi Hua Divine Emperor was also amazed.","“No matter how heaven-defying he is, he will still die if he dares to block my path.” Devil Cloud Star Master erupted with a shocking killing intent. “There’s no need to waste any more time. Just attack. Kill him.”","Devil Cloud Star Master sat on his throne and casually waved his hand.","However, the moment he waved his hand, the densely packed army of 100,000 Principles Masters behind him instantly moved.","“Kill!”","A shocking battle cry suddenly sounded.","The 100,000 people spoke at the same time, but the sound they made was as if it was made by one person. Moreover, this voice was filled with a shocking killing intent. For a moment, the entire universe void trembled.","The army of 100,000 Principles Masters was like a huge war machine that directly operated. Countless human figures rushed out at the same time. Even though they rushed out at the same time, this army was orderly and orderly, there was no disorder.","A terrifying killing intent filled the world.","The moment the army of 100,000 Principles Masters started to operate, the eyes of countless cultivators in the camp of the Divine Beginning Realm turned red, and they even became crazy.","These cultivators all took out their true treasures one by one. The lowest one was top-tier, and even top-tier true treasures appeared in their hands. The godly power of countless Principles Masters rushed into the sky.","“Fight!”","With a roar, the desire to fight soared into the sky.","In the next moment, an army of 700,000 Principles Masters formed seven huge battle formations. Like seven war beasts, they charged out.","Compared to the entire army of 100,000 Principles Masters on Devil Cloud Star, the seven war beasts on the side of the Divine Beginning Realm were not as perfect, but their momentum was not weak at all, the most important thing was the numbers. After all, it was seven against one.","Even if the quality of the Principles Masters on Devil Cloud Star’s army was higher than the Divine Beginning Realm’s side, the Divine Beginning Realm’s side was not afraid at all.","In the blink of an eye, the two armies clashed head-on.","This ultimate war that had begun a long time ago and determined the life and death of countless creatures in the Divine Beginning Realm had finally erupted from this moment!","The great battle had begun, and heaven and earth were enraged!"]},{"number":3960,"title":"Chapter 3960 - Armies Colliding","paragraphs":["Peng! Peng! Peng!","A series of earth-shattering and terrifying rumbles suddenly rang out.","The two armies formed a battle formation, combining the powers of all the Principles Masters together. At the first moment, they carried out a terrifying collision attack. That shock wave was shocking to the world, causing the surrounding universe void space to tremble crazily, black holes even appeared out of thin air.","In the first collision alone, of the seven war beasts on the side of Divine Beginning Realm, two were directly pushed back. The entire war beast was trembling madly and almost collapsed.","The battle formation was also formed by 100,000 Principles Masters. A single war beast was not a match for the Devil Cloud Star Army, even if there were two or more ‘War Behemoths’, they might not be able to contend against the Devil Cloud Star Army. However, the Divine Beginning Realm still had 700,000 Principles Masters, forming a total of seven ‘War Behemoths’.","Although one of these seven ‘War Behemoths’ was not a match for the Devil Cloud Star Army, the seven of them swarmed forward. Even though the battle formation of Devil Cloud Star’s army repelled two of them at the first moment, the remaining five frantically pounced forward and unleashed terrifying attacks, they charged straight at Devil Cloud Star’s army.","The battle formation of Devil Cloud Star’s army was like a single entity. The 100,000 Principles Masters within had obviously been working together for a long time, and they were extremely well-coordinated. Even if they were to face seven War Behemoths attacking from all directions at the same time, they would still be able to withstand the attacks, at the same time, they would also be able to carry out repeated clashes and counterattacks.","The 100,000 Principles Masters at the very least were at the peak of the fifth level of the void. Once they formed a battle formation and executed it perfectly, the power of a casual attack would already surpass that of an ordinary Ruler.","In terms of pure power, even a Ruler at the third or even fourth level could not compare to them.","The battle formation formed by the Devil Cloud Star Army clashed against the seven War Behemoths of the Divine Beginning Realm. They did not fall into a disadvantage for a short period of time.","In the surrounding void, many Rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm camp stood there and looked at the battlefield in front of them. They were all extremely shocked.","“Hundreds of thousands of Principles Masters forming a battle formation to fight and collide again and again. This is the first time I’ve seen such a scene.”","“It’s not just you. We’re all the same.”","“Tsk tsk, hundreds of thousands of Principles Masters madly fighting each other. Just thinking about it is inconceivable.”","The Rulers were all secretly praising.","Although there were quite a number of Principles Masters in this Star Field, hundreds of thousands of Principles Masters was still a huge number.","Usually, when the two large factions fought, the number of Principles Masters participating in the battle would be more than 10,000. This was considered an extremely large scene.","However, this scene paled in comparison to the battle before them.","“As expected of Devil Cloud Star. Although there are only 100,000 Principles Masters in the Devil Cloud Star Army, their quality, proficiency in battle formations, and coordination are much better than the Principles Masters in the Divine Beginning Realm. Fortunately, the number is seven to one. Otherwise, the Divine Beginning Realm would not be a match for Devil Cloud Star. Even now, the Divine Beginning Realm would only have a slight advantage,” Daoist Xuan God said solemnly.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","He could also see that the Principles Masters of the Devil Cloud Army cooperated very well. Moreover, their mastery and proficiency in battle formations were far beyond that of the Principles Masters of the Divine Beginning Realm.","Although there were 700,000 Principles Masters in the Divine Beginning Realm, most of them had been invited over during the past 1,000 years. Moreover, they had not arrived at once, but had arrived one after another over the past 1,000 years.","Although these Principles Masters had started to familiarize themselves with the battle formation as soon as they arrived, time was limited after all. Moreover, there were simply too many of them. Even if Ruler Spark had used all his skills, in such a short period of time...it was impossible for every Principles Master to have a high degree of control over the battle formation.","In other words, out of the 700,000 Principles Masters in the Divine Beginning Realm, most of them had barely grasped the control of the battle formation. There were also many who did not even have the time to grasp the battle formation and had only followed the others...they could barely form the battle formation.","Under such conditions, the Principles Masters in the Divine Beginning Realm could only exert 20-30% of their true power.","This resulted in the seven War Behemoths joining hands, but in a short time, they could only compete with the Devil Cloud Star Army. At most, they could only have a slight advantage.","“Master, it’s because of me that I’ve disappointed you,” Ruler Spark said beside Jian Wushuang.","“You can’t be blamed for this.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand.","He knew very well that it was already very good for Ruler Spark to have the 700,000 Principles Masters form a battle formation in such a short period of time.","“In the army of Principles Masters, although we don’t have much of an advantage in the Divine Beginning Realm, we still have the upper hand. Next, it’s up to the battle between the higher-ups.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly, his gaze pierced through the void and looked toward the far end of his line of sight, which was Devil Cloud Star Master.","Devil Cloud Star Master was still sitting on the lofty throne lazily, looking at the battlefield from time to time.","When he saw that Devil Cloud Star’s army was at a slight disadvantage in the battle with the Divine Beginning Realm, he was surprised.","“Battle Formation? And the level of this battle formation doesn’t seem to be low?”","Devil Cloud Star Master had such an eye for things. He could see that the seven ‘War Behemoths’ formed by the 700,000 Principles Masters of the Divine Beginning Realm were very impressive. It was just that those Principles Masters had a very low degree of control over the battle formation, that was why they were unable to fully unleash the power of the battle formation.","“This Divine Beginning Realm only began to produce a large number of Principles Masters within these few thousand years. Their army should have only been formed within these few thousand years. However, the army that was formed within such a short period of time can actually unleash such battle prowess?","“It seems that the Divine Beginning Realm has an expert skilled in arrays.” Devil Cloud Lord thought to himself.","The expert he spoke of who was skilled in arrays was naturally Ruler Spark.","“It is very difficult to determine the victor just by relying on the army under me. Let’s look at the battle prowess of the higher-ups.” Devil Cloud Master said as he slowly raised his right hand.","Behind him, the eyes of over a hundred Rulers from Devil Cloud Star instantly focused on Devil Cloud Star Master’s right hand.","As the Devil Cloud Star Master waved his right hand, numerous Ruler-level auras instantly erupted.","The hundreds of Rulers under the command of Devil Cloud Star, including many second-tier and even third-tier Rulers, all moved at this moment."]},{"number":3961,"title":"Chapter 3961 - Crushing Everything in Its Path","paragraphs":["Rumble!","The auras of the Rulers exploded one after another, causing the focus of the battlefield to shift from the armies of the Rulers of the two sides to the Rulers.","“It’s our turn.”","Dozens of Rulers gathered on the Divine Beginning Realm’s side.","These Rulers were already eager to make their move. When they saw the Rulers from the Devil Cloud Star attacking, they immediately made their move.","The aura of the same level of Rulers erupted. However, the Rulers from the Divine Beginning Realm could not compare with the Rulers from the Devil Cloud Star in terms of number or aura.","After all, the Rulers under the command of the Devil Cloud Star came from the second-level star world. There were many second-level Rulers, and even third-level Rulers. Even if Jian Wushuang killed a fourth divine general, there were still three, there were still three.","On the other hand, almost all the Rulers in the Divine Beginning Realm were first-level Rulers. Even the top-level first-level Rulers were few and far fewer than the other side.","Logically speaking, there should be no room for resistance when the battle strength of the Rulers collided. However, the Divine Beginning Realm was also prepared.","Hexagram battle formations suddenly rose up, and a group of Principles Masters suddenly appeared in the camp of the Divine Beginning Realm.","There were not many Principles Masters. There were only a few thousand of them. However, these Principles Masters were all at the level of the six void realms. Moreover, the Supreme Treasures and magic weapons in their hands were powerful. They were all supreme treasures!","Yes, they were supreme treasures.","Previously, Jian Wushuang had brought back thousands of supreme treasures from the Eternal Dark Prison. Most of them were useless, so Daoist Xuan God decided to be more extravagant, he gave some of the stronger Principles Masters of the sixth realm of the Void Realm Supreme Treasures.","The Principles Masters of the sixth realm of the Void realm who had supreme treasures did not join the battle formation of 100,000 people. Instead, they formed a new battle formation with 18 people.","The battle formation formed by 18 Great Beings of the six states of void who had supreme true treasures was not weaker than that of an ordinary Ruler.","Over 1,000 such Principles Masters formed more than 80 such battles, which meant that there were 80 more Rulers.","In addition to the dozens of Rulers in the Divine Beginning Realm, the number of Rulers was more than that of Devil Cloud Star.","However, numbers did not mean everything.","After all, Devil Cloud Star had many second-level and even third-level Rulers.","Boom!","The Rulers and experts of both sides engaged in a fierce battle. Immediately, a series of terrifying explosions sounded.","Many Rulers in the Divine Beginning Realm, including Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Heaven Ancestor, and Di Shisan, all made their moves. Jian Wushuang’s wife, Leng Rushuang, had also made her move, she was fighting against a second-level Ruler.","Leng Rushuang had absorbed the heart of the astral world and had great potential. She had also received the personal teachings of Paragon fog. After becoming a Ruler, her strength was extraordinary. Even if she did not use her trump card, she could easily fight against a second-level Ruler, once she used her trump card, she could even reach the peak of the second-level.","It could be said that all the Rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm, except for Jian Wushuang and the Ruler Spark, who was in charge of the overall situation, had made their moves.","Even so, the situation was still one-sided when the two sides clashed.","On the side of the Divine Beginning Realm, the six-pointed star battle formation formed by eighteen Principles Masters of the Six Void Realms was defeated by more than a dozen of them in just a short while. Many Principles Masters were killed on the spot, and even the Rulers were killed, three Rulers had already been killed by the third-level Ruler of Devil Cloud Star.","It only took a moment.","“The Ruler’s battle strength is no match for Devil Cloud Star.” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened, but he sent a message, “Xuan God, it’s almost time.”","Daoist Xuan God immediately understood when he received Jian Wushuang’s message. He ignored the Ruler in front of him and waved his hand. Instantly, an exquisite pavilion appeared in the middle of the battlefield.","The pavilion was beautiful and emitted a unique aura.","However, it was just a treasure. As the battle unfolded, the Rulers had already taken out all kinds of treasures, such as domain type supreme treasures, flight type supreme treasures, suppression type supreme treasures, and so on, now that Daoist Xuan God took out a pavilion, it was nothing.","The two sides had been in a fierce battle, and none of them had cared about Daoist Xuan God taking out this pavilion. But suddenly...sou!","Dozens of figures charged out of the exquisite pavilion. Each of these figures had an extremely powerful aura, and they had all reached the level of third-level Rulers. Most importantly...their combat power was even more powerful. Any one of them could almost rival a Ruler of a higher third-level level.","A total of forty people charged out and attacked those Rulers of Devil Cloud Star at the fastest speed.","Instantly...","“Not good!”","“There are so many third level Rulers?”","“No!”","A series of shocked and angry voices resounded throughout the entire universe void space.","These shocked and angry voices came from those Rulers under Devil Cloud Star.","These Rulers were all completely crazy at this moment.","Third-tier Rulers. In their Devil Cloud Star, only the Devil Cloud Star Master and the six great divine generals under him had reached the third-tier level. Moreover, he was the only one who had reached the peak of the third-tier before, in recent years, his strength had broken through to the fourth-tier.","But the six great divine generals were only at the third-tier level.","Yet, these forty people who had suddenly appeared in front of them were not weaker than any of the six divine generals? In fact, their combat power was even stronger than the six divine generals.","Two of them were especially suffocating, and their auras were close to the peak of the third-tier.","It must be known that third-tier Rulers were almost instantly killed by first-tier or second-tier Rulers.","Even third-tier Rulers who were slightly weaker could only be easily killed by the strongest experts from the Eternal Dark Prison.","And so many third-tier Rulers suddenly charged out from the center of the battlefield. This was absolutely disastrous for the Rulers under the command of Devil Cloud Star.","These forty third-tier Rulers swept across the battlefield at a terrifying speed. Wherever they passed, they easily killed the Rulers from Devil Cloud Star one by one like harvesting wheat. More than a hundred Rulers from Devil Cloud Star were killed, in the blink of an eye, more than half of them were killed.","And the remaining Rulers were like frightened birds."]},{"number":3962,"title":"Chapter 3962 - Won by Half","paragraphs":["“Run!”","“Hurry up and run!”","“The gap is too big. There’s no way to fight them. Hurry up and run!”","“There are so many third-tier Rulers. If they want to kill us, it’s practically a massacre.”","The Rulers who were still alive under the command of the Devil Cloud Star were scared to the point of madness.","In just an instant, more than half of the hundreds of Rulers had been slaughtered, including many second-tier Rulers.","As for the three divine generals under Devil Cloud Star, one of them had fought against a Ruler of the other side. That Ruler was Thousand Kills Emperor Lord.","In the end, Thousand Kills Emperor Lord had only used one ax and this divine general was heavily injured on the spot.","If another two or three strikes were used, this divine general would probably be killed on the spot.","“Too powerful, too terrifying. This person isn’t even the strongest among them!” The heavily injured divine general looked at the Thousand Kills Emperor Lord in fear before turning to look at Demon Dragon Lord and Devil Scorpion Lord, he could tell that Demon Dragon Lord and Devil Scorpion Lord were even stronger than the heavily injured person before him.","To escape, the surviving Rulers of Devil Cloud Star had lost all will to fight and chose to flee at this moment.","However, even if they fled, the slaves under Jian Wushuang’s command were still madly chasing after them. They had killed many Rulers, and in the end, only less than 20 of the hundreds of Rulers escaped from the battlefield, when they returned to the back of Devil Cloud Star Master, the remaining people, including one divine general, were killed by Jian Wushuang’s slaves.","Although less than 20 of them had escaped with their lives, their bodies were still trembling and their faces were full of fear.","“We won!”","“Just as I expected, as long as all my slaves attack, they will be able to defeat Devil Cloud Star’s Rulers easily.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and looked at the battlefield in front of him, he was very satisfied.","“Haha, this is great! This is great!”","“So many Rulers have been killed in just a short while. It’s like cutting wheat.”","“Where did these dozens of experts come from? How come they are so ridiculously strong?”","The Rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm camp were still standing there, and most of them were in a daze.","Most of them did not know where these dozens of powerful Rulers came from, and most of them did not know that there was such a group of Rulers.","When they saw the Rulers under Devil Cloud Star’s command burst out with great power, these masters were terrified. However, who would have thought that the situation would be completely reversed in the blink of an eye.","“Xuan God, what’s going on?”","“Xuan God Palace Master.”","The invited Rulers from the Divine Beginning Realm camp all began to ask questions.","Daoist Xuan God laughed heartily and said, “Everyone, the Rulers you see now are all brought back by Blood Sword from a special place. They are all his servants.”","“Brought back by Blood Sword?”","“Servants?”","The Rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm were all shocked. They could not help looking at Jian Wushuang, who was behind the battlefield. Their gazes became even more respectful.","What a joke! If his servants were so powerful, how powerful was Blood Sword Master?","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The Rulers of Devil Cloud Star were defeated. The Rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm, including Jian Wushuang’s servants, also returned to Jian Wushuang’s back.","“Master, I’m glad I didn’t disappoint you,” Demon Dragon Lord said respectfully.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile on his face.","From the beginning of the battle, Jian Wushuang had carefully planned and planned.","What he planned was the Rulers under Devil Cloud Star.","He wanted to kill as many of the Rulers under Devil Cloud Star as possible, and if possible, kill all the Rulers who came with the Devil Cloud Star Army. In this way...even if he could not stop master Devil Cloud Star in the end, he would not be worried.","If there were no Rulers under the command of Master Devil Cloud Star, even if Devil Cloud Star won this battle and Jian Wushuang and the others retreated to the Divine Beginning Realm, there would be no Ruler to take care of Devil Cloud Star in the Divine Beginning Realm, it would be difficult for master Devil Cloud Star to carry out his plan. At the very least, it would buy Jian Wushuang a lot of time.","Therefore, he deliberately showed weakness in the beginning. He only asked the local Rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm, the Rulers who had been invited to this Star Field over the years, and the Principles Masters of the six realms to fight head-on, at the same time, he asked Daoist Xuan God to stay in the exquisite attic, where all 40 of his servants were staying.","When the time was right, Daoist Xuan God took out the attic in the center of the battlefield. His servants killed the Rulers of Devil Cloud Star in the shortest time possible, this made it so that even Devil Cloud Star Master, who was at the edge of the battlefield, could not come to his aid in time.","Although the final result was not too perfect, after all, more than ten Rulers of Devil Cloud Star’s lineage had escaped. Perhaps killing more than half of Devil Cloud Star’s Rulers was already a tremendous result.","“More than half of Devil Cloud Star’s Rulers have been killed, and the rest have been scared out of their wits. They won’t be able to attack for the time being. As for the Great Army of the Principles Masters...our Divine Beginning Realm’s side also has the advantage. It can be said that our Divine Beginning Realm’s side completely suppresses devil cloud star in terms of camp. We’ve already won half of this battle!” Daoist Xuan God clenched his hands, his eyes were shining brightly.","“Now, we just need to find a way to stop Devil Cloud Master and Shi Hua Divine Emperor. That’s enough.”","“Shi Hua Divine Emperor is easy to deal with,” Jian Wushuang said, “the information given by Ruler Chenyun is true. Although Shi Hua Divine Emperor is in the fourth level, his strength is average. The Immortal Dipper Battle Formation formed by my 36 slaves should be able to fight against him. The key is Devil Cloud Master!”","Jian Wushuang stared at the Devil Cloud Star Master through the void.","According to the information given by Ruler Chenyun, Shi Hua Divine Emperor’s combat strength was very certain, but the real strength of the Devil Cloud Star Master was very vague.","After all, the Devil Cloud Star Master had occupied a second-level astral world long ago and became the Master of the second-level astral world. He had not fought for a long time.","Not only that, but he had also been in closed-door cultivation in recent years. He had just made a breakthrough and reached the fourth level. Although he had just made a breakthrough, he had taken over the Divine Beginning Realm after all, with the help of the Divine Beginning Realm’s Heavenly Dao, no one could tell how strong he was.","“Eh?”","Jian Wushuang suddenly raised his head and his pupils shrank.","Because he had already seen that Devil Cloud Star Master, who had been sitting lazily on the throne, had slowly stood up.","Devil Cloud Star Master was going to take action personally."]},{"number":3963,"title":"Chapter 3963 - Devil Cloud Star Master Made His Move","paragraphs":["Seeing that Devil Cloud Star Master had stood up, Jian Wushuang’s expression immediately turned solemn.","Although the battle had continued until now, the Divine Beginning Realm had already gained an absolute advantage, and it could even be said that they had already won half of the battle.","In fact, Jian Wushuang was very clear that this battle was only an appetizer until now.","Even though there were hundreds of thousands of Principles Masters’armies clashing against each other and numerous Rulers fighting crazily, it was just an appetizer. Jian Wushuang and the others had long expected this outcome, it was within their expectations.","The true factor of success or failure in this battle was determined by one person, and that person was Devil Cloud Master!","Devil Cloud Star Master was the most terrifying person in Devil Cloud Star. He was the strongest battle force, and also the biggest threat to the Divine Beginning Realm.","The Divine Beginning Realm could only defeat this Devil Cloud Star Master. To be exact, as long as they could resist this Devil Cloud Star Master and prevent him from killing, then this battle could be considered as a victory, otherwise, everything would be empty talk.","After all, as long as no one could resist this Devil Cloud Star Master, this Devil Cloud Star Master could kill all the high-level experts in the Divine Beginning Realm by himself.","“This Devil Cloud Star Master is really calm. He only plans to attack now.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, but then he smiled coldly. “So many Rulers have died. No matter how calm he is, he must be furious.”","Jian Wushuang guessed right. The current Devil Cloud Star Master was indeed furious.","He glanced at the slave behind Jian Wushuang, and his eyes were burning with anger.","After all, more than half of his Rulers had been killed just now, more than 80 of them.","More than half of the Rulers in Devil Cloud Star had been killed here. After the battle ended and he returned to Devil Cloud Star, the overall strength of Devil Cloud Star would be greatly weakened, the most important thing was that these Rulers had been killed right under his nose.","He had clearly watched these Rulers being killed, but he did not have time to rescue them.","This made him even angrier.","“Jian Wushuang, I have underestimated you. How could you find a group of third-level Rulers in such a short time? You are really capable,” said Devil Cloud Star Master coldly.","He had to admit that even he could not get dozens of third-level Rulers to help him in such a short time.","After all, this was the edge of the universe, and there were very few third-level Rulers in the nearby Star Field. He might even be able to get 30 or 40 third-level Rulers, that was not something he could do.","But Jian Wushuang did.","“Don’t worry, Devil Cloud Star Master. There are many things that you haven’t thought of.” Jian Wushuang sneered.","“Maybe, but I don’t have the patience to waste time with you. I just heard that the third-level masters behind you call you master. They are all your servants, right?","“If I kill you, they will either die or get rid of your control, right?” Devil Cloud Star Master said in a strange way.","Hearing this, the eyes of Demon Dragon Lord and the others behind Jian Wushuang lit up.","In fact, they had no choice but to submit to Jian Wushuang. Although Jian Wushuang had brought them out of the Eternal Dark Prison and they only needed to submit for 100,000 years, if there was a chance...who would be willing to stay under the command of a Principles Master for 100,000 years?","If Jian Wushuang died prematurely, would they not be freed in advance?","Jian Wushuang immediately understood Devil Cloud Star Master’s intention, but he smiled coldly. “Devil Cloud Star Master, you don’t have to think about my servants. Don’t think that they will pretend to be weak in this battle. Let me tell you, if I don’t die, they will naturally live. But if I die, I will kill them before I die.”","Jian Wushuang’s words were very straightforward and there was no room for negotiation. This shocked Demon Dragon Lord and the others. Although they were shocked and angry, they were more afraid.","They were now afraid that Jian Wushuang would really die in this battle.","“Haha, interesting. Let’s see if your servants can stop me.”","Devil Cloud Star Master smiled as his body slowly floated forward. At the same time, a terrifying aura that could shake the heavens and earth and cause all living things to tremble slowly rose from his body.","This aura was too strong, so strong that it made people feel suffocated.","Although there were many Rulers present, including those at the second or even third level, the auras these Rulers emitted were similarly majestic and powerful, however, compared to the aura that rose from Devil Cloud Star Master’s body, it was like a spark and a bright moon.","The rising and sweeping aura alone made many Rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm behind Jian Wushuang breathless. Some of them were even sweating profusely.","The aura alone made ordinary first or second level Rulers lose the courage to fight against it.","Only a master of the third level could barely resist the pressure of this aura.","“A master of the fourth level, is his divine power aura so terrifying?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly and then shouted, “Devil Flame!”","Whoosh!","A golden figure instantly appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","It was a man in golden armor with a cold expression. It was Devil Flame.","Devil Flame stood in front of Jian Wushuang. At the same time, a powerful divine power aura rose from his body. Although this aura was only at the peak of the third level and was still inferior to that of Devil Cloud Star Master, Devil Flame stood there...his eyes were cold, but he was not affected by Devil Cloud Star Master’s divine power aura.","“Go and kill Devil Cloud Star Master.” Jian Wushuang pointed at Devil Cloud Star Master.","“Yes.” Devil Flame nodded. His body turned into a golden bolt of lightning and flew out. In the next moment, he condensed in the void in front of Devil Cloud Star Master.","Devil Cloud Star Master Glanced at Devil Flame with disdain and said, “A third-level Ruler? Ridiculous.”","“Junior, you are too arrogant. When I rampaged through the universe and massacred fourth-level and even fifth-level Rulers, you were nowhere to be found,” Devil Flame said in a low voice.","“Junior?” Devil Flame was stunned.","He did not know that Devil Flame had been an ultimate Ruler and had lived for an extremely long time. If he had been at his peak, not to mention a fourth-level Ruler like Devil Cloud Star Master...even a fifth-level Ruler would shudder in front of him. In front of him, Devil Cloud Star Master was indeed just a junior."]},{"number":3964,"title":"Chapter 3964 - Devil Flame and Devil Cloud Star","paragraphs":["Boom!","With a loud bang, Devil Flame attacked.","A majestic golden light suddenly rose from his body. This golden light was incomparably dazzling, like a huge golden sun. As the golden light shone, the aura that Devil Flame emitted also suddenly soared.","In the blink of an eye, the golden light that filled the sky actually condensed into a ten meter long golden divine eagle. A shocking violent aura swept out. This golden divine eagle flapped its wings and directly streaked through the void.","“Divine Eagle?”","“Golden Divine Eagle?”","The surrounding experts who were watching the battle in the void were all greatly shocked when they saw the appearance of this Golden Divine Eagle.","“Junior, today, I will teach you what it means to be able to see beyond the heavens.” The cold voice of the Devil Flame came from the Golden Divine Eagle. This Golden Divine Eagle’s speed was extremely fast, and it looked down from above, as if it was catching its prey, it pounced down.","A terrifying might erupted from the golden divine eagle, and this might caused the surrounding spectating Rulers to be shocked.","Without a doubt, the power unleashed by this Golden Godly Eagle had definitely reached the fourth-tier level.","“Boasting shamelessly.” Devil Cloud Star Master smiled coldly. A pitch-black spear appeared in his hand. This pitch-black spear was emitting a faint dark light, and it spread out along with the godly power in Devil Cloud Star Master’s right hand.","Xiu!","This pitch-black spear thrust upward toward the void space.","It seemed to be a simple attack, but it caused a huge black hole to appear in the universe void space. It was like a bloody mouth that was swallowing everything around it.","In the blink of an eye, the golden godly eagle that pounced down from a high place collided with the spear. Its cold golden claws grabbed the spear, and the sound of metal colliding was heard, the two sharp claws of the golden godly eagle actually brushed past the pitch-black long spear, and then it clawed at Devil Cloud Star Master’s head.","“Hm? Fourth Level Ruler Combat Power?” Devil Cloud Star Master’s gaze was slightly raised.","He did not have the time to pull back the long spear in his hand to block the sharp claws of the Golden Godly Eagle, but his other hand was clenched into a fist. A terrifying power condensed in his hand, and then it exploded out.","Peng!","With a loud sound, the sky and earth shook, and the universe void space around them collapsed.","The Golden Godly Eagle’s sharp claws were pushed back, but suddenly, the Golden Godly Eagle opened its mouth. Hua!","A golden thunderbolt suddenly shot out at an incredible speed.","Devil Cloud Star Master was also shocked. His body moved quickly, and he barely avoided this golden thunderbolt.","“Screech!”","With a screech, your Golden Divine Eagle’s aura surged once again as it crazily attacked Devil Cloud Star Master.","The two pillars of the Golden Divine Eagle, its wings, and its incomparably sharp mouth had all become divine weapons at this moment. Furthermore, the power that erupted from them was extremely powerful, a casual attack had actually reached the fourth level.","The main point was that the golden eagle was extremely agile, and its speed was also extremely fast. Its attack method was also extremely strange. At this moment, the Star Devil Cloud Star Master had also revealed a power that far surpassed that of a third level Ruler, however, facing the crazy attacks of the golden eagle, he was actually at a disadvantage for a moment.","“So powerful!”","“That golden eagle is so powerful. Its every attack is extremely terrifying. It has actually reached the fourth level Ruler level.”","“Is this man also master’s slave? Since when did master have such a powerful slave?”","The dozens of slaves under Jian Wushuang’s command discussed and were all amazed.","Perhaps the first-level and second-level masters could not see the strength of this battle, but these slaves all had the battle strength of the third-level, so they could see the battle clearly.","They could see that the Devil Flame itself might only be at the third level, but the combat power displayed by the Golden Divine Eagle that he had transformed into was definitely at the fourth level, and it was not considered weak among the fourth level.","At the very least, the golden divine eagle that he had transformed into was crazily attacking. If it was a weaker fourth level Ruler, it would be very difficult for them to block it.","“There is actually such an expert in the Divine Beginning Realm Camp?”","The purple-armored man, Shi Hua Divine Emperor, was also watching the battle between the Golden Eagle and Demon Cloud Star Master.","He could feel the power of the Golden Eagle and Demon Cloud Star Master.","Especially the Golden Eagle. Not only was its attack extremely powerful, it did not give anyone a chance to catch their breath. If it were him, he would have been completely suppressed by such a crazy attack, as for the Devil Cloud Star Master, he was clearly much stronger than him. Up until now, he was only at a slight disadvantage.","“Devil Cloud, you are too careless. Be careful not to fail miserably,” Shi Hua Divine Emperor said with a smile. However, his tone was still extremely relaxed.","“Haha! It’s just that I have fought with someone for a long time. I just want to warm up my hands first.” Devil Cloud Star Master also smiled. However, his gaze turned cold and stern. “Scram!”","With a fierce shout, the aura on Devil Cloud Star Master’s body suddenly soared, and large patches of black devil clouds swept up. These devil clouds surged, and finally formed a pitch-black and hazy human face.","This human face was incomparably huge, and a pair of scarlet eyes directly pierced out at this moment.","The pitch-black spear in Devil Cloud Star Master’s hand also suddenly pierced out explosively, and instantly, the void of the universe madly collapsed. Terrifying power spread out, and this power was so strong that it completely affected the surrounding great void of the universe, as well as the nearby battlefield.","Although the Golden Divine Eagle formed by Devil Flame’s might was monstrous, under this spear’s explosively piercing attack, it actually felt an incomparably huge impact force, forcing its body to retreat explosively.","Weng!","The Golden Divine Eagle dissipated, and Devil Flame’s figure appeared in everyone’s sight.","And at this moment, Devil Flame’s expression was incomparably grave.","“You defeated my Golden Divine Eagle with just one blow. It seems that your strength is much stronger than I expected,” Devil Flame murmured.","According to Devil Flame and Jian Wushuang’s guess, Devil Cloud Master had just broken through to the fourth level, and his battle strength should be relatively weak among the fourth-level masters. However, it seemed that this was not the case.","At the very least, Devil Cloud Master’s strength was much stronger than that of Shi Hua Divine Emperor, who had reached the fourth level for a long time.","“Although it’s much stronger than I expected, it’s still within my range.” Devil Flame’s eyes turned slightly cold, and in the next moment, a rich golden light rose again.","Whoosh! Whoosh!","The golden light flashed strangely, and what was originally a golden light turned into two at this moment.","At the same time, two huge golden eagles condensed at the same time."]},{"number":3965,"title":"Chapter 3965 - Golden Swallow Flash","paragraphs":["“Two?”","“Two Golden Eagles?”","“Heavens, just one golden eagle is already so terrifying, but this person can actually transform into two golden eagles at the same time?”","The surrounding cultivators watching were all shocked.","Even Devil Cloud Star Master’s pupils could not help but constrict when he saw Devil Flame transform into two huge golden eagles at the same time.","Whoosh! Whoosh!","The two enormous golden eagles were like two streaks of golden lightning as they streaked across the void. Devil Cloud Star Master attacked from both sides.","Devil Cloud Star Master waved the pitch-black spear in his hand with one hand as he fought against the two golden eagles at the same time.","However, it was only one golden eagle just now. If he had been more serious, he would have been able to defend against it. However, against two golden eagles at the same time...even if he had been more serious, it would still have been extremely difficult for him to defend against them.","The two enormous golden eagles attacked time and time again. They either used their sharp claws, wings, or collided directly. Each attack was extremely powerful. It was not weaker than a full-force attack from a fourth-level Ruler, faced with this crazy attack, Devil Cloud Star Master could only passively block it. He could not find any chance to retaliate.","Suppression!","Devil Cloud Master had been completely suppressed by the two Golden Divine Eagles formed by Devil Flame.","“Awesome!”","“Well done.”","“Look, Devil Cloud Master has been completely suppressed.”","The Rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm were overjoyed at the scene in front of them.","Even Jian Wushuang could not help clenching his hands, his eyes shining.","He knew the origin of Devil Flame. Devil Flame had told him that as long as he could recover 20% of his gold-devouring divine body, he was 90% confident that he could defeat Devil Cloud Star Master, he was even 50% confident that he could kill Devil Cloud Star Master on the spot.","Now it seemed that Devil Flame was not lying. He had recovered 20% of his gold-devouring divine body. Although he had only recovered to the peak of the third-level divine body, with the many secret skills he had used when he was alive...his battle strength could completely surpass that of an ordinary primary Ruler of the fourth-level.","Although Devil Cloud Star Master was much stronger than they had expected, Devil Flame could still suppress him.","“However, it’s not enough to suppress him. If possible, I’d like to severely injure him or even kill him,” Jian Wushuang thought.","The two Golden Divine Eagles formed by the Devil Flame crazily attacked Devil Cloud Star Master and completely suppressed him. However, Devil Cloud Star Master was not really injured.","Most importantly, even though he was completely suppressed by the Devil Flame, he did not show any signs of anger or anxiety. This made Jian Wushuang a little worried.","“This is your full strength. Tsk, tsk, you’re just so-so.” A bewitching laughter suddenly came out of Devil Cloud Star Master’s mouth, and a strange smile appeared on his face.","Devil Flame’s heart sank, and in the next moment, the two giant golden divine eagles pierced through the void.","“Screech!”","“Screech!”","Two shrill screeches sounded at the same time. The two Golden Divine Eagles burst out with terrifying speed at this moment, one in front and one behind, attacking Devil Flame at the same time.","A monstrous murderous aura also spread out.","“Golden Swallow Flash!” Devil Flame roared in his heart.","Golden Swallow Flash was the strongest move of the evolved Golden Eagles secret technique that he was currently using.","This move was a killing move, so its power was naturally incomparably powerful.","“Oh?” Devil Cloud Star Master raised his head and looked at the Golden Eagles charging over crazily one after another. A trace of hesitation flashed through his eyes.","One of the two Golden Godly Eagles was in front and the other was behind him. Their speed was so fast that it was unbelievable. Under such a terrifying speed, he could not dodge at all. He could only forcefully block the attacks of the two Golden Godly Eagles, however, he only had time to swing his spear and block the golden godly eagle in front of him. The Golden Godly Eagles that were attacking him from behind were not hindered at all, it heavily impacted his divine body.","At this moment, the golden light soared. The entire dark void of the vast universe was completely illuminated by this brilliant golden light.","As for Devil Cloud Star Master, he was completely immersed in this sky full of golden light and was crazily attacked by the sky full of golden light.","Buzz! The two Golden Divine Eagles disappeared at the same time. Devil Flame’s figure also retreated rapidly to the surrounding void. His eyes were staring at the center of the battlefield.","Finally, the golden light slowly scattered. The figure of the Devil Cloud Star Master once again appeared in everyone’s sight.","At this moment, the clothes on the body of the Devil Cloud Star Master had already exploded. However, there was a green-colored battle armor covering his entire body. There was an extremely clear mark on that green-colored battle armor. It was clearly a mark that had just been left behind, this mark had already begun to slowly disappear. Meanwhile, the hair of the Devil Cloud Star Master was a little messy. There was even a trace of blood seeping out from the corner of his mouth. He looked a little miserable.","“You actually injured me?”","Devil Cloud Star Master stretched out his hand and wiped the blood from the corner of his mouth. He looked at Devil Flame again, but there was a hint of coldness in his eyes, “That’s right. Ever since I took over the Divine Beginning Realm and became Devil Cloud Star Master, although I’ve met many experts and fought with many Rulers, very few have been able to hurt me. You should be the only one who has hurt me in the past 100 million years. Moreover, this is on the premise that I’ve broken through to the fourth level.”","“You can still hurt me even after I’ve broken through. Just This Alone is enough for you to be proud.”","“Proud?” Devil Flame sneered, “You’re just sitting at the edge of the universe and observing the sky. If you go to the depths of the universe, no, even to the slightly larger territories, with your strength, there are many people who can kill you.”","“Maybe. However, you are not qualified.” Devil Cloud Star Master looked at Devil Flame coldly, and his voice slowly turned cold, “Your strength is not bad. You are barely qualified to make me use my full strength.”","“Use my full strength?” Devil Flame frowned.","The many experts who were watching the battle were all shocked.","“Has this Devil Cloud Star Master not used his full strength until now?”","“That’s impossible. The battle strength he displayed earlier was clearly at the fourth-tier level, and he could be considered one of the stronger ones among the fourth-tier. It’s already very impressive for a fourth-tier Ruler like him to have such strength. How could he still hide his strength?”","“It’s hard to say. From the looks of it, he doesn’t seem to be lying.”","All eyes were fixed on Devil Cloud Star Master at this moment.","Even Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted as he stared at Devil Cloud Star Master."]},{"number":3966,"title":"Chapter 3966 - The True Strength of the Star","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang did not know whether the Star Master had exerted his full strength.","However, judging from the relaxed look of the Star Master, it was not difficult to tell that he was not lying.","Suddenly...the Star Master put the pitch-black spear back into his hand and took out a purple spear with a flip of his hand.","It was also a spear-type magic weapon, but as soon as the purple spear appeared, the terrifying aura it emitted immediately attracted everyone’s attention.","“That’s...”","“A principle supreme treasure!”","“It’s a principle supreme treasure. Such a terrifying aura can’t be wrong.”","The entire battlefield was in an uproar.","“A principle supreme treasure?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","He had a principle true treasure and a divine sword that was suitable for him. He knew very well how much a principle true treasure could improve his strength.","For a Ruler, a Ruler with a principle true treasure was on a completely different level from a Ruler who did not have a principle true treasure.","The battle strength that Devil Cloud Star Master had just displayed was only ordinary or slightly stronger than a fourth-level primary Ruler. But now, he had a principle true treasure that was suitable for him to use! His battle strength could at least soar to the level of a fourth-level advanced Ruler!","“He actually has a principle true treasure?” Devil Flame was also a little confused at this moment.","It was known that many fourth-level and even fifth-level Rulers did not have a principle true treasure. Moreover, this place was at the edge of the universe, so there were very few principle true treasures. Jian Wushuang, for example, had a heaven-defying opportunity, he had only obtained a principle true treasure after passing the test in the Red Cloud World. However, Devil Flame had never thought that Devil Cloud Master would have a principle true treasure.","With a principle true treasure, Devil Cloud Master’s combat strength could reach a new level.","As an ultimate Ruler at his peak, Devil Flame had more than one or two principle true treasures. However, since he was hunted down and only his soul was left to escape, he could not find any, his treasures had all fallen into the hands of the expert who had chased him. Even if his soul body regained control of his divine body, Jian Wushuang could not get him a principle treasure suitable for him to use.","After all, Devil Flame was good at cprinciple skills, and his weapon was a cprinciple-type divine weapon. Jian Wushuang could only get him a supreme-grade supreme treasure to use.","However, a supreme-grade supreme treasure seemed to be only a step away from a nomological supreme treasure, but its power was far inferior.","Unlike the many experts in the Divine Beginning Realm who were shocked, Shi Hua Divine Emperor, who had also reached the fourth level, was not surprised at all when he saw Devil Cloud Star Master take out a nomological supreme treasure, some of them just sighed with emotion, “Only the cosmos godly palace is so wealthy. Devil Cloud joined the Cosmos Godly Palace not long ago, but he has been given a special godly weapon that can restrain special life forms and a principle true treasure that can attack. Although it’s only a low-grade principle true treasure, it’s still very rare.”","Shi Hua Divine Emperor and Devil Cloud Star Master were good friends, and he had been envious of Devil Cloud Star Master from the very beginning.","It was not only because Devil Cloud Star Master had taken over a star world, but it was also a fortuitous encounter for Devil Cloud Star Master. He had actually joined the Great Cosmos Godly Palace, which was a large faction that countless great beings in the vast universe yearned to join.","However, the Great Cosmos Godly Palace’s overall strength was extremely powerful, but the threshold was also very high. The requirements for the strength and potential of the Great Beings under its command were also extremely strict. Although Shi Hua Divine Emperor was a fourth-level Ruler...he was not qualified to join the Great Universe Godly Palace at all.","After the principle true treasure spear appeared in Devil Cloud Star Master’s hands, the pressure that Devil Cloud Star Master brought to the Divine Beginning Realm camp was even greater.","“You, try again!”","Devil Cloud Star Master held the Purple Spear with one hand, which was at the level of a principle true treasure. He had an evil smile on his face as he looked at Devil Flame in front of him. He even extended his other hand and hooked his finger at Devil Flame.","Devil Flame had an ugly look on his face. Although he knew that Devil Cloud Star Master’s overall combat power would be greatly improved after he had a principle true treasure, Devil Flame was not afraid at all. The surging golden light shone again.","In just an instant, Devil Flame condensed two huge Golden Godly Eagles again. The two Golden Godly Eagles hissed and attacked Devil Cloud Star Master again.","However, this time, faced with the attack of these two Golden Divine Eagles, Devil Cloud Star Master only casually waved the purple spear in his hand.","It was clearly a spear, but at this moment, it was used as a long rod by Devil Cloud Star Master, and was thrown out in an extremely casual manner.","With a casual smash, Devil Cloud Star Master did not even use his ultimate move.","However, the moment the purple spear was thrown out, an extremely unique power erupted.","Boom!","As If an adult was bullying a child, the purple spear smashed through everything in its path, directly crushing the two Golden Eagles formed by the Devil Flame. In fact, the purple spear still contained a shocking amount of power, it directly smashed into the Devil Flame’s divine body.","The Devil Flame’s golden divine body was extremely powerful, but it had only recovered 20% of its original strength. Under the attack of this power, it began to tremble violently, and the Devil Flame even spat out a large mouthful of blood, his aura was greatly weakened, and his body was forced back in a sorry state. It took him quite a while to regain his balance.","“How is this possible?” Devil Flame’s eyes were wide open, and his face was filled with disbelief.","The surrounding experts who were watching the battle were also stunned.","A casual attack was still able to smash out a spear like a long rod, but it was still able to instantly crush the two Golden Divine Eagles formed by Devil Flame. At the same time, it also heavily injured Devil Flame’s divine body.","The gap was too big.","Just a moment ago, Devil Cloud Star Master was in a terrible state under the attack of the two golden divine eagles, and he was even injured. How could it be changed in the blink of an eye.","“Universal principle!”","Jian Wushuang stared at Devil Cloud Star Master in front of him, his face extremely gloomy. Leng Rushuang, who was standing beside Jian Wushuang, was shocked. He also noticed the gloomy look on Jian Wushuang’s body.","“Universe principle!”","“It’s universe principle. Devil Cloud Star Master has comprehended a trace of universe principle?”","“How is it possible? It’s extremely difficult for a Ruler to comprehend a trace of universe principle. How could Devil Cloud Star Master...”","“Did he possess a star world because of this?”","The servants behind Jian Wushuang were also shocked.","The Universe principle was the most supreme power in the vast universe!","Even Jian Wushuang had to pay a great price to barely comprehend a trace of the universe principle.","But now, no one had expected that Devil Cloud Star Master had also comprehended a trace of the universe principle!"]},{"number":3967,"title":"Chapter 3967 - Jian Wushuang Made His Move","paragraphs":["“I’m in big trouble!”","Jian Wushuang clenched his hands, his body trembling slightly, and his heart filled with shock and anger.","He had never expected that Devil Cloud Star Master not only had a principle true treasure, but also comprehended a trace of the universe principle!","The universe principle, even if a Ruler had comprehended a trace of it, his strength would change dramatically. Moreover, with the universe principle driving the principle true treasure, the power of the principle true treasure could be better displayed.","Jian Wushuang himself had comprehended a trace of the universe principle, and he also had a principle true treasure. He knew very well how much help these two things would bring to his strength.","As a fourth-level Ruler, Devil Cloud Star Master was already at a high level. Although the increase in his strength from these two things would not be too outrageous, it would still reach a whole new level.","At the very least, he had to be at the peak of the fourth-level advanced Ruler, or even barely comparable to the peak of the fourth-level.","No one in the current Divine Beginning Realm camp could contend with such battle strength.","“What should we do?”","“This Devil Cloud Star Master’s power is too strong. It has completely exceeded our expectations. What should we do?”","“He already has the combat power of a fourth-level Ruler. With the addition of a principle true treasure and even comprehending a trace of the universe principles, he can completely slaughter all of us by himself.”","“Could it be that we really can only retreat to the Divine Beginning Realm?”","The experts of the Divine Beginning Realm were very anxious and angry at this moment.","“Husband.” Leng Rushuang glanced at Jian Wushuang and clasped her hands with a hint of worry on her face.","“Don’t worry, leave it to me.” Jian Wushuang gently rubbed Leng Rushuang’s hands and then rushed toward the void ahead.","Seeing Jian Wushuang appear in the battlefield ahead, the experts of the Divine Beginning Realm were stunned, and then a glimmer of hope burned in their eyes.","The strength that Devil Cloud Star Master had displayed was too tyrannical and terrifying. It was so terrifying that they almost despaired.","However, in the eyes of the experts from the Divine Beginning Realm camp, Jian Wushuang was also an absolute legend.","However, the Principles Master had killed a master of the third level before the outbreak of the Great War. He was widely recognized as the number one expert in this Star Field, and there were so many experts who had reached the third level, all of them had submitted to him, and were even his servants.","His strength and his methods were unfathomable to many experts in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Now that he had appeared on the battlefield, perhaps he really had the ability to change the current situation.","Although the hope was very slim, it was still hope.","“My young friend, the Heavenly Marquis.”","Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Heaven Ancestor stood side by side. Their eyes were completely locked on Jian Wushuang.","The four of them had been in contact with Jian Wushuang for the longest time. Over the years, they had watched Jian Wushuang grow step by step until his current strength and status.","At the same time, as Jian Wushuang grew, he gave them one shock after another. In their eyes, Jian Wushuang was a monster, a monster, he was even more heaven-defying than Xuan Yi.","Even though the Devil Cloud Star Master had shown his terrifying strength, when Jian Wushuang walked out, they did not know why, but they suddenly felt more confident.","This confidence was their absolute confidence in Jian Wushuang.","Unknowingly, they had already regarded Jian Wushuang as their backbone and the biggest pillar to support the Divine Beginning Realm.","In the entire Divine Beginning Realm, Jian Wushuang was the only one who still had a chance to fight against Devil Cloud Star Master.","“My young friend, I’m counting on you!” The four of them murmured in their hearts.","Jian Wushuang had already arrived beside Devil Flame.","“Haha, Jian Wushuang, are you finally going to make a move?” Standing in the void in front of them, Devil Cloud Star Master laughed heartily when he saw Jian Wushuang, but he did not intend to make a move immediately.","Jian Wushuang glanced at Devil Cloud Master coldly and did not say anything.","“Master, I’m useless.” Devil Flame bowed and said.","“Get up. You can’t be blamed for this.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand.","He did not mean to blame Devil Flame, and it was indeed not Devil Flame’s fault.","Devil Flame had only judged Devil Cloud Master’s approximate strength based on the information he had told him about Devil Cloud Master. He thought that Devil Cloud Master might have just broken through to the fourth-level Ruler not long ago, and that was indeed the case.","Devil Flame had not expected that Devil Cloud Star Master not only had a principle-type true treasure, but had also comprehended a trace of universe principle!","This was simply unbelievable. Jian Wushuang had not thought of it before, so Devil Flame certainly had not thought of it.","“Master, Devil Cloud Star Master is very strong, and he has comprehended a trace of universe principle. He also has a principle supreme treasure suitable for him to use. His battle strength is much stronger than we expected. I said that I was confident of defeating him, but now it seems that it’s a joke. His strength has completely exceeded what I can deal with now. Unless my gold-swallowing divine body can recover to more than 30%, I can’t kill him,” Devil Flame said solemnly.","Jian Wushuang took a look at Devil Flame and nodded slightly.","Devil Flame’s strength was already very impressive. He had only recovered 20% of his divine body and his cultivation was only at the peak of the third-level, but he was able to burst out with the battle strength of the fourth-level. Moreover, his battle strength was extremely strong. It was already very rare.","“Devil Flame, let me ask you. In your current state, if you recklessly use a more powerful killing move, at least it will be able to threaten Devil Cloud Star Master,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Well...” Devil Flame frowned, then he said seriously, “Master, I still have a killer move that is extremely powerful, but it’s not easy to use even when I’m at my peak. If I use it in my current state, I can barely use it, but the price is that the 20% gold-swallowing divine body that I recovered will directly collapse and I’ll have to start from scratch.”","“How powerful is this move of yours?” Jian Wushuang looked over.","“With my current strength, the power of this move can reach the peak of the fourth level. Although I’m not sure if I can kill him, at least I can seriously injure him,” Devil Flame said seriously.","“Can I seriously injure him?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes immediately lit up, and at the same time, a plan emerged in his heart."]},{"number":3968,"title":"Chapter 3968 - Triple Killer Move (Part One)","paragraphs":["“Devil Flame, get ready to use your strongest move. Don’t worry about your divine body collapsing again. After you kill Devil Cloud Star Master and survive this disaster, there will be plenty of opportunities for you to rebuild your divine body,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Devil Flame nodded.","“Demon Dragon,” Jian Wushuang sent another message. “Keep an eye on Shi Hua Divine Emperor. Once he makes any moves, form an Immortal Dipper Battle Formation to tie him down. Remember, you don’t have to kill Shi Hua Divine Emperor. Just tie him down and keep him out of the way.”","“Understood,” replied Demon Dragon Lord.","After giving his instructions, Jian Wushuang looked at Devil Cloud Star Master again.","Devil Cloud Star Master was obviously confident in his own strength. He knew that Jian Wushuang was planning something, but he was not anxious at all.","“Jian Wushuang, show me whatever you have. Otherwise, you and your Divine Beginning Realm will never have a chance to make a comeback,” Devil Cloud Star Master said with a smile.","“As you wish.” Jian Wushuang did not waste any more time with Devil Cloud Star Master. With a flip of his hand, the Wuqi divine sword immediately appeared in his hand.","They were both principle true treasures, but after Wu weeping divine sword appeared, the powerful aura of the true treasure spread out and steadily suppressed the Purple Spear in Devil Cloud Star Master’s hand.","Wu weeping divine sword came from the Red Cloud World after all. According to Lord Wu in the Red Cloud World, it was an upper-grade principle true treasure, while the Purple Spear in Devil Cloud Star Master’s hand was only a lower-grade principle true treasure, they were not on the same level at all.","“Eh? You have a principle true treasure, and the principle true treasure sword in your hand seems to be very high-grade?” Devil Cloud Star Master stared at the Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand with a burning look in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand again, and suddenly, the world began to rumble.","Three ancient and vast auras suddenly rose, and three golden lights rose. They were three towering stone tablets, which were 30,000 meters tall. As soon as they appeared, they immediately landed in three different corners of the surrounding void.","“Eh? Another principle supreme treasure, and there are three of them?” Devil Cloud Star Master was shocked.","He could clearly sense that the three towering stone tablets were principle supreme treasures.","However, this was the edge of the universe after all, and he was only a fourth-level Ruler. His knowledge was limited, so he could not directly recognize the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","Even if he could not recognize it, the three principle treasures alone were enough to make him extremely excited.","“Haha, Jian Wushuang, you’ve really prepared a big surprise for me.” Devil Cloud Master laughed loudly, his eyes flashing with fanaticism.","In his heart, whether it was the Wuqi divine sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand or the three Heaven Suppression Tablets that Jian Wushuang had taken out, they were already in his pocket. As long as he killed Jian Wushuang, these principle supreme treasures...would naturally be his.","“Humph.” Jian Wushuang snorted coldly, and a fierce light flashed in his eyes. “Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, activate!”","With the guidance of Jian Wushuang, the three heaven-shaking tablets released a series of special handprints. Under the control of Jian Wushuang, the complicated golden secret patterns on the three heaven-shaking tablets began to flash and flow rapidly, buzz. The void of the universe shook slightly.","In the next moment, rays of golden light were emitted from the three Heaven Suppression Tablets at the same time.","The rays of golden light were connected to each other. In the blink of an eye, the three Heaven Suppression Tablets had completely intersected, and a huge golden magic formation was formed.","This golden formation was like a huge golden cage, covering the entire world. A terrifying aura also rose from within this formation.","The Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation was already formed.","In an instant, a powerful suppressive force directly acted on Devil Cloud Star Master, who was at the center of the Golden Formation.","Devil Cloud Star Master’s body trembled slightly, but he immediately regained his calm.","“Haha, a Suppression-type principle true treasure?”","“Moreover, the three principle true treasures combined to form a special suppression formation. Unfortunately, your divine power is too weak, so you can’t display the true power of this formation. The suppression power of this formation has little effect on me.” Devil Cloud Star Master still smiled.","He was telling the truth.","The Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation was indeed powerful, but Jian Wushuang’s own divine power was too weak. When he had activated the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation to suppress the Demon Dragon Lord in the Eternal Dark Prison, the Demon Dragon Lord could also exert 70% of its combat strength.","Compared to the past, Jian Wushuang’s divine body was only slightly stronger because he had cultivated the third level of the supreme immortal celestial body. It did not affect the formation much, on the other hand, Devil Cloud Star Master was much stronger than Demon Dragon Lord.","The suppression power of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation could only allow Demon Dragon Lord to use 70% of his battle strength. However, the suppression power did not have much effect on Devil Cloud Star Master.","Jian Wushuang was not surprised. With a thought, a trace of universe principle fused into the three Heaven Suppression Tablets at the same time.","Suddenly...roar!","A low roar sounded, and the three Heaven Suppression Tablets began to shake violently. Then, endless golden secret patterns condensed on the surfaces of the three Heaven Suppression Tablets, forming three towering golden shadows at the same time.","The golden remnant soul of the divine devil hidden in the Heaven Suppression Tablets had been directly awakened by Jian Wushuang.","With the appearance of the three Golden Divine Devils, the suppression power of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation increased greatly.","“Huh?” Devil Cloud Star Master frowned slightly.","The suppressive power did not affect him much, but now, it was enough to affect him, but it still did not affect him much.","“Is that all?” Devil Cloud Star Master said with a faint smile.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He knew that the Suppressive Power alone would have a great impact on Devil Cloud Star Master’s strength.","However, this was only the beginning.","“Secret skill, dragon obliteration!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a fierce light. As he activated the dragon obliteration secret skill, the vast and mighty divine power in his body began to burn crazily.","The burning of divine power instantly increased Jian Wushuang’s basic divine power by a hundred times.","It must be known that the reason why the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation was not powerful enough to affect the Star Master was because his own divine power was too weak.","But now that he was using the dragon annihilation secret technique, his divine power increased explosively, and the suppression power of the god-devil heaven suppressing formation naturally increased explosively as well.","Weng weng weng!","The terrifying suppression power was at least several times or even dozens of times stronger than before, and it was crazily acting on the Star Master’s body. Even the Star Master felt an incomparably heavy pressure at this moment."]},{"number":3969,"title":"Chapter 3969 - 9: Triple Killer Move (Part Two)","paragraphs":["“He actually suppressed my strength by nearly 20%...” Devil Cloud Star Master’s expression finally changed a little.","However, the dragon-extinguishing secret skill was not the end.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand again, buzz!","The universe void slightly shook.","Then a large amount of black airflow suddenly swept up and covered the surrounding vast universe void in the blink of an eye.","This was the universe void, which was originally dark and boundless, but at this moment, it was even darker.","There was no light at all, and the entire universe fell into absolute darkness.","Silence!","The entire universe void was silent.","Primal universe!","Jian Wushuang’s most powerful innate skill, which was bestowed by the principles of the universe, and also his trump card, was displayed at this moment.","With the burning of the divine power of the dragon destruction secret skill and the blessing of the primordial universe, Jian Wushuang’s power reached a new level in an instant, and the suppression power of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation also increased sharply.","Buzz!","As Devil Cloud Master was trapped in the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, he felt a terrifying power pressing down on him. Even he could only use 70 percent of his strength under this terrifying suppression power.","“Impressive, Jian Wushuang. Is this your strongest trump card?” Devil Cloud Master stared at Jian Wushuang with a burning gaze. “It’s amazing that a mere Principles Master can release such a terrifying Suppressive Force with the help of a true treasure formation. However, as long as I kill you, all your trump cards and true treasures will be mine.”","Jian Wushuang’s face was solemn.","He knew that this move would not last for long.","Not to mention how much divine power was consumed by burning divine power, just his innate divine ability, the original universe, could only last for ten breaths.","“Even if I can’t kill him in 10 breaths, I have to deplete his divine power as much as possible.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes shone with a fierce light.","“Formation, kill!”","“Sword Formation, wave light!”","Whoosh! Whoosh! The mighty waves of sword essence swept up. They overlapped each other, and their power was earth-shaking.","As the waves of sword essence swept up, a large amount of blade-like golden light swept out from the three Heaven Suppression Tablets.","The golden light and the waves of sword essence combined perfectly. In an instant, a large amount of sword essence waves filled with golden light rushed toward Devil Cloud Star Master like a tsunami.","The Wave Light Sword Formation and the most powerful killing move of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation combined perfectly!","With Jian Wushuang’s dragon-exterminating secret skill and the support of the original universe, the waves of golden light sword essence were too powerful.","Almost every wave of golden light sword essence was as powerful as the full-strength attack of a fourth-level Ruler.","The Star Master was in the center of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation. Under the powerful Suppressive Force, he could only use 70% of his strength. However, 70% of his strength was still terrifying. He waved his spear or swept it, he could easily destroy the waves that swept around him.","In the blink of an eye, the Star Master had already destroyed dozens of waves of golden light sword intent.","However, the waves of golden light sword intent were as ordinary as they were endless. They continued to attack crazily.","“Sword Formation, what a terrifying sword formation!” The expression of the Star Master finally changed completely. He no longer looked as relaxed and relaxed as before.","There was nothing he could do. At this moment, he was trapped under this wave of light sword formation. He could only forcefully withstand the attacks of the surrounding golden light sword intent. Although the golden light sword intent attacks, one or two, did not pose much of a threat to him, there were dozens, hundreds...if there were even thousands of such attacks, it would be troublesome.","After all, that wave of sword intent was comparable to a full-force attack of a fourth-level Ruler. Even he, under the suppression of his power, had to use his full-force attack of the universe principles in order to easily defeat this wave of sword intent, however, as he destroyed the wave of sword essence, his divine power was rapidly depleting.","The rate of depletion was terrifying.","“Break!”","Devil Cloud Master was furious. He held the purple spear with one hand and suddenly stabbed it. In an instant, the purple spear turned into a huge purple lightning pillar, wanting to completely destroy the Sea of sword essence in front of him.","However...after hundreds of thousands of years of study in the Temporal Tower, Jian Wushuang had improved his three sword formations to the extreme, especially the wave light sword formation. After all, it could be combined with the Divine Demon Heaven Suppression Formation, it was his strongest killing move, so he tried his best to perfect the sword formation. After hundreds of thousands of years, the wave light sword formation had become extremely tough.","Most importantly, he was still using the dragon destruction secret technique and the sword formation in the primal universe. With the support of the surrounding Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, even though Devil Cloud Star Master was powerful, even if he used his strongest move...he could not even think of breaking the wave light sword light head-on.","Since he could not break it head-on, he could only fall into the wave light sword formation and endure the impact of the ocean of Golden Light Sword Intent. His godly power was constantly being consumed.","Hong! Hong! Hong! Hong! Hong! Hong! Hong!","One could only hear a series of low collision sounds continuously ringing within the sword array. This sound continued for a long time, yet it did not stop.","Within the Sword Array, Devil Cloud Star Master had already forcibly withstood the impact of over 1,000 waves of golden light sword intent.","Over 1,000 times! Over 1,000 times! Every time, he had to use all of his strength to withstand the impact. Accumulated, his godly power had already been greatly exhausted, and it was estimated that it was already close to 40%.","However, at this moment, the special power that had been covering the surrounding universe void space suddenly dissipated. Within the Sword Array, the power of the waves of golden light sword intent that had been madly attacking time and time again was greatly weakened at this moment, the Suppressive Effect on Devil Cloud Star Master’s body had also weakened considerably.","There was no other way. Ten breaths had already arrived.","The original universe naturally stopped.","“Huh?” Devil Cloud Star Master looked up and burst into laughter, “Haha, Jian Wushuang, I thought your sword formation could last forever and be endless. But now, it seems that you can only last for ten breaths at most. It’s a pity. If you can continue like this, you might really be able to kill me. But now...humph!”","Without the support of the original universe, the power of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation was weakened, and the strength that Devil Cloud Star Master could use was stronger. It was obviously much easier to resist the waves of sword essence around him.","“Ten breaths is enough to consume nearly 40% of Devil Cloud Star Master’s divine power.”","Jian Wushuang did not feel it was a pity. After all, he had never thought of killing Devil Cloud Star Master with this sword formation. This was only the first killing move in his plan.","The next move was the second killing move!"]},{"number":3970,"title":"Chapter 3970 - Triple Killer Move (Part Three)","paragraphs":["“Devil Flame!” Jian Wushuang suddenly shouted.","In the surrounding void, the Devil Flame, which had long been prepared, had a trace of madness in its eyes, followed by endless golden light rising.","Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish!","Nine Golden Phantoms flashed out at the same time. In the blink of an eye, these nine golden phantoms condensed into nine huge golden divine eagles in the void.","The power of the Golden Divine Eagles formed by Devil Flame had long been seen by everyone present. Just one Golden Divine Eagle alone had the battle strength of a fourth-tier Ruler, and Devil Flame had simultaneously transformed into the killing move golden swallow flash executed by two Golden Divine Eagles, it had also injured Devil Cloud Star Master.","But now, there were nine Golden Eagles, and most importantly, their auras were even stronger than before.","The moment they heard Jian Wushuang’s low shout, the nine Golden Eagles transformed into nine golden lights. Like burning golden flames, they pierced through the void in an instant, bringing with them an aura that would not rest until one of them died, they rushed crazily toward the Star Master.","They were too fast. The speed of the nine beams of golden light was really terrifying.","Moreover, the Star Master was still within the range of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation. He was still enduring the suppressive force and the long waves of sword essence of the golden light around him. Although he did not have the support of the original universe...the power of both of them had been greatly weakened, but Jian Wushuang still used his dragon-exterminating secret skill and burned his divine power with all his might.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was going all out.","Suddenly, dozens of waves of sword essence rose up from the vast sea of sword essence, forming layers of golden tsunamis that crashed down on Devil Cloud Master.","Devil Cloud Master hurriedly blocked the waves of sword essence, but he could not block the nine golden lights.","Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng!","The nine golden lights that were formed by the Golden Divine Eagle collided with Devil Cloud Star Master’s divine body at almost the same time. In an instant, a terrifying power erupted at the same time.","Even Devil Cloud Star Master’s expression changed drastically at this moment. He could sense the terrifying impact force contained within these nine golden lights.","Any one of the nine golden lights was comparable to the strongest attack of a superior Ruler of the fourth level. When the nine golden lights attacked at the same time, their power was no less than that of a peak Ruler of the fourth level.","Even Devil Cloud Master could not withstand such an attack.","Buzz!","The power of the nine golden lights was exhausted and finally dissipated.","As for the Devil Flame, the moment the power of the nine golden lights was exhausted, his divine body directly collapsed. However, his soul body left the battlefield at the fastest speed and fled to Jian Wushuang’s side, Jian Wushuang put it back into the blood-red gourd.","In the void in front of him, a huge universe black hole appeared, and large areas of space turbulence ran wildly.","In the center of the Universe Black Hole, Devil Cloud Star Master was still standing there.","However, at this moment, his face was extremely pale, and his originally soaring aura had been greatly weakened.","His body trembled, and his eyes seemed to be burning with flames.","“Puff!”","Devil Cloud Star Master opened his mouth and spat out a mouthful of scarlet blood.","But suddenly...","“Hahahaha!” Devil Cloud Star Master laughed crazily, but his laughter was extremely deranged, “The aura of death in this small Star Field actually made me feel the aura of death! I haven’t felt this aura of death for a very, very long time!”","“Jian Wushuang, I swear that I will crush your bones and scatter your ashes. I will make you beg for death, including that servant of yours and all the cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm!”","The crazed laughter of Devil Cloud Star Master echoed throughout the battlefield for a long time.","The experts from the Divine Beginning Realm camp, who were standing around the battlefield, could not help but feel terrified when they heard this.","However, Jian Wushuang, who was standing in front of Devil Cloud Star Master, suddenly shouted, “Devil Cloud Star Master, you won’t have the chance!”","His voice was so loud that it shook the entire universe.","Then, Jian Wushuang stepped on the ground and took out an object with a flip of his palm.","It was an ordinary-looking bamboo leaf.","However, the many cultivators present had amazing eyesight, so they could see the shocking power hidden in the bamboo leaf at a glance.","“What?” Devil Cloud Master was also shocked as he looked at the bamboo leaf in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","Jian Wushuang suddenly exerted force with his right hand. Under his guidance, a terrifying power that made everyone present feel suffocated suddenly rose up from the bamboo leaf.","This aura far surpassed that of a third-level Ruler, or even a fourth-level Ruler.","It was vast and mighty, like the might of the universe.","“Not good!”","Devil Cloud Star Master’s expression changed greatly, and his eyes widened to the size of copper bells.","He could feel the power rising from the bamboo leaf. This power had just risen, and it already made his heart palpitate.","As this power became more and more tyrannical, Devil Cloud Star Master became even more terrified.","“Fifth-level! This is the power of a fifth-level Ruler!” Devil Cloud Star Master’s body trembled, and a trace of fear finally appeared on his face.","Although he was a fourth-level Ruler, and because he had possessed the Divine Beginning Realm, he had comprehended a trace of the universe principles. He had even joined the Great Universe Godly Palace and obtained a principle true treasure that was suitable for him to use.","In addition, he had cultivated the secret skill of the Cosmos Temple. He believed that his life-saving ability was very good. Among the fourth-level Rulers, even if he encountered a Ruler at the peak of the fourth-level, he would not be too afraid even if he could not defeat him.","Just now, Jian Wushuang and Devil Flame had used two killing moves consecutively, which had posed a great threat to him. Devil Flame had severely injured him, but it had not truly frightened him.","But now, the power rising from the bamboo leaf had truly frightened him.","“Three killing moves!”","“The first killing move was when I used the dragon-exterminating secret skill to activate the original universe. I used the wave light sword formation and the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation to crazily attack and kill him. The purpose was to consume his divine power!”","“The second killing move was when Devil Flame’s divine body collapsed again. The most powerful move was to heavily injure him!”","“The third killer move is the real killer move that will kill him.","“This bamboo leaf was given to me by senior Wind Devil. It was personally refined by a fifth-level Ruler. It contains part of the power of a fifth-level Ruler. Under my guidance, it’s enough to kill a fourth-level Ruler in an instant. I don’t believe that you can survive this killer move even though you’ve used up more than half of your divine power and are already severely injured!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold and full of killing intent!"]},{"number":3971,"title":"Chapter 3971 - Was He Dead or Not?","paragraphs":["“No, no!” Demon Cloud Star Master was extremely shocked.","The power that rose from the bamboo leaf made his body and heart tremble.","That power gathered crazily and finally condensed into a blade.","A huge, incomparably domineering blade that could split the sky and split the earth.","It was obvious that the fifth-level master who had refined the bamboo leaf was an expert who specialized in saber principle, and his saber technique should be extremely domineering.","The saber that appeared in front of Devil Cloud Star Master now only had part of the power of the fifth-level master, but it still had the power of god-slaying and demon-slaying.","“Devil Cloud Star Master, go to Hell!”","Jian Wushuang’s killing intent soared to the sky. Above the universe void, the extremely domineering blade slashed down fiercely at Devil Cloud Star Master.","Even someone as powerful as Devil Cloud Star Master did not have the courage to resist this blade.","“It’s too powerful. If I was at my peak, I might be able to survive this blade. But in my current state, if I take this blade...I’ll die!” Devil Cloud Star Master’s eyes widened.","At this moment, he did sense an unprecedented life-and-death crisis.","This life-and-death crisis was so intense that it was the first time it had appeared since he possessed the Divine Beginning Realm and became Devil Cloud Star Master.","Without a doubt, this blade was enough to kill him.","“No, I, Devil Cloud, have just broken through to the fourth level, and I have just received the recognition of the Great Cosmos Godly Palace. I have yet to roam the universe, and I haven’t even had the time to go to the depths of the universe to take a look. How can I die like this!?”","“No!”","“I can’t die, I can’t die!”","Devil Cloud Star Master roared crazily, his voice hysterical.","His face had been completely distorted, and his eyes were bloodshot. Just as the domineering blade was about to slash down, a violent power suddenly rose from Devil Cloud Star Master’s body.","Weng weng! Devil Cloud Star Master’s entire body had become crazy at this moment.","“Soul Burning!”","“It’s soul burning!”","“Devil Cloud Star Master used soul burning?”","Many experts who were watching the battle in the void were shocked by this scene.","Even Jian Wushuang, who was guiding the saber, was stunned.","Soul Burning...under normal circumstances, when there was no chance of survival, they would burn their souls desperately to make the other party pay the price.","Once a cultivator burned his soul, he could not stop under normal circumstances until his soul was completely burned.","In other words, this method was a sure-death method.","When Jian Wushuang was in the Eternal Dark Prison, he used the keepsake of the Red Cloud Lineage to suppress many experts. Many experts, after being suppressed by him, chose to burn their souls to commit suicide because they were unwilling to submit to him.","However, what Jian Wushuang did not expect was that Devil Cloud Star Master had chosen to burn his soul at this moment.","Could it be that he thought that he would definitely die under this saber strike, so he made such a choice?","However, the domineering saber had not really slashed down, and its power had not been fully revealed. Was it not a little too early to burn his soul?","Although Jian Wushuang was puzzled, the speed and power of the domineering saber did not weaken at all.","Whoosh! Whoosh!","The saber light fought mercilessly. The entire universe void was split in half, and a huge space crack hung in the air like a Milky Way.","The saber light had completely engulfed the Devil Cloud Star Master, and its terrifying power completely covered him.","Sizzle! Sizzle! Sizzle!","The sound of divine power squeezing and colliding was heard. After a while, the power of the saber was completely exhausted and dissipated.","The universe void gradually regained its calm.","Jian Wushuang had also stopped burning his divine power and appeared at the edge of the battlefield.","Although it had only been a short time since he had attacked, he had used all his trump cards during this period of time, he had been using the dragon-killing secret skill all this time. He had also used the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation and his wave light sword formation to consume Devil Cloud Star Master’s divine power.","Although Devil Cloud Star Master’s divine power had been consumed by nearly 40%, he had also consumed a lot of his own divine power.","By now, Jian Wushuang’s aura had also weakened a lot. He had less than 50% of his divine power left, but he did not care about his state at all. Instead, he raised his head and stared at the void in front of him.","“Is Devil Cloud Star Master dead?” Jian Wushuang murmured softly.","He was not the only one. The Rulers from the Divine Beginning Realm and the Devil Cloud Star Master’s side were also staring at the void.","They were also waiting for a result.","Buzz! The remaining energy in the void completely dissipated, and the shattered universe void recovered.","After everything calmed down, a figure slowly appeared in front of everyone’s eyes.","The appearance of this figure caused all the experts in the Divine Beginning Realm to narrow their eyes.","“He’s not dead?”","“He used soul burning, but he’s still alive?”","“How is it possible? How is it possible that he’s still alive?”","“It’s impossible!”","The Rulers in the Divine Beginning Realm screamed.","Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and Heaven Ancestor were extremely excited just now. When they saw Devil Cloud Star Master burning his soul, they almost thought that Devil Cloud Star Master was dead for sure. But now, this figure appeared, they almost had a mental breakdown.","“He’s not dead yet?” Even Jian Wushuang was in disbelief at this moment.","Devil Cloud Star Master was not at the perfect level of life like himself. His soul could be recovered by divine power. When he used soul burning, he should have died.","But in the end...","“I survived. Haha! I did survive.” Devil Cloud Star Master laughed wildly.","“I have to thank the Cosmos Temple. If it wasn’t for its unique soul burning secret skill, I would have died.”","“But now...I survived. Haha! I, Devil Cloud, deserve to live. I won’t die here.”","Devil Cloud Master laughed like a madman.","Jian Wushuang fell silent after hearing Devil Cloud Master’s words.","“The hall of Yu the great? A unique soul burning secret skill?” Jian Wushuang immediately understood.","Devil Cloud Master did not die just now because he had a unique soul burning secret skill. It could burn one’s soul and produce terrifying strength in a short period of time, however, it could stop the soul burning midway to ensure that Devil Cloud Master’s soul would not be completely destroyed."]},{"number":3972,"title":"Chapter 3972 - Desperation","paragraphs":["The triple killer move was well-prepared, but it still failed to kill Devil Cloud Star Master, which made Jian Wushuang very unwilling.","Fortunately, although Devil Cloud Star Master was not dead, he suffered an unprecedented serious injury under the triple killer move. In addition, he had burned his soul crazily to resist the tyrant saber, which had destroyed more than half of his soul, now, although he was still alive, he could not be more miserable.","In the void space of the universe, although Devil Cloud Star Master’s body was still standing, his godly body was trembling slightly. The aura emitted from his body was no longer as magnificent and powerful as before, on the contrary, he gave people an extremely weak and dispirited feeling.","This kind of weakness was not faked. It was indeed extremely weak.","At this moment, Devil Cloud Master could not even use 10% of his battle strength, and he had very little divine power left.","In such a state, any third-level master could easily crush him, let alone Jian Wushuang.","“Devil Cloud Master must die!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a fierce light.","He knew very well that as long as Devil Cloud Master was alive, even if the Divine Beginning Realm Camp won the battle and Devil Cloud Master’s army was defeated, as long as Devil Cloud Master was given some time...he would be able to restore his strength to its peak, and then he would be able to lead his army to attack again.","If there was another battle, Jian Wushuang would not have the ability to defend against Devil Cloud Star Master.","It should be known that of the three killer moves that he had forced into a miserable state, only the first one was performed by himself. The purpose was to exhaust the divine power of Devil Cloud Star Master as much as possible.","However, the second killer move, the strongest attack from Devil Flame, could not be executed at all. This was because Devil Flame’s gold-swallowing divine body had already collapsed once again. How difficult would it be to repair it by twenty to thirty percent?","As for the final third killer move, the one that had truly forced Devil Flame into a desperate situation was the special treasure given by Wind Devil. There was only one treasure, and it had already been used. Naturally, it could not be used again.","In other words, if Devil Cloud Star Master came again, he would have to swallow the special blood pill and fight with him to the death.","“It was not easy to force Devil Cloud Star Master into such a situation. I must not give him a chance to make a comeback. Kill! I must kill him at all costs!” Jian Wushuang was extremely crazy, the Divine Devil Heaven Suppression Formation, which had always existed on the battlefield, had been exerting a terrifying suppressive force to suppress Devil Cloud Master.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang held the Wuqi divine sword with one hand and attacked directly.","“Oh no!”","Seeing Jian Wushuang attacking, Devil Cloud Master’s expression changed drastically.","In his current state, he could not fight Jian Wushuang head-on.","“Shi Hua, come and help me, quick!” Devil Cloud Master shouted urgently.","Shi Hua Divine Emperor, who had been standing at the edge of the battlefield, had been watching the battle. However, when he saw Jian Wushuang and Devil Flame combine forces and use the triple killer move to force Devil Flame into a desperate situation and almost kill him...he was extremely shocked.","The skills that Jian Wushuang had displayed had terrified him.","Now that he had heard Devil Cloud Master’s cry for help, he frowned but did not hesitate.","“No matter how powerful Jian Wushuang is, he is only a Principles Master. Although the successive killing moves were extremely powerful, they were probably his strongest trump card. He should not have any more powerful trump cards. Without relying on his trump cards, his battle strength is at most on par with mine. I have no reason to be afraid of him.” Shi Hua Divine Emperor was indeed on good terms with Devil Cloud Master.","Seeing that Devil Cloud Star Master was in trouble, he made his move.","However —","Demon Dragon Lord and the others, who had been watching Shi Hua Divine Emperor’s every move, saw him move! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The servants under Jian Wushuang also moved immediately.","This time, 36 servants, including Demon Dragon Lord and Devil Scorpion Lord, formed a towering battle formation.","The battle formation’s power was monstrous. Under the joint operation of 36 third-level Rulers, it exploded with terrifying strength. It rushed in front of Shi Hua Divine Emperor and stopped him.","“Damn it!”","Shi Hua Divine Emperor cursed in a low voice. He wanted to use the battle formation in front of him, but it was fine if they did not fight. The moment he did, he immediately realized the combat strength the battle formation could unleash, it had reached the level of a fourth-level Ruler.","In terms of strength and power, it was obviously stronger than him.","Although he attacked with all his strength, he could only fight the battle formation to a draw. He could not get rid of the battle formation and help Devil Cloud Star Master on the other side.","Demon Dragon Lord and the others had already received Jian Wushuang’s order. They had no intention of defeating or killing Shi Hua. They just relied on the battle formation to tangle with him, they did not give Shi Hua Divine Emperor a chance to make a move.","Shi Hua Divine Emperor was completely blocked and could not find any opportunity to make a move.","When Devil Cloud Star Master, who was frantically running for his life, saw this scene, his expression could not help changing drastically.","“What should I do? What should I do?”","Devil Cloud Star Master was screaming crazily in his heart as he thought about how to escape.","However, he was now in the suppression range of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation. Even at his peak, this formation might not be able to break, let alone now. He had almost no chance of escaping from this formation.","Shi Hua Divine Emperor, who was the only one who could save his life, was also blocked by the formation. He could not enter at all.","It seemed that he was in a real desperate situation.","He tried his best to think, but he could not find any solution.","Suddenly, Devil Cloud Star Master saw the remaining ten or so Rulers under his command outside the battlefield.","“Come and save me!”","Devil Cloud Star Master shouted.","Outside the battlefield, the ten or so Rulers from Devil Cloud Star were scared out of their wits by the servants under Jian Wushuang. They had yet to completely calm down, later, when they saw that Devil Cloud Star Master, who was invincible in their hearts, was forced into such a miserable situation and even fell into a desperate situation, they were all shocked and stunned.","It was only when they heard Devil Cloud Star Master’s stern shout that these Rulers regained their senses.","However, when they regained their senses, these Rulers looked at each other. For a moment, no one stepped forward.","“Why are you still not coming over? Are you courting death!” Devil Cloud Star Master roared once more. His explosive shout contained a shocking killing intent."]},{"number":3973,"title":"Chapter 3973 - Shocking Change!","paragraphs":["Sensing the killing intent of the Devil Cloud Star Master, the Rulers under him all trembled.","They had been under the Devil Cloud Star Master for many years, and over the years, they had developed an instinctive fear toward him.","Immediately, the two strongest divine generals amongst the ten Rulers moved.","The two divine generals were extremely fast. They flew through the void and rushed into the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation.","The Divine Beginning Realm also reacted immediately. Jian Wushuang had 41 servants, including the Devil Flame, who were all third-level experts brought back from the Eternal Dark Prison, among them, 36 formed an Immortal Dipper Battle Formation to block divine Shi Hua Divine Emperor, and the Ruler Spark was responsible for coordinating the two battlefields. However, there were still four servants left and they rushed out at once.","However, because Devil Cloud Star Master was fleeing toward the camp of Devil Cloud Star, he was closer to the two divine generals, so the two divine generals had already rushed into the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, they immediately stood in front of Jian Wushuang.","“You’re courting death!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold and filled with a shocking killing intent. He slashed out with the Wu Qi divine sword, and the obscure sword formation immediately took shape.","Before the battle began, Jian Wushuang had used the hazy sword formation to kill one of the divine generals under the command of the Devil Cloud Star Master. At that time, he had not used the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation.","Now that he had the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, it would be easy for him to kill the two divine generals even if he fought one against two.","However, no matter how easy it was, it would take some time. The Devil Cloud Star Master had used this short time to escape to the edge of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation. Meanwhile, Shi Hua Divine Emperor was fighting with the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation, he was constantly approaching Devil Cloud Star Master.","“Shi Hua, quick, faster!” Devil Cloud Star Master was burning with anxiety.","He knew that as long as he could delay Shi Hua Divine Emperor until he reached the array, he would be able to escape with Shi Hua Divine Emperor’s help.","However, Shi Hua Divine Emperor was entangled by the Immortal Gang Battle Array. Although he was approaching him, his speed was very slow.","At that moment...","“Devil Cloud Star Master.” A strange voice suddenly sounded.","In the void in front of Devil Cloud Star Master, a figure appeared out of thin air.","This figure appeared too suddenly, without any warning. There were many experts present, and Jian Wushuang had been suppressing the void with the Divine Demon Heaven Suppression Formation. However, even he...did not realize when this figure entered the formation.","“It’s the Sorcerer God!”","“It’s him?”","“When did the Sorcerer God enter the formation?”","Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the others from the Divine Beginning Realm’s camp immediately recognized the figure, but they were all shocked at the moment.","They had been paying attention to the Sorcerer God since the beginning of the war when they found him in the Ruler’s camp of the Devil Cloud planet. However, when the war broke out, the Rulers of the two camps began to fight wildly, they could no longer be bothered with the Sorcerer God. Later, the Rulers of Devil Cloud Star were defeated and only a dozen or so people managed to escape. It was clear that the Sorcerer God did not exist among the dozen or so people.","This made Daoist Xuan God and the others think that the Sorcerer God had died together with the Rulers under the command of Devil Cloud Star.","However, it now appeared that this was clearly not the case. The Sorcerer God had been using a special method to hide in the void of this universe since the very beginning. Furthermore, there were so many experts present, yet none of them had discovered his existence.","Even now, he had appeared within the array formation. If he had not taken the initiative to reveal himself, none of them would have known.","“What is this Sorcerer God trying to do?” Daoist Xuan God and the others were puzzled.","“Sorcerer God?” Even Devil Cloud Star Master was looking at the Sorcerer God who had suddenly appeared in astonishment. Even he did not know how the Sorcerer God had appeared within the array formation.","He also did not know why the Sorcerer God suddenly appeared in front of him under such circumstances.","Could it be that the Sorcerer God wanted to save him from Jian Wushuang?","Could it be possible?","“Tsk, tsk. Master Devil Cloud, as a fourth-level Ruler, you have grasped a principle true treasure and even comprehended a trace of universe principle. Even the universe temple recognized your strength and bestowed you with several secret skills. Who would have thought that you would be forced into such a sorry state by a Principles Master? You are really a disgrace to the universe temple behind you.” The Sorcerer God smiled wickedly, there was clearly a hint of mockery in his words.","“Sorcerer God, how dare you speak to me like this? Are you courting death!?” Devil Cloud Star Master’s voice was ice-cold.","Even though his current situation was extremely miserable, Devil Cloud Star Master had been in a high position all year round and had long been used to being overbearing.","As for Sorcerer God, he was merely a first-tier Ruler. In his eyes, such a Ruler was no different from an ant. If not for the fact that this Sorcerer God was of use to him previously, he would have long slapped him to death.","“Haha, Devil Cloud Star Master, you really don’t know your situation at all. Alright, let me tell you.” The Sorcerer God sneered and stopped laughing. He looked at Devil Cloud Star Master again, but he said word by word, “Devil Cloud Star Master, listen carefully. From today onwards, your divine body, your cultivation base, your Devil Cloud Star, including the Divine Beginning Realm that you have taken over, everything about you will...be mine.”","“What did you say?” Devil Cloud Star Master was shocked.","However, before Devil Cloud Star Master could react, the Sorcerer God, who was standing in front of him, had a hollow look in his eyes. His divine body started to wither. In just a blink of an eye, he had turned into a dried corpse, he fell powerlessly into the void below.","This scene shocked all the experts present. However, they immediately discovered that even though the Sorcerer God’s divine body was withering and falling, a majestic soul body was left behind. This soul body was extremely powerful, it was like a blazing flame that instantly charged toward Devil Cloud Star Master.","“This is...”","The moment he saw this spirit body charging toward him, Devil Cloud Star Master had already reacted. He had already understood what the Sorcerer God intended to do. His face was filled with shock and fury as he frantically tried to stop this spirit body.","However, this spirit body was not affected in the slightest. It directly entered Devil Cloud Star Master’s divine body.","The next moment —","“Ah!”","A hysterical roar was emitted from Devil Cloud Star Master’s mouth. Devil Cloud Star Master’s expression was as if he had gone mad. He squatted down in extreme pain.","“No! No!”","“Get out, get out!”","Mournful roars were continuously emitted from Devil Cloud Star Master’s mouth. His voice was filled with pain.","However, the further he went, the lower his voice became, and the weaker it became.","“Spare me, Sorcerer God, spare me!”","“I beg you...”","In the end, Devil Cloud Star Master’s mouth emitted terrified pleas for mercy, but his voice became lower and lower.","In the end, his voice completely disappeared, and at this moment, Devil Cloud Star Master had already calmed down once again."]},{"number":3974,"title":"Chapter 3974 - Soul-Devouring","paragraphs":["The entire universe void quieted down at this moment.","Even on the other battlefield, the Principles Master Army, which had been fighting crazily, had stopped what they were doing.","The Immortal Dipper Battle Formation formed by Jian Wushuang’s 36 slaves, which had been fighting with Shi Hua Divine Emperor, had also stopped.","As for Jian Wushuang, he had killed the two divine generals in front of him in a very short period of time. Now, he stood there and stared at the Devil Cloud Star Master.","Although Jian Wushuang was fighting with the two divine generals, he had been paying attention to the Devil Cloud Star Master. Naturally, he had seen the appearance of the Sorcerer God and the accident that happened to the Devil Cloud Star Master.","His intuition told him that something huge had happened to the Star Master, and it was the Sorcerer God who had caused all of this.","Suddenly...the calm Star Master raised his head and revealed an extremely strange smile.","“Star Master, no, this feeling, you should be...the Sorcerer God,” Jian Wushuang said coldly, his gaze extremely solemn.","“Keke, Jian Wushuang, you have good taste.” At this moment, ‘Devil Cloud Star Master’ laughed strangely, but it was obvious that the current ‘Devil Cloud Star Master’ was no longer the same person as before.","Although it was still the divine body of Devil Cloud Star Master, Jian Wushuang knew that the one controlling this divine body of Devil Cloud Star Master was the Sorcerer God.","“Possession?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","“Possession? Keke, I didn’t possess him. I just swallowed his soul,” the Sorcerer God said.","“Swallowed his soul?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Keke, if it was just possession, the soul of the Devil Cloud Star Master would be completely destroyed by me. I only controlled his divine body. As for other things, I can’t get them. However, if I directly swallow his soul, not only can I control his divine body, but I can also get his complete memory, including all the means he knows, such as the trace of the universe principle. Now, I have also mastered it, and the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm, which he controlled, is also under my control,” the Sorcerer God said with a smile.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was shocked.","After directly devouring the other party’s soul, he could obtain the other party’s memories, including many insights and techniques?","How could this be possible?","How could there be such an incredible technique in the universe.","Under normal circumstances, two different souls could not merge into one. Therefore, the so-called soul devouring...one soul wanted to devour the other soul, at most, it could devour some of the extremely pure soul origin of the other soul. However, if one soul was completely devoured, it would cause great damage to one’s soul.","Not to mention that he had to obtain the other party’s complete memory and many comprehension methods.","At least in Jian Wushuang’s opinion, it was impossible for the Sorcerer God to obtain all of the memory and comprehension methods of the Devil Cloud Star Master after devouring his soul.","However, it did not seem like the Sorcerer God was lying.","It was as if she could see the confusion in Jian Wushuang’s heart, the Sorcerer God smiled again and said, “Jian Wushuang, you were born at the edge of the universe and have not been qualified to explore the depths of the universe. You have no idea how vast the universe is and how many methods the countless cultivators in the universe have. It is indeed incredible to directly devour a cultivator’s soul and obtain their memories and comprehension methods, but for me, it is possible.”","“Of course, there are many limitations to my soul-devouring technique. For example, I’m just a Ruler, so I can’t devour even if a supreme-level soul is placed in front of me. As for Devil Cloud Star Master, I can’t devour his soul directly, but I have your help, right?”","“Jian Wushuang, I really have to thank you. If you hadn’t used so many killer moves to force Devil Cloud Star Master into such a miserable state and even caused him to burn more than half of his soul, I really wouldn’t have been able to do anything to him in my current state.”","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","He also understood that the Sorcerer God did have the ability to devour souls and thus obtain their memories and comprehension skills. However, this kind of soul devouring skill was not omnipotent.","Previously, when the Star Master’s strength was at its peak, or more accurately, when his soul was not damaged, the Sorcerer God could not do anything to the Star Master. However, because of his three-fold skill, he forced the Star Master to burn more than half of his soul, he had fallen into his weakest state, which gave the Sorcerer God the best opportunity to devour the Sorcerer God’s soul.","It could be said that he had indeed helped the Sorcerer God a great deal.","Now, the Sorcerer God not only occupied the divine body of the Sorcerer God, but also controlled everything about the Sorcerer God, including the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm.","“Sorcerer God, where did you come from?” Jian Wushuang stared at the Sorcerer God.","He did not know much about the Sorcerer God.","Not only him, but the entire Divine Beginning Realm knew very little about the Sorcerer God.","He only knew that the Sorcerer God was a Ruler from another Star Field and had come to the Divine Beginning Realm a long time ago for some unknown reason.","During the years that the Sorcerer God had been in the Divine Beginning Realm, he had founded the Sorcerer God sect, which had been secretly capturing some special life forms in the Divine Beginning Realm or cultivators from some higher-level special races.","However, no one knew the Sorcerer God’s purpose in capturing these high-level cultivators.","Previously, Jian Wushuang, including many experts from the Divine Beginning Realm, had focused all their attention on the Devil Cloud Star Master, and had neglected the Sorcerer God.","But now, the Sorcerer God had made a surprise move by devouring the soul of the Devil Cloud Star Master and controlling everything about him.","At this point, Jian Wushuang began to treat the Sorcerer God seriously. At the same time, he was curious about the Sorcerer God’s background and identity.","Jian Wushuang would not have believed the Sorcerer God if he did not have a great background.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, the Sorcerer God revealed a strange smile. “Jian Wushuang, do you really not recognize me?”","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Did the Sorcerer God mean that they had known each other before?","But he had never met the Sorcerer God.","“Does he have other identities besides the Sorcerer God?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Haha!” The Sorcerer God suddenly burst into laughter, which was full of mockery. “Jian Wushuang, didn’t I tell you that we will meet again soon?”"]},{"number":3975,"title":"Chapter 3975 - True Identity!","paragraphs":["“Jian Wushuang, didn’t I tell you that we would meet again soon?”","The Sorcerer God’s words made Jian Wushuang pale with fright.","“You are...” Jian Wushuang stared at the Sorcerer God in disbelief. A person had already appeared in his mind.","“Haha, it seems that you’ve recognized me after changing my appearance. Fine, I’ll change my appearance. You should be able to recognize me.” The Sorcerer God smiled. His body and appearance began to change at this moment.","He originally looked like Devil Cloud Star Master, but in the blink of an eye, he turned into a handsome man in a white robe with long, flowing white hair.","At first glance, the handsome man looked like a celestial being.","However, after seeing the handsome man, Jian Wushuang could no longer calm down.","Not only him, but his servants also widened their eyes and looked at the handsome man in disbelief.","They were all experts who had come out of the Eternal Dark Prison. As one of the ten kings of the Eternal Dark Prison and the number one evil demon in the Eternal Dark Prison, how could they not know him?","“Star Demon Ancestor, he’s Star Demon Ancestor!”","“That’s impossible. Star Demon Ancestor is already dead. I saw him burn his soul and die in front of my master. After his death, those who were turned into livestock and animals immediately recovered.”","“W-what’s going on? Why would Star Demon Ancestor, who is already dead, appear here?”","“No, he can’t be Star Demon Ancestor. I’ve seen him before. Even his soul aura is different. He just looks the same.”","The servants under Jian Wushuang were completely shocked.","This was normal. After all, Star Demon Ancestor was a super existence that had terrified them for a long time.","How could they accept such a super existence appearing in front of them and devouring the soul of Devil Cloud Star Master?","Even Jian Wushuang could not believe it.","“You’re Star Demon Ancestor. It’s impossible. Your soul aura is obviously different from Star Demon Ancestor,” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice.","“Soul aura?” The Sorcerer God smiled. “Jian Wushuang, you’ve been in the Eternal Dark Prison for a while. Don’t you know what I’m good at?","“I’m good at all kinds of methods. Of course, I have such methods to change my soul aura. If I want to, I can change it back.”","With that, the soul aura emitted by the Sorcerer God began to change. Soon, it was the same as when Jian Wushuang met Star Demon Ancestor in the Eternal Dark Prison.","It was not until this moment that Jian Wushuang truly believed that the person in front of him was really Star Demon Ancestor.","The Sorcerer God, who had stayed in the Divine Beginning Realm for a long time and had been searching for a high-life-level cultivator, was actually Star Demon Ancestor in the Eternal Dark Prison!","This meant that Star Demon Ancestor had actually escaped from the Eternal Dark Prison many years ago. As for who Star Demon Ancestor was, Jian Wushuang could not guess.","“Jian Wushuang, you should be very confused now.” The Sorcerer God, who was Star Demon Ancestor, looked at Jian Wushuang with interest. “Since there’s no hurry, I’ll dispel your doubts.”","“I am indeed Star Demon Ancestor. You don’t have to doubt that. As for the Sorcerer God, it’s just a temporary name I used after escaping from the Eternal Dark Prison.”","Star Demon Ancestor began to slowly explain.","“This matter has to start from the Eternal Darkness Prison.”","“The Eternal Darkness Prison is the place that the Red Cloud Lineage used to imprison prisoners. Although the vast majority of them are the sinners who committed heinous crimes in the Red Cloud Divine Empire, there are also a portion of them who were imprisoned for some special reasons. For example, I was imprisoned by the Red Cloud Lineage because I possessed that extremely special power.”","“Over the course of countless years, the redcloud lineage wanted to know the source of this power from me. Unfortunately, they were unable to obtain an answer from me. Eventually, the redcloud lineage was destroyed...”","He paused, Star Demon Ancestor continued, “Originally, I was imprisoned within the redcloud lineage and did not know that the redcloud lineage had been destroyed. However, hundreds of chaos cycles ago, the eternal prison suffered an intense bombardment that caused the eternal prison to tremble. After that, the cultivators of the redcloud lineage did not enter the eternal prison, nor did they imprison any other prisoners.”","“That’s why I’ve come to the conclusion that the Red Cloud Lineage has been destroyed. The impact on the eternal prison must have been caused by the destruction of the Red Cloud Lineage.”","“The Red Cloud Lineage has been completely destroyed, but no one has paid attention to the eternal prison for so long. I guessed that the eternal prison must have been lost. A lost prison? Who knows how long it will take for a prisoner like me to see the light of day again? I don’t want to wait that long. That’s why I’ve been searching for a way to leave the eternal prison since a long time ago.”","“I spent dozens of chaos cycles exploring every corner of the first level of Eternal Dark Prison to find a way out. Finally, when I passed by a dark area in the Demon Dragon Field, I found a gap in the Eternal Dark Prison formation.”","“The gap is very small. If I’m not mistaken, it must have been caused by the intense attack on Eternal Dark Prison when the Red Cloud bloodline was destroyed. The appearance of this gap gave me an opportunity to leave Eternal Dark Prison.”","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","There was indeed a gap in the Eternal Dark Prison, and Jian Wushuang knew it very well.","However, this gap was very small. Under normal circumstances, it was impossible to find it. Even if he found it, it would still be very difficult to escape from the gap. However, Star Demon Ancestor...","“From that day on, I began to study how to use this gap to leave the Eternal Dark Prison,” Star Demon Ancestor continued to explain, “this research took dozens of chaos cycles before I was able to barely find a way out. The most important aspect of this path is that it is impossible for a divine body to pass through. One can only use a soul body to pass through. No one has ever tried this path before. No one knows if they will be able to successfully leave or if they will die on the way.”","“I dare not gamble!”","“Therefore, I can only try again and again.” Star Demon Ancestor said."]},{"number":3976,"title":"Chapter 3976 - Cause and Effect","paragraphs":["“Try?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He could only try with his soul, but the soul was the foundation of a cultivator. Star Demon Ancestor was not a perfect life like him, so how could he try with his soul?","If he was not careful, Star Demon Ancestor’s soul would collapse and he would die.","“If it were an ordinary cultivator, an ordinary soul body would not be able to attempt it. However, I am different. My soul body is born with the ability to split. I can split my soul into two. One will remain in my main body while the other will attempt it according to that path. In the end, the split soul will be annihilated not long after I attempt it.”","“As soon as the soul was destroyed, my main body’s soul immediately sensed it, and the memory of that soul also returned to my main body. Although I lost a part of my soul, I have accumulated some experience. It only takes a certain amount of time for me to recover and divide again.”","“In this way, I tried hundreds of times over the long period of dozens of chaos cycles. Finally, I succeeded! The soul that I divided escaped from the Eternal Dark Prison.” Star Demon Ancestor smiled.","Jian Wushuang remained silent.","He did not expect Star Demon to have such a special ability. He could split his soul into two. Even if one of the two was destroyed, his memory would immediately return to his original body.","With this ability, Star Demon had tried hundreds of times in the Eternal Dark Prison, but he still succeeded.","Of course, Star Demon Ancestor was not lucky to escape. He had worked hard for hundreds of chaos cycles, tried again and again after his soul split, and tried again and again to repair his soul.","If it were anyone else, even if they found the gap, they would not be able to escape from the Eternal Dark Prison.","Jian Wushuang sighed and continued to listen to Star Demon Ancestor’s story.","“After my split soul escaped from the Eternal Dark Prison, it came to this Star Field. Then, I directly possessed a Principles Master and roamed this Star Field for a period of time. After having a sufficient understanding of this Star Field, my split soul directly used burning annihilation,” Star Demon Ancestor said.","“Burning soul?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","The split soul had already escaped, so why did he choose Soul Burn.","“Keke!” Star Demon Ancestor laughed strangely, “I can’t help it. The split soul that I used to escape only took 20% of my original soul, and there was no treasure in my hand. Naturally, I won’t let this soul replace my original body. Therefore, after the split soul was destroyed and my memory returned to my original body, I began to prepare.”","“This time, I’ve prepared well. I’ve restored my soul to its peak condition. However, there are always exceptions. I don’t dare to bet everything on this. That’s why I’ve divided my soul into ten percent and left it on my divine body. My core soul body has abandoned my divine body and brought my treasures to enter that path.”","“I was right to be cautious. Although I had tried hundreds of times and had a chance to succeed, the danger in the last passage was too great. Even though my soul body was careful, it still encountered a disaster in the passage. As a result, many of my treasures were lost in the spatial turbulence, and my soul body was severely injured even though it escaped.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted.","No wonder he did not get any valuable treasures from Star Demon Ancestor after killing him in the Eternal Dark Prison.","It turned out that Star Demon Ancestor, whom he met in the Eternal Dark Prison, was only a split soul with a divine body. As for the treasures, they were all taken away by his original soul body, and when he escaped from the Eternal Dark Prison...all of these treasures had been lost.","“Those lost treasures are still fine. Although there are a few principle true treasures and a few extremely precious items, as long as I can escape, I will have many opportunities to obtain treasures again in the future. However, the crux of the matter is that my soul body was severely injured. This is my original soul body, not a split soul body. The price of such a severe injury to my soul back then was very difficult for me to bear.”","“More importantly, this Star Field is located at the very edge of the universe. It is lacking in resources, and the quality of its cultivators is pitifully low. My soul has suffered such a severe injury, and I am unable to recover for a time. First, I possessed a Principles Master, and then I possessed a Ruler who had rushed over from another Star Field. This Ruler is the Sorcerer God.”","“Later on, I used my identity as the Sorcerer God to temporarily stay in this Star Field. At the same time, I was looking for an opportunity to recover my soul. However, with such scarce resources, even after spending millions or even tens of millions of years, my soul has only recovered a tiny bit. I know that it’s impossible to recover my soul with normal means, so I can only think of ways to devour other people’s souls!”","“You can recover your soul by devouring it.” Star Demon Ancestor’s eyes were shining with a fierce light.","Jian Wushuang stared at Star Demon Ancestor. On the battlefield, many experts from both sides were also looking at Star Demon Ancestor. No one came forward to interrupt him.","“In fact, devouring other people’s souls to recover and even improve my own soul is my best skill. In the Eternal Dark Prison, I used to devour the souls of prisoners to recover. But unlike the Eternal Dark Prison, the level of cultivators in this star area is too low. There are very few first-level masters and most of them are just Principles Masters.”","“The soul of a Ruler of principles probably requires thousands or even tens of thousands of souls to be comparable to the soul of a third-level Ruler of Eternal Darkness Prison. This is far from enough for me, who has suffered severe soul injuries. Therefore, I turned my gaze to those high-level lifeforms, especially the special lifeforms.” Star Demon ancestor smiled.","“Those high-level races, lifeforms, and even special lifeforms have souls that are completely different from ordinary human cultivators. To me, devouring the soul and divine body of a high-level lifeform is more useful than devouring the souls of hundreds of Ruler of principles. and devouring a special lifeform is comparable to devouring a second-or even third-level Ruler.”"]},{"number":3977,"title":"Chapter 3977 - Soul Extraction","paragraphs":["“Is this the reason why you controlled the Sorcerer God sect and captured special life forms and cultivators from special races?” Jian Wushuang stared at Star Demon Ancestor, then he asked, “I’m curious. Since it’s so difficult for you to recover your soul in this Star Field, why didn’t you choose to go to other Star Fields?”","“Haha, other Star Fields?” Star Demon Ancestor laughed, “First of all, the void of the universe is filled with endless dangers. Not to mention other things, just the large number of space pirates who roam the void of the universe all year round is a big problem. If my strength was at its peak, it wouldn’t be a problem for me to go to other Star Fields. However, the key point is that my soul is severely injured and I don’t have much strength left. Under such circumstances, if I go to other Star Fields alone, I might die if I’m not careful. The risk is too great.”","“Of course, the most important point is that I know about the existence of the Divine Beginning Realm. I also know that Devil Cloud Star Master has already taken over the Divine Beginning Realm. From that moment on, I’ve already started to plot against this Devil Cloud Star Master.”","“I first took the initiative to find this Devil Cloud Star Master and told him how to use the Divine Beginning Realm’s value to the extreme at the fastest speed. After Devil Cloud Star Master heard this, he was indeed moved. After all, he also hopes that his power can increase at the fastest speed.”","“Thus, I came to the Divine Beginning Realm and joined hands with the three great holy realms to start setting up. However, Devil Cloud Star Master didn’t know that the method I proposed could indeed squeeze out the potential of the Divine Beginning Realm in the shortest time. However, the one who benefited in the end wasn’t him, but me.”","“If everything goes according to the plan, after the plan is completed, I can borrow the power of the Divine Beginning Realm to recover my soul power completely. In fact, it will be even stronger than before. Unfortunately, because of your appearance, the three holy realms were destroyed. Even I can’t stay in the Divine Beginning Realm anymore. Thus, Devil Cloud Star Master had to come personally. As for my previous plan, I can only change it.”","“However, I never expected that you would seriously injure Devil Cloud Star Master in this battle. You even forced him into a desperate situation, forcing him to burn more than half of his soul. This simply created a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity for me.”","“I knew that I couldn’t wait any longer, so i directly attacked and devoured Devil Cloud Star Master’s soul until now...”","“Jian Wushuang, I really have to thank you. If you hadn’t forced the Star Master into such a miserable state, I don’t know when my plan would have been realized. But now, there’s no need. There’s no need for anything. After devouring the soul of the Star Master, my soul has already recovered by more than half. It’s much easier to recover the rest.” Star Demon Ancestor laughed heartily.","After hearing Star Demon’s words, Jian Wushuang’s eyes darkened.","He completely understood in his heart that Star Demon progenitor had actually started plotting against Devil Cloud Star Master a long time ago, what was laughable was that the Star Master actually thought that the plan put forward by the Star Demon Ancestor was to make him better display the value of the Divine Beginning Realm.","What he did not know was that all the efforts of the Star Devil Cloud Star Master had been in vain for Star Demon progenitor. Up until now, even his soul, his divine body, and everything he had...it’s all been taken from us by this Star Demon.","“Star Demon Ancestor, you’ve calculated for a long time and have successfully occupied everything of the Star Master. But there’s one thing you’ve forgotten,” Jian Wushuang suddenly said.","“Forgot what?” Star Demon Elder ancestor looked over.","“Have you forgotten the condition of the Star Master? He was severely injured before you devoured his soul. I’m afraid he won’t be able to use 10% of his strength. Although you’ve taken over his divine body again, how much of his strength can you use at his peak?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. “I don’t care if you’re the Sorcerer God, Star Demon Ancestor, or Devil Cloud Star Master. As long as I kill you here, everything will be over.”","Jian Wushuang’s killing intent surged, and the Wuqi divine sword in his hand trembled slightly. A shocking murderous aura swept out.","“Keke, you want to kill me?” Star Demon Ancestor looked at Jian Wushuang with interest. “Jian Wushuang, in the Eternal Dark Prison, what you saw was just a divine body controlled by my soul. At that time, you had the token of the Red Cloud Lineage, so you were invincible. No matter how powerful I am, it’s useless. But today, I’ll show you my real skills.”","As soon as Star Demon Ancestor finished his words, he moved.","Without any warning, Star Demon Ancestor appeared in a cosmic void outside the array formation. He was not far behind Shi Hua Divine Emperor. His speed was so fast that it was as though he had teleported.","Star Demon Ancestor stared at Shi Hua Divine Emperor in front of him as a hint of fanaticism flashed in his eyes. Following that, whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Chains that were transparent and emitted a special aura burst out from Star Demon Ancestor’s body. These chains were soul chains. There were nine of them, and each of them contained a rich soul aura.","The nine chains covered Shi Hua Divine Emperor at the fastest speed.","“What?” Shi Hua Divine Emperor was shocked.","He did not expect that Star Demon Ancestor would not only attack suddenly, but also target him.","It was Jian Wushuang who wanted to kill him, but Star Demon Ancestor attacked him at the first moment?","“Humph!” Shi Hua Divine Emperor snorted. After all, he was a fourth-level Ruler and was not weak. He wanted to destroy the nine souls at the first moment.","Then, the nine soul chains that burst out from Star Demon Ancestor’s body were not affected by the material attacks. They even passed through the material attacks and covered Shi Hua Divine Emperor’s divine body in the blink of an eye.","Shi Hua Divine Emperor wanted to struggle, but the moment the nine soul chains touched his divine body, his body trembled and a hint of horror appeared in his eyes.","Immediately following that, many experts in the surrounding battlefield could see that Shi Hua Divine Emperor’s soul body had been forcefully pulled out of his divine body by the nine soul chains.","The nine soul chains completely bound Shi Hua Divine Emperor’s soul body before rushing in the direction of Star Demon Ancestor.","As for Star Demon Ancestor, he opened his mouth and a gigantic black vortex appeared instantly.","“No!”","Shi Hua Divine Emperor let out a hysterical roar. However, under the restraints of the nine soul chains, he did not have any room to struggle. In the blink of an eye, he had already fallen into the black vortex, he was mercilessly devoured by the black vortex.","Furthermore, after devouring Shi Hua Divine Emperor’s soul, Shi Hua Divine Emperor’s divine body rushed toward the black vortex. Similarly, he was devoured by the black vortex."]},{"number":3978,"title":"Chapter 3978 - Escaping Back to the Divine Beginning Realm","paragraphs":["Silence!","The entire universe void was silent, so quiet that one could hear a pin drop.","In the depths of the universe void, regardless of whether it was the experts from the Divine Beginning Realm Camp or the Devil Cloud Star camp, their eyes were wide open as they looked at the scene in front of them in disbelief.","Shi Hua Divine Emperor was a genuine fourth-level Ruler. At the edge of the universe, such a Ruler could easily become a second-level Star Master. Although there were many experts present...except for Jian Wushuang, only the Immortal Dipper Battle Formation formed by the 36 slaves of the Divine Beginning Realm could contend with Shi Hua Divine Emperor.","However, such an extremely powerful Ruler was devoured by Star Demon Ancestor’s soul and divine body in an instant.","There was no room for struggle. Shi Hua Divine Emperor did not even have time to resist before he became Star Demon Ancestor’s food.","“This...” Jian Wushuang looked at the scene in front of him in astonishment.","After devouring Shi Hua Divine Emperor’s soul and body, the black vortex dissipated and Star Demon Ancestor reappeared.","However, Jian Wushuang could clearly sense that Star Demon Ancestor’s aura, including his soul aura, was much stronger than before.","“His injuries have recovered a lot?” Jian Wushuang was shocked. “He relied on devouring Shi Hua Divine Emperor’s soul and divine body to recover his soul and divine body?”","Jian Wushuang was immediately shocked and angry.","Star Demon Ancestor had said that he could rely on devouring other people’s souls to recover and improve his own soul. However, what Jian Wushuang did not know was that Star Demon Ancestor could also devour other people’s divine bodies, to recover his divine body.","Yes, Star Demon Ancestor had occupied the divine body of Devil Cloud Star Master. This divine body was too heavily injured and had little divine power left. It could not exert any battle strength. However, after devouring Shi Hua Divine Emperor’s divine body and soul...Star Demon Ancestor’s divine body instantly recovered a lot, and even his divine power had recovered about 20% .","“Hehehe...”","Star Demon Ancestor let out a wanton and strange laugh. After devouring Shi Hua Divine Emperor’s soul and divine body, he looked at the 36 experts who formed the immortal gang battle formation in front of him.","These 36 slaves of Jian Wushuang had been entangled with Shi Hua Divine Emperor in the immortal gang battle formation. They were the closest to Shi Hua Divine Emperor. After Star Demon Ancestor devoured Shi Hua Divine Emperor...he naturally began to pay attention to them again.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The transparent soul chains extended again. Each one of them was extremely fast and unstoppable.","Even Shi Hua Divine Emperor could not stop these souls directly. Jian Wushuang’s slaves could not stop them, even if they relied on the power of the battle formation.","The nine giant soul chains extended directly into the battle formation and almost instantly touched the nine slaves in the battle formation.","Although the nine slaves were all third-level masters and the strongest experts in the Eternal Dark Prison, they had no room to struggle in front of the soul chains.","In an instant, the nine souls were pulled out and charged at Star Demon Ancestor uncontrollably. In an instant, they were mercilessly devoured by Star Demon Ancestor.","“Heavens!”","“What kind of technique is this? Be it a third-level Ruler or a fourth-level Ruler, they do not have any room to struggle?”","“Run, run quickly, or they will all be devoured by Star Demon Ancestor.”","After nine experts were devoured by Star Demon Ancestor, the remaining slaves all panicked and immediately ran away as fast as they could.","“Run, everyone stay away from Star Demon Ancestor,” Jian Wushuang shouted. He spread the huge wings on his back and tried to reach Star Demon Ancestor as fast as he could, he wanted to stop Star Demon Ancestor.","However...Star Demon Ancestor knew that Jian Wushuang was a perfect being and that his soul was invincible.","The soul extraction technique that he was using was useful for third-level and fourth-level masters, but it was useless against Jian Wushuang.","Since his divine body had not fully recovered, he did not want to waste any more time on Jian Wushuang.","Star Demon Ancestor moved in a strange way, as if he had teleported through the universe void. In the blink of an eye, he arrived among the remaining masters on Devil Cloud Star.","Then, soul chains flew out, and the masters under Devil Cloud Star immediately became his food.","He followed Star Demon Ancestor to other places and appeared in one corner after another. The soul chains extended and devoured the souls and bodies of the experts. No one could stop him.","Even Jian Wushuang could only watch helplessly.","In the blink of an eye, Star Demon Ancestor had devoured more than 1,000 cultivators, including many Principles Masters. He had also devoured more than a dozen of Jian Wushuang’s slaves, Star Demon Ancestor had also devoured many of the Rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm.","“Run! Run toward the Divine Beginning Realm!”","“Quick! As long as we run back to the Divine Beginning Realm, Star Demon Ancestor won’t be able to do anything to us.”","“Don’t gather together! Run separately!”","The high-level experts of the Divine Beginning Realm roared desperately. Jian Wushuang did not chase after Star Demon Ancestor anymore. Instead, he helped the experts of the Divine Beginning Realm run as fast as possible.","Fortunately, the battlefield they had chosen before was in the universe void around the Divine Beginning Realm, leaving a way for their camp to retreat. Now that they had met Star Demon Ancestor, they could escape back to the Divine Beginning Realm as fast as possible, otherwise, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Even so, there were still many experts whose souls and divine bodies had been devoured by Star Demon Ancestor.","The vast universe void was originally filled with countless cultivators, but now, it was empty. Only Star Demon Ancestor was left standing there. As for the many experts from the Divine Beginning Realm’s camp and Devil Cloud Star’s camp...besides those who had been devoured, most of them had fled to the Divine Beginning Realm. There were also a few who had fled to other places.","The Divine Beginning Realm was close to the edge of the universe void.","Many top experts from the Divine Beginning Realm camp had gathered there, but their expressions were extremely unsightly at the moment.","“How are the losses?” Jian Wushuang looked at Ruler Spark beside him and asked in a low voice.","“It’s very tragic. Out of master’s 41 slaves, only 25 are alive, and nearly half have died. As for the Divine Beginning Realm camp’s Rulers, more than ten have died. As for the Principles Masters, they are still fine. Only a few hundred have been devoured,” Ruler Spark said."]},{"number":3979,"title":"Chapter 3979 - Devouring","paragraphs":["The main reason why so many of Jian Wushuang’s slaves died was that they were very close to Star Demon Ancestor. Moreover, those slaves were all third-level masters, so they were more attractive to Star Demon Ancestor.","As for the Masters in the Divine Beginning Realm camp, they were much further away from Star Demon Ancestor, but even so, they were still devoured by more than a dozen.","On the other hand, although hundreds of Principles Masters were devoured, in the eyes of the high-level experts of the Divine Beginning Realm, these hundreds of Principles Masters were far less important than those Rulers, after all, there were 700,000 Principles Masters in the Divine Beginning Realm alone.","“Fortunately, although Star Demon Ancestor’s methods are heaven-defying, he probably doesn’t dare to directly enter the inner part of the Divine Beginning Realm,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","In the universe void, only Star Demon Ancestor was still standing there alone.","He was standing outside the Divine Beginning Realm and could sense Jian Wushuang and the others who were at the edge of the Divine Beginning Realm. However, as Jian Wushuang had said, his original body did not dare to enter the Divine Beginning Realm.","Once he entered the Divine Beginning Realm, even though he had replaced Devil Cloud Star Master to control the power of the divine will of the Divine Beginning Realm, he would still be restricted by the universe principles, but the restrictions were not as great.","“Keke, you all chose to hide in the Divine Beginning Realm?” Star Demon Ancestor’s strange laughter rang out again, “It’s fine if it’s others, but Jian Wushuang, you’re a cultivator at the level of perfect life. You’re invincible in the aspect of the soul. You don’t dare to face me directly. Are you afraid that I’ll extract your soul and eat it?”","Jian Wushuang stood at the edge of the Divine Beginning Realm and could clearly hear Star Demon Ancestor’s words. His face sank slightly and he clenched his hands tightly.","“My young friend, don’t be rash. Star Demon Ancestor’s methods are strange and unpredictable. Although he has just displayed some soul techniques, he has swallowed so many experts and has recovered a lot of his strength. It’s hard to say whether his current battle strength is comparable to that of Devil Cloud Star Master or stronger. If you go out now, you may very well fall into his trap,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“Yes, it’s obvious that Star Demon Ancestor is trying to provoke you to leave, master,” said Ruler Spark.","“My young friend, you are the hope of the Divine Beginning Realm. Only when you break through to become a Ruler and take over the Divine Beginning Realm will we be able to escape from the crisis. Now, although we are forced to flee back to the Divine Beginning Realm, it doesn’t matter. No matter how strong Star Demon Ancestor is, he is only one person. Moreover, his original body doesn’t dare to enter the Divine Beginning Realm. Naturally, he can’t do anything to us. However, if you are angered by him and run out to fight him to the death, and accidentally get killed by him, the Divine Beginning Realm will really be finished,” Temporal Temple Master said solemnly.","“Husband.” Leng Rushuang also looked over.","“I know what you’re talking about.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and slowly relaxed his hands. “Don’t worry, I’m not stupid. I Won’t fall for such a simple provocation. Moreover, the army under Devil Cloud Star has been completely defeated. Star Demon Ancestor alone is not a big threat to the Divine Beginning Realm.”","From the beginning, the expected outcome of the battle in the Divine Beginning Realm was to defeat the army under Devil Cloud Star so that they could not enter the Divine Beginning Realm, this was a victory that they could accept.","Now that the Devil Cloud Star Army had been defeated, Devil Cloud Star Master was the only one left. Even if he controlled the Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm, he could not do anything in the Divine Beginning Realm without any help, he should not be able to do anything to the Divine Beginning Realm.","At this time, Jian Wushuang was not stupid enough to take the risk.","In the universe void, there was no reply from the Divine Beginning Realm after Star Demon Ancestor finished his words. He could not help but raise his eyebrows, “Tsk, tsk, it seems that you really don’t plan to come out. You plan to hide in the Divine Beginning Realm all the time. Fine, you can keep hiding like this. However, you can only live for ten more years.”","“Another ten years?”","Many experts in the Divine Beginning Realm were shocked when they heard this.","“What does Star Demon Ancestor mean?”","“Another ten years? Could it be that after ten years, we will all die?”","“Impossible. The Divine Beginning Realm is a star world. Star Demon Ancestor is alone. Even if he had two guts, he wouldn’t dare to attack us. How could he kill us?”","Many experts from the Divine Beginning Realm’s camp sneered at Star Demon’s words.","However, Jian Wushuang’s expression was very serious. He vaguely felt that Star Demon’s words did not seem to scare them.","“Jian Wushuang, do you really think that I can’t do anything to you as long as you hide in the Divine Beginning Realm? Haha, what a joke. You’re underestimating me too much.” Star Demon sneered, “I’m not Devil Cloud Star Master. Even if he takes over the Divine Beginning Realm and controls the power of the Heavenly Dao will, he can only slowly benefit from the evolution of the Divine Beginning Realm. But I’m different!”","“My most powerful technique is devouring. I can devour the soul of a cultivator, the divine body of a cultivator, and many natural treasures and even supreme treasures. Similarly, when I replace Devil Cloud Star Master and occupy the Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm, I can also devour the entire Divine Beginning Realm!”","“What?”","In the Divine Beginning Realm, many experts near the universe void were shocked by Star Demon’s words.","“Swallow the Divine Beginning Realm?” Jian Wushuang could not help but widen his eyes.","“Impossible, how is this possible?”","“Star Demon can swallow a star world? What a joke!”","“It’s fake. Star Demon must be lying to us. He just wants us to go out and die.”","“Right, Blood Sword Master, don’t fall for it!”","Many Rulers in the Divine Beginning Realm Camp spoke one after another.","No one believed Star Demon Ancestor’s words. “Directly swallow an astral world?”","“Are you kidding me? Who in the universe can swallow an astral world directly?”","Jian Wushuang was also full of doubts.","But Star Demon Ancestor soon spoke again, “I know you won’t believe it, but it doesn’t matter. You’ll believe it soon.”","Star Demon Ancestor did not say anything else. Instead, he directly arrived at the boundary between the Divine Beginning Realm and the void space. The corner of his mouth curled slightly before a huge, boundless black vortex appeared out of thin air.","This black vortex had a diameter of less than dozens of meters at the start, but as it continued to rotate, in the blink of an eye, it expanded to hundreds of meters, one kilometer, one hundred kilometers, ten thousand kilometers, one million kilometers!"]},{"number":3980,"title":"Chapter 3980 - The Last Hope","paragraphs":["Rumble!","The huge black vortex, which had a diameter of more than ten million miles, spun crazily and exploded with an incredible devouring power. This devouring power directly affected the Divine Beginning Realm.","Immediately, many experts in the Divine Beginning Realm, including Jian Wushuang and the others, could clearly sense that the vitality of the Divine Beginning Realm was fading away.","It was not a short-term loss, but a continuous flow of the devouring power of the Black Vortex.","The experts in the Divine Beginning Realm camp were stunned by this scene.","“He, he is really devouring the Divine Beginning Realm?”","“The life force of the entire Divine Beginning Realm is being devoured at a very fast speed.”","“Impossible. How could this be?”","The experts who had previously scoffed at Star Demon Ancestor’s claim of devouring the Divine Beginning Realm were now completely stunned.","None of them had expected that Star Demon Ancestor would actually be able to devour an entire astral world just as he had said.","“The life force is being devoured too quickly. If this rate of devouring continues, in ten years at most, the life force of the Divine Beginning Realm, as well as everything in the Divine Beginning Realm, will be completely devoured by Star Demon Ancestor.” Daoist Xuan God’s expression was extremely ugly. “A disaster! This is the biggest disaster in our Divine Beginning Realm!”","Even Devil Cloud Star Master had only wanted to speed up the evolution of the Divine Beginning Realm, so that it could end its lifespan as quickly as possible.","But now, Star Demon Ancestor wanted to devour the entire Divine Beginning Realm, making it his food. This was naturally an unprecedented disaster for the Divine Beginning Realm.","“It’s over, our Divine Beginning Realm is finished!”","“There’s nothing we can do. There’s nothing we can do. We can only watch as Star Demon Ancestor devours the Divine Beginning Realm.”","“We’ve done everything we can, but in the end, we still can’t change the ending of the Divine Beginning Realm’s destruction?”","Many cultivators who originally belonged to the Divine Beginning Realm began to wail in grief.","They had prepared too much for this battle. They thought that the Divine Beginning Realm would be spared once the Devil Cloud Star Army was defeated. Unexpectedly, Star Demon Ancestor’s sudden appearance...instead, the Divine Beginning Realm was plunged into an even greater disaster.","Moreover, this disaster was almost impossible to reverse.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was also clenching his hands. He looked up at the Black Vortex in the universe void, which had a diameter of more than ten million miles. His body was also trembling slightly.","“Husband.”","Leng Rushuang looked over with a smile on her face. “You’ve tried your best. You Don’t have to blame yourself for the ending.”","“Yes.” Daoist Xuan God nodded slightly. “You’ve tried your best. However, no one expected the appearance of Star Demon Ancestor. It seems that the Divine Beginning Realm is doomed to suffer this disaster. My young friend, you have extraordinary talent and unlimited potential. There’s no need for you to stay in the Divine Beginning Realm like us. If possible, you can take your wife and leave.”","“Leave?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Daoist Xuan God and asked, “What about you?”","“We are different from you. We have lived for a long time and have reached the end of our cultivation journey. Even if we are given the opportunity to venture into the depths of the universe, I’m afraid we won’t be able to make any progress. Therefore, we might as well stay in the Divine Beginning Realm and live and die with it,” Daoist Xuan God said with a smile.","“Haha, the mysterious God is right. Our potential has long been exhausted. We are lucky to have been able to live until now. However, my young friend Heavenly Marquis, if you venture into the depths of the universe, you will be able to achieve even greater achievements. In fact, you might even become a paragon in the future. At that time, you can take revenge for our Divine Beginning Realm and kill Star Demon Ancestor. We will have no regrets.” Temporal Temple Master smiled.","In the face of disaster, the local Rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm looked indifferent.","They did not care about their own lives, but they were still full of expectations for Jian Wushuang.","After all, Jian Wushuang’s talent and potential were too incredible. In their eyes, it was because they had been dragging Jian Wushuang down that he had not ventured into the depths of the universe.","Now, if the Divine Beginning Realm was really destroyed and all of them died, it might be a relief for Jian Wushuang.","Daoist Xuan God and Temporal Temple Master all thought so.","However, Jian Wushuang did not think so.","The Divine Beginning Realm was his hometown, a place that his Master Xuan Yi had risked his life to protect. As the second perfect life-level cultivator in the Divine Beginning Realm, his mission was born, it was to protect the Divine Beginning Realm.","Although it seemed that it was inevitable that the Divine Beginning Realm would be devoured, Jian Wushuang was not too pessimistic. He was still thinking of countermeasures.","“Is there really no way?” Jian Wushuang frowned, but his hands were tightly clenched. “No, there is still a glimmer of hope!”","Jian Wushuang flipped his right hand, and a scarlet elixir suddenly appeared in his hand.","This elixir was one of the special treasures that Wind Devil had given him in that special space.","Wind Devil had given him two treasures, one of which was the bamboo leaf, which had been used against Devil Cloud Star Master. The power of the bamboo leaf did not disappoint him, and it contained part of the power of a fifth-level Ruler, it had forced Devil Cloud Star Master into a desperate situation. If he did not know a special method to burn one’s soul, he would have died.","As for the bamboo leaf, Jian Wushuang only needed to guide it with his own divine power to unleash its power. However, the blood-red elixir was different.","According to Wind Devil, the blood-red elixir was not a trivial matter. Although it could allow him to unleash greater strength in a short period of time, the price was extremely high. He might even die.","It was precisely because the price was too high that Jian Wushuang had been holding back. He had treated the scarlet elixir as his strongest trump card and had never used it.","But now... with disaster looming, when he could not stop Star Demon Ancestor with all his trump cards, Jian Wushuang could only place all his hopes on the Scarlet Elixir.","“My young friend, what is this elixir in your hand?” Daoist Xuan God looked at the elixir in Jian Wushuang’s hand in surprise and felt that it was extraordinary.","“I don’t know what exactly it is, but this elixir will be the last hope of the Divine Beginning Realm!”","Jian Wushuang held the blood-red elixir in his hands tightly, but a fierce light surged in his eyes."]},{"number":3981,"title":"Chapter 3981 - Take the Blood Pill","paragraphs":["“Your last hope?”","Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and many experts from the Divine Beginning Realm looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Shuang ‘er.”","Jian Wushuang looked at his wife tenderly and smiled faintly. “I really want to walk with you to the end of time and explore every corner of the universe, but...I’m sorry.”","“Husband.” Leng Rushuang’s eyes immediately became wet. Looking at the blood pill and Jian Wushuang’s words, she vaguely guessed something. She smiled faintly. “I’ve been very satisfied these years. Don’t worry about me. If you die, I won’t live one day longer than you.”","Jian Wushuang was stunned. He took a deep look at his wife. He could see the determination in his eyes.","He nodded and rushed toward the universe void.","In the Divine Beginning Realm camp, many cultivators were almost in despair. Suddenly, they saw the figure flying toward the universe void.","“It’s Blood Sword Master!”","“Blood Sword Master, are you going to fight with Star Demon Ancestor?”","For some reason, when they saw Jian Wushuang flying out, the cultivators who had been in despair suddenly had a glimmer of hope in their hearts.","Yes, Jian Wushuang was their only hope.","“Star Demon Ancestor!”","A loud shout exploded in the universe void. Jian Wushuang had already left the Divine Beginning Realm and returned to the universe void.","Previously, because the Devil Cloud Star Army had been defeated and only Star Demon Ancestor was left, everyone thought that Star Demon Ancestor could not really threaten the Divine Beginning Realm by himself. Therefore, Jian Wushuang did not need to take the risk.","But now that he knew that Ruler Star Demon could directly devour the Divine Beginning Realm within ten years, Jian Wushuang had no choice but to fight with Ruler Star Demon.","Buzz, buzz, buzz. The huge black vortex suddenly stopped, and then it disappeared at an amazing speed.","Soon, the black vortex completely disappeared, and Ruler Star Demon’s figure slowly emerged.","“Haha, Jian Wushuang, you’re finally willing to come out?”Star Demon Ancestor looked at Jian Wushuang with a strange smile on his face.","Jian Wushuang’s face was cold and he did not speak. He held the Wuqi Divine Sword in one hand and the blood-red elixir in the other.","The blood-red elixir was his only chance, but he did not intend to swallow it immediately.","“Although Star Demon Ancestor has eaten Shi Hua Divine Emperor, many Rulers, and many Principles Masters, his battle strength has not recovered to its peak.” Jian Wushuang stared at Star Demon Ancestor.","He could feel that Star Demon Ancestor’s divine body, which originally belonged to Devil Cloud Star Master, had not yet reached its peak state. It was still far from its peak state.","“Let’s test his current combat strength first.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and three towering Heaven Suppression Tablets rose into the air. Waves of golden light flashed, and in the blink of an eye, the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation was formed.","A powerful suppressive force was exerted on Star Demon Ancestor’s body, but he still smiled faintly as if he was not affected at all.","“Array formation, exterminate!”","“Sword array, wave light!”","Boom! An endless sea of golden sword intent swept out as it charged at Star Demon Ancestor in a mighty and frenzied manner.","Star Demon Ancestor only casually glanced at the sea of golden sword intent before him as the corners of his mouth revealed a hint of contempt.","“What a joke.”","With a casual wave of his hand, a black divine power swept out.","This streak of black divine power was very special. It was completely different from the divine power of ordinary cultivators, and much more powerful.","“It’s this power again.” Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted.","He remembered clearly that when he was in the Eternal Dark Prison, he had used the token of the Red Cloud Lineage to suppress Star Demon Ancestor. However, Star Demon Ancestor could still mobilize a very special power, which was not only special...it was strange, but also very impressive.","Star Demon Ancestor had also said back then that the Red Cloud Lineage had suppressed him because he had mastered this special power.","And now, with Star Master’s divine body, Star Demon Ancestor was once again using this special power. Although Star Master’s divine body had yet to recover to its peak, Star Demon Ancestor’s strength was not at its peak, however, when the black divine power spread out...","The waves of golden light sword essence were mercilessly crushed. In the end, they even directly shattered the ocean of Golden Light Sword Essence.","With a casual wave of his hand, the wave light sword formation that Jian Wushuang had combined with the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation was directly destroyed.","Although Jian Wushuang had not used the dragon-exterminating secret skill and could not activate the primordial universe, as long as he used it with the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, he would be able to deal with an ordinary fourth-level master, however, Star Demon Ancestor...","“He is very strong. Even though he has not reached the peak of his current state, his battle strength is still much stronger than that of the previous Devil Cloud Star Master. Moreover, after he swallowed the soul of the Devil Cloud Star Master, he has mastered everything about the Devil Cloud Star Master, including the trace of universe principle that the Devil Cloud Star Master has comprehended. However, when Star Demon Ancestor attacked just now, he did not use the universe principle.” Jian Wushuang’s face was extremely gloomy.","After a simple exchange, he understood that he was far from being able to contend with Star Demon Ancestor with his own strength, even if he used the dragon-killing secret skill and the original universe.","He could only place all his hopes on the blood-red elixir in his palm.","“Senior Wind Devil, don’t disappoint me with this elixir!”","Jian Wushuang’s face was completely twisted and became extremely ferocious. He knew that he might die if he swallowed this elixir. At this moment, he was ready to die.","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang directly swallowed the blood-red elixir in his left hand.","When the elixir entered his body, Jian Wushuang felt his throat dry. At first, there was nothing unusual.","But after he swallowed the blood-red elixir, boom! Boom!","An incredible power suddenly erupted.","This power swept in all directions with an ancient will.","Rumble! The entire universe began to tremble crazily. The vast universe was under the control of the ancient will at this moment.","At the same time, a vast amount of information surged toward Jian Wushuang like a tide."]},{"number":3982,"title":"Chapter 3982 - Primordial Spirit Treasure Pill","paragraphs":["“This...”","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was in a daze.","He had thought that the blood-red pill was purely a pill that could increase his strength in a short period of time. However, after taking it, he found that it was not the case.","At least the blood-red elixir contained not only the power of the elixir, but also an ancient will power and a vast message.","The vast message was first about the use and origin of the elixir.","“The Primordial Spirit Treasure Elixir!”","Jian Wushuang did not know the real name of the blood-red elixir until now.","However, Jian Wushuang was surprised by the origin and use of the elixir.","The Primordial Spirit Treasure Pill is a top-grade autarch-level pill. Anyone who takes it, be it a Principles Master, a Ruler of chaos, or a Supreme Ruler, will immediately enter a state of ‘epiphany’! Whether it was the speed of training or the speed of comprehension can be directly increased a hundred times!","This elixir was one of the most popular elixirs in the vast universe. Even a Ruler at the Supreme Realm longed for it.","The simple introduction shocked Jian Wushuang. “This elixir is completely different from what senior Wind Devil said.”","When Wind Devil gave him the blood-red elixir in that special space, wind demon clearly said that this elixir could increase his strength in a short period of time, but it had great side effects, once he swallowed it, he might even die.","Jian Wushuang remembered clearly that Wind Devil did say so. Therefore, he had always regarded this elixir as his strongest trump card. Until the last moment, he did not want to swallow the elixir and risk his life.","But now, when he really swallowed the elixir, the information he got was completely different.","The blood-red elixir was called the treasure elixir of the great spirit. It was a elixir that could make people fall into a state of enlightenment in a short period of time. It was purely used to help with cultivation and comprehension. Moreover, it was of a very high level.","If Jian Wushuang had obtained this elixir, he would have been overjoyed.","After all, achieving the state of enlightenment was very rare.","But now...he had swallowed the elixir to fight with Star Demon Ancestor. What was the point of enlightenment at this time?","Jian Wushuang felt bitter. He did not know why Wind Devil made such a big mistake.","But the information that came to his mind made Jian Wushuang completely understand.","Wind Devil left him the following information.","“Jian Wushuang, since you can see this information, you must have swallowed the elixir I gave you. Did you not think of it? Are you dumbfounded?”","“Haha!” Wind Devil obviously did this on purpose, the message was full of ridicule.","“Anyway, let me tell you first. Indeed, I lied to you. The elixir I gave you is not something that can increase your strength in a short period of time, but the price is very high. It can even kill you. I can’t give you such an elixir. After all, you have comprehended a trace of the universe principles at the level of a Principles Master. Such a super genius is a treasure even for the Lingyun Star lineage. Why would I give you such an elixir?”","“Of course, the main reason I lied to you was to train you. If I told you the real purpose of this elixir, you would have swallowed it earlier and solved the problem with your strength. What’s the point of training?”","Jian Wushuang had a strange look on his face.","He now understood that Wind Devil had been lying to him from the beginning. There was such an elixir that could be of great use to him, but he told him that it was used to fight at critical moments.","At that time, he had not thought that Wind Devil would lie to him because of his identity.","Of course, Wind Devil had lied to him for his own good.","Jian Wushuang continued to listen.","“Jian Wushuang, listen carefully. The Primordial Spirit Treasure Pill that you have swallowed is one of the top elixirs in the vast universe. It is coveted by countless supreme-beings and is even coveted by them. Of course, although the pill itself is precious, star master left a trace of will in it. This trace of will is the most precious and most important thing. It is much rarer than the Primordial Spirit Treasure Pill,” Wind Devil continued.","“Will?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","He swallowed the spirit-treasure pill, and an ancient and majestic will instantly rose up and now completely covered the entire universe void.","This ancient will was left behind by Star Master Lingyun?","No wonder it was so strong.","“This pill was originally prepared by the star master for his personal disciple. Unfortunately, the great battle came too suddenly back then, and the star master did not have the time to take in a personal disciple. This pill was kept in that special space-time with us until you passed the test of the eighteen ultimate formation set by the star master. At that time, we thought that you had the qualifications to become the star master’s personal disciple, but it was just barely qualified. In addition, you were an Immortal Saint back then, and your strength was too weak. If we had given you this pill back then, it would have been too wasteful. That’s why we didn’t give it to you directly back then, but let you choose an inner star secret art instead.”","“However, when you came to that special space-time, you not only broke through to become a Principles Master, but you also comprehended a trace of the universe principles. Tsk, tsk, a Principles Master comprehended a trace of the universe principles, and you’re a perfect life-level cultivator. I’m afraid that there’s no one else with such talent in the entire universe. Therefore, at that time, we were sure that you could become the star master’s personal disciple. Therefore, when you asked us to save you, I discussed with the other brothers and gave you the Primordial Spirit Treasure Pill.”","“Jian Wushuang, I lied to you. I told you to swallow the elixir at the critical moment. You must be in a very dangerous situation. But it doesn’t matter. As long as the star master’s will is awakened, no one can hurt you.”","“The elixir will not only help you enter a state of enlightenment, but more importantly, after the star master’s will is awakened, it will give you a great opportunity. This opportunity is actually the guidance left by the star master. It is his understanding of the principles of heaven and earth, the principles of the universe, weapons refinement, alchemy, formation, and various daos, such as saber principle, sword principle, and spear principle. The star master has lived for countless years and is an invincible supreme. He has unique insights and comprehension in all aspects","“After you consume the Primordial Spirit Treasure Pill, you will be able to come into contact with the star master’s will. The star master’s will will teach you for a hundred years.","“Of course, this is a hundred years in a special state, but in the outside world, it’s only a day!”"]},{"number":3983,"title":"Chapter 3983 - Teaching in Enlightenment","paragraphs":["“100 years? The will of Star Master Lingyun taught me personally for 100 years? And it was in the state of enlightenment after taking the primordial spirit treasure pill...” Jian Wushuang was a little confused.","“Jian Wushuang, although it’s only 100 years, it’s an incredible opportunity for any ruler. You’re only a Principles Master and you got this opportunity in a desperate situation. Your harvest will be even greater. Treasure this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. Don’t let me down.” The message was completely cut off.","However, Jian Wushuang could no longer calm down.","At this moment, he could clearly sense the existence of the ancient will.","This ancient will was left behind by the invincible supreme-level star Master Lingyun. Even if it was just a trace of the will, it could still make the laws of the universe retreat.","At this moment, this ancient will covered the entire universe void. Star Demon Ancestor, who was standing in front of Jian Wushuang, was full of a mocking smile before, but now he could not laugh at all, because he also felt the will in Jian Wushuang’s body.","This will covered everything in the universe void. He was also covered by this ancient will. At this moment, he felt as if his thoughts were completely frozen.","He stood there with his eyes wide open. He wanted to open his mouth, but he found that he could not move at all.","He could not even move his mouth, let alone attack Jian Wushuang.","“What the hell is this?” Star Demon Ancestor was extremely shocked and furious. He was also screaming crazily in his heart.","He did not know what had happened to Jian Wushuang. He only knew that he could not move under the will.","He stood in front of Jian Wushuang like a statue. At this moment, Jian Wushuang was sitting cross-legged in the universe void. He even closed his eyes.","He had swallowed the Primordial Spirit Treasure Pill. The power of the pill had been exerted, and Jian Wushuang quickly entered a mysterious state. This state was the state of enlightenment that countless cultivators dreamed of!","Under the state of enlightenment, the speed of the cultivator’s comprehension would increase exponentially.","At this time, a blurry figure appeared in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","This figure was extremely tall and majestic, but at the same time, it gave off an extremely familiar feeling.","Jian Wushuang knew that this blurry figure was the Star Master Lingyun.","Star Master Lingyun’s will was present at the moment, and it had seeped into his mind and was directly preaching in his mind.","Star Master Lingyun began preaching.","Because Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master, and he was good at sword principle and a little bit of universe principle, Star Master Lingyun mostly talked about rules, sword principle, and universe principle.","Jian Wushuang listened carefully. He had a very high comprehension ability, and with the help of the Primordial Spirit Treasure Pill, his comprehension speed was incredible. He understood almost everything Star Master Lingyun talked about.","Jian Wushuang also knew that this was a rare opportunity. He did not waste any of it. He listened attentively, understood, and comprehended.","As for Star Master Lingyun, he was an invincible supreme expert and an overlord in the vast universe. The things he talked about were all useful and helpful to Jian Wushuang.","Time began to pass slowly. Less than an hour had passed in the universe void, but three years had passed in Jian Wushuang’s consciousness world.","In just three years, Jian Wushuang had already comprehended the fifth principle, the principle of gold!","Gold was the most masculine and cool!","Previously, Jian Wushuang had tested his affinity with the principles of heaven and earth. The affinity between the principle of gold and his was no less than that of the principle of Earth.","Previously, after he had completely comprehended the principles of earth and fused the four principles, he had already begun to explore the fifth principle, which was the principle of gold.","Before the start of the battle, Jian Wushuang had already gained some understanding of the principle of gold, but the level of understanding was not high.","But now, with the help of the Spirit Treasure Pill, Jian Wushuang listened to Star Master Lingyun talk about the various principles of gold. From shallow to deep, it contained everything about the principle of gold. In just three years, Jian Wushuang had completely comprehended the principle of gold.","And this was just the beginning.","In the 13th year of Enlightenment, he completely comprehended the sixth rule, the rule of darkness.","In the 31st year, Jian Wushuang made great progress in his sword principle and reached the first level of the universe origin of sword principle. Many fourth-level masters who were good at sword principle had not reached this level.","In the 45th year, Jian Wushuang made another breakthrough in sword principle and reached the first level of the universe origin of sword principle. His understanding of sword principle alone was comparable to that of a fifth-level master.","In the 78th year, Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the universe principle improved greatly, from barely grasping a trace to truly stepping into the threshold of the universe principle.","In the 82nd year, Jian Wushuang comprehended the fifth principle, the gold principle, and combined it with the other four principles. Since then, the five principles had been merged.","In the 99th year, Jian Wushuang reached a new level in the Dao of formation. He was already comparable to some masters who were better at formation in the universe, such as Blood Rain Demon Master.","Finally, it was the 100th year, the last year.","In the last year, the effects of the Primordial Spirit Treasure Pill had almost been used up. Jian Wushuang did not make much progress in this year. Instead, he had fully comprehended the comprehension of the previous 99 years.","In the vast universe void.","Buzz buzz buzz the ancient will that had existed for a day and a night finally slowly dissipated.","The vast universe void also regained its calm. As for Star Demon Ancestor, he had finally regained his ability to move.","“Has it finally dissipated?”","Star Demon Ancestor clenched his teeth as his expression turned extremely ugly.","Although it had been an emergency that lasted for a day and a night, he had been filled with pride during that day and night. He had been suppressed by the will and was unable to move at all...he could feel the power and terror of the ancient will at all times.","“The will of a supreme-being is definitely the will of a supreme-being expert, and I’m afraid it’s not an ordinary supreme-being.”","Star Demon Ancestor had an ordinary background and was quite knowledgeable. Naturally, he could sense the supreme strength of the owner of the will.","Just a trace of the will was powerful enough to intimidate the entire universe void and make the universe principles avoid it. Such an expert must be an overlord even in the deepest part of the universe.","“What did Jian Wushuang do? What happened to the will just now? How many secrets does this kid have?”","Star Demon Ancestor narrowed his eyes and stared at Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3984,"title":"Chapter 3984 - The Laws of the Universe, Descended Again!","paragraphs":["Not only Star Demon Ancestor, but also many experts from the Divine Beginning Realm, who were standing close to the edge of the universe void, did not understand what had happened to Jian Wushuang.","They were as confused and confused as Star Demon Ancestor.","“What’s going on with Blood Sword Master?”","“I don’t know, but it seems that he is cultivating?”","“Cultivating? Are you kidding me?”","The experts from the Divine Beginning Realm camp had strange expressions on their faces.","They could not believe that Blood Sword Master was still in the mood to cultivate at this critical moment of life and death?","But looking at him sitting cross-legged in the universe void, there was no doubt that he was cultivating. Moreover, it seemed that Star Demon Ancestor had not disturbed his cultivation.","“Miss Shuang ‘er, you are the wife of my Heavenly Marquis friend. Do you know what this is?” Xuan God Daoist looked at Leng Rushuang.","“I don’t know either.” Leng Rushuang shook her head slightly. “My husband took out a blood-red elixir and said something like that. Based on my understanding of him, he should have wanted to use the blood-red elixir to fight Star Demon Ancestor to the death, but the result...”","Leng Rushuang was also very confused.","In fact, it was not their fault. Even Jian Wushuang himself did not expect such a situation.","Now, a day and a night had passed, and a full 100 years had passed in the consciousness space. Jian Wushuang’s cultivation had finally come to an end.","However, even though he had stopped cultivating, Jian Wushuang still did not open his eyes. Moreover, there was majestic divine power crazily gathering in his body.","Boom!","Suddenly, the entire universe shook. Then, a brand-new divine power aura burst out from Jian Wushuang’s body.","“This is...the divine power aura of a Ruler!” Star Demon Ancestor’s expression suddenly changed.","“A Ruler’s aura!”","Many experts from the Divine Beginning Realm’s camp also sensed it at this moment, and they were all shocked.","“Ruler, it can’t be wrong. This is indeed the aura of a Ruler. My young friend, have you already broken through to become a Ruler?” Xuan God Daoist stared at Jian Wushuang with wide eyes and a look of disbelief, there was also an unprecedented excitement in the depths of his eyes.","“He made a breakthrough? He just sat in the universe void and cultivated for a while, and then he made a breakthrough?”","Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Heaven Ancestor, Di Shisan, and all the experts in the Divine Beginning Realm were in disbelief.","However, apart from disbelief, there was also an unprecedented excitement and ecstasy!","After all, Jian Wushuang was a perfect life-level cultivator. Once he made a breakthrough to a Ruler, he could easily take over the Divine Beginning Realm again. Naturally, he could turn the situation around in the Divine Beginning Realm.","However, it was too difficult for a perfect life-level cultivator to break through to become a Ruler from a Principles Master. They had asked Jian Wushuang before, and he had said that he was still far from becoming a Ruler, it was impossible for him to break through in a short period of time.","It was because Jian Wushuang could not break through to become a Ruler that they had no choice but to fight with the Devil Cloud Star and lure out Star Demon Patriarch.","But who would have thought that Jian Wushuang would break through at this time?","“Did he really break through, or did he temporarily rise to the Ruler realm because of the blood-red elixir?” Spark Master suddenly asked.","His words made the hearts of the experts from the Divine Beginning Realm tense again, and they immediately looked over.","“He has broken through to the Ruler realm? That’s impossible!” Star Demon Patriarch stared at Jian Wushuang in disbelief.","But at this moment...boom!","The universe void suddenly let out a violent rumble.","Star Demon Patriarch and the countless experts from the Divine Beginning Realm camp were startled by this roar. In the next moment, everyone raised their heads at the same time.","They saw that above the void space of the universe at the very top, rumble! That dark and boundless universe space seemed to have been forcefully pierced through by someone. A huge and boundless universe hole appeared out of thin air.","This universe black hole was too big. It occupied almost half of the universe void space.","Following that, from within that universe hole, hua la! A dazzling multicolored light lit up. A supreme principle suddenly descended!","This principle was incomparably transcendent and supreme!","The moment it appeared, the entire void space of the universe instantly froze.","Star Demon Ancestor, who was in this void space of the universe, widened his eyes as he watched this scene.","“This is...the universe principle?”","“The descent of the universe principle?”","Within the Divine Beginning Realm, countless great beings from the Divine Beginning Realm camp were stunned.","“It’s the universal principle. The universal principle has come in person!”","“It’s really the legendary universal principle. What’s going on?”","“The universal principle was attracted by Blood Sword Master?”","Exclamations rang out one after another.","Xuan God Daoist, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and Divine Ancestor looked at each other. Their eyes were filled with unprecedented shock.","They were not unfamiliar with the arrival of universal principles.","When Jian Wushuang refined the eternal chaotic world into his heaven and earth secret realm in the Divine Beginning Realm, he also attracted the arrival of universal principles.","However, the scale of the arrival was relatively small, and the universal principles came through the Divine Beginning Realm. However, this time, it came directly from the universe void. The descending universal laws were obviously more vast and majestic.","Similarly, the last time the universe law descended, it was because of Jian Wushuang. This time, the universe law descended because of Jian Wushuang!","“It’s my young friend, the Heavenly Marquis. He must have broken through to the Ruler realm, which is why the universe law has personally descended!” Xuan God Daoist suddenly cried out in surprise.","“Has Blood Sword Master really broken through?”","“From the Principles Master to the Ruler realm, the universe laws have come?”","The experts of the Divine Beginning Realm looked at each other in dismay. The shock in their hearts could not be described with words.","In fact, what Xuan God Daoist said was not wrong.","Jian Wushuang had broken through!","Before the start of the battle, he was indeed far from the Ruler realm. After all, he had only just comprehended the fifth rule, and to break through to the Principles Master realm at the perfect life level.., even if he integrated the five rules, it might not be enough.","Jian Wushuang had never thought that he could break through to the master level before the battle.","However, the appearance of the Primordial Spirit Treasure Pill completely changed everything.","The Primordial Spirit Treasure Pill allowed him to enter a state of epiphany. During this period, it contained the will of Star Master Lingyun, who had taught him in the space of consciousness for a full 100 years.","During these hundred years, his progress was really, really great."]},{"number":3985,"title":"Chapter 3985 - The Laws of the Universe,","paragraphs":["From the moment he started comprehending the fifth principle to the moment he fused the five principles together, he had even comprehended the sixth principle.","As for Sword Dao, he had reached the first level of the sword universe origin, and his comprehension of the universe principles had also greatly increased.","It could be said that the past 100 years had been a qualitative leap for him.","His comprehension of the principles was not enough for him to break through to the Ruler realm, but the key point was that Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the sword principle and the universe principles was too high, which greatly promoted him.","Now, he had finally broken through from the Principles Master to the Ruler realm, and as soon as he broke through, the universe principles immediately came!","Jian Wushuang had encountered the universal principle descending before.","The universal principle descending was not as powerful as this time, but it still gave him an innate divine power and a portion of the power of will.","This time, the universal principle descending did not give Jian Wushuang an innate divine power, but it also gave Jian Wushuang a portion of the power of will.","Moreover, this portion of the power of his will was much more powerful than the first one he had obtained!","When the first universal principle had descended, the portion of the power of his will that had been bestowed upon him could directly double his attack power!","But now, this portion of the power of his will had directly increased his attack power by ten times!","Not only that, Jian Wushuang also faintly sensed that the power of the will that the universal principle had bestowed upon him this time contained some extremely special power that even Jian Wushuang could not touch.","In the universe void, Jian Wushuang was still sitting cross-legged with his eyes slightly closed.","He was feeling the changes in himself.","It was a qualitative change for an ordinary cultivator to break through from a Principles Master to a Ruler, let alone Jian Wushuang.","The moment a perfect life-level cultivator broke through to a Ruler, both his divine body and soul had an unprecedented improvement, and his divine power had also undergone a transformation.","Finally, everything had calmed down.","Jian Wushuang’s transformation had been completed, and the descending universal principle had slowly disappeared.","The universe void had returned to its previous darkness and tranquility.","The difference was that Star Demon Ancestor was no longer as casual and calm as before. On the contrary, his expression was extremely grave.","Star Demon Ancestor stared at Jian Wushuang. Although Jian Wushuang was still sitting cross-legged and had no intention of attacking, Star Demon Ancestor could feel a tremendous pressure from Jian Wushuang.","This kind of pressure was unprecedented in the previous battle.","“How could it be?”","“His battle strength was at the peak of the third-level. He could barely fight against a fourth-level Ruler with his sword formation and principle true treasure. He could only threaten an ordinary fourth-level Ruler with his divine power burning secret skill and many trump cards. Now, even if he has reached the Ruler realm, it should only be a change in his divine power and soul. This kind of increase in divine power should be too outrageous for his overall strength. But why is the pressure he is now bringing so great?”","Star Demon Ancestor was puzzled.","He did not know that Jian Wushuang’s overall strength did not increase much when he broke through from Principles Master to Ruler. However, he had spent 100 years in the space of consciousness on the day he meditated, he had made great progress in the past 100 years.","Now that he had broken through to Ruler, his divine power had been replenished. His overall strength was completely different from before.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang, who had been sitting cross-legged in the universe void, suddenly opened his eyes and slowly stood up.","A powerful aura of a Ruler gathered around him, and his mighty divine power swept out.","Divine power was determined by the strength of divine power.","Previously, Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master. Because of his special life level, his divine power was comparable to an ordinary Ruler, so his divine power was naturally at the same level as an ordinary Ruler.","But now that he had broken through to the Ruler level, he had already fused five principles. Once he broke through, he would become a second-level Ruler. In addition to the special characteristics of a perfect life, his basic divine power was now comparable to a third-level Ruler. Naturally, his divine power was also at the third-level.","But it was only basic divine power!","Jian Wushuang had yet to use many of his secret skills.","“Ruler...”","“After so many years and so much effort, I’ve finally broken through to become a Ruler.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands, his eyes shining.","In the Divine Beginning Realm, the experts of the Divine Beginning Realm were overjoyed.","“Haha, he really broke through. The Blood Sword Master has really broken through to become a Ruler.”","“He didn’t rely on consuming pills to reach the Ruler level within a short period of time. Instead, he actually broke through to become a Ruler. Looking at his divine might, he is definitely not an ordinary Ruler.”","“Tsk tsk, before master broke through, his battle strength was already comparable to a fourth-level Ruler. Now that he has broken through, how strong is he?”","“The Divine Beginning Realm is saved.”","The experts of the Divine Beginning Realm camp were all very excited.","Especially Xuan Shen Daoist, temporal temple master, and the others. They knew very well how important Jian Wushuang’s breakthrough to a Ruler would be to the entire Divine Beginning Realm.","After all, only after Jian Wushuang had made the breakthrough to a Ruler would he be able to take over the Divine Beginning Realm again. Only then would he be able to truly extricate the Divine Beginning Realm from its crisis. Now, Jian Wushuang had finally done it.","The only problem now was Star Demon Ancestor.","“Star Demon Ancestor.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were like lightning, emitting a terrifying light. He stared at Star Demon Ancestor, and there was a shocking killing intent gathering in the depths of his eyes.","“Humph, I won’t go in. You’ve only broken through from the Principles Master to the Ruler realm. How strong can you be?” Star Demon Ancestor snorted coldly.","“I’ll let you see it.” Jian Wushuang did not waste any time. The Wuqi divine sword appeared in his hand, and then he attacked.","Buzz, buzz, buzz!","A shocking power burst out from the three heaven-suppression tablets, forming a huge divine devil heaven-suppression formation.","The same formation, but with the increase in Jian Wushuang’s divine power and his improvement in the universe principles, the power of the Divine Devil heaven-suppression formation was several times or even dozens of times stronger than before!","In the huge heaven-suppression tablet, three towering golden gods were formed. They were obviously more majestic and powerful than before, and the golden light on their bodies was more intense."]},{"number":3986,"title":"Chapter 3986 - Nirvana","paragraphs":["Boom!","The entire universe, which was covered by the Divine Demon Heaven Suppression Formation, began to tremble violently.","Star Demon Ancestor, who was in the center of the formation, was also the first to feel the suppressive force. His face could not help but darken.","“The same formation, but now its power has increased so much?” Star Demon Ancestor frowned.","Previously, even if Jian Wushuang used the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation with all his strength, it would not have any effect on him. He could even break into the magic formation quietly and leave it at any time. But now...","Standing in the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, Star Demon Ancestor could feel that he was constantly enduring the enormous suppressive force. The suppressive force was so strong that he could not get rid of it, naturally, he could not move freely in this layer of formation.","Jian Wushuang drew his sword.","The sea of sword essence swept up again. The sea of sword essence was covered with a thick layer of golden light, and a terrifying power surged up, the sea of golden light sword essence rolled crazily and formed a layer of earth-shaking waves.","These earth-shaking waves rushed toward Star Demon Ancestor from all directions.","They were also waves of golden light sword essence, but they were much stronger than before.","“Humph!”","Star Demon Ancestor snorted and waved his hand again. The unique black divine power swept out again.","Previously, Jian Wushuang had also used the wave light sword formation with all his strength. In the end, Star Demon Ancestor simply waved his hand and his sword formation collapsed.","But now...","Bang!","The first wave of golden light sword essence collided with the black divine power head-on, creating a violent explosion. Then, the wave of golden light sword essence collapsed, and the black divine power dissipated.","“What?” Star Demon Ancestor was shocked.","He had destroyed Jian Wushuang’s sword formation with the same move, but this time, he had only destroyed the first wave of sword essence in the sea of sword essence?","After all, the sea of sword essence was endless.","Crash!","Golden light and sword essence waves rose up crazily, forming a series of tsunamis.","Star Demon Ancestor’s face changed. He had to take out a black scythe. He waved the black scythe crazily and slashed out numerous pitch-black saber lights, each beam carried a unique black divine power.","Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng!","Dense clashing sounds rang out continuously as star fiend brandished his scythe to collide with the waves. However, the waves were endless, one after another, never-ending.","“How is this possible?”","“How did the power of these sword intent waves increase so much all of a sudden?”","“They are too powerful. Any one of these sword intent waves has probably reached the pinnacle of the fourth-level. Even I have to go all out to withstand them.”","Star Demon Ancestor had a look of fear.","After reaching the fourth-level, it was very difficult to increase each level.","Like Devil Cloud Star Master, he had just broken through to the fourth-level not long ago. However, with the help of a law true treasure that was suitable for him to use and the comprehension of a thread of universe principles, he was able to unleash his full power, he was barely able to unleash his peak fourth-level combat power.","However, such an outburst was really very difficult.","As for Star Devil Ancestor, after he had taken everything from Devil Cloud Star Master, he was even stronger than Devil Cloud Star Master. Furthermore, because he had grasped that unique power, his combat power was definitely at the pinnacle of the fourth level, it could even be said that he was at the pinnacle of the fourth level.","But there were two points.","First, Star Demon Ancestor’s battle strength had not reached the peak because when he took over the divine body of the star master, the star master was already in a terrible state. Although he had recovered a lot by devouring a large number of cultivators, he had only recovered 70% of his battle strength at most.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang was controlling the three Heaven Suppression Tablets and using the Divine Demon Heaven Suppression Formation to suppress him, which had a shocking effect on his strength.","This meant that he had to use all his strength to withstand the wave of sword essence. Not only did he have to use the special power he had mastered, but he also had to use the universal law to barely withstand it.","However, he could only withstand the wave of sword essence.","Star Demon Ancestor knew very well that the wave of sword essence in Jian Wushuang’s sword formation was endless. He could only withstand it for a while, but if it was prolonged, it would be difficult for him to withstand it.","There was another important point, which was that Jian Wushuang had yet to use the secret skill that burned his divine power.","Yes, Jian Wushuang did not use the dragon-exterminating secret skill. He only relied on his divine power, which had greatly increased after he broke through to the ruler realm, and his comprehension of sword principle and universe laws, the combination of the divine demon heaven-suppressing formation and the Wave Light Sword Formation had completely suppressed Star Demon Ancestor.","The waves of sword essence in the sea of sword essence had reached the peak of the fourth level. Although it was just barely reached, it was still ridiculous.","“Just using the Wave Light Sword Formation in a normal way is enough to suppress Star Demon Ancestor?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and looked at Star Demon Ancestor coldly.","He thought he would have to fight Star Demon Ancestor even if he made a breakthrough, but it seemed that was not the case.","He did not need to use his strongest trump card, the original universe. He did not even need to burn his divine power with the dragon extinguishing secret skill anymore.","Jian Wushuang stared at Star Demon Ancestor coldly and slowly raised the Wuqi divine sword in his hand.","Jian Wushuang had become the absolute focus of the entire universe void.","Everyone was staring at Jian Wushuang, staring at the sword in his hand.","He closed his eyes. He had been in the consciousness space for 100 years, so many insights on sword principle surged into his mind. In an instant, a new sword skill was formed.","“This sword move is named Nirvana!”","“After this sword move, the Divine Beginning Realm will be rid of the crisis and usher in a new rebirth!”","“From now on, the Divine Beginning Realm will have nothing to worry about!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly opened, and there seemed to be a flash of lightning in them.","The Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand, which was raised high, fell down coldly!","In an instant, an earth-shaking and terrifying sword light descended.","This sword not only brought Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of sword principle to a hundred years in the space of consciousness, but it also brought with it an extremely rich universe principles.","Most importantly, this sword also contained the brand-new power of will given by the universe principles!","This sword was called Nirvana!"]},{"number":3987,"title":"Chapter 3987 - Had Won!","paragraphs":["Hua!","The heaven-shaking sword beam that was imbued with the rich principles of the universe and the might of a brand new will slashed down.","The moment the sword beam appeared and mercilessly slashed down, even Star Demon Ancestor could not help but shudder.","An unprecedented sense of danger enveloped Star Demon Ancestor’s heart.","Star Demon Ancestor gave it his all. The vast black divine power in his body swept up crazily. He had already exerted the special power he had mastered to the maximum, and he had also exerted his current battle strength to the best of his ability.","Boom! A huge universe black hole appeared out of thin air. The universe black hole occupied half of the battlefield like an open mouth, wanting to swallow the incoming sword light.","In terms of size, the sword light that Jian Wushuang displayed was on a completely different level compared to the universe black hole.","However, the moment the sword light came into contact with the universe black hole, a terrifying power instantly erupted.","Sizzle! Sizzle! Sizzle!","The huge universe black hole was mercilessly slashed, and a large amount of special black divine power frantically retreated in all directions like a tide.","Behind the universe black hole, Star Demon Ancestor’s figure appeared. However, at this moment, his face was full of fear. After the shocking sword light with the power of will cut through the universe black hole, it directly cut into his body.","In an instant, Star Demon Ancestor’s divine body directly collapsed.","Although his divine body collapsed, the most important core of Star Demon Ancestor was his soul, which was his foundation. Logically, after his divine body collapsed, his soul still had a chance to escape.","However, to Star Demon Ancestor’s horror, Jian Wushuang’s terrifying sword light contained an extremely special power. When the sword light slashed and destroyed his divine body, the sword light also instantly cut through his soul.","“I, I...”","Star Demon Ancestor was completely dumbfounded. He felt that his soul had collapsed, and even his consciousness had begun to blur.","“No, no!”","“I can’t die, how can I die!?”","“I can’t accept this, I can’t accept this!”","“Jian Wushuang, if it weren’t for the fact that I haven’t recovered to my peak condition and that I lost many of my supreme treasures when I escaped from the eternal dark prison, how could you kill me?!”","“No!”","The divine body of Star Demon Ancestor let out a series of hysterical roars. These roars were filled with unprecedented fear and hatred, but the voice had gradually weakened.","Star Demon Ancestor’s entire soul body had been cut in half. It was impossible for him to survive such an injury.","“You’re right. If you have recovered to your peak condition, or if you haven’t lost all your treasures, with your skills and trump cards, I’m afraid it won’t be easy to kill you even if I use all my trump cards. Unfortunately, there is no medicine for regret. You can only blame your bad luck,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","He had to admit that Star Demon Ancestor was indeed terrifying.","His methods were too incredible. If he had not lost all his treasures in the space passage in order to escape from the eternal dark prison, with Star Demon Ancestor’s battle strength and the many treasures in his hands...Jian Wushuang was not absolutely sure that he could kill him.","Even now, Jian Wushuang was able to kill Star Demon Ancestor so cleanly because of the new power of the will given by the universal principle.","The new power of the will given by the universal principle was completely different from the previous one.","Not only was the power of the will ten times stronger, but the most important thing was that the power of the will contained some special things that could directly attack Star Demon Ancestor’s soul through his divine body.","The sword attack just now had destroyed Star Demon Ancestor’s divine body and destroyed his soul.","Jian Wushuang estimated that if Star Demon Ancestor’s soul was too split, his split soul would also be destroyed.","This special power was like karma.","It could kill Star Demon Ancestor’s soul through his divine body, and it could also kill all his split souls through one of his souls.","What Jian Wushuang did not know was that the Star Demon Ancestor did have a split soul body.","The split soul body was deliberately left behind by the Star Demon Ancestor before the outbreak of the war. He had prepared a way out for himself. If something unexpected happened during the war, his plan would fail, on the contrary, if he was killed by the star master or Jian Wushuang, at least he would not die. There was still a split soul body to survive and there was still a chance for him to rise up in the future.","But now, when Jian Wushuang’s sword slashed down, the split soul that he had hidden in the universe void was also destroyed.","Star Demon Ancestor was truly dead.","“Although I don’t know what the special power contained in the power of the will is, no matter what, Star Demon Ancestor is really dead and the crisis in the Divine Beginning Realm has been resolved.”","“Master, I’ve protected what you asked me to protect.”","Jian Wushuang clenched his hands, his eyes shining with a strange light.","Then, Jian Wushuang suddenly smiled. He was very happy and willful.","He was not the only one. The experts of the primordial divine realm were ecstatic and excited.","“He’s dead! Star Demon Ancestor is really dead!”","“Even his soul has been destroyed. He couldn’t be more dead. Haha, the crisis of our Divine Beginning Realm has finally been resolved!”","“We won! Our Divine Beginning Realm Camp has won this war!”","“We won! Haha!”","The experts who had been invited to the Divine Beginning Realm camp were fine, but the cultivators who had come from the Divine Beginning Realm were overjoyed.","Daoist Xuan God, the Temporal Temple Master, and the others even had misty eyes.","They were so happy that they wept.","There was nothing they could do. Ever since Devil Cloud Star Master had taken over the Divine Beginning Realm, the Divine Beginning Realm had always been on the edge of a cliff. They had also been working hard for the Divine Beginning Realm.","They had once thought that the Divine Beginning Realm would one day resolve its crisis and become like an ordinary astral world. However, this step had always been extremely far away.","Even before the outbreak of the war, although they had made ample preparations, they still did not have much confidence in winning, especially after the appearance of Star Demon Ancestor and his terrifying devouring ability, it made them almost despair.","However, they did not expect that Jian Wushuang would be able to stand up and kill Star Demon Ancestor in such a situation and turn the tide by himself!"]},{"number":3988,"title":"Chapter 3988 - Celebration Feast!","paragraphs":["Victory!","After Jian Wushuang killed Star Demon Ancestor, the Divine Beginning Realm had truly won the battle.","After the battle, Star Demon Ancestor, Star Demon Ancestor, and Star Demon Ancestor had died, and the army of Star Demon Ancestor had been defeated. Now, the Divine Beginning Realm had returned to the control of the will of the Heavenly Dao.","The greatest crisis of the Divine Beginning Realm had been resolved.","The countless cultivators from the Divine Beginning Realm were overjoyed.","They had won, which meant that the Divine Beginning tribulation had been saved. There was no need for them to abandon their hometown and wander in the universe void.","In the universe void, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath. At this moment, he felt that everything around him was very beautiful.","He took a look at the Divine Beginning Realm in front of him and smiled faintly. Then, he walked directly toward the Divine Beginning Realm.","A large number of people from the Divine Beginning Realm’s camp immediately moved to welcome him.","“Husband!”","Leng Rushuang’s eyes were filled with tears. She was the first to run to Jian Wushuang and directly rushed into his arms.","Jian Wushuang also opened his arms and hugged his wife.","Previously, he was almost determined to die in front of Star Demon Ancestor. He had already said his final farewell to his wife. But now, he survived and came to his wife again, holding his breath, Jian Wushuang could not calm down for a long time.","“My young friend, the Heavenly Marquis.”","Xuan God Daoist, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the others looked at Jian Wushuang at this moment with complicated emotions in their eyes.","Some of these emotions were excitement, some were admiration, but most of them were gratitude.","They were grateful that Jian Wushuang had killed Star Demon Ancestor and saved the Divine Beginning Realm by himself.","It could be said that Jian Wushuang was the savior of the Divine Beginning Realm. Without him, the Divine Beginning Realm would only end in destruction.","Jian Wushuang glanced at Daoist Xuan God and the others, then grinned and said, “Everyone, the Divine Beginning Realm is safe.”","Safe.","These simple words made countless experts in the Divine Beginning Realm smile knowingly.","Half a day later, in the Third Heaven of the Divine Beginning Realm, where the three holy lands used to be, a huge feast was being held here, where the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was located.","Of course, this feast was a celebration feast!","On the vast and vast plaza, there were densely packed cultivators sitting upright. These cultivators were all contributors who had directly participated in this great battle. Not only were there Rulers, but there were also a large number of Principles Masters, they all had a place on this plaza.","And on the high platform in front of the plaza, there were many thrones standing upright. These were the top experts of the Divine Beginning Realm’s camp.","One of the thrones was particularly eye-catching.","Not only was it larger than the other thrones, but it was also located in the center and the core.","There were two people sitting on the throne. They were Jian Wushuang and his wife. They were sitting on the throne together, and there was a lot of attention around them.","A person’s position depended on his own strength.","In this battle, Jian Wushuang was undoubtedly the first hero. He killed Star Demon Ancestor at the last moment and turned the tide. In terms of strength, he was now the undisputed number one expert in this star area, therefore, he was the absolute protagonist of this celebration banquet.","Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the others directly promoted Jian Wushuang to the highest position.","Jian Wushuang had refused at first, but Daoist Xuan God and the others had repeatedly requested that Jian Wushuang sit on the largest and most conspicuous throne.","This throne alone proved Jian Wushuang’s current supreme position.","Although he still respected the leaders of the Divine Beginning Realm, such as Daoist Xuan God and Temporal Temple Master, they no longer regarded him as a cultivator of the same level.","“Everyone.”","Jian Wushuang, who was sitting on the highest throne, suddenly stood up. Leng Rushuang, who was beside him, also stood up at the same time.","The entire banquet quieted down, and countless gazes were fixed on Jian Wushuang.","With a smile on his face, Jian Wushuang held a glass of wine in his hand, he said grandly, “All of you here have contributed greatly to this battle. It is because of everyone’s concerted efforts that we in the Divine Beginning Realm can obtain the final victory in this battle. For the sake of this victory, everyone, cheers!”","“Cheers!”","Countless cultivators at the banquet raised their glasses and drank the celebratory wine.","“Haha, wonderful, wonderful!” Daoist Xuan God finished his cup of wine and immediately began to laugh loudly, “It’s been a very, very long time since I’ve had such a wonderful cup of wine. Previously, whenever I encountered something, there would always be a thorn in my heart. It was this thorn that caused me to be unable to eat or sleep. But now, I can finally drink this cup of wine to my heart’s content.”","“You’re right. It’s not just you. We’re all the same. Previously, when the Divine Beginning Realm was in danger, as the leaders of the Divine Beginning Realm, we didn’t dare to relax. But now, this crisis has finally been resolved. Our Divine Beginning Realm has finally settled down. We can sleep now. Seeing the Divine Beginning Realm reach this stage, even if I die now, I can rest in peace.” The Temporal Temple Master laughed heartily.","“Haha, it’s not easy for the Divine Beginning Realm to settle down. We haven’t had a few days of peace yet. You can’t just die like this,” the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master joked.","The other top experts of the Divine Beginning Realm also laughed happily.","Even Di Shisan, who was usually extremely cold, frequently smiled at this celebratory feast.","“Master, we congratulate you for breaking through to the Ruler realm and showing off your divine power to kill Star Demon Ancestor.”","Many of the slaves Jian Wushuang brought back from eternal prison had been killed by Star Demon Ancestor, but there were still many alive. Now, Demon Dragon Lord led them to toast Jian Wushuang.","“Thank you, everyone.” After Jian Wushuang drank the wine, he smiled and replied, “Don’t worry, I won’t change my promise. I will definitely give you your freedom within 100,000 years. Now that the Divine Beginning Realm has won the war, it won’t be long before the Divine Beginning Realm is completely peaceful. I don’t think I’ll need you, so I might let you go ahead of time.”","“Early?” The eyes of Demon Dragon Lord and the others immediately lit up.","Jian Wushuang did not lie. He had enslaved Demon Dragon and the others to prepare for the war with Devil Cloud Star.","Now that the war was over, there should be no more danger in the Divine Beginning Realm. With his current strength, these slaves would not be of much help to him, so even if he gave them their freedom in advance...it would not affect Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3989,"title":"Chapter 3989 - Hesitation","paragraphs":["The celebratory feast was filled with cheers and laughter. As the main character of the battle, Jian Wushuang naturally became the center of attention. The top experts of the Divine Beginning Realm toasted Jian Wushuang, but Jian Wushuang did not refuse.","After three rounds of drinking, the celebratory feast was still very lively.","“Husband, I’m afraid you haven’t been this happy in a long time.” Leng Rushuang looked at Jian Wushuang and smiled.","“Indeed.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “Other than the time when you recovered your divine body and reunited with me, it’s true that I haven’t been this happy for a long time. But it’s also normal. Previously, I’ve been shouldering the heavy burden of saving the Divine Beginning Realm, so I can’t relax at all times. Now that the crisis in the Divine Beginning Realm has been resolved, just like Xuan God and the others, I’ve truly relaxed. Of course, I’m happy to be able to relax like this.”","“Husband, when are you going to take over the Divine Beginning Realm?” Leng Rushuang suddenly asked.","“Take over?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. “Shuang ‘er, to be honest, I’m hesitating now.”","“Why are you hesitating?” Leng Rushuang was puzzled.","“I’m hesitating. Should I take over the Divine Beginning Realm?” Jian Wushuang said seriously.","If it was before the crisis of the Divine Beginning Realm was resolved, he would definitely take over the Divine Beginning Realm without hesitation. Only then could he protect the Divine Beginning Realm.","But now, it was different.","Devil Cloud Star Master had died, including Star Demon Ancestor. Now, no one could control the power of the Divine Beginning Realm’s will of the Heavenly Dao. It operated on its own. Whether or not he took over the Divine Beginning Realm at this time...it did not matter.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang was thinking whether he should not take over the Divine Beginning Realm’s will of the Heavenly Dao and let it operate and evolve on its own.","No one interfered and no one controlled the divine will. It was just like a normal astral world.","“Husband, do you want to ask Xuan God and the others about this?” Leng Rushuang asked.","“Yes, let me ask them.” Jian wushuang nodded and immediately asked at the banquet.","Of course, although he asked, he blocked the surrounding space and time, so others could not hear his conversation with Xuan God and the others.","“My young friend, are you hesitating to take over the Divine Beginning Realm?”","Xuan God Daoist, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Divine Ancestor, and the other leaders of the Divine Beginning Realm all looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes.” Jian wushuang nodded.","“What do you think?” Xuan God Daoist asked.","“I don’t want to take over.” Jian Wushuang said directly, “The Divine Beginning Realm is a star world born in the vast universe. It should follow the universal principles and should not be controlled or disturbed by any external factors. Before, there was no way. I had to take over to save the Divine Beginning Realm. But now, since it’s no longer necessary, it’s better not to take over.”","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, the leaders of the Divine Beginning Realm looked at each other and smiled.","Jian Wushuang was not selfish at all. He did not want to improve his strength by taking over the Divine Beginning Realm. Obviously, he was doing it for the Divine Beginning Realm, Xuan God Daoist and the others were very satisfied and pleased.","“My young friend, the Heavenly Marquis,” Temporal Temple Master said, “You can easily possess the Divine Beginning Realm and get endless benefits, but you don’t have any selfish motives. You want to let the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm evolve and operate on its own. This makes us very happy. However, even though we are happy, you still have to possess it.”","“Why?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“First of all, for you,” Temporal Temple Master said solemnly, “My young friend, you are talented and have unlimited potential. You are like a hidden dragon, which is bound by the Divine Beginning Realm and even the star field. You should go to the deeper part of the universe, where you should stay. If you possess the Divine Beginning Realm, it will bring you countless benefits, and you will have more room to grow in the future!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression did not change.","Possessing the Divine Beginning Realm was indeed a great opportunity for him, but he did not care.","After all, since he was born, he had obtained more than one or two great opportunities?","Not to mention others, just the Lingyun Star and the Red Cloud lineage were great opportunities.","Perhaps for others, possessing an astral world was definitely a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity, but Jian Wushuang did not care. He believed that even if he did not possess the Divine Beginning Realm, he could still step into the peak of the universe in the future.","“Perhaps you don’t care about this opportunity, but you have sacrificed so much for the Divine Beginning Realm. Of course, we have to think of you. Of course, there are more important reasons.” Temporal Temple master smiled. “My young friend, although the crisis in the Divine Beginning Realm has been resolved, if I’m not wrong, there are still a lot of hidden dangers in the Divine Beginning Realm.”","“Hidden dangers?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Yes, the hidden dangers come from the various means that the star master of Devil Cloud Star used to control the three Saint Realms and the Sorcerer God Sect in the Divine Beginning Realm. These methods were used to accelerate the evolution of the Divine Beginning Realm and to maximize the potential of the Divine Beginning Realm. Although these methods seem to have stopped after the three Saint Realms were destroyed, who knows how much the three Saint Realms have squeezed the Divine Beginning Realm?”","“We don’t know what methods they used or whether they will continue to harm the Divine Beginning Realm. We can’t communicate with the heavenly will of the Divine Beginning Realm. Even if the Divine Beginning Realm is still damaged, we don’t know.”","Jian Wushuang was silent.","Indeed, after the battle with Devil Cloud Star Master, the Divine Beginning Realm had been devastated. Although the divine realm was now under the control of the will of the Heavenly Dao, no one knew if there were any major hidden dangers in the Divine Beginning Realm.","After all, they could not communicate with the will of the Heavenly Dao of the Divine Beginning Realm.","“In order to truly eliminate these hidden dangers and ensure that the Divine Beginning Realm is safe and sound, you must possess the Divine Beginning Realm. Only by controlling the will of the Heavenly Dao of the Divine Beginning Realm can you know everything about the Divine Beginning Realm. If there are really many hidden dangers in the Divine Beginning Realm, you can also take action to solve them,” Temporal Temple Master said.","Temporal Temple Master’s words immediately attracted the approval of the surrounding leaders.","Obviously, they also thought that Jian Wushuang should possess the Divine Beginning Realm.","“There’s one more thing,” Temporal Temple Master continued, “Although the Divine Beginning Realm seems safe now, what about the future?”","“My dear Heavenly Marquis, you will definitely go to the depths of the universe in the future. When the Divine Beginning Realm encounters a crisis, even if you know about it, you won’t be able to rush back in time or even help much. But if you possess the Divine Beginning Realm, it will be completely different.”"]},{"number":3990,"title":"Chapter 3990 - The True Method of Protection","paragraphs":["“If you possess the Divine Beginning Realm, then even if your true body is in the deepest part of the universe, you can still block all of my powerful enemies that can threaten my Divine Beginning Realm outside the Divine Beginning Realm!”","“Heavenly Marquis little friend, this is the true method of protecting the Divine Beginning Realm!” Temporal Temple Master sighed.","“Yes, the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm will only operate in accordance with the principles of the universe. If there is a big crisis, the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm will not be of any use. Only you, Heavenly Marquis, can control the will of the Heavenly Dao and protect the Divine Beginning Realm.” Xuan God Daoist and the others nodded in agreement.","Hearing their words, Jian Wushuang was convinced.","Temporal Temple Master was right.","Whether it was the hidden dangers in the Divine Beginning Realm or the future disasters, he could only solve them by possessing the will of the Heavenly Dao of the Divine Beginning Realm.","“In that case, after the celebration party is over, I’ll go and possess it.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up. He had made up his mind.","Seeing this, Xuan God Daoist, Temporal Temple Master, and the others all laughed.","The celebration banquet continued.","After all, this was a great victory for the entire Divine Beginning Realm. Moreover, this battle had actually begun a long time ago. It was only now that the Divine Beginning Realm had truly won. This was a victory of special significance, the celebration banquet naturally lasted a long time.","The celebratory feast lasted for three days and three nights before it ended.","The experts of the Divine Beginning Realm dispersed one after another. As for the experts who had been invited, they also obtained the supreme treasures they wanted and left the Divine Beginning Realm.","In the highest void, the leaders of the Divine Beginning Realm were gathered here.","“My young friend, Heavenly Marquis, go.” Xuan God Daoist smiled.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. Then, under their gazes, he merged into the surrounding void.","Jian Wushuang was a perfect life-level cultivator. After his strength broke through to the Ruler realm, he could clearly sense the existence of the divine will of the Divine Beginning Realm, because of his experience in refining the Eternal Chaotic World, it was very easy for Jian Wushuang to take over the Divine Beginning Realm.","Everything went according to Jian Wushuang’s expectations. After only a dozen attempts, Jian Wushuang had successfully refined the divine will of the Divine Beginning Realm on the 17th try. At this moment, Jian Wushuang had truly grasped the entire Divine Beginning Realm.","After truly grasping the Divine Beginning Realm, Jian Wushuang knew the benefits he could obtain by possessing the Divine Beginning Realm.","There were two kinds of benefits.","One was that the Divine Beginning Realm was a star world born in the universe and had a complete Heavenly Dao cycle. Jian Wushuang could feel the existence of this complete Heavenly Dao cycle through the Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm, this was incredibly helpful to his cultivation.","The other was more useful.","The Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm operated according to the supreme universe principle. After possessing theDivine Beginning Realm, he could communicate with the vast universe through the Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm, he could clearly sense the existence of the universal principle, not only the universal principle, but also the power of the universe and the many things contained in the universe. This was of great help to him.","“I now understand why the Devil Cloud Star Master was not very talented and was forced to wander in the outside world when he was in Devil Cloud Star. But after possessing theDivine Beginning Realm, his strength increased so much in a short period of time, and he even comprehended a trace of the universal principle.” Jian Wushuang could not help sighing.","He could feel the complete cycle of the Heavenly Dao at any time, and he could even clearly sense the principles of the universe and even communicate with the vast universe. With such an innate advantage, even if he was an ordinary person...he could greatly improve in a short period of time.","‘If I had possessed the Divine Beginning Realm earlier, I wouldn’t have had to go to the Dark Magic Region to experience life and death. Finally, I would have relied on the life core fragment of the Immortal Youmo to comprehend a trace of the universe principles. I would have been able to comprehend a trace of the universe principles by myself. I’m afraid I would have been able to easily comprehend a trace of the universe principles,’ Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","‘Just think about it.’ Even Devil Cloud Star Master could comprehend a trace of the universe principle by relying on the divine will of the Divine Beginning Realm. His talent and perception were many times stronger than Devil Cloud Star Master’s. To comprehend a trace of the universe principle...naturally, it was extremely easy.","Now that he had already comprehended the universe principle and had truly stepped into the threshold of the universe principle, his speed of communicating with the universe and comprehending the universe principle would naturally be faster, and it would definitely be dozens of times faster, or even hundreds of times faster.","Although Jian Wushuang was quite happy to know the benefits he could get from possessing the Divine Beginning Realm, he was not too excited.","Next, he immediately controlled the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm and began to explore the entire Divine Beginning Realm.","With the help of the will of the Heavenly Dao, Jian Wushuang quickly covered every corner of the Divine Beginning Realm with his consciousness. He was able to see everything in the Divine Beginning Realm. As expected, Jian Wushuang found a few huge hidden dangers in the Divine Beginning Realm.","The hidden dangers were called hidden dangers because Jian Wushuang could clearly sense that they had been causing damage to the Divine Beginning Realm.","There was one place that Jian Wushuang was extremely familiar with.","“Samsara Sect, Samsara Heaven Domain!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were wide open.","In the Divine Beginning Realm, the Samsara Sect was located in the Second Heaven. Jian Wushuang had gone to the Samsara Sect in order to completely comprehend the Samsara principles. In the Samsara Heaven Domain of the Samsara sect, Jian Wushuang had discovered a shocking secret.","At that time, he had discovered that the bottom of the Samsara Heaven region contained a terrifying power of life and death, which had perfectly fused together to form a huge vortex of life and death.","At that time, he had also encountered the consciousness left behind by the Samsara leader, who had told him that the vortex of life and death was a complete samsara!","At that time, Jian Wushuang was really shocked. After all, the Samsara was only a legendary existence.","However, he was too weak to really comprehend the Samsara of life and death, so he had to leave. Later, he did not go there again.","But now, after Jian Wushuang controlled the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm, he found that the vortex of life and death at the bottom of the Samsara Heaven Domain was not a samsara of life and death, but a huge magic formation, it was a formation that could continuously squeeze the potential of the Divine Beginning Realm and have a great impact on it.","Obviously, the vortex of life and death was one of the means set up by the three Saint Realms. However, the Samsara Patriarch found it by chance and thought that it was a supreme treasure and wanted to refine it, the Samsara Patriarch also placed the headquarters of the Samsara Sect there."]},{"number":3991,"title":"Chapter 3991 - Freedom","paragraphs":["“It’s funny that I thought it was a magic array and a great opportunity. I didn’t expect it to be a huge hidden danger.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. He moved and appeared in front of the Second Heaven, which was the sect of the Samsara Sect.","He now dominated the will of the heavenly axiom in the Divine Beginning Realm. He could easily appear in every corner of the Divine Beginning Realm with just a thought.","Looking at the huge sect ahead, Jian Wushuang directly released his divine power.","Although because he was in the Divine Beginning Realm, he could not fully display his strength. Even his divine might could only display a part of it. However, this part of his divine might, to the Samsara sect, it’s already shocking.","!!","Countless cultivators in the entire Samsara sect began to tremble under this divine power, while the sect master and the elders of the Samsara sect appeared in front of Jian Wushuang as fast as they could.","“Pay respects to the Blood Sword Master.” Samsara Master and those elders all opened their mouths in unison, extremely respectful.","“May I know why Master Blood Sword has come to our Samsara sect?” The Samsara Sect Master was very nervous. He was well aware of Jian Wushuang’s strength and status. With one word from him, the entire Samsara Sect would probably be destroyed. There was no chance for him to struggle.","“Samsara Sect Master, you, as one of the many elders of the Samsara Sect who participated in the battle with the Devil Cloud Star, should also know about the hidden dangers in the Divine Beginning Realm.” Jian Wushuang stared at the Samsara Sect Master calmly.","“I know a little.” The Samsara Sect Master nodded.","“Well, take a look at this.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand and directly activated the awareness of the Samsara Sect Master and the elders, looking at the bottom of the Samsara Heaven Region.","Soon, the Samsara Sect Master and the elders saw the huge life and death vortex at the bottom of the Samsara Heaven Region.","“Oh my God.”","“What is that?”","The Samsara Sect Master and the elders were shocked.","Although the headquarters of the Samsara sect was above the life and death vortex and the Samsara Heaven Region had always been their treasure, they did not know about the huge life and death vortex at the bottom of the Samsara Heaven Region.","“It’s a layer of magic formation. It was once set up by the three Saint Realms to squeeze the potential of the Divine Beginning Realm. Later, the founder of your Samsara Sect, the Samsara Patriarch, discovered it. He thought it was an opportunity, so he placed your headquarters here,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Is that so?” Samsara Sect Master looked at Jian Wushuang and asked, “Blood Sword Master, are you here to destroy the formation?”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded, “However, your Samsara Sect is right above the formation. If I destroy the formation, your Samsara Sect will be destroyed as well. That’s why I came to inform you. After all, your Samsara Sect contributed to the previous battle. I won’t destroy your Samsara Sect directly, but I hope you can move your sect to another place as soon as possible.”","“I understand.”","The Samsara Sect Master took a deep breath. He knew that since the formation was harmful to the Divine Beginning Realm, it must be destroyed. Now that Jian Wushuang came to them and asked them to relocate the sect, it was for their own good.","“Blood Sword Master, it will take some time to prepare for the relocation of a sect,” the Samsara Sect Master said with a frown.","“I know. I’ll give you one month. I’ll make a move in one month,” Jian Wushuang said.","“One month?” Samsara Sect Master nodded slightly.","One month was a little short, but it was enough for the Samsara sect disciples to move to other places.","Moreover, Samsara Sect Master knew very well that since the war was constantly damaging the Divine Beginning Realm, Jian Wushuang would not let it continue to exist for long.","It was already very kind of Jian Wushuang to give them a month.","“Thank you, Blood Sword Master,” Samsara Sect Master said gratefully.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded and left immediately.","Then, Jian Wushuang went to several other places where there were great hidden dangers.","Those places were not the headquarters of some sects, but they were also very remote. Some of them were even in dangerous places.","However, for Jian Wushuang now, any dangerous places in the Divine Beginning Realm posed no danger to him. He easily arrived at those places where there were hidden dangers and immediately attacked them, he destroyed the means and magic formations that the three Saint Realms had set up.","A month later, Jian Wushuang returned to the Samsara sect. By now, the Samsara sect had almost been relocated. At least the expert disciples had left.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate. He directly attacked and destroyed the huge vortex of life and death with just one sword strike.","Since then, the many means and formations set up by the three Saint Realms in the Divine Beginning Realm had been removed. At that moment, Jian Wushuang clearly felt that the Divine Beginning Realm seemed to have been relieved of a heavy burden.","The entire Divine Beginning Realm began to change for the better. He believed that it would not be long before it returned to its normal state.","The crisis in the Divine Beginning Realm, including the hidden dangers, had been resolved.","Outside the Divine Beginning Realm, in the vast universe void.","Jian Wushuang stood there with his hands behind his back. In front of him stood a number of rulers.","These rulers were naturally the prisoners that Jian Wushuang had brought back from the eternal dark prison. Although Star Demon Ancestor had devoured more than a dozen of these prisoners in the previous battle, there were still more than 20 who survived, Demon Dragon Lord, Devil Scorpion Lord, and Spark Master were all still alive.","“As I said before, I will release you in advance. However, after I release you, you’d better leave this star field immediately. Of course, it doesn’t matter if you don’t leave, but I don’t want anyone to do evil in this star field. Otherwise, I will directly take action and not just enslave you. I will kill him. You should understand that I have the strength,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, the servants were all shocked.","If they had been forced to submit to Jian Wushuang in the eternal dark prison, they would have been more or less unconvinced.","But now...they had witnessed how Jian Wushuang had killed Star Demon Ancestor. His terrifying strength was at the top of the fourth-level masters.","Now, Jian Wushuang was no different from killing chickens. Naturally, they did not dare to doubt his words.","“Alright, go.”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and instantly withdrew the brand he had left in the slaves’ soul origin.","The slaves were shocked and their faces were filled with ecstasy.","Then they bowed respectfully to Jian Wushuang and left.","..."]},{"number":3992,"title":"Chapter 3992 - Eternal Island","paragraphs":["In the Divine Beginning Realm, a special Temporal was hidden in the Third Heaven.","This special Temporal was an endless sea, and in the center of the sea was a huge island.","This island had many immortal lakes, spiritual trees, various immortal birds, and flying beasts. There were also many exquisite manors on the island. The manors were dazzling with flowers and were as beautiful as a fairyland on Earth.","The island was called the Eternal Island.","“From today on, our family will live on the Eternal Island.” Jian Wushuang stood in the center of the manors, with his wife and his parents and relatives beside him.","!!","“It’s so beautiful here.” A delicate-looking red-clothed girl looked around the manors and exclaimed.","Her name was Zhuo Yiyi, and she was the granddaughter of Jian Wushuang’s elder brother, Zhuo Peng. If Jian Wushuang was called Jian Wushuang, he would have to call her third grandpa. After all, Jian Wushuang was the third brother of the Zhuo family.","“I spent a lot of money to build this island. Of course it’s beautiful.” Jian Wushuang smiled and looked at the girl in red with a hint of love.","He had lived two lives. In his first life, his parents only had one son. Although he had reunited with his wife, he did not have any children.","In his second life, he was the third son of the Zhuo family. His eldest sister, Zhuo Bing, and his second brother, Zhuo Peng, had long been married and had children. After so many years, the children had already multiplied, there were tens of thousands of direct family members in the Zhuo family. However, only a few of the tens of thousands of Zhuo family members were able to come to the Eternal Island. Only the most direct four generations of family members were able to come here.","As for the Eternal Island, it was built by Jian Wushuang on purpose.","The Divine Beginning Realm had been completely settled down and there would be no more crisis in the future. He no longer had any burden on his body. In the following days, he wanted to stay on the Eternal Island with his wife, he wanted to live with his family.","The name of the island was eternal, but it also meant immortal.","He hoped that he could always be by his family’s side.","As for the universe...perhaps he would go to the universe when he was too bored in the Divine Beginning Realm, but it was still too early.","After resolving the crisis, Jian Wushuang naturally wanted to live a peaceful and peaceful life.","“Husband,” Leng Rushuang suddenly said.","“Well, what’s wrong?” Jian Wushuang looked at Leng Rushuang.","“Let me tell you something.” Leng Rushuang quietly whispered in Jian Wushuang’s ear, “I have a baby.”","“You have a baby?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled and did not react immediately. “What do you mean?”","“What do you mean you have a baby?” Leng Rushuang rolled her eyes at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang suddenly understood. His eyes instantly widened as he stared at Leng Rushuang.","“Shuang ‘er, are you serious?” Jian Wushuang’s voice trembled.","“Of course I’m serious.” Leng Rushuang laughed.","“Haha, we have it. We have it.” Jian Wushuang laughed. His smile was a little silly. He did not look like an absolute beginning master, the strongest expert in the entire star field. Instead, he looked like a child.","“What’s wrong? Shuang ‘er, what are you laughing at?” Jian Nantian and the others walked over.","“Father, mother, I, I’m going to be a father.” Jian Wushuang was so excited that he did not know what to say.","“What?” The surrounding people were stunned at first, but then they were pleasantly surprised.","“I’m going to be a grandfather?” Jian Nantian’s eyes were also wide open.","“Nantian, we’re going to have a grandson?” Ji Wumeng was also a little confused.","Then, the entire Eternal Island was in an unprecedented joyous mood.","Twenty years passed in the blink of an eye.","In the manor on the Eternal Island.","“Father, you don’t know. My brother’s talent in sword principle is really incredible. He is definitely the most talented in sword principle I have ever seen. I think you can consider taking him as your disciple. It would be a pity if such a sword principle genius were to be taken away by others.” A handsome young man in a silver robe stood in the open space of the manor, they were talking leisurely.","Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang were casually sitting opposite each other at the stone table in front of the silver-robed young man. Jian Wushuang was leisurely drinking a pot of wine, as if he had not heard what the silver-robed young man said.","As for Leng Rushuang, she just smiled and said, “Qing ‘er, how long have you been out training? How many geniuses have you seen? How can you ask your father to take you as his disciple? Your father has high expectations.”","The silver-robed young man whom Leng Rushuang called ‘Qing ‘er’ was her and Jian Wushuang’s son, Jian Qing.","Jian Qing grew up on the Eternal Island. Because of his parents, he was born with great talent. In addition, there were countless resources on the island, and he was personally taught by Jian Wushuang, in just over ten years, he had reached the immortal saint level. When Jian Qing was 16 years old, Jian Wushuang allowed him to travel alone in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Although he only traveled alone, Jian Wushuang had left several tricks on Jian Qing. These tricks were only activated when Jian Qing was in a life-or-death crisis. Once they were activated, not to mention the Divine Beginning Realm...even in this star field, no one could kill him, so Jian Wushuang was naturally at ease.","Jian Qing had traveled in the Divine Beginning Realm for four years, and now he had returned here. As soon as he returned, he told Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang about his good friend’s heaven-defying talent in sword principle.","However, Jian Wushuang did not take it to heart.","What a joke. Jian Qing had only been out for four years, and he was only at the immortal saint level. How many geniuses could he meet?","Even if his good friend’s talent in sword principle was extremely high, it was only for ordinary experts. Perhaps an ordinary Principles Master or even a Ruler would be attracted to such a genius.","However, with Jian Wushuang’s strength, it was very difficult for him to find a genius in the Divine Beginning Realm who could satisfy him and make him want to take him as a disciple.","Jian Qing curled his lips at Leng Rushuang’s words and did not say anything. He had stayed in the Eternal Island for so long. Although he still did not know his father’s true strength and identity, he knew one thing very well, his father was very, very powerful.","He was a Principles Master who was considered a top expert in the Divine Beginning Realm. He had to kneel in front of his father. Even a Ruler had to be respectful in front of his father.","“Qing ‘er, how long do you plan to stay here?” Jian Wushuang finally took a look at Jian Qing.","“I just came back to visit you, father and mother. You’re leaving soon,” Jian Qing said.","“When are you going to come back?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","“In a few months, when my sister is born, I’ll come back,” Jian Qing said.","Jian Wushuang could not help glancing at Leng Rushuang’s belly, which was slightly bulging, which made Jian Wushuang smile in his heart.","Yes, he and Leng Rushuang’s second child had been pregnant for three months, and Jian Wushuang had long known that the second child was a daughter.","..."]},{"number":3993,"title":"Chapter 3993 - 36,000 Years","paragraphs":["Seven months later, Jian Wushuang’s daughter was born. Jian Wushuang named her Xuan ‘Er.","In terms of talent, Jian Xuan ‘Er was no less talented than Jian Qing, but she was much more obedient and sensible than Jian Qing.","Jian Qing was a more flamboyant and lawless character. In addition, his father, Jian Wushuang, was wandering around in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Of course, Jian Qing was very kind and did not bully the weak. Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang had taught him this since they were young.","Jian Xuan ‘Er, on the other hand, had been very obedient since she was young. She followed the rules and was completely different from Jian Qing.","!!","Jian Wushuang also taught them how to behave when they were young. As for how they would behave in the Divine Beginning Realm, he did not care. He and Leng Rushuang lived on the Eternal Island and occasionally went around, they went to every corner of the Divine Beginning Realm and lived a very carefree life.","However, while they lived a carefree life, Jian Wushuang’s cultivation did not lag behind.","It must be known that he was now in control of the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm. He could use the will of the Heavenly Dao to meditate at all times and even stir up the universe.","In addition, he had just become a Ruler and his strength was in an explosive stage. With such a huge innate advantage, his improvement speed was also extraordinary.","However, no matter how great his improvement was or how strong his strength was, there was no room for him to display his strength in this star field.","Time was merciless, and time continued to pass.","In the blink of an eye, 36,000 years had passed since the end of the battle and the Divine Beginning Realm was completely settled.","On the Eternal Island, in the manor.","Jian Wushuang casually sat there. In front of him, there was a strong young man who was nearly two meters tall. He was brandishing a huge axe and practicing his axe skill.","Because he was on the island, the strong young man did not use divine power and only used the profound essence of the axe skill. However, the momentum of his axe skill was still very shocking.","After a while, the strong young man stopped what he was doing and stood there, looking at Jian Wushuang nervously.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and said, “It’s not bad for you to reach this stage in 30 years. However, your understanding of the axe principle is still too weak. You need to improve more.”","“Yes.” The burly young man nodded heavily.","“Father, the secret realm that Bei Yi was in was very special. It was too narrow and many cultivators did not have any research on the axe principle. Although Bei Yi is the strongest expert in the secret realm, he did not receive any guidance before. He just relied on his own ability to reach that level. He started very late in the axe principle. In addition, it has only been 30 years. I think he has made great progress.” Jian Xuan ‘Er, who was dressed in purple, said.","Jian Xuan ‘Er completely inherited her mother’s beauty and was born with the same beauty. The difference was that her mother, Leng Rushuang, was cold by nature. It was Jian Wushuang who opened her window, while Jian Xuan ‘Er was not in a cold mood.","“What? I just agreed to your matter, and you’re so eager to speak for him?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Jian Xuan ‘Er.","“Of course not.” Jian Xuan ‘Er blushed and lowered her head in shame.","The burly young man touched the back of his head and smiled.","Leng Rushuang shook her head and smiled when she saw this.","Jian Xuan ‘Er was the apple of their eyes. Jian Wushuang had always valued her. 36,000 years had passed, and Jian Xuan ‘Er and Jian Qing had already broken through to Principles Master.","Jian Qing had already married and had children a long time ago. Now, he even had a lot of grandchildren and great-grandchildren.","However, Jian Xuan ‘Er had very high expectations and had never found a suitable husband.","Until 100 years ago, when Jian Wushuang and his wife took Jian Xuan ‘Er on a trip in a secret realm of heaven and earth, they saw Bei Yi.","At that time, the secret realm of heaven and earth happened to be in a life-and-death crisis. Its situation was almost comparable to that of the Divine Beginning Realm 36,000 years ago. In the Bald Man in crisis, it was Bei Yi, the acknowledged number one expert of the secret realm of Heaven and earth, he had risked his life to fight a powerful enemy alone.","In the end, he killed the enemy, but he was in a desperate situation and was almost certain to die.","Jian Wushuang looked at Bei Yi and thought of the crisis in the Divine Beginning Realm. He was also determined to die and wanted to fight with Patriarch Devil. He was moved and saved Bei Yi, then he brought Bei Yi back to the Eternal Island.","Since then, Bei Yi had temporarily lived on the Eternal Island. At first, it was nothing. Who would have thought that his daughter, Jian Xuan ‘Er, would witness Bei Yi risking his life to fight the enemy for his hometown, she became very interested in Bei Yi.","Jian Xuan ‘Er often came to see Bei Yi. After a while, the two actually developed feelings for each other.","Until 30 years ago, when the two of them completely confirmed their relationship, Jian Wushuang did not object and directly agreed.","There was nothing to object to. Jian Wushuang saved Bei Yi himself, so his character was absolutely fine. As for his strength, although it was a little weak, Jian Wushuang did not care at all as long as his daughter liked it.","From that day on, Jian Wushuang also taught Bei Yi to comprehend the axe principle.","“Eh?” Jian Wushuang’s expression suddenly changed. He waved his hand and said, “Xuan ‘Er, Bei Yi, you two go to the side first. Your Uncle Xuan ‘Er is here.”","“Uncle Xuan ‘Er?” Jian Xuan ‘Er was delighted.","She was Jian Wushuang’s daughter, which was equivalent to the princess of the entire Divine Beginning Realm. The leaders of the Divine Beginning Realm, such as Daoist Xuan ‘Er and Temporal Temple Master, all doted on Jian Xuan ‘Er.","Soon, Daoist Xuan God appeared in the manor, accompanied by another person.","“Master Chenyun?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","“Greetings, Master Blood Sword.” Master Chenyun stood in front of Jian Wushuang, looking extremely humble.","During the battle 36,000 years ago, Master Chenyun had been watching from the surrounding void and had witnessed everything.","He saw Jian Wushuang break through to become a Ruler, attract the arrival of universal principles, and then kill Star Demon Ancestor with lightning speed.","Later, he found out that Jian Wushuang had taken over the Divine Beginning Realm.","After all, Jian Wushuang had comprehended a trace of universal principles at the level of Principles Master, and he was a special life form. Just these two points alone made him an incredible genius with immeasurable potential, the Nine Emperor Pavilion valued him very much.","But later, Jian Wushuang took over another star world? His potential was even greater and more terrifying.","Even the higher-ups of the Nine Emperor Pavilion personally ordered him to try his best to befriend Jian Wushuang. Clearly, the Nine Emperor Pavilion valued Jian Wushuang, the super genius, more than before."]},{"number":3994,"title":"Chapter 3994 - Excitement","paragraphs":["“Chenyun, did you ask Xuan God to bring you here?” Jian Wushuang looked at Master Chenyun.","“Yes.” Master Chenyun nodded. “To tell you the truth, I’m here today because I received a piece of news that should be very important to you, Blood Sword Master.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","His name had been listed on the Nine Emperor List. In the future, the Nine Emperor Pavilion could ask him for a favor.","The Nine Emperor Pavilion would try their best to keep an eye out for any information related to him.","!!","Apparently, Master Chenyun knew that he was involved in something, so he came to look for him.","“For a piece of news, just send me a message directly. Why do I need you to come personally?” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","“I’m afraid it’s difficult to talk about this matter with just a message. I can only come personally. Blood Sword Master, you’d better take a look at this.” Master Chenyun took out a token, he directly guided the message contained in the token.","Jian Wushuang immediately began to read the message carefully.","“Hmm, a reward token?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","The token that Master Chenyun took out contained a reward.","The reward was from a force called Thundergod Palace in the Nine Luminaries Star Field.","“The Nine Luminaries Star Field is a big star field, and Thundergod Palace is one of the four most powerful forces in the Nine Luminaries Star Field. Of course, these are not the most important things. The most important thing is, master blood sword, take a closer look,” Master Chenyun said.","Jian Wushuang continued to read.","There was a reward column in the bounty notice.","There were two kinds of rewards. One was to provide the specific location of the other party, and after confirming the truth, one could get 100 universe origin stones as a reward.","The second was to kill or capture the other party alive, and one could get a middle-grade principle treasure and 500 origin stones as a reward.","It had to be said that the reward was very tempting.","Jian Wushuang was very clear about the value of the universe origin stones. When he sold a low-grade principle treasure in the Nine Emperor Pavilion, he only got 150 origin stones.","Now, as long as he provided the specific location of the person on the bounty, he could get 100 universe origin stones. This was the entire wealth of many fourth-level Rulers, and some even poorer fifth-level Rulers, it was estimated that their total wealth was only about 100 universe origin stones.","If they killed or captured the target alive, the reward would be even more shocking. A middle-grade principle supreme treasure plus 500 universe origin stones were enough to drive fourth-level and fifth-level Rulers crazy.","After all, many fifth-level Rulers did not have a principle supreme treasure, let alone a middle-grade principle supreme treasure?","“What kind of hatred would make the Thundergod Palace issue such a high reward?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled, and then he continued to look down.","However, when he saw the name of the person on the bounty, he was stunned.","The name of the person on the bounty was...Xuan Yi!","“Xuan Yi?” Jian Wushuang’s body trembled, and he frowned. “Is it just a coincidence?”","The universe was too vast, and there were countless cultivators. Naturally, there were many people with the same name.","If Jian Wushuang’s name was in the universe, there would be at least 100,000 people with the same name as his master.","There must be many people in the natural universe who had the same name as his Master Xuan Yi.","Jian Wushuang subconsciously thought it was a coincidence. However, when he saw a lifelike portrait at the bottom of the bounty notice, he was completely stunned.","The portrait depicted a middle-aged man in green. The middle-aged man was tall, tall, and handsome. Just by looking at his appearance, he gave off an extremely warm feeling, and there was an otherworldly air between his brows, he had a wild and unrestrained temperament.","He was like a mortal immortal standing on a mountain peak, overlooking 10,000 living beings.","He was also like a boundless sea, containing everything in the world.","This was a person who was admired and fascinating just by looking at him with the naked eye.","There was a smile on his lips as if the entire universe was under his control.","However, no matter how fascinating this person was or how unique his temperament was, it was not the key.","The key was that Jian Wushuang was too familiar with this person.","Whether it was his appearance in the portrait or his unique temperament, they were all identical.","This person was Jian Wushuang’s master, Xuan Yi!","“It’s my master, it’s him!” Jian Wushuang was so excited that his body was trembling crazily.","“Xuan Yi?” Xuan God Daoist was also stunned.","Although he had come with Master Chenyun, he had not seen the bounty before. He did not even know why Master Chenyun had come to find Jian Wushuang.","Therefore, when he saw the bounty and the portrait, he was a little confused.","Naturally, he recognized that the person in the portrait was Xuan Yi.","There was no mistake. Moreover, the name of the person on the bounty was Xuan Yi.","His name, appearance, and even temperament were exactly the same. It was impossible for them to be two people.","“It’s really master, it’s really him!”","“He’s not dead, he’s not dead!”","Jian Wushuang was so excited that he did not know what to say.","With his current strength, especially in this star field, there was almost nothing that could make him so excited, even if it was a peerless principle treasure that appeared in the three battlefields, at most, he was only slightly happy.","But now, it was different.","It was his master!","He had lived two lives. If he did not mention his parents, the person he was most grateful to and respected was definitely his master Xuan Yi!","Moreover, his master was like a father. To a certain extent, his master Xuan Yi was no different from his father in his eyes.","The death of his master was an irreparable scar in Jian Wushuang’s heart. However, there was nothing Jian Wushuang could do. After all, his master had died before he was born, at that time, he had only been in contact with the consciousness left by his master. The only thing he could do was to complete his master’s mission and protect the Divine Beginning Realm.","In the end, he did it.","The Divine Beginning Realm had been completely stabilized.","But now, at this moment, Master Chenyun came and showed him a reward for his master?","“Master Chenyun, when was this reward issued?” Jian Wushuang stared at Master Chenyun.","“After I got this reward, I asked. It was issued 1,000 years ago. It’s said that the person in the reward created a huge storm in the Nine Luminaries Star Field 1,000 years ago and offended the Thundergod Palace so badly that they issued the reward for him,” Master Chenyun said.","..."]},{"number":3995,"title":"Chapter 3995 - Decision","paragraphs":["“A thousand years ago?” Jian Wushuang was ecstatic.","The bounty order issued a thousand years ago clearly allowed his master to appear in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field a thousand years ago and caused a huge storm.","His master, Xuan Yi, was really alive.","“I thought my master was dead.” Jian Wushuang’s body trembled.","Many years ago, in the first war between the Divine Beginning Realm and the Demon Cloud Star, the Demon Cloud Star was completely defeated and the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was destroyed. His master was also killed in that war.","Even his corpse was still in the Eternal Chaotic World.","When he was refining the Eternal Chaotic World, he saw the consciousness left by Xuan Yi. Xuan Yi told him that he was dead.","Jian Wushuang no longer doubted it. He had always thought that his master was dead. What he had encountered before was only a remnant soul of his master.","However, if he thought about it carefully, Jian Wushuang could find something wrong.","First of all, his master’s methods were too incredible.","His master, Xuan Yi, was not only the first perfect life in the Divine Beginning Realm. Most importantly, he was able to create a second perfect life when he was only left with a remnant soul after his death, that was Jian Wushuang.","It seemed that creating a perfect life form had only taken some twists and turns, and it was also a fluke. But in fact, how rare was a perfect life form? In terms of rarity, it was even rarer than a super genius who had comprehended a trace of the universe’s laws, which was rare even in billions of star worlds.","Such a life form was very rare even in the vast universe.","However, Xuan Yi had created it himself and succeeded.","And the heaven-cleaving skill!","This was an extremely powerful divine ability, which was of great help to Jian Wushuang. He could let the special life form exert its innate advantage.","This secret skill was also very terrifying.","Jian Wushuang had seen Blood Wave in the Blood Wave Realm. Blood Wave came from the Life Palace, which was an alliance of top forces gathered by the special life forms in the vast universe.","Even among the top forces in the universe such as the Life Palace, only their extremely powerful palace master had created a life divine power that could maximize the innate advantage of the special life form, furthermore, when this palace master created the life divine ability, he had spent a long time to study it and finally created it with great difficulty.","In terms of level, perhaps the heaven-cleaving technique could not compare to the life divine ability, but the nature of the two was extremely similar.","Even Blood Wave felt incredulous when he found out that Xuan Yi had created the heaven-cleaving technique. Because when Blood Wave was created, not to mention Principles Masters, even Rulers and even paragons...it was impossible to create a secret technique like that.","But mystic one did it.","In addition, there was the eternal chaos of the world!","When his master Xuan Yi had already been defeated in the great battle back then, he used a great method to completely seal the seven-star divine territory. Furthermore, through the evolution of the formation, he actually gradually transformed the seven-star divine territory into a complete Heavenly Dao cycle, in the end, he had even made Jian Wushuang recognize him as his master.","This method was equally incredible to Jian Wushuang!","Creating a perfect life, creating the heaven-cleaving skill, and turning the Eternal Chaotic World into a complete cycle of Heavenly Dao were three things that ordinary experts could not do.","For example, Jian Wushuang’s strength should be far stronger than his master’s at his peak. However, if he was asked to do all three things, he would definitely not be able to accomplish any of them.","However, his master did all of them.","“Master may not be strong in battle, but he has the most unfathomable means that I know of. Even Star Demon Patriarch, who has special divine power and special devouring power, is far inferior to master,” Jian Wushuang murmured.","Previously, Jian Wushuang thought that his master was really dead, but he did not really think about it. He only thought that his master had a special opportunity to use his means.","But now that he thought about it carefully, Jian Wushuang realized that his master’s means were not something that could be used and completed by ordinary opportunities.","There was no doubt that his master had a big secret.","Even his master’s origin was not as simple as Jian Wushuang knew.","Even the enormous corpse that was still lying in the Eternal Chaotic World, Jian Wushuang was not sure whether it was really his master’s corpse.","“What is the origin of Master? And what is his purpose for doing all this? He is clearly still alive, but why does he say that he is dead?”","Jian Wushuang frowned and was at a loss. He had too many questions, too many questions.","Unfortunately, no one could answer him.","After a while, Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly shone with a fierce light.","“Shuang ‘er.” Jian Wushuang looked at Leng Rushuang beside him and said, “I’ve decided to explore the universe. I’ll go to the Nine Luminaries Star Field.”","“Huh?” Leng Rushuang was stunned, but she was not surprised.","She had been with Jian Wushuang for so many years, so she knew how much Jian Wushuang loved his master.","Previously, Jian Wushuang thought that his master was dead, so he had nothing to worry about. He was not in a hurry to explore the universe. Instead, he stayed in the Divine Beginning Realm and lived a carefree life with her.","However, now that he knew that his master was still alive and in the Nine Luminaries Star Field, he could no longer sit still.","“Father, are you going to the depths of the Universe?” Jian Xuan ‘Er raised her eyebrows and immediately looked over. She then said directly, “I want to go too.”","“Nonsense!” Jian Wushuang scolded in a low voice, “Do you think I’m going to the depths of the universe to play?","“The universe is vast and full of dangers. Although I’m invincible in this star field, I’m nothing in the vast universe. Even if I go to the depths of the universe, I have to tread on thin ice and be cautious everywhere. How can I protect you?","“This time, only your mother and I will go to the universe. As for you and Qing ‘er, stay in the Divine Beginning Realm and keep your grandparents company.”","Jian Wushuang’s tone was cold, and there was no room for negotiation.","He could not take Jian Xuan ‘Er or Jian Qing to the universe. As for his wife, Leng Rushuang, her strength had improved a lot over the years because of the heart of the astral world, she was now a second-level Ruler and was very close to the third-level. In addition, she had the inheritance of supreme fog, so her battle strength was very strong. She was no less than a third-level Ruler, that was why Jian Wushuang was willing to let Leng Rushuang go with him.","Otherwise, he did not want his wife to go with him."]},{"number":3996,"title":"Chapter 3996 - Exploring the Universe!","paragraphs":["Jian Xuan ‘Er bit her lips. Although she knew her father was right, she was still unwilling to accept it.","Seeing her daughter like this, Jian Wushuang’s heart softened, he said, “Xuan ‘Er, listen to me. Although father and mother will leave the Divine Beginning Realm and explore the universe, both of us will have consciousness avatars. With consciousness avatars, you can still talk to us at any time.”","“Can consciousness avatars be the same as the original body?” Jian Xuan ‘Er’s eyes were red.","Jian Wushuang was helpless. It was Leng Rushuang who went up and tried to calm Jian Xuan ‘Er down.","In fact, Jian Xuan ‘Er had been very obedient since she was young. But this time, when she knew that her father and mother were going to leave the Divine Beginning Realm and take risks in the vast universe, she was naturally worried.","“Xuan ‘Er, go and call Qing ‘Er, your grandparents, and the others over,” Leng Rushuang said.","“Okay.” Jian Xuan ‘Er nodded and immediately went to call for them.","“Master Chenyun.” Jian Wushuang looked at Master Chenyun in front of him with a serious expression. “I want to know the detailed star map leading to the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field and everything about it.”","“No problem.” Master Chenyun nodded. “When I came here, I had already sorted out the star map and the information about the Nine Luminaries Star Field. It’s in this jade slip. Blood Sword Master, you can explore it slowly.”","Master Chenyun handed a jade slip to Jian Wushuang. Jian Wushuang took it and scanned it with his consciousness.","“Well, it’s so far?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","The first thing he looked at was the star map, which marked the star fields he would pass by and the approximate time it would take.","According to Master Chenyun’s estimation, if he traveled through the universe void at his own speed, it would take him at least millions of years to reach the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field from this star field, this was the time he needed to travel without encountering any trouble.","The universe was too big.","The Nine Luminaries Star Field was not the edge of the universe. It was indeed far from where they were now.","Of course, the Nine Luminaries Star Field was still not the depths of the universe. If Jian Wushuang wanted to travel deeper into the universe in the future, the distance would be even greater and the time needed would be longer.","“It will take millions of years just to travel, tsk tsk...” Jian Wushuang could not help but exclaim. After all, he had only cultivated for about 300,000 years.","“Fortunately, Devil Cloud Star Master has a complete universe boat. After I killed Star Demon Ancestor, the universe boat fell into my hands. Using the universe boat to travel in the universe void, the speed is at least 100 times faster than that of an ordinary Ruler. Millions of years will save 100 times the time, which is tens of thousands of years, at most 100,000 years,” Jian Wushuang thought.","Nearly 100,000 years was not a short time, but Jian Wushuang had no choice but to go to the Nine Luminaries Star Field.","If he wanted to save time, he would have to pay a great price to travel through one universe tunnel after another. However, the cost of traveling through a universe tunnel between a star field and a star field was extremely high.","If he had to travel through a universe tunnel from this star field to the Nine Luminaries Star Field, the price would be too high for Jian Wushuang to bear.","“I can’t help it. I can only travel by universe boat in most star fields. There are only a few star fields that can be crossed. I can pay a price to take the universe passage, which will save me a lot of time,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed again.","He saw a star field on the star map given by Master Chenyun.","This star field was called the Purple Micro Star Field. It was a medium-sized star field.","In the vast universe, there were indeed different sizes of star fields.","The first thing that could be called a large star field was that there would definitely be a grade one star field in this star field!","A grade one star field was much, much stronger than a grade two star field. Under normal circumstances, if a grade one star field grew to its peak, it would be able to give birth to a large batch of Rulers, there were even countless Rulers in the third, fourth, and even fifth grades. In fact, when a grade 1 astral world grew up, it would definitely have an ultimate Ruler overseeing it.","If it was in the depths of the universe, a grade 1 astral world would even have a supreme expert overseeing it!","Other than a grade 1 astral world, there were at least tens or even hundreds of grade 2 astral worlds in a large starfield. As for grade 3 astral worlds, there were thousands or even tens of thousands of them. There were countless of them.","A first-grade astral world, dozens or hundreds of second-grade astral worlds, and a large number of third-grade astral worlds could form a large star field.","For example, in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field, there were first-grade astral worlds.","As for medium-sized star fields, they were far inferior to large star fields. However, there were still several second-grade or even dozens of second-grade star fields. There were also a large number of third-grade star fields.","As for small-sized starfields...those that could become small-sized starfields had to have at least one second-grade starfield.","For example, the Starfield where Devil Cloud Star was located was a small-sized starfield.","And the starfield where the Divine Beginning Realm was located at the very edge of the universe. It was the most barren place and didn’t even have a second-grade starfield. There were only a few dozen third-grade starfields. This starfield was simply an unrated starfield.","Because of this, this star field did not even have a name until now.","The reason why Jian Wushuang paid attention to the Purple Micro Star Field was because he had heard from the nine Emperor Pavilion that the Ruler of star field was from the Purple Micro Star Field.","The Ruler of Star Field was Leng Ruxue’s master.","The Ruler of Star Field had appeared during the war with the Devil Cloud Star 36,000 years ago. However, after the death of the Star Master of the Devil Cloud Star, the Ruler of star field immediately fled. Even Jian Wushuang did not know where she went, he could only ask Ruler Chen Yun to investigate and find out about the existence of the Purple Micro Star Field.","If Jian Wushuang guessed correctly, Ruler star Luo should have returned to the Purple Micro Star Field by now. Moreover, Leng Ruxue was most likely in the Purple Micro Star Field.","After all, Leng Ruxue was a consciousness derived from Leng Rushuang. Her existence was a thorn to both Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang. If there was a chance, they had to resolve this matter.","Now, Jian Wushuang found that he was going to pass by the Purple Micro Star Field on his way to the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field.","“It’s good that I’ll get to the Purple Micro Star Field and take care of the Star Luo Ruler and Leng Ruxue as well.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold.","Soon, Jian Wushuang set up a banquet and invited his family and friends in the Divine Beginning Realm. During the banquet, Jian Wushuang told them that he was going to leave the Divine Beginning Realm.","These close friends and relatives of Jian Wushuang had long been prepared for this and could accept it.","After the banquet, Jian Wushuang told Jian Xuan ‘Er and Jian Qing a few words, and then he left with Leng Rushuang.","..."]},{"number":3997,"title":"Chapter 3997 - Drifting","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang bid farewell to his family and friends one by one. He and Leng Rushuang left their consciousness incarnations at the same time. Then, they left the Divine Beginning Realm together.","After leaving the Divine Beginning Realm, they did not leave this star field to explore the universe. Instead, they went to the three battlefields.","First, they went to the Red Cloud World to say goodbye to Lord Wu. Then, they went to the special space in Devil Smoke Valley.","In that special space, Jian Wushuang met Wind Devil again.","Wind Devil was embarrassed when he found out that Jian Wushuang had swallowed the spiritual treasure pill and knew that he had lied to him on purpose.","Knowing that Jian Wushuang was going to explore the universe, Wind Devil only gave Jian Wushuang four words, “Be careful.”","After saying goodbye to Wind Devil, Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang finally started to move.","At the edge of the star field, in the vast universe void, there was no light at all.","A huge universe boat was rapidly moving through the universe void.","This universe boat was obtained from Devil Cloud Star Master. It was an extremely complete universe boat. When it moved through the universe void, its speed was much faster than that of a ruler-level cultivator.","In the universe boat, Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang sat side by side. Behind them stood a guard.","This guard was Devil Flame.","In order to kill Devil Cloud Star Master, Devil Flame used its strongest killing move at all costs. The 20% gold-swallowing divine body that he had painstakingly condensed collapsed once again. However, after Jian Wushuang killed Star Demon Ancestor...at the same time, he also obtained all the treasures of Devil Cloud Star Master. After that, he went to the nine Emperor Pavilion to exchange for a lot of treasures to restore Devil Flame’s divine body.","The reason why Jian Wushuang went to the nine Emperor Pavilion to exchange for the special gems was that he had to send them over within 500 years.","However, there was no need to rush this time, so the price was much higher. Over the years, the Devil Flame had used the special gems to restore its divine body. Now, it had recovered 20% of its divine body, it would take some time for him to recover 30% of his divine body. Most importantly, Jian Wushuang’s current wealth was not enough for him to recover 30% of his divine body.","However, even though he had only recovered 20% of his divine body and Devil Flame was only at the peak of the third-level ruler realm, his battle strength was undoubtedly at the fourth-level. On this trip to the universe, Jian Wushuang brought Devil Flame along with him, except for his wife.","“Shuang ‘er, we’re about to leave this star field. Are you ready to explore the universe with me?” Jian Wushuang glanced at his wife.","“Of course.” Leng Rushuang nodded with a smile.","“Well, let’s go!”","Jian Wushuang laughed. Under his guidance, the universe boat immediately burst into terrifying speed and passed through the universe void in front of them. It had already left the star field, it sailed toward the vast universe void.","From this day on, Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang truly began to wander and explore the universe.","The most difficult thing about wandering in the universe void was boredom.","Jian Wushuang was fine. He did not need to rely on his own leg strength to travel. He rode on the universe boat directly. Moreover, his wife had been accompanying him on the universe boat, so he could still endure it.","However, in the vast universe, most of the cultivators had just left their hometown and drifted in the universe void. It was boundless darkness. This drifting usually lasted for tens of thousands of years or even hundreds of thousands of years, some cultivators could even drift in the universe for hundreds of thousands of years without meeting other cultivators. Such lonely and boring days were really difficult to endure.","In the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang had been driving the universe boat and traveling in the universe void for 3,000 years.","In the universe boat.","“Fortunately, we didn’t let Qing ‘er, Xuan ‘er, and the others come with us. Otherwise, with their temperament, they would have been unable to endure wandering in the universe for thousands of years,” Leng Rushuang said with a smile.","“Although they have been born for almost 40,000 years, they haven’t experienced as much as us. Since they were born, everything has been smooth sailing. We have always been by their side. Under such circumstances, if we let them wander in the universe void, haha...” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","During the 3,000 years that he and Leng Rushuang had spent wandering in the universe void, they had never felt lonely or tormented.","“Master, according to the star map, we are about to arrive at the Purple Micro Star Field,” Devil Flame suddenly said.","“The Purple Micro Star Field?”Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","Galaxies only appeared in the dark void of the universe. They were usually extremely vast and connected to different star fields.","Jian Wushuang had read the star map in detail and knew that they would have to pass through the Purple Micro Star Field to go to the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field. Although the Purple Micro Star Field was connected to a large number of star fields, there was only one medium-sized star field, it was the Purple Micro Star Field. It was because of this that the galaxy was named Purple Micro.","“Before we go to the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field, we have to go to the Purple Micro Star Field. The Purple Micro Star Field is at the end of the Purple Micro Star Field. If we want to go there, we have to go through the Purple Micro Star Field completely. The process will probably take more than a thousand years,” Jian Wushuang said.","The universe was too vast. Even if they took the universe boat and traveled much faster than ordinary cultivators, they still needed a lot of time to travel. 1,000 years was considered a relatively short time.","As Jian Wushuang was talking, the universe boat arrived at the edge of the vast Purple Micro Star Field.","“That’s the galaxy?”","Jian Wushuang was still sitting in the universe boat, but he could see the vast galaxy in front of him through the universe boat.","The galaxy was colorful and emitted dazzling light. It was gorgeous and dazzling in the universe void.","“It’s so beautiful,” Leng Rushuang could not help saying.","“Yes, it’s beautiful, but there are many dangers in the galaxy,” Jian Wushuang said.","He looked carefully at the star chart and some information given by the Dark Cloud Lord, which mentioned the dangers in the galaxy.","In the vast universe, the endless dark void of the universe was actually extremely safe, because the entire dark void of the universe was really too big, and there was not a single ray of light to be seen. Although countless cultivators had left their hometowns, it was very difficult to meet other cultivators after wandering in the universe dark void.","For example, Jian Wushuang and the others had drifted here from their hometowns. They relied on the universe boat to travel through the universe dark void for 3,000 years. Although they passed by many star fields, they did not meet any cultivators.","But the universe galaxy was completely different."]},{"number":3998,"title":"Chapter 3998 - Galaxy","paragraphs":["The galaxy of the universe was incomparably bright and dazzling in the void space of the universe.","The most important thing was that the galaxy of the universe was vast and boundless, and it was connected to many star fields. Almost all the cultivators who traveled between these star fields had to pass through this galaxy, after all, even though cultivators could also rush to other star fields from the dark void space of the universe, the dark void space of the universe did not have a trace of light, and there were not any material symbols. Cultivators who traveled in the void space of the universe...it was easy to get lost, but it was different in the galaxy.","It could be said that the galaxy was an important link for the communication between the galaxies, which was why there were a lot of cultivators who came and went.","And because there were too many cultivators who came and went, there were some evil people who engaged in the business of plundering. These people were called space pirates.","In the galaxy, space pirates were rampant. In the Purple Micro Galaxy before them, there were countless space pirates hiding. There were even a large number of space pirate forces that specialized in plundering cultivators who came and went.","Around the vast Purple Micro Galaxy, there were a large number of cultivators. Most of these cultivators were only Principles Masters, but there were also a small number of Rulers.","They stood in groups of two or three outside the galaxy, forming a large gathering place for cultivators.","Buzz!","The universe boat, which gave off an ancient aura and looked extremely majestic, immediately attracted the attention of many cultivators around it when it appeared at the edge of the galaxy.","“There are so many people here?”","Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang sat side by side in the universe boat and looked at the large number of cultivators outside the universe boat.","“We’ve been wandering in the universe dark void for 3,000 years, but we haven’t seen a single cultivator. But now, there are so many people here. They must have drifted here from their hometowns, right?” Leng Rushuang sighed.","“I think so.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Under normal circumstances, as long as one became a Principles Master, he or she would have the capital to survive in the universe dark void.","Therefore, in the universe, there were many Principles Masters who would leave their hometowns after reaching a certain level of strength and go deeper into the universe. There were also some who would come to the universe to explore after becoming a Ruler.","There might not be many of these people from one or two star fields, but when countless star fields gathered at the edge of the universe, there would be more people.","Now, there were nearly 10,000 cultivators gathered around the galaxy.","Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang were talking when suddenly...many cultivators rushed toward the universe boat.","They did not dare to stand in front of the universe boat. They just came to the side of the universe boat.","Soon, voices were transmitted in.","“Sir in the universe boat, can you take me for a ride? I’m willing to pay the price.”","“And me. And me.”","“Sir, please give us a ride.”","The pleas entered Jian Wushuang’s ears, and he frowned.","“Master, if I’m not wrong, these people gathered at the edge of the galaxy. They must know that there are a lot of space pirates in the galaxy. They don’t dare to go in alone, so they stay here and wait for more people to come. Then they form teams to go in. Of course, if there are experts who want to enter the galaxy, they will try to curry favor with them. After all, if there are real experts leading them, it will be easier for them to pass through the Purple Micro Galaxy,” Devil Flame said.","“Do these people think we’re experts?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","“Of course. Master, you’re riding a universe boat. In the universe, owning a complete universe boat is enough to prove your identity. If you ride a universe boat into the galaxy, even if you encounter space pirates, they won’t dare to disturb you,” Devil Flame said.","Jian Wushuang understood.","He also understood that the universe boat was very precious. Those who could own a complete universe boat in the universe were not weak.","For example, this universe boat originally belonged to Devil Cloud star-master, who was a second-level star-world master. His strength had already reached the fourth-level Ruler level, and the fourth-level Ruler was at the edge of the universe, he was already a top expert. Under normal circumstances, he would not encounter any trouble if he wanted to cross the galaxy.","After all, the Star Island in the Purple Micro Star Field was probably only at the third-grade Ruler level. It was hard to say whether there would be a fourth-grade Ruler.","“Husband, should we bring these people?” Leng Rushuang asked.","“Madam, I advise you not to.” Before Jian Wushuang could speak, Devil Flame had already spoken.","“Why?” Leng Rushuang looked over.","“It’s simple. The universe is dangerous.” Devil Flame said in a low voice, “Madam, you and master must remember these words when you travel in the universe in the future so that you can live longer. There is no mercy in traveling in the universe. It’s better not to get into unnecessary trouble.”","“Devil Flame is right.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. “Since these people have decided to leave their hometown and venture into the universe, they should have been mentally prepared. This is their own choice and has nothing to do with us.”","Jian Wushuang had obviously experienced a lot and had no sympathy for the cultivators who were begging outside the universe boat.","Perhaps if the Divine Beginning Realm did not have such a life-and-death crisis, he might have come to the universe when he was a Principles Master, and his experience would have been similar to those cultivators.","But so what?","It was their own choice, so what did it have to do with him?","“Let’s go, we’ll go straight into the galaxy.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand and directly drove the universe boat toward the vast galaxy ahead.","The large number of cultivators surrounding the universe boat became anxious when they saw that the universe boat only paused for a moment before continuing forward.","“Sir, take us on a journey.”","“Sir, show mercy!”","The cultivators were shouting, hoping that Jian Wushuang would stop the universe boat and let them go up.","Unfortunately, the universe boat did not stop and quickly entered the galaxy.","Seeing this, these cultivators were also helpless.","“We entered the galaxy, but the people on the universe boat still couldn’t let us go up. What a pity.”","“It is indeed a pity. Such a complete universe boat, the person controlling it must be a top-tier great being. How could ordinary space pirates dare to provoke such a great being who was adventuring in the galaxy?”","“What kind of expert do you think the owner of this universe boat is?”","“I don’t know, but according to my estimation, he must be at least a third-level master, maybe a fourth-level master, or maybe even a fifth-level master.”","Many cultivators outside the galaxy were talking among themselves, but they did not blame Jian Wushuang for ignoring them and entering the galaxy directly.","After all, they knew the dangers of the universe, and it was the right choice for Jian Wushuang to do so.","..."]},{"number":3999,"title":"Chapter 3999 - Space Pirates","paragraphs":["The dazzling galaxy was so beautiful that it was intoxicating.","The ancient universe boat traveled through the galaxy at an extremely fast speed.","Traveling through the galaxy was obviously different from traveling through the dark void of the universe. There were so many cultivators in the galaxy that Jian Wushuang and the others could easily meet other cultivators along the way.","Moreover, these cultivators were almost a group of dozens or even hundreds of people working together. It was rare to see one person alone.","Jian Wushuang drove the universe boat into the Purple Micro Galaxy for the second year.","Boom!","The starry sky in the galaxy shook, and faint waves of divine power were transmitted from the void in front of them.","“There are people fighting in front, and judging from the waves, there are quite a number of people fighting,” Devil Flame said.","“Husband, should we go around?” Leng Rushuang asked.","“No need.” Jian Wushuang shook his head. “Let’s go directly.”","Jian Wushuang did not choose to take a detour, and there was no need to take a detour.","Although there were many dangers in the galaxy and a large number of Space Pirates, these Space Pirates could only threaten a large number of rule masters and some weaker Rulers.","However, Jian Wushuang’s strength was almost invincible in this galaxy, not to mention that he was riding the universe boat. This alone made most of the Space Pirate gangs not dare to find trouble with him.","The universe boat continued to move forward and soon arrived at the edge of the battlefield. Through the universe boat, Jian Wushuang could see the scene of the battlefield ahead.","This fierce battle was a one-sided fierce battle. It could even be called a massacre.","There were more than 200 cultivators on one side, including more than a dozen Rulers and three second-level Rulers.","On the other side, there were less than 50 people. There were only six Rulers and only one second-level Ruler.","The difference in strength was too great, causing the fifty-strong team to be unable to resist at all. They were directly swept away. From the battle until now, in just a short while, more than half of the team had died, the remaining people were also frantically fleeing.","“Kill, kill them all!”","“Haha, encountering our One Star, it’s fine if they don’t beg for mercy, but they aren’t even willing to pay the toll. They’re really courting death!”","“Do you think you can walk across the Purple Micro galaxy safely with the help of a second-level Ruler? What a joke!”","Rampant laughter echoed across the battlefield.","Jian Wushuang understood immediately.","The team of more than 200 people should be Space Pirates, and they came from a gang of Space Pirates called ‘One Star’.","As for the other team, they were obviously passing by and were killed. Because they could not pay the price, they were slaughtered by the gang.","In just a moment, the slaughter ended. Only two or three of the 50-man team managed to escape, while the rest died at the hands of One Star Space Pirates.","“So they are Space Pirates? They are really ruthless.” Leng Rushuang frowned.","“It’s normal. Even in the Divine Beginning Realm, the most important places for trade, there are also a lot of bandits. Those bandits have the same means as these Space Pirates, except that they are stronger.” Jian Wushuang was still very calm.","He had experienced too much in the Divine Beginning Realm, and he had seen too much. He had also dealt with many bandits, so he was already numb to the scene before him.","“Let’s go, let’s continue on our way.” Jian Wushuang drove the universe boat and continued to move forward.","On the battlefield just now, the Space Pirates were busy collecting the spoils of war.","But at this time...","“Look over there.” A cry of surprise suddenly sounded.","Many Space Pirates raised their heads at the same time and immediately saw an ancient and huge universe boat flying over.","This scene caused the expressions of these Space Pirates to change greatly.","“Quick, get out of the way.” The leader of the Space Pirates shouted immediately.","Instantly, over 200 Space Pirates dashed toward the surrounding void space and made a wide path. That universe boat passed through the center of the battlefield without any obstruction and then disappeared from the sight of these Space Pirates.","Seeing the universe boat disappear, these Space Pirates heaved a sigh of relief.","“That was close.” The leader also sighed lightly.","“Leader, that universe boat just now was obviously just passing by, and it didn’t have any intention of stopping. We don’t have to be so nervous, right?” A Space Pirate couldn’t help but ask.","“What do you know?” The leader glared at that Space Pirate. “This is a complete universe boat. In the universe, to be able to own such a complete universe boat, one must be extraordinarily powerful. It’s very likely that he’s a Ruler above the fourth level, or someone with a big background. No matter what kind of person he is, he’s not someone that a small star island gang like us can afford to provoke.”","“And we’re lucky. The people on the universe boat didn’t attack us just now. But you have to know that there are many eccentric people in this universe. Their behavior is eccentric, and it all depends on their likes and dislikes. They don’t need any reason at all. If we met such people just now, it’s very likely that they would kill all of us just because they saw us standing in their way.”","“Or maybe, they are the young fellows who have just started to explore the universe but have a big background. Such young fellows are even scarier. They have never experienced the cruelty of the world. They are often merciful and abhor evil. When they see that the Space Pirates are killing the cultivators who are passing by, they might attack us too. Even if they can’t kill us, they will order their guards and servants to kill us. We won’t even have a chance to struggle.”","“Normally, if our star islands encountered such a complete universe boat in the Milky Way, we would have long hidden far away, and we would not have dared to appear in front of universe boat at all. This time, we just happened to be in the middle of an ambush, so we did not discover it ahead of time. If we had discovered it ahead of time, I would have told you to stop and make way for us.”","“Is that so?”","Hearing the leader’s words, the surrounding star islands secretly rejoiced.","It was true. If Jian Wushuang wanted to, he could easily kill all the pirates, but as long as the pirates did not provoke him or block his way, he was too lazy to do anything.","The universe boat continued to fly in the Purple Micro Galaxy. Along the way, they could often see the pirates plundering wantonly. But just as Devil Flame had said, with the existence of the universe boat, the passing pirates would immediately move aside when they saw it, no Space Pirates would dare to plunder.","Just like that, the universe boat was unimpeded in the Purple Micro galaxy and operated for 300 years.","..."]},{"number":4000,"title":"Chapter 4000 - Husband and Wife","paragraphs":["The Milky Way was still dazzling and beautiful, as if the crazy slaughter in the Milky Way only added some color to the Milky Way.","The universe boat was still flying forward, but at this moment, in the void space ahead, a slaughter was going on.","“Another Space Pirate.” Leng Rushuang’s eyes were cold as she looked at the battlefield ahead.","After 300 years of traveling in the galaxy, they had encountered similar scenes many times before.","Every time they saw the Space Pirates plundering, it was usually the cultivators who suffered. Of course, there were also some cultivators who were powerful or especially powerful, and the Space Pirates were at a disadvantage. However, this was only a minority.","!!","As for Jian Wushuang and the others, no one dared to provoke them in the galaxy on the universe boat.","Seeing the battlefield in front of them, Jian Wushuang and the others did not intend to pay attention to it, but at this moment...","“Husband, look over there,” Leng Rushuang suddenly said and pointed in a direction.","Jian Wushuang followed the direction and looked over. Immediately, he saw two figures being surrounded and killed by six or seven Space Pirates.","These two figures were Rulers, but the ones who were surrounding them were also Rulers.","“Little Yue, get ready. I will risk my life to create a chance for you to escape. You must seize this chance!” The cold-looking man in a white robe who was holding a long spear gritted his teeth and roared. His eyes were bloodshot.","“No, Brother Yun, if you want to go, Let’s go together! If you die, I won’t live anymore.” Standing behind the cold-looking man was a woman in red. The woman in red had a determined look on her face, and she did not have any intention of escaping alone.","“What nonsense are you talking about!” The cold-faced man berated.","The Space Pirates who were surrounding the two of them also heard their conversation and sneered, “What a pair of lovebirds who share life and death together. Don’t worry. The two of you will definitely die together. We promise.”","“Haha, kill them!”","The eyes of the Space Pirates were cold, and their killing intent soared to the sky. The strength they displayed was also very impressive.","He burst out, obviously using a special secret skill. In a short time, his strength had reached a new level.","“Quick, Little Yue, run, run!” The cold-faced man roared crazily.","“No, if you want to die, let’s die together!” The red-clothed woman was extremely determined.","This scene was completely witnessed by Jian Wushuang and the red-clothed woman on the universe boat.","Jian Wushuang understood that the cold-looking man and the red-clothed woman should be a couple. They had come to the universe together, but unfortunately, they were killed by the Space Pirates, although the cold-looking man desperately wanted to give his wife a chance to escape, his wife was unwilling to leave him.","Unsurprisingly, the couple would be killed here by the Space Pirates.","“Darling, do you remember what you said to me when you were about to take the elixir and fight with Star Demon Ancestor?” Leng Rushuang looked at him.","“Of course, I remember.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","At that time, he was determined to die. To a certain extent, he wanted to fight with Star Demon Ancestor. At that time, he told Leng Rushuang that if Star Demon Ancestor was not dead, he would let her leave the Divine Beginning Realm.","But Leng Rushuang’s answer was very straightforward. She said that if he died, he would not live!","Jian Wushuang remembered that at that time, Leng Rushuang was also as determined as the red-clothed woman in front of him.","“Husband, this couple is very pitiful. Let’s save them,” Leng Rushuang suddenly said.","Jian Wushuang glanced at Leng Rushuang and nodded slightly.","He knew that Leng Rushuang had compassion for him because she saw him in the red-clothed woman.","Jian Wushuang did not refuse.","“Let’s go.”","With a thought, the universe boat, which had slowed down and almost stopped, suddenly shot through the galaxy at an amazing speed and arrived at the battlefield in the blink of an eye.","Buzz, buzz, buzz!","The appearance of the huge universe boat shocked the experts fighting on the battlefield, especially the Space Pirates. They could not help but stop.","Universe boat stopped in the void around the couple.","“You two, come in.” Jian Wushuang’s voice came from within the universe boat.","“Are you talking about the two of us?” The cold man with scarlet eyes was stunned at first, but then he was ecstatic.","“Little Yue, let’s go. Let’s get on board.” The cold-looking man brought his wife and immediately rushed toward the universe boat.","A space passage appeared in the array on the universe boat, allowing the two of them to enter the universe boat.","As for the Space Pirates, they were all watching this scene with their own eyes, including the six Rulers who had besieged the couple. Although they were anxious, none of them dared to go forward.","A tall, muscular old man who was over three meters tall walked over.","“Thirteen leaders, what should we do?” The six Rulers who had surrounded and killed the couple asked one after another.","“Universe boat?” The muscular old man was the leader of the Space Pirates. His eyes were as big as copper bells, and he stared at universe boat with a gloomy expression.","After a moment of hesitation, the burly old man walked toward the universe boat.","“Sir, I am the 13th leader of the Ancient Yuan Star. The two people just now were the prey of the Ancient Yuan Star. Please return them to us,” the burly old man said in a deep voice.","His words shocked the surrounding pirates from the Ancient Yuan Star, and then they became nervous.","In the universe boat, Jian Wushuang looked down at the robust old man through the universe boat.","“How dare a master at the peak of the second level come here and ask me to hand him over?” Jian Wushuang was also a bit surprised.","Under normal circumstances, since he had saved the couple and rode on the universe boat, these Space Pirates should have been tactful and let him pass. However, the robust old man did not. Instead, he came here and asked them to hand him over.","“Interesting.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","What he did not know was that although the burly old man knew that those who could own a universe boat were extraordinary, the Ancient Yuan Star where the burly old man was located was one of the top ten large-scale pirate gangs in the Zi Wei Galaxy, he was very powerful. With Ancient Yuan Star as his backer, he had some confidence in his heart.","Most importantly, he did not want to lose the meat on his mouth, so he dared to come forward.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang opened his mouth.","“The 13th leader of Ancient Yuan Star, right? I don’t care where you come from, but I promise you that the couple just now will stay away. If you dare to say another word, all of you will stay.”","Jian Wushuang did not want to waste his time talking to these Space Pirates.","..."]}]);
